h#En206Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>Hablen</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En206Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En207"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En207Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde262" /><gams:textualContent>Fue entonces cuando Traveler aludió a los cambios, y después de un silencio oyó cómo  Horacio se reía bajito  en la sombra.Insistió, queriendo alguna certidumbre y sin saber cómo plantear una materia que le resbalaba de</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En207Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En207Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En207Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En207Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Horacio se reía bajito </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Horacio|ms] se [v|reía|reír|rs] [a|bajito|bajo|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En207Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Horacio</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En207Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>reía</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#reír" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En207Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En208"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En208Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde262" /><gams:textualContent>sí, poco frecuente, el 56 era fatal, qué le va a hacer.Por aquí,    hablen bajo  para no despertar a la merza.Y vos qué me representás a esta hora, rajá a la cama</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En208Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En208Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En208Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En208Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>   hablen bajo </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s||up]  [v|hablen|hablar|is] [a|bajo|bajo|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En208Ph1Su1"><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Undefined" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En208Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>hablen</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En208Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En209"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En209Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde262" /><gams:textualContent>la luz del cielo estrellado y caliente) y se acercó indecisa a la fuente. Oliveira le silbó bajito , pero Talita siguió mirando el chorro de agua, y hasta acercó un dedo experimental y lo mantuvo un</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En209Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En209Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En209Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En209Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Oliveira le silbó bajito </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Oliveira|ms] le [v|silbó|silbar|is] [a|bajito|bajo|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En209Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Oliveira</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En209Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>silbó</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#silbar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En209Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En210"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En210Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde263" /><gams:textualContent>que canta boleros, y se rió y  Vítor pasó entonces por mi lado del lado de la oscuridad y me dijo bajito al oído, Ten cuidado que es la prima de Moby Dick, La Ballena Negra, y me alegré</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En210Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En210Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En210Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En210Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Vítor pasó entonces por mi lado del lado de la oscuridad y me dijo bajito al oído</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Vítor|ms] pasó entonces por mi lado del lado de la oscuridad y me [v|dijo|decir|ts] [a|bajito|bajo|auvnmnnn] al oído</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En210Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Vítor</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En210Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>dijo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#decir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En210Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En211"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En211Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde263" /><gams:textualContent>uno y que el aparato, el avión, los tambores, son la relación, lo que permite volar bajo y ver las casas y la gente o volar alto y ver las nubes y estar entre el cielo</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En211Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En211Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En211Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>permite volar bajo y ver las casas</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>permite [v|volar|volar|is] [a|bajo|bajo|auvnmnnn] y ver las casas</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En211Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>volar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#volar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En211Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En212"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En212Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde263" /><gams:textualContent>uno y que el aparato, el avión, los tambores, son la relación, lo que permite volar bajo y ver las casas y la gente o volar alto y ver las nubes y estar entre el cielo</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En212Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En212Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En212Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>o volar alto y ver las nubes</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>o [v|volar|volar|is] [a|alto|alto|auvnmnnn] y ver las nubes</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En212Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>volar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#volar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En212Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>alto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#alto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En213"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En213Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde263" /><gams:textualContent>para mí.Tomamos tres seguidos, antes de que entrara un grupo de gente haciendo ruido y  Vivian  dijera bajito , «¡Ay mi madre!»</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En213Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En213Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En213Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En213Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Vivian  dijera bajito , «¡Ay mi madre!»</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Vivian|fs]  [v|dijera|decir|ts] [a|bajito|bajo|auvnmnnn] , «¡Ay mi madre!»</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En213Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Vivian</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En213Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>dijera</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#decir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En213Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En214"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En214Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde263" /><gams:textualContent>digo, Ve: hay una cubana y un cubano que no bailan, y  Magalena empieza a cantar , bajito , Yo me voy para la luna que es lo que está tocando la orquesta y se levanta, Con</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En214Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En214Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En214Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En214Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Magalena empieza a cantar , bajito ,</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Magalena|fs] empieza a [v|cantar|cantar|ts] , [a|bajito|bajo|auvnmnnn] ,</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En214Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Magalena</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En214Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>cantar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cantar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En214Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En215"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En215Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde263" /><gams:textualContent>como estaba frotando el vaso con la mano y al pensar pronunciaba el nombre  ese hombrecito sobrio que habla bajo dentro de mí para que nadie más que yo lo oiga decir que estoy perdiendo pie y como este genio dentro de la</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En215Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En215Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En215Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En215Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> ese hombrecito sobrio que habla bajo dentro de mí</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|ese hombrecito sobrio|ms] que [v|habla|hablar|is] [a|bajo|bajo|auvnmnnn] dentro de mí</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En215Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>ese hombrecito sobrio</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En215Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>habla</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En215Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En216"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En216Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde263" /><gams:textualContent>que yo lo oiga decir que estoy perdiendo pie y como  este genio dentro de la botella que soy yo  decía bajito Cuba, ella se apareció y me saludó alegremente diciendo, Buenas querido y dándome un beso donde la mejilla</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En216Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En216Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En216Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En216Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> este genio dentro de la botella que soy yo  decía bajito Cuba</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|este genio dentro de la botella que soy yo|ms]  [v|decía|decir|ts] [a|bajito|bajo|auvnmnnn] Cuba</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En216Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>este genio dentro de la botella que soy yo</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En216Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>decía</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#decir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En216Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En217"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En217Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde263" /><gams:textualContent>La pesadilla sin aire acondicionado.Al pasar por mi lado  ella me dijo ( bajito ) por favor.no dejes que me lleve.ten piedá y se juntó a Beba Martínez o como carajo</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En217Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En217Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En217Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En217Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> ella me dijo ( bajito ) por favor</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|ella|fs] me [v|dijo|decir|ts] ( [a|bajito|bajo|auvnmnnn] ) por favor</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En217Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>ella</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En217Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>dijo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#decir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En217Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En218"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En218Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde177" /><gams:textualContent>para todo, pero de chico cada vez que me agarraba el brazo para subir a la acera,  yo la decía bajito a Transi, «ya me caló», que ella tronchada, y el infeliz de Paco, </gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En218Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En218Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En218Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En218Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> yo la decía bajito a Transi</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|yo|ms] la [v|decía|decir|ts] [a|bajito|bajo|auvnmnnn] a Transi</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En218Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>yo</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En218Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>decía</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#decir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En218Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En219"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En219Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde54" /><gams:textualContent>La niebla envolvía la isla del Fraile y esfumaba las covachas miserables de la Punta. Las gaviotas  volaban bajo , calaban en busca de una presa, se cernían de nuevo en el aire, volvían a caer.En</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En219Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En219Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En219Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En219Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Las gaviotas  volaban bajo </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Las gaviotas|fp]  [v|volaban|volar|is] [a|bajo|bajo|auvnlnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En219Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Las gaviotas</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En219Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>volaban</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#volar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En219Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Location" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En220"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En220Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde54" /><gams:textualContent>— Vamos, reflexiona —el del bigote se había acuclillado junto a él, con solicitud—:  Dímelo  bajito , al oído.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En220Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En220Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En220Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Dímelo  bajito , al oído</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|Dímelo|decir|ts]  [a|bajito|bajo|auvnlnnn] , al oído</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En220Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>Dímelo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#decir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En220Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Location" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En221"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En221Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde119" /><gams:textualContent>puerta se cuadraba rápidamente gritando ¡Atención!,  él se detenía un poco, nos miraba a todos silbando bajito  y avanzaba entre las camas: a Bobbio le toqueteaba las patillas demasiado largas, a Videla le tironeaba de</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En221Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En221Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En221Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En221Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> él se detenía un poco, nos miraba a todos silbando bajito </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|él|ms] se detenía un poco, nos miraba a todos [v|silbando|silbar|is] [a|bajito|bajo|auvnlnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En221Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>él</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En221Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>silbando</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#silbar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En221Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Location" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En222"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En222Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde55" /><gams:textualContent>cara llena de lágrimas de nuevo. El Batuque se frota contra sus tobillos, le lame los zapatos, gruñe bajito  mirándolo.Echa a andar, despacio, las manos en los bolsillos, hacia la Plaza Dos de Mayo, y</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En222Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En222Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En222Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En222Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> El Batuque se frota contra sus tobillos, le lame los zapatos, gruñe bajito </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|El Batuque|ms] se frota contra sus tobillos, le lame los zapatos, [v|gruñe|gruñir|is] [a|bajito|bajo|auvnlnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En222Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>El Batuque</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En222Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>gruñe</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#gruñir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En222Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Location" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En223"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En223Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde55" /><gams:textualContent>la tarde, y le pasa la mano por la frente y lo mira y le sonríe y le habla bajito  y le pellizca una oreja: bien hecho que duela cabecita, amor, y él la besa.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En223Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En223Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En223Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>le habla bajito </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>le [v|habla|hablar|is] [a|bajito|bajo|auvnlnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En223Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>habla</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En223Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Location" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En224"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En224Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde55" /><gams:textualContent>—dijo Queta—.¿Qué harías si se lo contara a todo el mundo? Él se rió bajito y cortésmente en la semioscuridad.Estaba de espaldas, fumando, y Queta veía cómo se mezclaban en el aire</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En224Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En224Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En224Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En224Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Él se rió bajito y cortésmente en la semioscuridad</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Él|ms] se [v|rió|reír|rs] [a|bajito|bajo|auvnmnnC] y cortésmente en la semioscuridad</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En224Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Él</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En224Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>rió</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#reír" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En224Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En225"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En225Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde55" /><gams:textualContent>— A veces ni con ésas, ni por ésas — gimió Ambrosio , bajito —.Yo pienso se va a enfurecer, se va a enloquecer, va a.Pero no,</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En225Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En225Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En225Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En225Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> gimió Ambrosio , bajito </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|gimió|gemir|ts] [s|Ambrosio|ms] , [a|bajito|bajo|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En225Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Ambrosio</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En225Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>gimió</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#gemir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En225Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En226"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En226Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde6" /><gams:textualContent> Susan debió notarlo desde sus anteojos de sol y su necesidad de Coca-Cola, porque lo abrazó y gritó , bajito no más al oído: «¡a la Plaza de Acho, caracho!», y fueron cómplices por</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En226Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En226Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En226Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En226Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Susan debió notarlo desde sus anteojos de sol y su necesidad de Coca-Cola, porque lo abrazó y gritó , bajito no más al oído: «¡a la Plaza de Acho, caracho!»</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Susan|fs] debió notarlo desde sus anteojos de sol y su necesidad de Coca-Cola, porque lo abrazó y [v|gritó|gritar|ts] , [a|bajito|bajo|auvnmnnn] no más al oído: «¡a la Plaza de Acho, caracho!»</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En226Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Susan</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En226Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>gritó</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#gritar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En226Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En227"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En227Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde6" /><gams:textualContent>el padre ése tan austero la convenció y la confesó una mañana y a ella le encantó que  le hablaran bajito con acento alemán desde atrás de una cortinita.Al terminar, mientras rezaba una penitencia francamente generosa,</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En227Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En227Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En227Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En227Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>le encantó que  le hablaran bajito con acento alemán</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>le encantó que [s||up] le [v|hablaran|hablar|is] [a|bajito|bajo|auvnmnnn] con acento alemán</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En227Ph1Su1"><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Undefined" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En227Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>hablaran</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En227Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En228"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En228Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde6" /><gams:textualContent>un tecito para beberlo con el otro chofer.«No está mala la pechichona, carajo»,  exclamó  bajito  el del La Salle , poniéndose y quitándose la gorra, pero la Decidida le había dado ya la espalda</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En228Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En228Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En228Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En228Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> exclamó  bajito  el del La Salle </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|exclamó|exclamar|ts]  [a|bajito|bajo|auvnmnnn]  [s|el del La Salle|ms] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En228Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>el del La Salle</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En228Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>exclamó</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#exclamar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En228Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En229"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En229Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde6" /><gams:textualContent>, sin importancia, se perdió en tres gritos que más tenían de sollozos y en unos cuantos mierdas pronunciados bajito , con la nariz y la boca aplastadas contra la almohada.Notó que se le terminaba esa rabia y</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En229Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En229Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En229Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En229Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>en tres gritos que más tenían de sollozos y en unos cuantos mierdas pronunciados bajito ,</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>en [s|tres gritos|mp] que más tenían de sollozos y en unos cuantos mierdas [v|pronunciados|pronunciar|is] [a|bajito|bajo|auvnmnnn] ,</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En229Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>tres gritos</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En229Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>pronunciados</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#pronunciar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En229Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En230"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En230Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde187" /><gams:textualContent>preferencia a las pedigüeñas y por eso, al principio, no se acercan mucho: merodean calladas, o murmurando bajito , pasan y vuelven a pasar frente a la puerta, acercándose poco a poco más y más.Alguna se atreve a detenerse</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En230Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En230Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En230Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>merodean calladas, o murmurando bajito </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>merodean calladas, o [v|murmurando|murmurar|is] [a|bajito|bajo|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En230Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>murmurando</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#murmurar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En230Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En231"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En231Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde58" /><gams:textualContent>Os puse una tarjeta.Y me mandaste otra desde Roma.De la Costa-Donde-Nunca-Se-Pone-El-Sol me enviabas cartas — rió  bajo , con el borde del vaso en el labio inferior—.Cartas kilométricas.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En231Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En231Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En231Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> rió  bajo </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|rió|reír|is]  [a|bajo|bajo|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En231Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>rió</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#reír" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En231Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En232"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En232Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde58" /><gams:textualContent>la mañana siguiente llegué temprano.El plomero colocaba la nueva vidriera.Era  un tipo cuarentón , que silbaba bajito , mientras trabajaba, y daba las órdenes al aprendiz en un andaluz imposible.Mary, Merceditas y </gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En232Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En232Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En232Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En232Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> un tipo cuarentón , que silbaba bajito </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|un tipo cuarentón|ms] , que [v|silbaba|silbar|is] [a|bajito|bajo|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En232Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>un tipo cuarentón</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En232Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>silbaba</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#silbar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En232Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En233"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En233Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde264" /><gams:textualContent>sí señor!No había que tenerle miedo a la grandilocuencia, como  esos mediocres que de tanto miedo hablan bajito  o no dicen más que cositas humildes.Qué, acaso la gente no se muere?No habrá entonces </gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En233Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En233Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En233Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En233Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> esos mediocres que de tanto miedo hablan bajito </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|esos mediocres|mp] que de tanto miedo [v|hablan|hablar|is] [a|bajito|bajo|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En233Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>esos mediocres</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En233Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>hablan</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En233Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En234"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En234Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde60" /><gams:textualContent>, pa su diablo", pensó Lituma.¿Eran de enfermedad?¿Heridas o quemaduras? Hablo  bajito para no espantarlo:</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En234Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En234Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En234Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Hablo  bajito para no espantarlo</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|Hablo|hablar|is]  [a|bajito|bajo|auvnmnnn] para no espantarlo</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En234Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>Hablo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En234Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En235"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En235Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde60" /><gams:textualContent>, en la que, todavía con la cabeza reclinada sobre el pecho,  Doroteo-Jesús había empezado a murmurar , bajito , pero audible en las primeras filas de la platea: "Me caigo, me caigo".Paralizados</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En235Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En235Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En235Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En235Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Doroteo-Jesús había empezado a murmurar , bajito , pero audible</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Doroteo-Jesús|ms] había empezado a [v|murmurar|murmurar|is] , [a|bajito|bajo|auvnmnnC] , pero audible</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En235Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Doroteo-Jesús</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En235Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>murmurar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#murmurar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En235Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En236"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En236Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde60" /><gams:textualContent>de amor salidas de estro humano. Unas beatas madrugadoras que, alguna vez, lo sorprendieron así, cantando bajito y llorando frente al convento, propalaron la especie atroz de que, ebrio de vanidad, se había</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En236Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En236Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En236Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En236Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Unas beatas madrugadoras que, alguna vez, lo sorprendieron así, cantando bajito y llorando</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Unas beatas madrugadoras|fp] que, alguna vez, lo sorprendieron así, [v|cantando|cantar|is] [a|bajito|bajo|auvnmnnn] y llorando</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En236Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Unas beatas madrugadoras</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En236Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>cantando</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cantar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En236Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En237"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En237Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde61" /><gams:textualContent>Creo que había  una música china , lastimera, sonando bajito .Una voz de mujer, si no me equivoco, que se cortaba en la mitad de cada queja</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En237Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En237Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En237Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En237Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> una música china , lastimera, sonando bajito </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|una música china|fs] , lastimera, [v|sonando|sonar|is] [a|bajito|bajo|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En237Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>una música china</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En237Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sonando</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#sonar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En237Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En238"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En238Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde61" /><gams:textualContent> Alguna voz  tarareaba bajito , dentro de mí, la canción de Milton Nascimento: &lt;lb/&gt;Descobri que minha arma é &lt;lb/&gt;o que a memória guarda...</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En238Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En238Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En238Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En238Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Alguna voz  tarareaba bajito , dentro de mí, la canción de Milton Nascimento</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Alguna voz|fs]  [v|tarareaba|tararear|ts] [a|bajito|bajo|auvnmnnn] , dentro de mí, la canción de Milton Nascimento</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En238Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Alguna voz</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En238Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>tarareaba</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#tararear" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En238Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En239"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En239Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde61" /><gams:textualContent>En el camino, los resplandores herían los ojos. El viento , que soplaba bajo y en remolino, cubría con máscaras de polvo rojizo a los hombres y a las cosas.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En239Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En239Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En239Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En239Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> El viento , que soplaba bajo y en remolino,</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|El viento|ms] , que [v|soplaba|soplar|is] [a|bajo|bajo|auvnmnnC] y en remolino,</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En239Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>El viento</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En239Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>soplaba</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#soplar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En239Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En240"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En240Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde120" /><gams:textualContent>Me dispuse a ser ese buen novio, al menos por una noche, cuando de pronto apareció un mozo explicándonos bajito que habían llegado clientes de verdad para nuestra mesa, y entregándonos el papelito que parecía la cuenta.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En240Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En240Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En240Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En240Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>apareció un mozo explicándonos bajito que habían llegado clientes</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>apareció [s|un mozo|ms] [v|explicándonos|explicar|ts] [a|bajito|bajo|auvnmnnn] que habían llegado clientes</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En240Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>un mozo</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En240Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>explicándonos</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#explicar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En240Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En241"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En241Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde120" /><gams:textualContent>— Hija de puta — dije , bajito , y aprovechando que el monstruo no entendía ni papa de castellano.Miré a Carlos, pero éste se</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En241Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En241Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En241Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>— Hija de puta — dije , bajito ,</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>— Hija de puta — [v|dije|decir|ts] , [a|bajito|bajo|auvnmnnn] ,</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En241Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>dije</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#decir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En241Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En242"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En242Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde120" /><gams:textualContent>—    Hablan bajito y jadeando —insistí, para ver hasta qué punto dolía.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En242Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En242Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En242Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En242Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>   Hablan bajito y jadeando</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s||up]  [v|Hablan|hablar|is] [a|bajito|bajo|auvnmnnC] y jadeando</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En242Ph1Su1"><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Undefined" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En242Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>Hablan</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En242Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En243"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En243Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde120" /><gams:textualContent>— Operativo X 023 —le dije , bajito , a Sandra, para que él no preguntara, ¿y eso qué, es?, y para que ella</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En243Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En243Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En243Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>— Operativo X 023 —le dije , bajito , a Sandra</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>— Operativo X 023 —le [v|dije|decir|ts] , [a|bajito|bajo|auvnmnnn] , a Sandra</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En243Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>dije</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#decir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En243Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En244"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En244Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde265" /><gams:textualContent>una poza llena de vino, más..., más que todo el oro del mundo...( Canturrea  bajito .) «más quel aire que respiro y más que la mare mía»</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En244Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En244Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En244Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>( Canturrea  bajito .) «más quel aire que respiro y más que la mare mía»</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>( [v|Canturrea|canturrear|ts]  [a|bajito|bajo|auvnmnnn] .) «más quel aire que respiro y más que la mare mía»</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En244Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>Canturrea</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#canturrear" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En244Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En245"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En245Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde266" /><gams:textualContent>y hasta la boca.Baby dirá que no le parece tan mal, y yo le pediré que cante bajito uno de esos blues que le están dando fama en Londres v en Estocolmo.Y después volveremos a Out</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En245Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En245Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En245Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>que cante bajito uno de esos blues</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>que [v|cante|cantar|ts] [a|bajito|bajo|auvnmnnn] uno de esos blues</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En245Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>cante</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cantar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En245Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En246"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En246Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde267" /><gams:textualContent>presente salido de Santa, Allá en el rancho grande, Un rincón cerca del cielo, Ando volando bajo , o cualquier otra película que se quiera; seres emergidos de los rollos que yo clasificaba, sacándolos d</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En246Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En246Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En246Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Ando volando bajo </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Ando [v|volando|volar|is] [a|bajo|bajo|auvnlnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En246Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>volando</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#volar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En246Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Location" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En247"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En247Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde268" /><gams:textualContent>El viejo no logra oír la respuesta. Renato  habla bajito , pero ella se excita más.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En247Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En247Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En247Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En247Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Renato  habla bajito </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Renato|ms]  [v|habla|hablar|is] [a|bajito|bajo|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En247Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Renato</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En247Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>habla</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En247Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En248"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En248Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde268" /><gams:textualContent>quizás una aprensión suya porque ha recordado otra strina, muy distinta, una puñalada de melancolía...La canturrea bajito : &lt;lb/&gt;La Nochebuena se viene, &lt;lb/&gt;la Nochebuena se va &lt;lb/&gt;y nosotros nos iremos &lt;lb/&gt;y no volveremos más.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En248Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En248Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En248Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>La canturrea bajito </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>La [v|canturrea|canturrear|ts] [a|bajito|bajo|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En248Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>canturrea</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#canturrear" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En248Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En249"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En249Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde268" /><gams:textualContent>del dormitorio conyugal, en la posición fortificada de los dos partisanos, montaña arriba.Allí le habla bajito  (esta noche no solamente lo piensa) para que sus palabras calen mejor en el niño.No le impulsa</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En249Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En249Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En249Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Allí le habla bajito </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Allí le [v|habla|hablar|is] [a|bajito|bajo|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En249Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>habla</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En249Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En250"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En250Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde268" /><gams:textualContent>— ¿Qué ha dicho?— pregunta  bajito  el viejo .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En250Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En250Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En250Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En250Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>¿Qué ha dicho?— pregunta  bajito  el viejo </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>¿Qué ha dicho?— [v|pregunta|preguntar|ts]  [a|bajito|bajo|auvnmnnn]  [s|el viejo|ms] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En250Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>el viejo</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En250Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>pregunta</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#preguntar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En250Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En251"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En251Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde67" /><gams:textualContent>Se acerca y  dice  bajito : «No pensar mal de mí por hacer dolor a cabayo.No ser culpa mía.Blancos pagar muy</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En251Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En251Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En251Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> dice  bajito :</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|dice|decir|ts]  [a|bajito|bajo|auvnmnnn] :</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En251Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>dice</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#decir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En251Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En252"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En252Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde67" /><gams:textualContent>chaval», pero no me obedece.Recostándose contra la pared y sin dejar de tocarme y sonreír  dice  bajito : «No tengas miedo, que no habrá necesidad de envenenarse.» ¿Veneno un Etiqueta Negra que </gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En252Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En252Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En252Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> dice  bajito : «No tengas miedo</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|dice|decir|ts]  [a|bajito|bajo|auvnmnnn] : «No tengas miedo</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En252Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>dice</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#decir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En252Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En253"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En253Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde68" /><gams:textualContent>—Don Pablo — susurró bajo , cual si acomodara su volumen a la tenue luz de la lámpara envuelta en una toalla azul.Ahora</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En253Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En253Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En253Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>—Don Pablo — susurró bajo </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>—Don Pablo — [v|susurró|susurrar|ts] [a|bajo|bajo|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En253Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>susurró</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#susurrar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En253Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En254"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En254Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde269" /><gams:textualContent>brazo, e hizo la mímica de beber al seco. El gorila lo miró, interesado, gruñendo bajito , aspirando los mocos, golpeando estruendosamente el paragolpes contra un guardabarros del camión.El negro que parecía</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En254Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En254Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En254Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En254Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> El gorila lo miró, interesado, gruñendo bajito ,</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|El gorila|ms] lo miró, interesado, [v|gruñendo|gruñir|is] [a|bajito|bajo|auvnmnnn] ,</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En254Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>El gorila</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En254Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>gruñendo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#gruñir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En254Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En255"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En255Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde189" /><gams:textualContent> Bill  chiflando bajito se movía con soltura muy suya, como quien ha pasado ahí toda su vida.Tomó los libros abandonados</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En255Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En255Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En255Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En255Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Bill  chiflando bajito se movía</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Bill|ms]  [v|chiflando|chiflar|is] [a|bajito|bajo|auvnmnnn] se movía</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En255Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Bill</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En255Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>chiflando</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#chiflar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En255Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En256"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En256Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde189" /><gams:textualContent> Roberta se pone a silbar bajito la canción que Edouard nunca cantó para ella.Porque hay una luna intensa y al claro de luna </gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En256Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En256Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En256Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En256Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Roberta se pone a silbar bajito la canción</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Roberta|fs] se pone a [v|silbar|silbar|ts] [a|bajito|bajo|auvnmnnn] la canción</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En256Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Roberta</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En256Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>silbar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#silbar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En256Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En257"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En257Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde76" /><gams:textualContent>nada anormal en la oficina, no llegaron a preguntar por mí, no oíste nada extraño?— hablaba  bajo , para no perturbar a Sebastián.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En257Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En257Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En257Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> hablaba  bajo , para no perturbar a Sebastián</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|hablaba|hablar|is]  [a|bajo|bajo|auvnmnnn] , para no perturbar a Sebastián</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En257Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>hablaba</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En257Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En258"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En258Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde76" /><gams:textualContent>se levantó, se sentó en la banqueta de la mesa de dibujo y continuó con su trabajo, tarareando bajito .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En258Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En258Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En258Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>continuó con su trabajo, tarareando bajito </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>continuó con su trabajo, [v|tarareando|tararear|is] [a|bajito|bajo|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En258Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>tarareando</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#tararear" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En258Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En259"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En259Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde76" /><gams:textualContent>Escucharon el rumor de los demás acercándose.  Venían riendo bajito , haciéndose bromas sobre el reumatismo, el dolor de huesos, los músculos tiesos...bromas tímidas, de </gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En259Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En259Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En259Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En259Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>  Venían riendo bajito </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s||mp] Venían [v|riendo|reír|is] [a|bajito|bajo|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En259Ph1Su1"><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En259Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>riendo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#reír" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En259Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En260"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En260Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde76" /><gams:textualContent>, le empezó a entrar risa.Empezó a sonreír sola por haber sobrevivido su primera posta y luego rió bajito pensándose allí, en la hamaca, convertida en otra persona; una mujer en medio del territorio nacional </gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En260Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En260Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En260Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>luego rió bajito pensándose allí</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>luego [v|rió|reír|is] [a|bajito|bajo|auvnmnnn] pensándose allí</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En260Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>rió</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#reír" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En260Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En261"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En261Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde76" /><gams:textualContent>— ¿Felipe? — dijo bajito , casi temiendo despertarlo, como si se hubiese quedado dormido—.¿Felipe?—dijo un poco </gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En261Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En261Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En261Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>— ¿Felipe? — dijo bajito ,</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>— ¿Felipe? — [v|dijo|decir|ts] [a|bajito|bajo|auvnmnnn] ,</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En261Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>dijo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#decir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En261Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En262"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En262Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde234" /><gams:textualContent> Raúl , riéndose bajito , como si estuviera confiando una travesura a su padre: </gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En262Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En262Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En262Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En262Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Raúl , riéndose bajito ,</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Raúl|ms] , [v|riéndose|reír|rs] [a|bajito|bajo|auvnmnnn] ,</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En262Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Raúl</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En262Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>riéndose</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#reír" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En262Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En263"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En263Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde270" /><gams:textualContent>"Por qué te vuelves ahora contra mí, le dice , bajito , AnaCarla , de qué quieres vengarte si después de todo tú estás viva y vives con él."</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En263Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En263Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En263Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En263Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>le dice , bajito , AnaCarla </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>le [v|dice|decir|ts] , [a|bajito|bajo|auvnmnnn] , [s|AnaCarla|fs] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En263Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>AnaCarla</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En263Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>dice</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#decir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En263Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En264"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En264Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde134" /><gams:textualContent>la cama ese manjar lejano.Deduje por la descripción que se trataba de una pera. Thierry se reía bajito : aquella fruta era como de carne santa y él no había vuelto a tener entre sus labios nada parecido</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En264Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En264Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En264Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En264Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Thierry se reía bajito </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Thierry|ms] se [v|reía|reír|rs] [a|bajito|bajo|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En264Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Thierry</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En264Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>reía</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#reír" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En264Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En265"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En265Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde134" /><gams:textualContent>No dije nada, o mejor dicho,  dije  bajito que estaba listo para partir.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En265Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En265Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En265Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> dije  bajito que estaba listo</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|dije|decir|ts]  [a|bajito|bajo|auvnmnnn] que estaba listo</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En265Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>dije</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#decir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En265Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En266"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En266Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde134" /><gams:textualContent>hule por los hombros y se quedó dormida.Fue entonces cuando oí por primera vez su voz. Hablaba  bajito como si hablara con sus muertos, y aunque yo tampoco comprendía las palabras de su boca, pude entender</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En266Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En266Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En266Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Hablaba  bajito como si hablara con sus muertos</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|Hablaba|hablar|is]  [a|bajito|bajo|auvnmnnn] como si hablara con sus muertos</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En266Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>Hablaba</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En266Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En267"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En267Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde134" /><gams:textualContent>rápido de asiento y él metió, como quien mete un bulto, a su mujer;  ella se quejaba bajito  y cuando ya estábamos en camino vomitó, sentí un olor a sangre y mis zapatos se llenaron de aquel </gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En267Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En267Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En267Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En267Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> ella se quejaba bajito </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|ella|fs] se [v|quejaba|quejar|rs] [a|bajito|bajo|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En267Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>ella</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En267Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>quejaba</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#quejar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En267Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En268"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En268Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde134" /><gams:textualContent>el capullo, les apartaba las nalgas y les tentaba por debajo el saco de los huevos.A veces hablaba bajito con un hombre y lo separaba del grupo, era seguro que le había palpado un bulbo.Cuando </gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En268Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En268Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En268Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>A veces hablaba bajito con un hombre</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>A veces [v|hablaba|hablar|is] [a|bajito|bajo|auvnmnnn] con un hombre</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En268Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>hablaba</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En268Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En269"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En269Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde134" /><gams:textualContent>Prendió un cigarro y se sirvió un vaso de ron.La habitación estaba en penumbras,  Thierry  hablaba bajito pero cada frase la repetía un par de veces, era como un dictado monótono y altivo, la emoción</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En269Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En269Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En269Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En269Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Thierry  hablaba bajito pero cada frase la repetía</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Thierry|ms]  [v|hablaba|hablar|is] [a|bajito|bajo|auvnmnnn] pero cada frase la repetía</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En269Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Thierry</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En269Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>hablaba</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En269Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En270"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En270Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde134" /><gams:textualContent>entenderse se habían quedado dentro del automóvil y me llamaron para que entrara yo también.Oí que  el marido  hablaba bajito  y que luego comenzaba a subir el tono, la noche estaba oscura y eché la luz </gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En270Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En270Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En270Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En270Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> el marido  hablaba bajito </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|el marido|ms]  [v|hablaba|hablar|is] [a|bajito|bajo|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En270Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>el marido</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En270Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>hablaba</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En270Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En271"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En271Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde134" /><gams:textualContent>— Ni la pena ni la alegría —le comenté bajito —.Un hombre nunca sabe nada, Thierry, ése es su espanto.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En271Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En271Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En271Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>le comenté bajito </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>le [v|comenté|comentar|ts] [a|bajito|bajo|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En271Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>comenté</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#comentar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En271Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En272"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En272Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde134" /><gams:textualContent>había logrado, lo cierto es que  nuestro padre lo esperó en la puerta de la fonda, le habló bajito  y le entregó un cuchillo.El otro no quiso defenderse y el viejo Thierry lo rajó de arriba abajo.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En272Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En272Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En272Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En272Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> nuestro padre lo esperó en la puerta de la fonda, le habló bajito </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|nuestro padre|ms] lo esperó en la puerta de la fonda, le [v|habló|hablar|is] [a|bajito|bajo|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En272Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>nuestro padre</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En272Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>habló</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En272Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En273"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En273Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde134" /><gams:textualContent>quien los ve. Yoyotte, mi hermana , cuenta que los ha visto en Bombardopolis, se lo cuenta bajito a sus gemelos, los albinos que sembró Camerún.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En273Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En273Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En273Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En273Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Yoyotte, mi hermana , cuenta que los ha visto en Bombardopolis, se lo cuenta bajito a sus gemelos</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Yoyotte, mi hermana|fs] , cuenta que los ha visto en Bombardopolis, se lo [v|cuenta|contar|ts] [a|bajito|bajo|auvnmnnn] a sus gemelos</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En273Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Yoyotte, mi hermana</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En273Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>cuenta</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#contar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En273Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En274"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En274Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde134" /><gams:textualContent>de sangre.Yo fui quien la encontró mucho más tarde,  ella no se podía mover, pero  rezaba  bajito .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En274Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En274Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En274Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En274Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> ella no se podía mover, pero  rezaba  bajito </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|ella|fs] no se podía mover, pero  [v|rezaba|rezar|is]  [a|bajito|bajo|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En274Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>ella</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En274Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>rezaba</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#rezar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En274Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En275"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En275Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde134" /><gams:textualContent>con el diablo. Yo le tomé aquella mano, me la llevé a la boca y empecé a llorar bajito , no por el difunto, sino porque tenía que ir al velorio y enfrentarme otra vez con Frou-Frou.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En275Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En275Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En275Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En275Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Yo le tomé aquella mano, me la llevé a la boca y empecé a llorar bajito </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Yo|us] le tomé aquella mano, me la llevé a la boca y empecé a [v|llorar|llorar|is] [a|bajito|bajo|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En275Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Yo</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Undefined" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En275Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>llorar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#llorar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En275Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En276"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En276Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde79" /><gams:textualContent>—  Habla  bajito , muchacho  —dijo, en voz baja, acercándose a la cama—.No quiero que tu abuela se despierte</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En276Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En276Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En276Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En276Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Habla  bajito , muchacho </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|Habla|hablar|is]  [a|bajito|bajo|auvnmnnn] , [s|muchacho|ms] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En276Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>muchacho</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En276Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>Habla</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En276Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En277"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En277Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde79" /><gams:textualContent>— ¿Bajo?Bajo ganará usted por cojudo, oiga.¿Usted cree que la Patty gana bajo ?¿Usted cree que el Francisquito gana bajo?¿Usted cree que toditas las hermanas de la Patty que están ahí metidas en publicidad ganan bajo? Ay, carijo. Miles de dólares ganan esas chuchas. Miles. Millones. La Patty se debe de haber robado miles de millones de dólares, oiga usted. Esa enana chupapingas es una ladrona de campeonato. ¿No ha visto el carrazo de putamadre que se maneja? Yo, si la veo por la calle, le choco su carro, oiga. Sólo por joder la choco.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En277Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En277Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En277Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En277Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Usted cree que la Patty gana bajo </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Usted cree que [s|la Patty|fs] [v|gana|ganar|is] [a|bajo|bajo|auvnunnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En277Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>la Patty</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En277Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>gana</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ganar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En277Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Other" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En278"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En278Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde79" /><gams:textualContent>— ¿Bajo?Bajo ganará usted por cojudo, oiga.¿ Usted cree que la Patty gana bajo?¿Usted cree que el Francisquito gana bajo ?¿Usted cree que toditas las hermanas de la Patty que están ahí metidas en publicidad ganan bajo? Ay, carijo. Miles de dólares ganan esas chuchas. Miles. Millones. La Patty se debe de haber robado miles de millones de dólares, oiga usted. Esa enana chupapingas es una ladrona de campeonato. ¿No ha visto el carrazo de putamadre que se maneja? Yo, si la veo por la calle, le choco su carro, oiga. Sólo por joder la choco.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En278Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En278Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En278Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En278Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>¿Usted cree que el Francisquito gana bajo ?</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>¿Usted cree que [s|el Francisquito|ms] [v|gana|ganar|is] [a|bajo|bajo|auvnunnn] ?</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En278Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>el Francisquito</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En278Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>gana</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ganar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En278Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Other" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En279"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En279Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde79" /><gams:textualContent>cojudo, oiga.¿Usted cree que la Patty gana bajo?¿Usted cree que el Francisquito gana bajo?¿Usted cree que toditas las hermanas de la Patty que están ahí metidas en publicidad ganan bajo ?Ay carijo. Miles de dólares ganan esas chuchas. Miles. Millones. La Patty se debe de haber robado miles de millones de dólares, oiga usted. Esa enana chupapingas es una ladrona de campeonato. ¿No ha visto el carrazo de putamadre que se maneja? Yo, si la veo por la calle, le choco su carro, oiga. Sólo por joder la choco.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En279Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En279Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En279Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En279Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Usted cree que toditas las hermanas de la Patty que están ahí metidas en publicidad ganan bajo </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Usted cree que [s|toditas las hermanas de la Patty|fp] que están ahí metidas en publicidad [v|ganan|ganar|is] [a|bajo|bajo|auvnunnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En279Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>toditas las hermanas de la Patty</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En279Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>ganan</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ganar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En279Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Other" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En280"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En280Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde271" /><gams:textualContent> La señora Leverett  maldice bajito , pero América finge no oír.Ella se siente mal porque la señora Leverett tuvo que salir por ella</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En280Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En280Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En280Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En280Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> La señora Leverett  maldice bajito </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|La señora Leverett|ms]  [v|maldice|maldecir|is] [a|bajito|bajo|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En280Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>La señora Leverett</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En280Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>maldice</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#maldecir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En280Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En281"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En281Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde272" /><gams:textualContent>poder hacer lo que siempre hacen: soltar risotadas, criticar, pasarse secretos.Claro, así toca hablar bajito y puro en la oreja, si no todos van a oír y qué vergüenza.A ella eso no</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En281Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En281Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En281Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En281Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text>así toca hablar bajito y puro en la oreja</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>así toca [v|hablar|hablar|is] [a|bajito|bajo|auvnmnnC] y [a|puro|puro|aunnsnnC] en la oreja</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En281Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>hablar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En281Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En281Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>puro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#puro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Noun" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Specification" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En282"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En282Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde272" /><gams:textualContent>— Sin carro es un lío.No nos dejan entrar —le habló bajito , en un rincón oscuro de la sala.Poca gente bailaba y el tocadiscos sonaba a medio volumen.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En282Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En282Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En282Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>le habló bajito </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>le [v|habló|hablar|ts] [a|bajito|bajo|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En282Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>habló</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En282Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En283"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En283Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde106" /><gams:textualContent>cortado casi al rape.Gracias al deporte mantenía un excelente físico, sin asomo de grasa.Le respondía bajito , con humildad, tratando de apaciguarlo.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En283Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En283Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En283Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Le respondía bajito , con humildad</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Le [v|respondía|responder|is] [a|bajito|bajo|auvnmnnC] , con humildad</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En283Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>respondía</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#responder" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En283Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bajito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En284"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En284Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde106" /><gams:textualContent> Lucas , casi pegado su rostro al mío, hablaba rápido y bajo , accionando, con el sombrero empalmado tirado atrás y sostenido del cuello por el Barbiquejo</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En284Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En284Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En284Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En284Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En284Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text> Lucas , casi pegado su rostro al mío, hablaba rápido y bajo </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Lucas|ms] , casi pegado su rostro al mío, [v|hablaba|hablar|is] [a|rápido|rápido|auvnmnnC] y [a|bajo|bajo|auvnmnnC] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En284Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Lucas</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En284Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>hablaba</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En284Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>rápido</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#rápido" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En284Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>bajo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bajo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">4</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En285"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En285Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde141" /><gams:textualContent>tura trato seguro que el azeyte avn que sea viejo ni se asolana ni se azeda: y si vale barato puede seguramente guardar hasta que aya mejor venta: y dentro a casa vienen arogar por ello o si los</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En285Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En285Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En285Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>si vale barato puede seguramente guardar</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>si [v|vale|valer|is] [a|barato|barato|ausnqnnn] puede seguramente guardar</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En285Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vale</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#valer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En285Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>barato</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#barato" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En286"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En286Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde95" /><gams:textualContent>esperiencia que  muchos merchantes más quieren comprar caro de una tienda porque el mercader es gracioso, que no comprar barato de otra tienda porque el vendedor es dessabrido.Quiero dezir que ay muchos que quieren más servir a un</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En286Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En286Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En286Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En286Ph1Ve2" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En286Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En286Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text> muchos merchantes más quieren comprar caro de una tienda porque el mercader es gracioso, que no comprar barato de otra tienda</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|muchos merchantes|mp] más quieren [v|comprar|comprar|is] [a|caro|caro|auonqnnn] de una tienda porque el mercader es gracioso, que no [v|comprar|comprar|is] [a|barato|barato|auonqnnn] de otra tienda</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En286Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>muchos merchantes</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En286Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>comprar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#comprar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En286Ph1Ve2"><aaif:text>comprar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#comprar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">4</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En286Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En286Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>barato</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#barato" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">5</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En287"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En287Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde95" /><gams:textualContent>tu espacio estando assentado robarás en las plaças.¡O, pobre de ti, Cincinato!Pues compra barato y vende caro ; promete mucho y cumple poco; recibe con una medida y vende con otra; vela</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En287Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En287Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En287Ph1Ve2" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En287Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En287Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text>Pues compra barato y vende caro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Pues [v|compra|comprar|is] [a|barato|barato|auonqnnn] y [v|vende|vende|is] [a|caro|caro|auonqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En287Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>compra</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#comprar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En287Ph1Ve2"><aaif:text>vende</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vende" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En287Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>barato</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#barato" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En287Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">4</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En288"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En288Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde95" /><gams:textualContent>el mundo nos cuesta a nosotros muy caro y nosotros nos vendemos a él muy barato .Mucho dixe en dezir que nos vendemos barato, que a la verdad mejor dixera en dezir que nos damos de balde; porque son muy pocos los que</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En288Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En288Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En288Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En288Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>y nosotros nos vendemos a él muy barato </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>y [s|nosotros|mp] nos [v|vendemos|vender|rs] a él muy [a|barato|barato|auomqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En288Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>nosotros</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En288Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vendemos</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vender" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En288Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>barato</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#barato" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En289"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En289Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde95" /><gams:textualContent>a nosotros muy caro y nosotros nos vendemos a él muy barato.Mucho dixe en dezir que  nos vendemos barato , que a la verdad mejor dixera en dezir que nos damos de balde; porque son muy pocos los que</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En289Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En289Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En289Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En289Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>dezir que  nos vendemos barato </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>dezir que [s||mp] nos [v|vendemos|vender|rs] [a|barato|barato|auonqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En289Ph1Su1"><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En289Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vendemos</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vender" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En289Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>barato</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#barato" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En290"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En290Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde98" /><gams:textualContent>gracia lo dan. &lt;lb/&gt;— Alargad el plato&lt;lb/&gt;(¿veis la mesa puesta?),&lt;lb/&gt;que  lo dan barato :&lt;lb/&gt;sólo querer cuesta. &lt;lb/&gt;Vuestra es esta fiesta,&lt;lb/&gt;¡oh hijos de Adán!&lt;lb/&gt;— Dime el precio</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En290Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En290Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En290Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En290Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Alargad el plato&lt;lb\/&gt;(¿veis la mesa puesta?),&lt;lb\/&gt;que  lo dan barato </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Alargad el plato&lt;lb\/&gt;(¿veis la mesa puesta?),&lt;lb\/&gt;que [s||up] lo [v|dan|dar|ts] [a|barato|barato|auonqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En290Ph1Su1"><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Undefined" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En290Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>dan</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#dar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En290Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>barato</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#barato" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En291"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En291Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde98" /><gams:textualContent>al vivo se retrata;&lt;lb/&gt;allí se verá el nombre y  la figura &lt;lb/&gt;que al que la vio jamás costó barata ." &lt;lb/&gt;Y aquí paró, mas vuelve a sus cruezas&lt;lb/&gt;y así con cien mil formas de tristezas:</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En291Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En291Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En291Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En291Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> la figura &lt;lb\/&gt;que al que la vio jamás costó barata </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|la figura|fs] &lt;lb\/&gt;que al que la vio jamás [v|costó|costar|is] [a|barata|barato|afsnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En291Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>la figura</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En291Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>costó</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En291Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>barata</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#barato" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FeminineSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En292"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En292Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde142" /><gams:textualContent>se haze el queso muy nombrado plaçentino, que son grandes como panes de çera, y aunque allí vale varato en todas partes es caro.Para venir a Milán, que es doçe leguas, se pasa el Po</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En292Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En292Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En292Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>aunque allí vale varato en todas partes es caro</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>aunque allí [v|vale|valer|is] [a|varato|barato|ausnqnnn] en todas partes es caro</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En292Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vale</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#valer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En292Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>varato</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#barato" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En293"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En293Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde142" /><gams:textualContent>oro llenos de pedrería, ajorcas, y arracadas, por pobre que sea lo tiene porque  las piedras  valen baratas .El día que van al baño he visto muchas señoras mugeres de prinçipales, y quando van a</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En293Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En293Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En293Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En293Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> las piedras  valen baratas </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|las piedras|fp]  [v|valen|valer|is] [a|baratas|barato|axsnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En293Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>las piedras</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En293Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>valen</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#valer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En293Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>baratas</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#barato" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FemininePlural" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En294"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En294Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde142" /><gams:textualContent>cada año las inchen, y como lo traen por mar si no le dan prisa se deshaze;    danlo varato y no se puede vender otro sino lo del Gran Turco, hasta que no haya más que vender</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En294Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En294Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En294Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En294Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>   danlo varato y no se puede vender otro</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s||mp]  [v|danlo|dar|ts] [a|varato|barato|auonqnnn] y no se puede vender otro</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En294Ph1Su1"><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En294Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>danlo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#dar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En294Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>varato</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#barato" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En295"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En295Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde143" /><gams:textualContent>25.Pues luego se dieron prisa  estos santos amigos de la Virgen a concertar las casas, y, a mi parecer, las dieron baratas .Trabajaron harto, que en cada una quiere Dios haya que merecer en estas fundaciones a los que nos ayudan, y yo soy la que no hago nada, como otras veces he dicho, y nunca lo querría dejar de decir, porque es verdad.Pues lo que ellos trabajaron en acomodar la casa, y dando también dineros para ello, porque yo no los tenía, fue muy mucho, junto con fiarla;que primero que en otras partes hallo un fiador, no de tanta cantidad, me veo afligida.Y tienen razón, porque si no lo fiasen de Nuestro Señor, yo no tengo blanca.Mas Su Majestad me ha hecho siempre tanta merced, que nunca por hacérmela perdieron nada, ni se dejó de pagar muy bien, que la tengo por grandísima.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En295Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En295Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En295Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En295Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> estos santos amigos de la Virgen a concertar las casas, y, a mi parecer, las dieron baratas .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|estos santos amigos de la Virgen|mp] a concertar las casas, y, a mi parecer, las [v|dieron|dar|ts] [a|baratas|barato|axonqnnn] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En295Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>estos santos amigos de la Virgen</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En295Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>dieron</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#dar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En295Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>baratas</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#barato" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FemininePlural" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En296"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En296Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde144" /><gams:textualContent>lo qual vuestros compañeros guardaron muy bien la imitación, porque, como auían de tratar de palabras y valen baratas , fueron largos en lo que vale barato y tan fácilmente dan los hombres.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En296Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En296Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En296Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En296Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>como auían de tratar de palabras y valen baratas </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>como auían de tratar de [s|palabras|fp] y [v|valen|valer|is] [a|baratas|barato|axsnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En296Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>palabras</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En296Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>valen</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#valer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En296Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>baratas</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#barato" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FemininePlural" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En297"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En297Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde144" /><gams:textualContent>lo qual vuestros compañeros guardaron muy bien la imitación, porque, como auían de tratar de palabras y valen baratas, fueron largos en  lo que  vale barato y tan fácilmente dan los hombres.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En297Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En297Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En297Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En297Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> lo que  vale barato y tan fácilmente dan los hombres</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|lo que|ms]  [v|vale|valer|is] [a|barato|barato|ausnqnnn] y tan fácilmente dan los hombres</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En297Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>lo que</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En297Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vale</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#valer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En297Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>barato</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#barato" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En298"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En298Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde9" /><gams:textualContent>Fiestas hay que por el año &lt;lb/&gt;a su gusto se pasean, &lt;lb/&gt;caminando por los meses &lt;lb/&gt;al paso de la Cuaresma.&lt;lb/&gt;A ti, Jueves de Comadres, &lt;lb/&gt;¡qué paulina se te llega! &lt;lb/&gt;No hay amiga que no masque, &lt;lb/&gt;no hay criada que no muerda.&lt;lb/&gt;Tras quesadilla y roscón, &lt;lb/&gt;el gallo en Carnestolendas &lt;lb/&gt;hace, al revés de San Pedro, &lt;lb/&gt;llorar lo que no se niega.&lt;lb/&gt;Si yo me muero, me olvidan; &lt;lb/&gt;y si cumplo años, me cuelgan; &lt;lb/&gt;si vengo, dicen qué traigo; &lt;lb/&gt;si voy, que lleve encomiendas.&lt;lb/&gt;Si he de vivir de estos años, &lt;lb/&gt;Dios me los quite de a cuestas; &lt;lb/&gt;pues la edad que tenga de ellos&lt;lb/&gt;será, aunque moza, muy vieja.&lt;lb/&gt; Yo no he vivido barato &lt;lb/&gt;ni mes que bien me parezca,&lt;lb/&gt;sino los nueve en que el vientre&lt;lb/&gt;me fue posada y despensa.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En298Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En298Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En298Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En298Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Yo no he vivido barato </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Yo|fs] no [v|he vivido|vivir|is] [a|barato|barato|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En298Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Yo</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En298Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>he vivido</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vivir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En298Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>barato</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#barato" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En299"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En299Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde145" /><gams:textualContent>»— Con sola ésta espero tener vida y, si más caro me costara, la compraba barato .Confío en Dios de vivir alegre y morir consolada, y así suplico se haga como mi esposo Dorido</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En299Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En299Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En299Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>la compraba barato .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>la [v|compraba|comprar|ts] [a|barato|barato|auonqnnn] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En299Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>compraba</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#comprar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En299Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>barato</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#barato" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En300"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En300Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde146" /><gams:textualContent>México y los que bajan de Lima a México, para tomar refrecos de carne, y gallinas que valen baratas , a dos reales cada una.No se me ofrece otra cosa que decir de este puerto.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En300Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En300Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En300Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En300Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>y gallinas que valen baratas , a dos reales cada una</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>y [s|gallinas|fp] que [v|valen|valer|is] [a|baratas|barato|axsnqnnn] , a dos reales cada una</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En300Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>gallinas</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En300Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>valen</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#valer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En300Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>baratas</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#barato" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FemininePlural" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En301"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En301Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde146" /><gams:textualContent>cuatro reales; doce huevos, un real; y de esta manera por el consiguiente  las demás cosas de comida  valen baratas .En este pueblo de Olmos dejamos aquellos caballos que trajimos, muy cansados; y alquilamos otros cuatro para</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En301Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En301Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En301Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En301Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> las demás cosas de comida  valen baratas </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|las demás cosas de comida|fp]  [v|valen|valer|is] [a|baratas|barato|axsnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En301Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>las demás cosas de comida</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En301Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>valen</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#valer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En301Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>baratas</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#barato" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FemininePlural" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En302"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En302Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde147" /><gams:textualContent>culpa al diablo de lo que peca la carne, y, finalmente, heredamos comprar caro y vender barato .Y no me digas que estos males se heredan, porque de puro usados se hacen connaturales, y</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En302Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En302Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En302Ph1Ve2" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En302Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En302Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text>heredamos comprar caro y vender barato </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>heredamos [v|comprar|comprar|is] [a|caro|caro|auonqnnn] y [v|vender|vender|is] [a|barato|barato|auonqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En302Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>comprar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#comprar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En302Ph1Ve2"><aaif:text>vender</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vender" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En302Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En302Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>barato</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#barato" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">4</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En303"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En303Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde147" /><gams:textualContent>que me respetasen, y aun los despreciaba, porque siempre tuve por regla verdadera que  la mujer sólo compra barato aquello que estima en poco.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En303Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En303Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En303Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En303Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> la mujer sólo compra barato aquello que estima en poco</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|la mujer|fs] sólo [v|compra|comprar|ts] [a|barato|barato|auonqnnn] aquello que estima en poco</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En303Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>la mujer</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En303Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>compra</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#comprar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En303Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>barato</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#barato" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En304"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En304Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde147" /><gams:textualContent> La mujer sólo compra barato lo que estima en poco.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En304Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En304Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En304Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En304Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> La mujer sólo compra barato lo que estima en poco.</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|La mujer|fs] sólo [v|compra|comprar|ts] [a|barato|barato|auonqnnn] lo que estima en poco.</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En304Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>La mujer</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En304Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>compra</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#comprar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En304Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>barato</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#barato" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En305"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En305Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde148" /><gams:textualContent>y a él se lo han agradecido poco o nada; los indios, aunque ya por este tiempo  vale  barato el vino , lo apetecen poco, porque se contenían con su antiguo brebaje, hecho de zara y agua</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En305Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En305Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En305Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En305Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> vale  barato el vino , lo apetecen poco</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|vale|valer|is]  [a|barato|barato|ausnqnnn] [s|el vino|ms] , lo apetecen poco</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En305Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>el vino</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En305Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vale</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#valer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En305Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>barato</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#barato" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En306"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En306Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde149" /><gams:textualContent>unos hijos que mantengo,&lt;lb/&gt;que me es forzoso que venda&lt;lb/&gt;este esclavillo que tengo.&lt;lb/&gt; Yo os le venderé barato &lt;lb/&gt;yos holgaréis del contrato,&lt;lb/&gt;que aunque el hierro es excesivo,&lt;lb/&gt;ni es ladrón ni es fugitivo,</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En306Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En306Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En306Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En306Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Yo os le venderé barato </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Yo|us] os le [v|venderé|vender|ts] [a|barato|barato|auonqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En306Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Yo</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Undefined" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En306Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>venderé</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vender" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En306Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>barato</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#barato" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En307"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En307Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde150" /><gams:textualContent>su casa algún pernil de tocino y algunas varas de lienzo crudo; en fin, de  aquellas cosas que valen baratas  en los lugares del distrito de su comisión, y con esto sustenta su casa como el pecador mejor</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En307Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En307Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En307Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En307Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> aquellas cosas que valen baratas </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|aquellas cosas|fp] que [v|valen|valer|is] [a|baratas|barato|axsnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En307Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>aquellas cosas</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En307Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>valen</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#valer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En307Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>baratas</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#barato" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FemininePlural" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En308"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En308Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde151" /><gams:textualContent>Mellado Porque a un carrillo en Madrid &lt;lb/&gt;le hizo que fuese cristiano. &lt;lb/&gt;Don Pedro ¿Cristiano a un carrillo?¿Cómo? &lt;lb/&gt;Mellado Como le plantó en lo llano &lt;lb/&gt;los Mandamientos de Dios. &lt;lb/&gt;Don Pedro ¿Y adonde intentan matarlo? &lt;lb/&gt;Mellado Al puente. &lt;lb/&gt;Don Pedro ¡Cómo me alegro! &lt;lb/&gt;Que éste es mi mayor contrario, &lt;lb/&gt;y así no tendremos quien &lt;lb/&gt;nos persiga. &lt;lb/&gt;Mellado Enmascarados &lt;lb/&gt;han de ir los seis camaradas: &lt;lb/&gt;danles por la obra... &lt;lb/&gt;Don Pedro ¿Cuánto? &lt;lb/&gt;Mellado Quinientos; pero yo digo &lt;lb/&gt;que  concertaron barato . &lt;lb/&gt;Don Pedro Y él, ¿cómo saben que irá? &lt;lb/&gt;Mellado Porque le tienen trazado &lt;lb/&gt;un papel de desafío.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En308Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En308Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En308Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En308Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>yo digo &lt;lb\/&gt;que  concertaron barato .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>yo digo &lt;lb\/&gt;que [s||mp] [v|concertaron|concertar|is] [a|barato|barato|auonqnnn] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En308Ph1Su1"><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En308Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>concertaron</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#concertar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En308Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>barato</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#barato" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En309"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En309Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde152" /><gams:textualContent>los celos de Dorotea con sus joyas?Vete, Julio, que no es nobleza comprar caro y vender barato , vestir locos y no pagar criados, y dar una mujer a un hombre lo que ha menester para</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En309Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En309Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En309Ph1Ve2" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En309Ph1Ve3" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En309Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En309Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En309Ph1Ad3" /><aaif:text>no es nobleza comprar caro y vender barato , vestir locos y no pagar criados</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>no es nobleza [v|comprar|comprar|is] [a|caro|caro|auonqnnn] y [v|vender|vender|is] [a|barato|barato|auonqnnn] , [v|vestir|vestir|is] [a|locos|loco|apsnunnn] y no pagar criados</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En309Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>comprar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#comprar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En309Ph1Ve2"><aaif:text>vender</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vender" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En309Ph1Ve3"><aaif:text>vestir</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vestir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">5</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En309Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En309Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>barato</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#barato" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">4</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En309Ph1Ad3"><aaif:text>locos</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#loco" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">6</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#MasculinePlural" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Other" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En310"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En310Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde111" /><gams:textualContent>cual yo lo hago plata y oro, y tú, hollín; y la piedra filosofal verdadera es comprar barato y  vender caro  y váyanse en hora mala todos esos fulanos y zutanos, que yo de mejor gana gastaría mi carbón</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En310Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En310Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En310Ph1Ve2" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En310Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En310Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text>la piedra filosofal verdadera es comprar barato y  vender caro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>la piedra filosofal verdadera es [v|comprar|comprar|is] [a|barato|barato|auonqnnn] y  [v|vender|vender|is] [a|caro|caro|auonqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En310Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>comprar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#comprar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En310Ph1Ve2"><aaif:text>vender</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vender" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En310Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>barato</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#barato" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En310Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">4</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En311"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En311Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde153" /><gams:textualContent>Sin duda que Francisco&lt;lb/&gt;todo lo entiende,&lt;lb/&gt;pues que todos dicen:&lt;lb/&gt;«Con él me entierren».&lt;lb/&gt;Siempre compra barato &lt;lb/&gt;y a menos precio,&lt;lb/&gt;porque tiene Francisco&lt;lb/&gt;buenos terceros.&lt;lb/&gt;Es desagradecido,&lt;lb/&gt;y al que le halaga</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En311Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En311Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En311Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Siempre compra barato &lt;lb\/&gt;y a menos precio</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Siempre [v|compra|comprar|is] [a|barato|barato|auonqnnC] &lt;lb\/&gt;y a menos precio</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En311Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>compra</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#comprar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En311Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>barato</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#barato" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En312"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En312Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde154" /><gams:textualContent>A la ballena y a Jonás, muy mal pintados, que se compraron caros y se vendieron baratos </gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En312Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En312Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En312Ph1Ve2" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En312Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En312Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text>A la ballena y a Jonás, muy mal pintados, que se compraron caros y se vendieron baratos </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>A la ballena y a Jonás, muy mal pintados, que se [v|compraron|comprar|rs] [a|caros|caro|apsnqnnn] y se [v|vendieron|vender|rs] [a|baratos|barato|apsnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En312Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>compraron</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#comprar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En312Ph1Ve2"><aaif:text>vendieron</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vender" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En312Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caros</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#MasculinePlural" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En312Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>baratos</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#barato" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">4</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#MasculinePlural" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En313"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En313Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde155" /><gams:textualContent>pueda vender a corto precio el trigo y demás especies de su cosecha; pero querer que el labrador venda barato su grano, y todo lo que necesite lo compre caro, y además de eso pague puntualmente los tributos</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En313Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En313Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En313Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En313Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>pero querer que el labrador venda barato su grano</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>pero querer que [s|el labrador|ms] [v|venda|vender|ts] [a|barato|barato|auonqnnn] su grano</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En313Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>el labrador</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En313Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>venda</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vender" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En313Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>barato</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#barato" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En314"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En314Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde155" /><gams:textualContent>de comercio son pugnantes con los de las compañías de fábricas. Los del comercio miran sólo a comprar barato  y género que den a vender con estimación justa su género y a hacerle de calidad que acredita la fábrica</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En314Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En314Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En314Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En314Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Los del comercio miran sólo a comprar barato </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Los del comercio|mp] miran sólo a [v|comprar|comprar|is] [a|barato|barato|auonqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En314Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Los del comercio</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En314Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>comprar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#comprar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En314Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>barato</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#barato" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En315"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En315Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde155" /><gams:textualContent>, para que, siendo más los trabajadores, crezcan en abundancia los frutos, y es en vano pensar que éstos valdrán baratos  interín subsistan las causas apuntadas.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En315Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En315Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En315Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En315Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>es en vano pensar que éstos valdrán baratos </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>es en vano pensar que [s|éstos|mp] [v|valdrán|valer|is] [a|baratos|barato|apsnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En315Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>éstos</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En315Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>valdrán</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#valer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En315Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>baratos</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#barato" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#MasculinePlural" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En316"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En316Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde156" /><gams:textualContent>Gaceta. Grandes novedades. La Gaceta. Libritos, estampas para aprender el arte de cocinar, a contar, sumar, restar, multiplicar, medio partir, partir por entero. La Gaceta. Grandes novedades.&lt;lb/&gt;Diario.Diario económico, pro amico.Ventas, pérdidas o hallazgos;cosas curiosas que verá el que me dé dos cuartos;lo que yo no puedo aunque me den cuatro.Vengan, señores; le doy barato .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En316Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En316Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En316Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>le doy barato .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>le [v|doy|dar|ts] [a|barato|barato|auonqnnn] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En316Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>doy</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#dar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En316Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>barato</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#barato" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En317"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En317Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde157" /><gams:textualContent>que del jardín los traigo&lt;lb/&gt;de la Capona?¿Quién me los lleva,&lt;lb/&gt;que los vende baratos &lt;lb/&gt;hoy la enclusera ?</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En317Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En317Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En317Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En317Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>los vende baratos &lt;lb\/&gt;hoy la enclusera ?</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>los [v|vende|vender|ts] [a|baratos|barato|aponqnnn] &lt;lb\/&gt;hoy [s|la enclusera|fs] ?</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En317Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>la enclusera</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En317Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vende</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vender" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En317Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>baratos</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#barato" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#MasculinePlural" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En318"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En318Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde158" /><gams:textualContent>Petimetre 2.º Vamos claros;&lt;lb/&gt;todos somos tus amigos;&lt;lb/&gt;tu ventura celebramos&lt;lb/&gt;con deseo que la logres &lt;lb/&gt; barata y por muchos años;&lt;lb/&gt;pero es menester que sea&lt;lb/&gt;de participantes.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En318Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En318Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En318Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>tu ventura celebramos&lt;lb\/&gt;con deseo que la logres &lt;lb\/&gt; barata y por muchos años</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>tu ventura celebramos&lt;lb\/&gt;con deseo que la [v|logres|lograr|ts] &lt;lb\/&gt; [a|barata|barato|afonunnn] y por muchos años</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En318Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>logres</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#lograr" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En318Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>barata</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#barato" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FeminineSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Other" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En319"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En319Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde159" /><gams:textualContent>de víveres, particularmente para la gente pobre.País donde faltan mendigos es prueba que no falta qué comer barato : a excepción de algún ciego o mutilado, otro ninguno no pide en esta ciudad limosna.Además de que tienen</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En319Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En319Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En319Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>no falta qué comer barato </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>no falta qué [v|comer|comer|ts] [a|barato|barato|auonqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En319Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>comer</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#comer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En319Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>barato</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#barato" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En320"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En320Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde160" /><gams:textualContent>¿Quién lleva rosquillas?&lt;lb/&gt;¿Quién llega a comprar&lt;lb/&gt;turrones de moda,&lt;lb/&gt;rico mazapán,&lt;lb/&gt;que lo da barato &lt;lb/&gt;todo el catalán ?&lt;lb/&gt;(Pregonado.)&lt;lb/&gt;¡Turrón fino!</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En320Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En320Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En320Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En320Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>que lo da barato &lt;lb\/&gt;todo el catalán </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>que lo [v|da|dar|ts] [a|barato|barato|auonqnnn] &lt;lb\/&gt;todo [s|el catalán|ms] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En320Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>el catalán</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En320Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>da</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#dar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En320Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>barato</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#barato" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En321"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En321Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde161" /><gams:textualContent>Teresa.&lt;lb/&gt;Nunca mis cosas &lt;lb/&gt;se dan barato .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En321Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En321Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En321Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En321Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Nunca mis cosas &lt;lb\/&gt;se dan barato .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Nunca [s|mis cosas|fp] &lt;lb\/&gt;se [v|dan|dar|rs] [a|barato|barato|auonqnnn] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En321Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>mis cosas</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En321Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>dan</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#dar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En321Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>barato</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#barato" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En322"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En322Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde162" /><gams:textualContent>a la Aduana, *&lt;lb/&gt;se metió luego a tratante&lt;lb/&gt;de cuanto viene a la plaza&lt;lb/&gt;por mayor,  compra  barato ,&lt;lb/&gt;y en perjuicio de la causa&lt;lb/&gt;común, después lo revende&lt;lb/&gt;por un ojo de la cara!</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En322Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En322Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En322Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> compra  barato ,&lt;lb\/&gt;y en perjuicio de la causa</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|compra|comprar|is]  [a|barato|barato|auonqnnn] ,&lt;lb\/&gt;y en perjuicio de la causa</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En322Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>compra</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#comprar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En322Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>barato</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#barato" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En323"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En323Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde163" /><gams:textualContent>¿Pues qué, la ciencia del comercio sólo consiste en comprar barato y vender caro ?, de ninguna manera: porque en este caso serían los más expertos los agentes y regatones que</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En323Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En323Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En323Ph1Ve2" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En323Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En323Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text>la ciencia del comercio sólo consiste en comprar barato y vender caro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>la ciencia del comercio sólo consiste en [v|comprar|comprar|is] [a|barato|barato|auonqnnn] y [v|vender|vender|is] [a|caro|caro|auonqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En323Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>comprar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#comprar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En323Ph1Ve2"><aaif:text>vender</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vender" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En323Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>barato</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#barato" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En323Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">4</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En324"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En324Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde164" /><gams:textualContent>blancos de bramante casi nuevos.Me despojé de todo en un rincón, y como cuando tenía hambre vendía barato , al primero que me ofreció un peso por ambas cosas se las solté prontamente antes que se arrepintiera</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En324Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En324Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En324Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>cuando tenía hambre vendía barato </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>cuando tenía hambre [v|vendía|vender|is] [a|barato|barato|auonqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En324Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vendía</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vender" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En324Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>barato</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#barato" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En325"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En325Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde165" /><gams:textualContent>— ¿Quiere usted que le diga yo lo que nos darán en cualquier fonda adonde vayamos?Mire usted: nos darán en primer lugar mantel y servilletas puercas, vasos puercos, platos puercos y mozos puercos: sacarán las cucharas del bolsillo, donde están con las puntas de los cigarros;nos darán luego una sopa que llaman de yerbas, y que no podría acertar a tener nombre más alusivo;estofado de vaca a la italiana, que es cosa nueva;ternera mechada, que es cosa de todos los días;vino de la fuente;aceitunas magulladas;frito de sesos y manos de carnero, hechos aquéllos y éstos a fuerza de pan;una polla que se dejaron otros ayer, y unos postres que nos dejaremos nosotros para mañana.&lt;lb/&gt;— Y también nos llevarán poco dinero, que aquí se come barato .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En325Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En325Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En325Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>aquí se come barato </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>aquí se [v|come|comer|rs] [a|barato|barato|auonqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En325Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>come</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#comer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En325Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>barato</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#barato" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En326"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En326Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde166" /><gams:textualContent>Los "artículos ministeriales", que algunos seudoelegantes quieren introducir, no se acreditan.Son como los peines altos, que sólo sirven para que se vea venir desde lejos a quien los usa, y para dar una elevación ridícula a la persona.Hay, sin embargo, un regular surtido al uso de los pretendientes, en la fábrica-colmena de La Abeja, imprenta de don Tomás Jordán.Aunque es moda nueva,  se venden baratos , sin duda porque la gente de gusto no los gasta.Es moda antinacional como los sombreros de señora;así es que, por más flores que se les pongan, no se saben llevar, con paciencia, se entiende.Estas dos modas últimas, exageradas, como algunos las llevan, no nos parecen del caso;los ministeriales no hacen buena figura, y los de oposición pueden llegar a hacerla mucho peor.Con cierta medida todo es bueno.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En326Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En326Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En326Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En326Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Aunque es moda nueva,  se venden baratos , sin duda porque la gente de gusto no los gasta</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Aunque es moda nueva, [s||mp] se [v|venden|vender|rs] [a|baratos|barato|aponqnnn] , sin duda porque la gente de gusto no los gasta</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En326Ph1Su1"><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En326Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>venden</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vender" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En326Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>baratos</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#barato" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#MasculinePlural" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En327"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En327Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde167" /><gams:textualContent>piden un sentido; se hacen valer;  el público no quiere pagar caro , el oficial no quiere trabajar barato .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En327Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En327Ph1Su1" /><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En327Ph1Su2" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En327Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En327Ph1Ve2" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En327Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En327Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text> el público no quiere pagar caro , el oficial no quiere trabajar barato </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|el público|ms] no quiere [v|pagar|pagar|is] [a|caro|caro|auonqnnn] , [s|el oficial|ms] no quiere [v|trabajar|trabajar|is] [a|barato|barato|ausnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En327Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>el público</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En327Ph1Su2"><aaif:text>el oficial</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">4</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En327Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>pagar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#pagar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En327Ph1Ve2"><aaif:text>trabajar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#trabajar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">5</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En327Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En327Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>barato</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#barato" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">6</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En328"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En328Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde168" /><gams:textualContent>La sal a catorce, cada día más cara y en la Gaceta dijeron que  la iban a dar barata  para favorecer al pueblo: ¡lo que defienden al pueblo!En otro tiempo dicen que tenían</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En328Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En328Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En328Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En328Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>dijeron que  la iban a dar barata </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>dijeron que [s||up] la iban a [v|dar|dar|ts] [a|barata|barato|afonqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En328Ph1Su1"><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Undefined" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En328Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>dar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#dar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En328Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>barata</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#barato" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FeminineSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En329"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En329Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde169" /><gams:textualContent>las Audiencias u otras autoridades de Su Majestad.Éstas muchas veces los toman entre ojos porque  ellos quieren tomar barato el tabaco o la sal o niñerías del propio jaez, que yo a veces las deshago y desvanezco con</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En329Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En329Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En329Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En329Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> ellos quieren tomar barato el tabaco o la sal</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|ellos|mp] quieren [v|tomar|tomar|ts] [a|barato|barato|auonqnnn] el tabaco o la sal</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En329Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>ellos</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En329Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>tomar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#tomar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En329Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>barato</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#barato" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En330"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En330Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde170" /><gams:textualContent>–Yo he comprado en casa de los Bazil un terciopelo blanco que por mareado  lo dan barato ; pero como de noche no se le ven las manchitas...Mis hermanas me hacen el traje de pierrot,</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En330Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En330Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En330Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En330Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>un terciopelo blanco que por mareado  lo dan barato </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>un terciopelo blanco que por mareado [s||up] lo [v|dan|dar|ts] [a|barato|barato|auonqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En330Ph1Su1"><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Undefined" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En330Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>dan</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#dar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En330Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>barato</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#barato" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En331"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En331Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde171" /><gams:textualContent>—  Vendo  barato a usted...¡Cincuenta pesos!</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En331Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En331Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En331Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Vendo  barato a usted...¡Cincuenta pesos!</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|Vendo|vender|is]  [a|barato|barato|auonqnnn] a usted...¡Cincuenta pesos!</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En331Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>Vendo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vender" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En331Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>barato</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#barato" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En332"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En332Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde172" /><gams:textualContent>— ¿Dice usted que Barrera trajo mucha mercancía?¿Y la da barata ?</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En332Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En332Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En332Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>¿Y la da barata ?</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>¿Y la [v|da|dar|ts] [a|barata|barato|afonqnnn] ?</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En332Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>da</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#dar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En332Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>barata</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#barato" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FeminineSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En333"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En333Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde33" /><gams:textualContent>Balbino hizo un movimiento involuntario y se apresuró a replicar: &lt;lb/&gt;- ¡Ojalá!Se vive, nada más.Con negocios de a cuatro centavos, que son los que puedo hacer, no hay para guardar dinero.Eso está bueno para Bárbara y para usted, que tienen tierras y cogen bastante ganado.Yo apenas he podido recoger este año unos cuarenta cachilapos.Y ya que hablamos de esto;cómpremelos, don Guillermo.Tengo un apuro de unos centavos y se los daría baratos .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En333Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En333Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En333Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>se los daría baratos .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>se los [v|daría|dar|ts] [a|baratos|barato|aponqnnn] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En333Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>daría</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#dar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En333Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>baratos</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#barato" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#MasculinePlural" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En334"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En334Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde119" /><gams:textualContent>de Durán—.Si el sardo no se da vuelta, cornudo, para que hacés méritos si la sacaste barata ...¿Dos días te metieron...?¿o hasta que nos vayamos?—y le mira la</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En334Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En334Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En334Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>para que hacés méritos si la sacaste barata </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>para que hacés méritos si la [v|sacaste|sacar|ts] [a|barata|barato|afonqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En334Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sacaste</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#sacar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En334Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>barata</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#barato" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FeminineSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En335"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En335Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde64" /><gams:textualContent>rígidos y reconocibles, porque invariablemente el caballo de San Jorge era blanco, y rojo el de San Demetrio. Ofrecía  baratos los iconos y había compradores, así que en el contorno cundió la fe suscitada por ambos cabalgantes, y Nicéforo</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En335Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En335Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En335Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Ofrecía  baratos los iconos</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|Ofrecía|ofrecer|ts]  [a|baratos|barato|aponqnnn] los iconos</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En335Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>Ofrecía</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ofrecer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En335Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>baratos</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#barato" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#MasculinePlural" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En336"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En336Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde76" /><gams:textualContent>pensado bien.No había sido fácil decidir.Pero por fin, una amigo le recomendó una enfermera que cobraba barato .Se lo hizo.El problema era que la hemorragia no se le contenía.Ya todo ella olía</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En336Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En336Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En336Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En336Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>le recomendó una enfermera que cobraba barato </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>le recomendó [s|una enfermera|fs] que [v|cobraba|cobrar|is] [a|barato|barato|auonqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En336Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>una enfermera</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En336Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>cobraba</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cobrar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En336Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>barato</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#barato" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En337"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En337Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde173" /><gams:textualContent>a cualquier animal con su sola mirada.Se pagaba los estudios con el entrenamiento de perros y no cobraba barato .No era un tipo con quien uno fuera a regatear.Su seriedad era inconmovible.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En337Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En337Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En337Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Se pagaba los estudios con el entrenamiento de perros y no cobraba barato .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Se pagaba los estudios con el entrenamiento de perros y no [v|cobraba|cobrar|is] [a|barato|barato|auonqnnn] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En337Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>cobraba</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cobrar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En337Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>barato</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#barato" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En338"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En338Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde209" /><gams:textualContent> miren cuáles son sus mañas, &lt;lb/&gt;que hasta la color del rostro &lt;lb/&gt;llevaba el jaque robada); &lt;lb/&gt; llegóse  bonito a ella, &lt;lb/&gt;y sacando la afilada, &lt;lb/&gt;de oreja a oreja le yende, &lt;lb/&gt;de parte a parte le rasga.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En338Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En338Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En338Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> llegóse  bonito a ella</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|llegóse|llegar|rs]  [a|bonito|bonito|ausnmnnn] a ella</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En338Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>llegóse</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#llegar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En338Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bonito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bonito" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En339"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En339Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde375" /><gams:textualContent>No tenía ella la culpa de no encontrar soluciones más allá de sus cejas.Las mil complicadas combinaciones de la unión moral, la obra espiritual de la fusión de dos almas y la práctica de las virtudes prudencia, amor y abnegación eran para Angelita y para Mercedes un dédalo de dificultades, una trigonometria incomprensible.En medio de este aislamiento moral, de esta negación de espiritualismo  vieron  bonito á Chucho el Ninfo y lo amaron.El primer impulso de amor pertenece á la forma.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En339Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En339Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En339Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> vieron  bonito á Chucho el Ninfo</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|vieron|ver|ts]  [a|bonito|bonito|auonunnn] á Chucho el Ninfo</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En339Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vieron</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En339Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bonito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bonito" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Other" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En340"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En340Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde500" /><gams:textualContent>Nadie se admirará de que la pinte bonita .Lo era: Un tipo de criolla fogosa, con ojos negros y brillantes, escondidos detrás de tupidas y largas pestañas; nariz grande, labios carnosos muy apretados, y la cabellera cubierta en parte por un pañuelo caido hasta media cabeza, negra como los ojos.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En340Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En340Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En340Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Nadie se admirará de que la pinte bonita </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Nadie se admirará de que la [v|pinte|pintar|ts] [a|bonita|bonito|afonmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En340Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>pinte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#pintar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En340Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bonita</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bonito" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FeminineSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En341"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En341Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde400" /><gams:textualContent>Son los guaraúnos * del bajo Orinoco, * degenerados, descendientes * del bravo caribe * legendario, que salen al encuentro de las embarcaciones en sus diminutas curiaras, * por los caños angostos, sorteando los islotes de borales florecidos, * bogando sobre el aguaje de los caimanes que acaban de zambullirse.Se acercan a los costados del vapor en marcha y en jerga de gerundios proponen comercio: &lt;lb/&gt;— ¡Cuñao!* Yo dándote moriche * canta bonito , tú dándome papelón.* &lt;lb/&gt;— Yo dándote chinchorro, * tú dándome sal.*</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En341Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En341Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En341Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Yo dándote moriche * canta bonito , tú dándome papelón</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Yo dándote moriche * [v|canta|cantar|is] [a|bonito|bonito|auvnmnnn] , tú dándome papelón</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En341Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>canta</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cantar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En341Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bonito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bonito" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En342"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En342Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde400" /><gams:textualContent>— ¡Mira cómo viene ese filón veteando bonito !</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En342Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En342Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En342Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En342Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>¡Mira cómo viene ese filón veteando bonito !</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>¡Mira cómo viene [s|ese filón|ms] [v|veteando|vetear|is] [a|bonito|bonito|ausnmnnn] !</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En342Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>ese filón</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En342Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>veteando</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vetear" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En342Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bonito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bonito" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En343"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En343Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde400" /><gams:textualContent>eran cerca de cien hombres los que allí abrían solapas y barrancos, acosando al filón que continuaba veteando bonito  * y triturando el cuarzo en pequeños morteros, por que a todos los que llegaron pidiendo:</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En343Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En343Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En343Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En343Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>acosando al filón que continuaba veteando bonito </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>acosando al [s|filón|ms] que continuaba [v|veteando|vetear|is] [a|bonito|bonito|ausnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En343Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>filón</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En343Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>veteando</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vetear" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En343Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bonito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bonito" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En344"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En344Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde287" /><gams:textualContent>hasta que se le antojara a Pedro Páramo.Dijo mirando hacia el dintel de la puerta: "Se ven bonitos  esos moños negros , lo que sea de cada quien."</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En344Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En344Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En344Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En344Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Se ven bonitos  esos moños negros </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Se [v|ven|ver|rs] [a|bonitos|bonito|apsnmnnn]  [s|esos moños negros|mp] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En344Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>esos moños negros</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En344Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>ven</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En344Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bonitos</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bonito" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#MasculinePlural" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En345"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En345Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde287" /><gams:textualContent>Imagínese en qué pararía el trabajo que nos hemos tomado todos estos días para arreglar la iglesia y que luzca bonita  ahora para la Natividad, si alguien se muere en esa casa.Con el poder que tiene don Pedro</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En345Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En345Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En345Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>para arreglar la iglesia y que luzca bonita </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>para arreglar la iglesia y que [v|luzca|lucir|is] [a|bonita|bonito|afsnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En345Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>luzca</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#lucir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En345Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bonita</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bonito" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FeminineSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En346"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En346Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde117" /><gams:textualContent>La mujer aquí, llorando, llorando; pero echa no más.Rico ¡caray!abanquina. Llorando  bonito , caray.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En346Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En346Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En346Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Llorando  bonito </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|Llorando|llorar|is]  [a|bonito|bonito|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En346Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>Llorando</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#llorar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En346Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bonito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bonito" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En347"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En347Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde51" /><gams:textualContent>No hay ningún imaginaria a la vista."Debe haber una timba, si tuviera un cobre, un solo puto cobre, podría ganar los veinte soles, quizá más.Debe estar jugando y espero que me fíe, te ofrezco cartas y novelitas, de veras que en los tres años nunca me ha encargado nada, fuera caray, ya veo que me jalan en Química." Recorre toda la galería sin encontrar a nadie.Entra a las cuadras de la primera y la segunda sección, los baños están vacíos, uno de ellos apesta.Inspecciona los baños de otras cuadras, atravesando ruidosamente los dormitorios, a propósito, pero en ninguno se altera la respiración sosegada o febril de los cadetes.En la quinta sección, poco antes de llegar a la puerta del baño, se detiene.Alguien desvaría: distingue apenas, entre un río de palabras confusas, un nombre de mujer."Lidia.¿Lidia?Parece que se llamaba Lidia la muchacha ésa del arequipeño ése que me enseñaba las cartas y las fotos que recibía, y me contaba sus penas,  escríbele  bonito que la quiero mucho, yo no soy un cura, qué carajo, usted es un tarado.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En347Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En347Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En347Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> escríbele  bonito que la quiero mucho</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|escríbele|escribir|is]  [a|bonito|bonito|auvnmnnn] que la quiero mucho</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En347Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>escríbele</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#escribir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En347Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bonito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bonito" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En348"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En348Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde261" /><gams:textualContent>Huele bien. Ella  huele bonito .Ah, sí, aún puedo distinguir las mejillas encendidas, los ojos brillantes, toda la figura joven</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En348Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En348Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En348Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En348Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Ella  huele bonito </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Ella|fs]  [v|huele|oler|is] [a|bonito|bonito|ausnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En348Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Ella</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En348Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>huele</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#oler" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En348Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bonito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bonito" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En349"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En349Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde1" /><gams:textualContent>Se acaba la cosecha y te despachan volando.Y cuando cruzas la frontera, mano, pos hasta recuerdas bonito aquellas tierras.Acá no ves más que tierra seca y indios mugrosos, mano.Como que no crece</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En349Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En349Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En349Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Y cuando cruzas la frontera, mano, pos hasta recuerdas bonito aquellas tierras</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Y cuando cruzas la frontera, mano, pos hasta [v|recuerdas|recordar|ts] [a|bonito|bonito|auonmnnn] aquellas tierras</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En349Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>recuerdas</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#recordar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En349Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bonito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bonito" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En350"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En350Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde55" /><gams:textualContent>Y Símula: estaban oyendo la radio pero no decían nada de la revolución, señora.Qué revolución ni ocho cuartos, Amalia se dio cuenta que estaba tomadita, ya se había arreglado todo.Pero si ellas habían visto, señora, decía Carlota, la manifestación y los policías y todo, y la señora tontas, no había de qué asustarse.Había hablado por teléfono con el señor, les iban a dar un escarmiento a los arequipeños y mañana ya estaría todo en paz.Tenía hambre y Símula le hizo un churrasco: el señor no pierde la serenidad por nada, decía la señora, no vuelvo a preocuparme así por él.Apenas levantó la mesa, Amalia se fue a acostar.Ya está, había comenzado todo de nuevo, bruta, te habías amistado con él.Sentía una languidez suave, una flojera tibiecita.Cómo se llevarían ahora, ¿se pelearían de vez en cuando?, no iría más a casa de su amigo, que alquilara un cuartito, ahí podrían pasar los domingos.Se lo arreglarás bonito , bruta.Si pudiera conversar con Carlota y contarle.No, tenía que aguantarse las ganas hasta que</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En350Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En350Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En350Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Se lo arreglarás bonito , bruta.</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Se lo [v|arreglarás|arreglar|ts] [a|bonito|bonito|auonmnnn] , bruta.</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En350Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>arreglarás</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#arreglar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En350Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bonito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bonito" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En351"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En351Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde55" /><gams:textualContent>— Una pésima cantante la Musa ésa —ordenó Cayo Mierda, asintiendo—.¿No?&lt;lb/&gt;— No me parece —dijo Queta—. Canta  bonito , sobre todo los boleros.&lt;lb/&gt;— ¿Ves?¡Ja já!—prorrumpió la mujer, señalando a Queta, haciendo una morisqueta a Cayo Mierda—.¿Ves que pierdo mi tiempo contigo?¿Ves que estoy arruinando mi carrera?</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En351Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En351Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En351Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Canta  bonito , sobre todo los boleros.</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|Canta|cantar|is]  [a|bonito|bonito|auvnmnnn] , sobre todo los boleros.</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En351Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>Canta</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cantar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En351Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bonito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bonito" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En352"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En352Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde6" /><gams:textualContent>Pero ni él ni los otros chicos les hablaban, sólo los muchachos del barrio Marconi las miraban a veces, las calculaban sabe Dios si para ellos en el futuro, dentro de dos, de tres, de cuatro veranos, o para un hermanito de once años que estaba buceando hecho un imbécil y que ahora, a la salida, para que se haga bien machito, ellos obligarían a trompearse con el palomilla que ya quería cuidar automóviles en la puerta de la piscina y que era probablemente el que se había robado la bicicleta del hermano de Pedro.Fumaban calculadores los muchachos del barrio y, entre cigarrillo y cigarrillo, iban llevando la cuenta de los saltos mortales del gringo, ojalá que en una de ésas caiga fuera de la piscina y se mate, y a quien ellos le iban a romper el alma esta tarde, a la salida, mientras tanto fumen, muchachos, fumen, controlen siempre a las gilas y no se olviden de besarlas bonito , que es lo más importante.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En352Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En352Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En352Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>controlen siempre a las gilas y no se olviden de besarlas bonito </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>controlen siempre a las gilas y no se olviden de [v|besarlas|besar|ts] [a|bonito|bonito|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En352Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>besarlas</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#besar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En352Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bonito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bonito" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En353"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En353Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde6" /><gams:textualContent>Carcajadas y aplausos de la mesa de Tonelada, donde Bobby le traducía a Lester la respuesta del vividor, y Santiago y sus amigos gastaban y se dejaban querer por las muchachas del show.Tonelada regresó y pidió que le hicieran sitio junto a su ñatita.«Contigo vida nueva, contigo al fin del mundo», le dijo, mientras se sentaba a su lado y ella lo recibía con risas y besos.Un mes se iba a quedar en Lima la ñatita, la trompudita, la de la vida nueva.Ya Tonelada le había echado el ojo, «ésta para mí», había pensado.Tenía que trabajársela bonito , sentimental .La arrinconó, le hizo su nochecita ahí, carita a cara, dándole la espalda a los otros, «¿y tú cómo caíste en lo bajo?», le preguntó, añadiéndole whisky a su vaso, y explicándole que eso a su corazón le importaba mucho saberlo.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En353Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En353Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En353Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En353Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text>Tenía que trabajársela bonito , sentimental </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Tenía que [v|trabajársela|trabajar|rs] [a|bonito|bonito|auvnmnnC] , [a|sentimental|sentimental|auvnmnnC] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En353Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>trabajársela</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#trabajar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En353Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bonito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bonito" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En353Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>sentimental</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#sentimental" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En354"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En354Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde491" /><gams:textualContent>Muchos de aquellos hombres simples oían con reverencia y hasta arrobamiento aquellos juegos de palabras sonoras e incomprensibles. Sonaba  bonito .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En354Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En354Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En354Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Sonaba  bonito </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|Sonaba|sonar|is]  [a|bonito|bonito|ausnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En354Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>Sonaba</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#sonar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En354Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bonito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bonito" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En355"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En355Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde60" /><gams:textualContent>—  Suena  bonito  y me convendría que fuera verdad —dijo la tía Julia, frotando contra mi mejilla una nariz que siempre estaba fría—.Pero es mentira de principio a fin.¿Lo físico algo secundario?Es lo más importante para que dos personas se aguanten, Varguitas.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En355Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En355Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En355Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Suena  bonito </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|Suena|sonar|is]  [a|bonito|bonito|ausnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En355Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>Suena</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#sonar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En355Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bonito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bonito" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En356"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En356Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde492" /><gams:textualContent>, porque los escogíamos mal.Por ejemplo, teníamos el gran error de fijarnos en  un tipo que hablaba bonito  y ya decíamos: "¡Ucha!...¡Qué bien habla este tipo!Ha de ser bueno</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En356Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En356Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En356Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En356Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> un tipo que hablaba bonito </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|un tipo|ms] que [v|hablaba|hablar|is] [a|bonito|bonito|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En356Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>un tipo</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En356Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>hablaba</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En356Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bonito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bonito" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En357"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En357Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde492" /><gams:textualContent>Ha de ser bueno para dirigente." Y muchas veces no era sí.No  todos los que  hablan bonito  saben actuar bien, ¿no?Otras veces hallábamos a un tipo realmente sano, honesto, que quería</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En357Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En357Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En357Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En357Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> todos los que  hablan bonito </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|todos los que|mp]  [v|hablan|hablar|is] [a|bonito|bonito|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En357Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>todos los que</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En357Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>hablan</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En357Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bonito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bonito" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En358"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En358Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde492" /><gams:textualContent>que saber darle su papel, hay que saber valorar lo de cada uno.Algunos son buenos para hablar bonito .Otros para escribir, bueno.Otros servimos para hacer bulto, por lo menos, para estar allí presentes y</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En358Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En358Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En358Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Algunos son buenos para hablar bonito </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Algunos son buenos para [v|hablar|hablar|is] [a|bonito|bonito|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En358Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>hablar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En358Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bonito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bonito" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En359"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En359Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde492" /><gams:textualContent>decir algo también respecto a nuestros partidos políticos.Lo que yo veo es que muchos de  los que  hablan bonito  en tiempo de calma, llegado un momento difícil como éste, no saben estar con nosotros.Puedo notar</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En359Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En359Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En359Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En359Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> los que  hablan bonito </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|los que|mp]  [v|hablan|hablar|is] [a|bonito|bonito|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En359Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>los que</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En359Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>hablan</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En359Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bonito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bonito" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En360"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En360Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde120" /><gams:textualContent>, a lo mejor esa misma mañana, que dejé de cantar para siempre por las calles.Una pena, porque cantaba bonito y en varios idiomas, con lo cual mi repertorio era bastante variado y lograba interrumpir muchas caquitas en vereda</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En360Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En360Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En360Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Una pena, porque cantaba bonito y en varios idiomas</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Una pena, porque [v|cantaba|cantar|is] [a|bonito|bonito|auvnmnnn] y en varios idiomas</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En360Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>cantaba</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cantar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En360Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bonito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bonito" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En361"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En361Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde120" /><gams:textualContent>los nuestros, viviendo un poquito del cuento a veces, porque la verdad es que no basta con cantar bonito  Los ejes de mi carreta para haber estado en la guerrilla del Che o haber sido su amigo o</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En361Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En361Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En361Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>no basta con cantar bonito </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>no basta con [v|cantar|cantar|ts] [a|bonito|bonito|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En361Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>cantar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cantar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En361Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bonito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bonito" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En362"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En362Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde268" /><gams:textualContent>—  Habláis  bonito , los que escribís papeles: bla, bla, bla, como los políticos...Pero de mí no</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En362Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En362Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En362Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Habláis  bonito , los que escribís papeles</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|Habláis|hablar|is]  [a|bonito|bonito|auvnmnnn] , los que escribís papeles</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En362Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>Habláis</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En362Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bonito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bonito" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En363"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En363Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde501" /><gams:textualContent>, que siempre estaba pintado y arreglando la casa nuestra, y sembrando flores y árboles para que todo se viera bonito .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En363Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En363Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En363Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En363Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>para que todo se viera bonito </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>para que [s|todo|ms] se [v|viera|ver|rs] [a|bonito|bonito|ausnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En363Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>todo</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En363Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>viera</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En363Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bonito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bonito" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En364"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En364Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde79" /><gams:textualContent>Un mozo también bajito, pero no tanto como Mesa de Noche, se acercó a ella, algo temeroso.&lt;lb/&gt;— Que la atienda bonito nomás a la bruja, porque si no lo convierte en sapo —dijo Patty.De pronto, uno de los gatos saltó a la mesa de Patty.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En364Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En364Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En364Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Que la atienda bonito nomás a la bruja</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Que la [v|atienda|atender|ts] [a|bonito|bonito|auvnmnnn] nomás a la bruja</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En364Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>atienda</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#atender" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En364Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bonito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bonito" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En365"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En365Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde79" /><gams:textualContent>levantes que he hecho así, taxeando.Tres mamitas que las recojo, les meto letra, les hablo bonito , las trabajo como se debe y me las termino agarrando, muchacho.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En365Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En365Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En365Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>les hablo bonito </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>les [v|hablo|hablar|is] [a|bonito|bonito|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En365Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>hablo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En365Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bonito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bonito" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En366"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En366Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde79" /><gams:textualContent>Y, por supuesto,  doña Inés le sonríe bonito  y acerca su mano huesuda y arrugada para depositar sus veinte dólares que ha guardado toda la semana para la limosna del domingo.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En366Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En366Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En366Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En366Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> doña Inés le sonríe bonito </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|doña Inés|fs] le [v|sonríe|sonreír|is] [a|bonito|bonito|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En366Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>doña Inés</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En366Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sonríe</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#sonreír" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En366Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bonito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bonito" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En367"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En367Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde271" /><gams:textualContent>— Se vería bonito con un azul más oscuro en el cielorraso —oye a Elena decirle a su mamá cuando se escabulle a</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En367Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En367Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En367Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Se vería bonito con un azul más oscuro</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Se [v|vería|ver|rs] [a|bonito|bonito|ausnmnnn] con un azul más oscuro</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En367Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vería</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En367Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bonito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bonito" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En368"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En368Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde81" /><gams:textualContent>— Negro York.&lt;lb/&gt;Y Mairena se reía mucho mientras avanzaba a buscarse un lugar en el círculo, y dijo: &lt;lb/&gt;—  Suena  bonito .Así debería de llamarse esta ciudad: Negro York.Bueno, algún día la rebautizaremos.&lt;lb/&gt;— Nazi York —dijo Leo.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En368Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En368Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En368Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Suena  bonito </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|Suena|sonar|is]  [a|bonito|bonito|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En368Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>Suena</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#sonar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En368Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bonito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bonito" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En369"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En369Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde423" /><gams:textualContent>saben que han de dar gualardón por ella; pues que tienen que fazen  conpra a plazo , que les cuesta cara , e que son adebdados de la pagar.E por esto, quando non ge la dan, non</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En369Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En369Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En369Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En369Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> conpra a plazo , que les cuesta cara </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|conpra a plazo|fs] , que les [v|cuesta|costar|is] [a|cara|caro|afsnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En369Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>conpra a plazo</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En369Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>cuesta</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En369Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cara</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FeminineSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En370"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En370Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde291" /><gams:textualContent>, ca syn duda tomare yo agora vengança de la muerte de mi hermano; e bien cuydo que uos costara caro  el tajar que auedes fecho en los otros con la vuestra espada ».E estonçe el rrey Çedio saco</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En370Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En370Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En370Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En370Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>bien cuydo que uos costara caro  el tajar que auedes fecho en los otros con la vuestra espada </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>bien cuydo que uos [v|costara|costar|is] [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn]  [s|el tajar que auedes fecho en los otros con la vuestra espada|ms] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En370Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>el tajar que auedes fecho en los otros con la vuestra espada</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En370Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>costara</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En370Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En371"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En371Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde292" /><gams:textualContent>Andados siete annos del regnado de Artaxerses oco Rey de persia.Mientre esse Rey artaxerses andaua por su tierra en la uenida de grecia.pensando en su fazienda &amp; en sos fechos que asmaua cometer contra otras yentes; enuio sos mandaderos a egipto por las parias que auie a auer dalla.&amp; tornaronse los mandaderos sin ellas que ge las non quisieron dar.El Rey quando aquello sopo; pesol.&amp; touolo por abaxamiento de la su onrra &amp; del so poder.&amp; non folgo con ello.&amp; guiso como costasse caro  aquel fecho a los de egipto.&amp; enuio luego por todos sos principes &amp; sus cauallerias &amp; desend sos omnes darmas.que el tenie connosçudos a mano &amp; sabie muy bien quales eran en ellas &amp; desi por todos los otros de so regno que pora armas fuesen otrossi.&amp; si grand fue la huest que el guiso pora grecia.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En371Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En371Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En371Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En371Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>guiso como costasse caro  aquel fecho a los de egipto.</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>guiso como [v|costasse|costar|is] [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn]  [s|aquel fecho|ms] a los de egipto.</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En371Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>aquel fecho</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En371Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>costasse</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En371Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En372"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En372Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde293" /><gams:textualContent> Lo caro es caro, cuesta caro , guárdasse caro , acábalo caro ; lo rehez es rehez, cuesta rehez, guárdasse rehez, acábalo rehez lo caro es rehez, lo rehez es caro.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En372Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En372Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En372Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En372Ph1Ve2" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En372Ph1Ve3" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En372Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En372Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En372Ph1Ad3" /><aaif:text> Lo caro es caro, cuesta caro , guárdasse caro , acábalo caro ;</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Lo caro|ms] es caro, [v|cuesta|costar|is] [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn] , [v|guárdasse|guardar|rs] [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn] , [v|acábalo|acabar|ts] [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn] ;</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En372Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Lo caro</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En372Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>cuesta</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En372Ph1Ve2"><aaif:text>guárdasse</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#guardar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">4</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En372Ph1Ve3"><aaif:text>acábalo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#acabar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">6</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En372Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En372Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">5</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En372Ph1Ad3"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">7</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En373"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En373Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde453" /><gams:textualContent>caridat.&lt;lb/&gt;Ella fizo mi ruego, pero con antipara,&lt;lb/&gt;dixo: «Non querria ésta que me costase cara &lt;lb/&gt;como la marroquía que me corrió la vara;&lt;lb/&gt;mas el leal amigo al bien e al mal</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En373Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En373Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En373Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Non querria ésta que me costase cara &lt;lb\/&gt;como la marroquía que me corrió la vara</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Non querria ésta que me [v|costase|costar|is] [a|cara|caro|afsnqnnn] &lt;lb\/&gt;como la marroquía que me corrió la vara</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En373Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>costase</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En373Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cara</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FeminineSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En374"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En374Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde454" /><gams:textualContent>el pendón bien guardando&lt;lb/&gt;del bueno de don Enrique.&lt;lb/&gt; El pendón de don Ferrando &lt;lb/&gt;a los moros costó caro ,&lt;lb/&gt;sus vasallos lo guardando&lt;lb/&gt;que llamando ivan «¡Faro!».&lt;lb/&gt; Con el de don Tello van</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En374Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En374Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En374Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En374Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> El pendón de don Ferrando &lt;lb\/&gt;a los moros costó caro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|El pendón de don Ferrando|ms] &lt;lb\/&gt;a los moros [v|costó|costar|is] [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En374Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>El pendón de don Ferrando</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En374Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>costó</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En374Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En375"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En375Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde456" /><gams:textualContent>con los señores comparas;&lt;lb/&gt;algazaras * muy amaras *&lt;lb/&gt;contra muchos buenos fazes,&lt;lb/&gt; tus señaras * cuestan caras &lt;lb/&gt;al coger de los agrazes.&lt;lb/&gt; 3 Religiosos muy famosos, *&lt;lb/&gt;papas, reyes, emperadores,&lt;lb/&gt;soberviosos</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En375Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En375Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En375Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En375Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> tus señaras * cuestan caras </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|tus señaras|fp] * [v|cuestan|costar|is] [a|caras|caro|axsnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En375Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>tus señaras</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En375Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>cuestan</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En375Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caras</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FemininePlural" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En376"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En376Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde457" /><gams:textualContent>Sé que m'á costado cara ,&lt;lb/&gt;Amor, vuestra companýa ,&lt;lb/&gt;pues por vos me densenpara&lt;lb/&gt;quien consolar me solía.&lt;lb/&gt;Siempre jamás vos servísin</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En376Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En376Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En376Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En376Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Sé que m'á costado cara ,&lt;lb\/&gt;Amor, vuestra companýa ,</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Sé que m'á [v|costado|costar|is] [a|cara|caro|afsnqnnn] ,&lt;lb\/&gt;Amor, [s|vuestra companýa|fs] ,</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En376Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>vuestra companýa</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En376Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>costado</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En376Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cara</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FeminineSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En377"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En377Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde458" /><gams:textualContent>8 A unos reyendo * con poco cuidado&lt;lb/&gt;aljófar * se torna la su negra pez,&lt;lb/&gt;e yo compro caro e vendo rafez , *&lt;lb/&gt;nunca he ganançia en ningunt mercado;&lt;lb/&gt;e si alguna cosa me faz' menester,</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En377Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En377Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En377Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En377Ph1Ve2" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En377Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En377Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text>e yo compro caro e vendo rafez </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>e [s|yo|us] [v|compro|comprar|is] [a|caro|caro|auonqnnn] e [v|vendo|vender|is] [a|rafez|rahez|auonqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En377Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>yo</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Undefined" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En377Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>compro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#comprar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En377Ph1Ve2"><aaif:text>vendo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vender" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">4</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En377Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En377Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>rafez</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#rahez" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">5</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En378"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En378Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde459" /><gams:textualContent>llevase más de lo que devía levar.Eso mesmo sy cobdiçié que veniese tienpo malo e caro por vender caro las cosas que tenía.O si algunas vezes demandó las cosas que l'eran ya pagadas, o si algunas</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En378Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En378Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En378Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>por vender caro las cosas que tenía</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>por [v|vender|vender|ts] [a|caro|caro|auonqnnn] las cosas que tenía</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En378Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vender</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vender" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En378Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En379"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En379Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde460" /><gams:textualContent>çielo&lt;lb/&gt;venid dar consuelo&lt;lb/&gt;a este moçuelo,&lt;lb/&gt;Jesús, tan bonito.&lt;lb/&gt;Este fue reparo,&lt;lb/&gt;avnque 1' costó caro ,&lt;lb/&gt;d'aquel pueblo amaro,&lt;lb/&gt;catiuo en Egito.&lt;lb/&gt;Este santo dino,&lt;lb/&gt;niño tan benino,&lt;lb/&gt;por redemir</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En379Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En379Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En379Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>avnque 1' costó caro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>avnque 1' [v|costó|costar|is] [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En379Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>costó</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En379Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En380"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En380Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde461" /><gams:textualContent>vatalla contra ellos, no veyendo otro reparo.E como lo vieron los ingleses, entendieron que les costarían caros  e tomáronlos por pleitesía a salva fe.E después de tomadas las armas, matáronlos todos, que uno</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En380Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En380Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En380Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>entendieron que les costarían caros </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>entendieron que les [v|costarían|costar|is] [a|caros|caro|apsnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En380Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>costarían</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En380Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caros</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#MasculinePlural" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En381"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En381Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde461" /><gams:textualContent>de Castilla de ir a cortes e servir en sus guerras con CCC de cavallo,  lo qual le salió caro al Rey que gelo dio, segund se contiene en su título.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En381Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En381Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En381Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En381Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> lo qual le salió caro al Rey</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|lo qual|ms] le [v|salió|salir|is] [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn] al Rey</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En381Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>lo qual</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En381Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>salió</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#salir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En381Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En382"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En382Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde90" /><gams:textualContent>concertado,&lt;lb/&gt;no camines al revés,&lt;lb/&gt;passa siempre por el vado,&lt;lb/&gt;no quieras lo mal ganado ,&lt;lb/&gt;que cuesta caro después.&lt;lb/&gt;¡Qué vanos bienes terrenos,&lt;lb/&gt;qué pobre bivir amargo!,&lt;lb/&gt;quien déstos tiene más cargo</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En382Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En382Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En382Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En382Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>no quieras lo mal ganado ,&lt;lb\/&gt;que cuesta caro después</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>no quieras [s|lo mal ganado|ms] ,&lt;lb\/&gt;que [v|cuesta|costar|is] [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn] después</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En382Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>lo mal ganado</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En382Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>cuesta</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En382Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En383"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En383Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde462" /><gams:textualContent>— Señor, yo lo conozco, mas no ha mucho; y cuando lo conoscí, mucho me costó caro , fasta ser llagado al punto de la muerte.Mas él, que el daño me hizo</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En383Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En383Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En383Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>mucho me costó caro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>mucho me [v|costó|costar|is] [a|caro|caro|ausmqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En383Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>costó</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En383Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En384"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En384Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde91" /><gams:textualContent>así que no sé quién no se goce en mentarlo.No tiene sino una tacha: que lo bueno vale caro y lo malo hace daño.Así que con lo que sana el hígado enferma la bolsa.Pero todavía con</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En384Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En384Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En384Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En384Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>que lo bueno vale caro y lo malo hace daño</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>que [s|lo bueno|ms] [v|vale|valer|is] [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn] y lo malo hace daño</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En384Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>lo bueno</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En384Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vale</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#valer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En384Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En385"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En385Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde141" /><gams:textualContent>el bezerro mas sin las abejas mas sofrir lo ha mejor que el pobre quanto mas que  las abejas assy auidas  cuestan caro .La otra manera para auer abejas delas monteses que estan en los huecos delos arboles es esta y esto</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En385Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En385Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En385Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En385Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> las abejas assy auidas  cuestan caro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|las abejas assy auidas|fp]  [v|cuestan|costar|is] [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En385Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>las abejas assy auidas</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En385Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>cuestan</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En385Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En386"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En386Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde92" /><gams:textualContent>Punto&lt;lb/&gt;y afanes de rato en rato.&lt;lb/&gt;Llegados somos al trato&lt;lb/&gt;do virtudes son tan raras,&lt;lb/&gt;que las bestias valen caras &lt;lb/&gt;y los honbres  muy barato .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En386Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En386Ph1Su1" /><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En386Ph1Su2" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En386Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En386Ph1Ve2" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En386Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En386Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text>que las bestias valen caras &lt;lb\/&gt;y los honbres  muy barato .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>que [s|las bestias|fp] [v|valen|valer|is] [a|caras|caro|axsnqnnn] &lt;lb\/&gt;y [s|los honbres|mp] [v||valer|ih] muy [a|barato|barato|ausmqnnn] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En386Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>las bestias</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En386Ph1Su2"><aaif:text>los honbres</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">4</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En386Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>valen</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#valer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En386Ph1Ve2"><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#valer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">5</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En386Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caras</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FemininePlural" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En386Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>barato</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#barato" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">6</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En387"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En387Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde463" /><gams:textualContent>— Regner, si no estuviéssemos delante del emperador, yo haría que vos costasse caro lo que dezís , ca vos mentistes en ello.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En387Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En387Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En387Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En387Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>yo haría que vos costasse caro lo que dezís , ca vos mentistes en ello</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>yo haría que vos [v|costasse|costar|is] [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn] [s|lo que dezís|ms] , ca vos mentistes en ello</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En387Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>lo que dezís</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En387Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>costasse</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En387Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En388"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En388Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde94" /><gams:textualContent>, Dïana,&lt;lb/&gt;en esta siesta insana, tu ejercicio;&lt;lb/&gt;por agora  tu oficio desamparo,&lt;lb/&gt;que me ha costado caro en este día.&lt;lb/&gt;¡Ay dulce fuente mía, y de cuán alto&lt;lb/&gt;con solo un sobresalto m'arrojaste</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En388Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En388Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En388Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En388Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> tu oficio desamparo,&lt;lb\/&gt;que me ha costado caro en este día</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|tu oficio|ms] desamparo,&lt;lb\/&gt;que me [v|ha costado|costar|is] [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn] en este día</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En388Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>tu oficio</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En388Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>ha costado</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En388Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En389"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En389Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde464" /><gams:textualContent>que es buen varón y verdadero christiano,  buena obra le haze en lugar de mala, aunque a él le costará cara .Si las haze al que es malo, aquél le dió por ventura ocasión a ello con su maldad</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En389Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En389Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En389Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En389Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> buena obra le haze en lugar de mala, aunque a él le costará cara </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|buena obra|fs] le haze en lugar de mala, aunque a él le [v|costará|costar|is] [a|cara|caro|afsnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En389Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>buena obra</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En389Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>costará</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En389Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cara</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FeminineSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En390"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En390Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde465" /><gams:textualContent>, y dexarlo del todo antes que entres en ello, porque, si comienças y tornas atrás, costarte ha caro después; ca, según he visto, los que algún tiempo fueron recogidos y lo dexaron, siempre paran</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En390Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En390Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En390Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>si comienças y tornas atrás, costarte ha caro después</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>si comienças y tornas atrás, [v|costarte|costar|is] ha [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn] después</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En390Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>costarte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En390Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En391"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En391Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde95" /><gams:textualContent>pobres en semejantes necessidades, sino para poner a las repúblicas en otras mayores; porque, según entonces venden caro  y según lo mucho que dan a logro, yo juro que juren los míseros pobres que más daño les</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En391Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En391Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En391Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>según entonces venden caro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>según entonces [v|venden|vender|is] [a|caro|caro|auonqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En391Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>venden</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vender" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En391Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En392"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En392Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde95" /><gams:textualContent>lo que vendía y tú no conociendo lo que compravas, diote lo caro barato y lo barato te vendió caro ; diote lo agro por dulce y lo dulce te tornó agro; lo malo te dio por bueno y</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En392Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En392Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En392Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>diote lo caro barato y lo barato te vendió caro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>diote lo caro barato y lo barato te [v|vendió|vender|ts] [a|caro|caro|auonqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En392Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vendió</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vender" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En392Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En393"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En393Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde183" /><gams:textualContent>que él quería, parte de miedo que los parientes della no lo supiesen y a él no le costase caro  tan gran bellaquería , con ayuda de la criada, la cual se temía de lo mismo, ahogó a </gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En393Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En393Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En393Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En393Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>a él no le costase caro  tan gran bellaquería </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>a él no le [v|costase|costar|is] [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn]  [s|tan gran bellaquería|fs] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En393Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>tan gran bellaquería</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En393Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>costase</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En393Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En394"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En394Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde466" /><gams:textualContent>: que stando en un vanquete alabavan todos  ciertos capones que allí se comían , y diziendo uno que valían caros  porque costava un ducado cada uno, respondió la dama: —«¿A esso llamáis caro?,</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En394Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En394Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En394Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En394Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> ciertos capones que allí se comían , y diziendo uno que valían caros </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|ciertos capones que allí se comían|mp] , y diziendo uno que [v|valían|valer|is] [a|caros|caro|apsnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En394Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>ciertos capones que allí se comían</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En394Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>valían</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#valer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En394Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caros</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#MasculinePlural" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En395"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En395Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde241" /><gams:textualContent>que llegó hasta que salió del Perú, ca fue necessario gastar largo con los españoles, y  valían  caríssimo  las cosas de Castilla , no solamente las de comer y vestir, pero las de guerrear, como eran</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En395Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En395Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En395Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En395Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> valían  caríssimo  las cosas de Castilla </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|valían|valer|is]  [a|caríssimo|caro|ausnqnnn]  [s|las cosas de Castilla|fp] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En395Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>las cosas de Castilla</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En395Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>valían</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#valer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En395Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caríssimo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En396"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En396Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde241" /><gams:textualContent>governador y adelantado; y hizo muchas cosas con los indios y aun con españoles, que a otro costaran caro .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En396Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En396Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En396Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En396Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>hizo muchas cosas con los indios y aun con españoles, que a otro costaran caro .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>hizo [s|muchas cosas|fp] con los indios y aun con españoles, que a otro [v|costaran|costar|is] [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En396Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>muchas cosas</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En396Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>costaran</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En396Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En397"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En397Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde306" /><gams:textualContent>él tenía tan bien por cuenta, que, si por malos de mis pecados me desmandara a más de mi tasa, me costara caro .Finalmente, yo me finaba de hambre.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En397Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En397Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En397Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>si por malos de mis pecados me desmandara a más de mi tasa, me costara caro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>si por malos de mis pecados me desmandara a más de mi tasa, me [v|costara|costar|is] [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En397Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>costara</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En397Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En398"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En398Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde142" /><gams:textualContent>Mata.¿ Cuestan  caros ?</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En398Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En398Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En398Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>¿ Cuestan  caros ?</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>¿ [v|Cuestan|costar|is]  [a|caros|caro|apsnqnnn] ?</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En398Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>Cuestan</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En398Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caros</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#MasculinePlural" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En399"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En399Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde142" /><gams:textualContent>Mata.¿ Valen  caras las aves ?</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En399Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En399Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En399Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En399Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>¿ Valen  caras las aves ?</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>¿ [v|Valen|valer|is]  [a|caras|caro|axsnqnnn] [s|las aves|fp] ?</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En399Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>las aves</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En399Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>Valen</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#valer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En399Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caras</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FemininePlural" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En400"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En400Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde308" /><gams:textualContent>o iros con Dios, y de aquí adelante tened más miramiento en lo que dijéreis , porque os costará caro por ello, e os haré castigar." Era muy porfiado, en especial en cosas de la guerra,</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En400Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En400Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En400Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En400Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>tened más miramiento en lo que dijéreis , porque os costará caro por ello</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>tened más miramiento en [s|lo que dijéreis|ms] , porque os [v|costará|costar|is] [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn] por ello</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En400Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>lo que dijéreis</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En400Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>costará</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En400Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En401"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En401Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde102" /><gams:textualContent>al sexo tímido reparo,&lt;lb/&gt;y de suerte en los bárbaros se envuelven&lt;lb/&gt;que a más de diez la vuelta costó caro ;&lt;lb/&gt;por esto los primeros aun no vuelven&lt;lb/&gt;que quieren que el partido sea más claro,&lt;lb/&gt;y no poner</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En401Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En401Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En401Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En401Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>a más de diez la vuelta costó caro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>a más de diez [s|la vuelta|fs] [v|costó|costar|is] [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En401Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>la vuelta</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En401Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>costó</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En401Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En402"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En402Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde102" /><gams:textualContent>en demanda del bárbaro Lautaro&lt;lb/&gt;y el cargo que tan loco desatino&lt;lb/&gt;como es venir allí, le cueste caro .&lt;lb/&gt;Diose tal priesa a andar que presto vino&lt;lb/&gt;a la corva ribera del río Claro,&lt;lb/&gt;que vuelve</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En402Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En402Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En402Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En402Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>y el cargo que tan loco desatino&lt;lb\/&gt;como es venir allí, le cueste caro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>y [s|el cargo|ms] que tan loco desatino&lt;lb\/&gt;como es venir allí, le [v|cueste|costar|is] [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En402Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>el cargo</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En402Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>cueste</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En402Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En403"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En403Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde102" /><gams:textualContent>orgulloso,&lt;lb/&gt;que las parias que pides , ¡oh Lautaro!,&lt;lb/&gt;te costarán , si esperas, presto caro .&lt;lb/&gt;»En pago de tu loco atrevimiento&lt;lb/&gt;te darán españoles por tributo&lt;lb/&gt;cruda muerte con áspero tormento,</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En403Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En403Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En403Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En403Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>que las parias que pides , ¡oh Lautaro!,&lt;lb\/&gt;te costarán , si esperas, presto caro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>que [s|las parias que pides|fp] , ¡oh Lautaro!,&lt;lb\/&gt;te [v|costarán|costar|is] , si esperas, presto [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En403Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>las parias que pides</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En403Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>costarán</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En403Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En404"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En404Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde467" /><gams:textualContent>Un señor dijo a uno que era su convidado, que bebía muy poco vino: &lt;lb/&gt;-Si todos bebiesen como vos, barato valdría el vino.&lt;lb/&gt;Respondió: &lt;lb/&gt; —Antes valdría caro , porque yo bebo cuanto quiero.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En404Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En404Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En404Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Antes valdría caro , porque yo bebo cuanto quiero</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Antes [v|valdría|valer|is] [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn] , porque yo bebo cuanto quiero</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En404Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>valdría</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#valer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En404Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En405"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En405Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde9" /><gams:textualContent>Al juego de daca y toma &lt;lb/&gt;se juega ya con las damas: &lt;lb/&gt;que a la dama, sin recibo, &lt;lb/&gt;nadie le alquila sus casas.* &lt;lb/&gt;Dígame, por vida suya, *&lt;lb/&gt;injundia de mis entrañas,&lt;lb/&gt;¿tanto la miente su espejo,&lt;lb/&gt;que aspire a venderse cara ?*&lt;lb/&gt;¿Tan soberbia me la tienen&lt;lb/&gt;cuatro mudas y seis pasas&lt;lb/&gt;del gran turco Solimán,&lt;lb/&gt;con artificio preñadas?</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En405Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En405Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En405Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>¿tanto la miente su espejo,&lt;lb\/&gt;que aspire a venderse cara ?</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>¿tanto la miente su espejo,&lt;lb\/&gt;que aspire a [v|venderse|vender|rs] [a|cara|caro|afsnqnnn] ?</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En405Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>venderse</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vender" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En405Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cara</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FeminineSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En406"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En406Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde316" /><gams:textualContent>con gran desassossiego,&lt;lb/&gt;hasta acabar vn hecho torpe, y raro,&lt;lb/&gt; el qual , aunque le pudo costar caro ,&lt;lb/&gt;le dio la vida, y le causò sossiego.&lt;lb/&gt;El hierro de la lança que lleuaua&lt;lb/&gt;le siruio</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En406Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En406Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En406Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En406Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> el qual , aunque le pudo costar caro ,&lt;lb\/&gt;le dio la vida</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|el qual|ms] , aunque le pudo [v|costar|costar|is] [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn] ,&lt;lb\/&gt;le dio la vida</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En406Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>el qual</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En406Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>costar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En406Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En407"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En407Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde468" /><gams:textualContent>contrastando a la fortuna,&lt;lb/&gt;entregan desvalidos&lt;lb/&gt;al ocio blando todos los sentidos.&lt;lb/&gt;Que amor sus glorias venda &lt;lb/&gt; caras , es gran razón y es trato justo,&lt;lb/&gt;pues no hay más rica prenda&lt;lb/&gt;que la que se quilata</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En407Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En407Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En407Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En407Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Que amor sus glorias venda &lt;lb\/&gt; caras </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Que [s|amor|ms] sus glorias [v|venda|vender|ts] &lt;lb\/&gt; [a|caras|caro|axonqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En407Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>amor</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En407Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>venda</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vender" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En407Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caras</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FemininePlural" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En408"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En408Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde147" /><gams:textualContent>si hay tiento, el rasero está en la mano.Y si por la prisa, o por comprarse cara la cebada, o con celo de hacer bien por vuestro padre, quisiéredes medir con el celemín del</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En408Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En408Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En408Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>o por comprarse cara la cebada</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>o por [v|comprarse|comprar|rs] [a|cara|caro|afonqnnn] la cebada</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En408Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>comprarse</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#comprar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En408Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cara</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FeminineSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En409"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En409Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde469" /><gams:textualContent>mal término es el que usáis!&lt;lb/&gt;No me quitéis el embozo ,&lt;lb/&gt;porque a fe que os cueste caro .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En409Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En409Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En409Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En409Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>No me quitéis el embozo ,&lt;lb\/&gt;porque a fe que os cueste caro .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>No me quitéis [s|el embozo|ms] ,&lt;lb\/&gt;porque a fe que os [v|cueste|costar|is] [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En409Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>el embozo</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En409Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>cueste</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En409Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En410"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En410Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde470" /><gams:textualContent>no hay quien masque frenos,&lt;lb/&gt;y si alzo la vara,&lt;lb/&gt; yo os haré que la pulla os cueste cara .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En410Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En410Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En410Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En410Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>yo os haré que la pulla os cueste cara .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>yo os haré que [s|la pulla|fs] os [v|cueste|costar|is] [a|cara|caro|afsnqnnn] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En410Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>la pulla</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En410Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>cueste</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En410Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cara</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FeminineSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En411"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En411Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde471" /><gams:textualContent>la tabla enemiga&lt;lb/&gt;con lengua muda el mismo salmón diga:&lt;lb/&gt;«colorado me paro&lt;lb/&gt;de vergüenza de verme vender caro ,&lt;lb/&gt;con sisa y con dedillo»,&lt;lb/&gt;vaya con Dios, ¿pero el abadejillo,&lt;lb/&gt;que se hace</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En411Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En411Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En411Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>vergüenza de verme vender caro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>vergüenza de verme [v|vender|vender|is] [a|caro|caro|auonqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En411Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vender</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vender" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En411Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En412"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En412Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde472" /><gams:textualContent>que  esto no se puede hacer conmigo, y que a no ser vs. ms. quien son, les podría costar caro .Manden contentar estos testigos, y echen de ver que les sirvo sin interés".Yo vi luego</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En412Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En412Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En412Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En412Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> esto no se puede hacer conmigo, y que a no ser vs. ms. quien son, les podría costar caro .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|esto|ms] no se puede hacer conmigo, y que a no ser vs. ms. quien son, les podría [v|costar|costar|is] [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En412Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>esto</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En412Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>costar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En412Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En413"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En413Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde430" /><gams:textualContent>más», «yo lo haré», «aquí me las tengo» y  otras cosas que cuestan caro a los que las dicen</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En413Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En413Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En413Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En413Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> otras cosas que cuestan caro a los que las dicen</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|otras cosas|fp] que [v|cuestan|costar|is] [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn] a los que las dicen</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En413Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>otras cosas</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En413Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>cuestan</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En413Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En414"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En414Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde473" /><gams:textualContent>de la Guardia i el que la Reyna levantó.Y todas han quedado deshechas, con que le cuesta carísima la Vitoria .Assí se escrive.Con esta ganancia se ha ensanchado el Francés por la Lorena a Alemania</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En414Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En414Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En414Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En414Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>le cuesta carísima la Vitoria .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>le [v|cuesta|costar|is] [a|carísima|caro|afsnqnnn] [s|la Vitoria|fs] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En414Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>la Vitoria</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En414Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>cuesta</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En414Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>carísima</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FeminineSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En415"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En415Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde184" /><gams:textualContent>de montambanco y, ayudándome del oficio de charlatán, ensalzaba mis drogas y encarecía la cura y vendía caro ; porque la persona que quisiere cargar en España para vaciar en otros reinos ha de vender sus mercancías por</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En415Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En415Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En415Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>ensalzaba mis drogas y encarecía la cura y vendía caro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>ensalzaba mis drogas y encarecía la cura y [v|vendía|vender|is] [a|caro|caro|auonqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En415Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vendía</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vender" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En415Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En416"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En416Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde280" /><gams:textualContent>tus ruegos.Pidele Sara a Abraan ijos de su esclava Agar: dióselo como lo quería, y  costóle  caro  lo que mas deseó : despectui me habet.Gen.19. y lo que antes quería, ya</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En416Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En416Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En416Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En416Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> costóle  caro  lo que mas deseó </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|costóle|costar|is]  [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn]  [s|lo que mas deseó|ms] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En416Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>lo que mas deseó</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En416Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>costóle</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En416Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En417"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En417Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde280" /><gams:textualContent>esso a de bastar para el pesar; y no porque es mi daño, o porque me puede costar caro mi delito .Esso solo mirava David en su culpa, el ser solo contra Dios: Tibi soli peccavi</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En417Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En417Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En417Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En417Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>porque me puede costar caro mi delito .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>porque me puede [v|costar|costar|is] [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn] [s|mi delito|ms] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En417Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>mi delito</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En417Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>costar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En417Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En418"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En418Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde210" /><gams:textualContent>le tiró tantos flechazos que a no averse prevenido con el resguardo de llevar las armas dobles le huviera costado caro  el querer vengar duelos agenos ; pero al fin, metiéndole la espada por los pechos, le huvo</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En418Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En418Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En418Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En418Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>le huviera costado caro  el querer vengar duelos agenos </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>le [v|huviera costado|costar|is] [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn]  [s|el querer vengar duelos agenos|ms] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En418Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>el querer vengar duelos agenos</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En418Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>huviera costado</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En418Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En419"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En419Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde337" /><gams:textualContent>; que soy infeliz y soñarán un comento a mi explicación en que, trabucado el sentido, me cueste caro  el uso de las voces , aunque vivo seguro de pleitos.Pues cualquier contrario mío puede tener por suya</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En419Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En419Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En419Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En419Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>me cueste caro  el uso de las voces </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>me [v|cueste|costar|is] [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn]  [s|el uso de las voces|ms] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En419Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>el uso de las voces</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En419Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>cueste</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En419Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En420"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En420Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde155" /><gams:textualContent>su cosecha; pero querer que el labrador venda barato su grano, y todo lo que necesite lo compre caro , y además de eso pague puntualmente los tributos, es pedir imposibles.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En420Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En420Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En420Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En420Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>querer que el labrador venda barato su grano, y todo lo que necesite lo compre caro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>querer que [s|el labrador|ms] venda barato su grano, y todo lo que necesite lo [v|compre|comprar|ts] [a|caro|caro|auonqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En420Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>el labrador</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En420Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>compre</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#comprar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En420Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En421"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En421Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde474" /><gams:textualContent>á Lóndres.A vuestra llegada os aconsejo dexeis todo el exterior contraido en París, porque os podrá costar caro  el afectar mucho galicanismo .En Lóndres os entregareis á todo género de libertad, y volved al continente</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En421Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En421Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En421Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En421Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>porque os podrá costar caro  el afectar mucho galicanismo </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>porque os podrá [v|costar|costar|is] [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn]  [s|el afectar mucho galicanismo|ms] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En421Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>el afectar mucho galicanismo</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En421Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>costar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En421Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En422"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En422Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde475" /><gams:textualContent>y se traga el anzuelo.&lt;lb/&gt;Mira que  ese bocado &lt;lb/&gt;no es para necios,&lt;lb/&gt;y te ha de salir caro &lt;lb/&gt;si has de comerlo.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En422Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En422Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En422Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En422Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> ese bocado &lt;lb\/&gt;no es para necios,&lt;lb\/&gt;y te ha de salir caro &lt;lb\/&gt;si has de comerlo.</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|ese bocado|ms] &lt;lb\/&gt;no es para necios,&lt;lb\/&gt;y te ha de [v|salir|salir|is] [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn] &lt;lb\/&gt;si has de comerlo.</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En422Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>ese bocado</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En422Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>salir</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#salir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En422Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En423"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En423Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde159" /><gams:textualContent>, armellas y cuanto más herraje es necesario, pero traído desde Europa de cuenta de S. M. para no tener que comprar caro estos efectos a los comerciantes: anticipando también estopa de coco, que es buena para algunas costuras, y</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En423Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En423Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En423Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>para no tener que comprar caro estos efectos a los comerciantes</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>para no tener que [v|comprar|comprar|ts] [a|caro|caro|auonqnnn] estos efectos a los comerciantes</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En423Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>comprar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#comprar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En423Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En424"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En424Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde476" /><gams:textualContent>Juan y Pepita.&lt;lb/&gt;Ya va viniendo&lt;lb/&gt;mi dueño falso;&lt;lb/&gt;como pueda,  el lance &lt;lb/&gt;le ha de costar caro .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En424Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En424Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En424Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En424Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> el lance &lt;lb\/&gt;le ha de costar caro .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|el lance|ms] &lt;lb\/&gt;le ha de [v|costar|costar|is] [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En424Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>el lance</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En424Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>costar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En424Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En425"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En425Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde13" /><gams:textualContent>sueño&lt;lb/&gt;Para volar con él:&lt;lb/&gt;Mi labio ¡ay Dios!te nombra,&lt;lb/&gt;Pero despierto, y pago &lt;lb/&gt; Caro el fugaz halago&lt;lb/&gt;Con un dolor cruel.&lt;lb/&gt;Ponga la noche al menos&lt;lb/&gt;Tregua á las ansias mias;&lt;lb/&gt;Y pues</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En425Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En425Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En425Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Pero despierto, y pago &lt;lb\/&gt; Caro el fugaz halago&lt;lb\/&gt;Con un dolor cruel</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Pero despierto, y [v|pago|pagar|ts] &lt;lb\/&gt; [a|Caro|caro|auonqnnn] el fugaz halago&lt;lb\/&gt;Con un dolor cruel</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En425Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>pago</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#pagar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En425Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>Caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En426"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En426Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde477" /><gams:textualContent>algo más gustosa si hubiera sabido desprenderme de los ambiciosos deseos de  un cierto patriotismo que me va ya saliendo caro .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En426Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En426Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En426Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En426Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> un cierto patriotismo que me va ya saliendo caro .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|un cierto patriotismo|ms] que me va ya [v|saliendo|salir|is] [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En426Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>un cierto patriotismo</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En426Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>saliendo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#salir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En426Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En427"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En427Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde478" /><gams:textualContent>de afligirme que en tan pocos días se hayan desaparecido los quinientos pesos. Esas obras de casa nos saldrán caras , a lo que veo.Ahora más que nunca es necesaria la economía, porque si tenemos mutación de</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En427Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En427Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En427Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En427Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Esas obras de casa nos saldrán caras </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Esas obras de casa|fp] nos [v|saldrán|salir|is] [a|caras|caro|axsnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En427Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Esas obras de casa</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En427Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>saldrán</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#salir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En427Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caras</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FemininePlural" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En428"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En428Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde13" /><gams:textualContent>sin favor ni amparo.&lt;lb/&gt;¡O de un padre infeliz hijos queridos,&lt;lb/&gt;Cuánto su tierno amor os cuesta caro !&lt;lb/&gt;¡Ojalá fuera menos su indulgencia,&lt;lb/&gt;Y nunca os diera la fatal licencia!</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En428Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En428Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En428Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En428Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Cuánto su tierno amor os cuesta caro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Cuánto [s|su tierno amor|ms] os [v|cuesta|costar|is] [a|caro|caro|auonqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En428Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>su tierno amor</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En428Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>cuesta</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En428Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En429"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En429Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde479" /><gams:textualContent>porque fué preciso lavar la ropa que se ensució en el estero del Caáñabé. Esta lavadera me costó cara , porque en ella y al sacarla me robaron camizas, calzetas, pañuelos, etc., lo que</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En429Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En429Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En429Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En429Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Esta lavadera me costó cara </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Esta lavadera|fs] me [v|costó|costar|is] [a|cara|caro|afonqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En429Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Esta lavadera</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En429Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>costó</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En429Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cara</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FeminineSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En430"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En430Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde139" /><gams:textualContent>las fatales resultas de una embaxada tan terrible tomó su camino, pero estraviando de rumbo.Mas le costó caro  su inobediencia , porque en el mar tubo que padecer muchos sustos y peligros donde le salió la Muerte a</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En430Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En430Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En430Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En430Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Mas le costó caro  su inobediencia </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Mas le [v|costó|costar|is] [a|caro|caro|auonqnnn]  [s|su inobediencia|fs] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En430Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>su inobediencia</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En430Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>costó</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En430Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En431"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En431Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde216" /><gams:textualContent>, y de la Iglesia amparo,&lt;lb/&gt;Así tu silla en duracion retrata,&lt;lb/&gt;Y así de santo honor comerció caro &lt;lb/&gt;En dulces lazos de piedad las ata;&lt;lb/&gt;Lazos que desde el tiempo más remoto&lt;lb/&gt;La turbadora envidia nunca ha</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En431Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En431Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En431Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Y así de santo honor comerció caro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Y así de santo honor [v|comerció|comerciar|is] [a|caro|caro|auonqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En431Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>comerció</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#comerciar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En431Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En432"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En432Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde164" /><gams:textualContent>; y pienso que al primer tapón he de salir, tal vez, con un emblema que me cueste caro , * y cuando piense que voy a traer lana, salga trasquilado hasta el cogote.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En432Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En432Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En432Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En432Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>con un emblema que me cueste caro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>con [s|un emblema|ms] que me [v|cueste|costar|is] [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En432Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>un emblema</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En432Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>cueste</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En432Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En433"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En433Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde246" /><gams:textualContent>- Bien -dijo-, te doy permiso;una sola condición quiero imponerte: supuesto que nada me ocurre a mí propio que pueda ser de provecho en tan crítica circunstancia, quiero probar tu entendimiento.¿Sabes empero lo que es la vida?¿Sabes lo que es mi honor?Respeta la primera en la víctima y el segundo en tu amo;¿te acomoda esta condición?&lt;lb/&gt;Una inclinación de cabeza manifestó el asentimiento del juglar.&lt;lb/&gt;- En buen hora;adiós -dijo el conde levantándose-.Ferrus, vida y honor;si infringes los tratados, tu sangre me responderá de tu malicia o de tu ignorancia y  pagarás  cara tu loca presunción;serás la primera víctima que podrá acusarme de haber borrado un ser de la lista de de los vivientes.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En433Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En433Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En433Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> pagarás  cara tu loca presunción</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|pagarás|pagar|ts]  [a|cara|caro|afonqnnn] tu loca presunción</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En433Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>pagarás</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#pagar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En433Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cara</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FeminineSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En434"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En434Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde246" /><gams:textualContent>de que existía en su poder, permanecía  Hernando en su puesto con su alano, bien decidido a vender cara su vida si no podía salvar a su señor; viendo que nadie se acordaba de él, se determinó</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En434Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En434Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En434Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En434Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Hernando en su puesto con su alano, bien decidido a vender cara su vida</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Hernando|ms] en su puesto con su alano, bien decidido a [v|vender|vender|ts] [a|cara|caro|afonqnnn] su vida</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En434Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Hernando</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En434Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vender</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vender" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En434Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cara</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FeminineSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En435"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En435Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde246" /><gams:textualContent>¡Voto a tal!—exclamó Hernando aplicando el oído—.Me han descubierto los traidores; vendámosles caras nuestras vidas.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En435Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En435Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En435Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Me han descubierto los traidores; vendámosles caras nuestras vidas.</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Me han descubierto los traidores; [v|vendámosles|vender|ts] [a|caras|caro|axonqnnn] nuestras vidas.</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En435Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vendámosles</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vender" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En435Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caras</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FemininePlural" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En436"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En436Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde480" /><gams:textualContent>un día de asueto.Es lo malo que si me recogen antes de que me lean,  habré pagado  caro el placer de un monólogo escrito; pero siempre me queda el recurso de aprenderlo antes de coro, y</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En436Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En436Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En436Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> habré pagado  caro el placer de un monólogo escrito</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|habré pagado|pagar|ts]  [a|caro|caro|auonqnnn] el placer de un monólogo escrito</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En436Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>habré pagado</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#pagar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En436Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En437"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En437Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde247" /><gams:textualContent>—  Ese odio tuyo a los españoles —dijo doña Rosa— todavía ha de costarnos caro , Leonardo.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En437Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En437Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En437Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En437Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Ese odio tuyo a los españoles —dijo doña Rosa— todavía ha de costarnos caro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Ese odio tuyo a los españoles|ms] —dijo doña Rosa— todavía ha de [v|costarnos|costar|is] [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En437Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Ese odio tuyo a los españoles</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En437Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>costarnos</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En437Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En438"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En438Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde247" /><gams:textualContent>Recalque V. a Dubois que el reloj es para mí.Él me conoce y debe saber que le costará caro ...</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En438Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En438Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En438Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>debe saber que le costará caro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>debe saber que le [v|costará|costar|is] [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En438Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>costará</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En438Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En439"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En439Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde247" /><gams:textualContent>— Para eso —dijo Cecilia con satisfacción— que le costó caro  el meterse conmigo .A la salida del baile esperó a José Dolores en la esquina de la calle Ancha</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En439Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En439Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En439Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En439Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>que le costó caro  el meterse conmigo </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>que le [v|costó|costar|is] [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn]  [s|el meterse conmigo|ms] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En439Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>el meterse conmigo</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En439Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>costó</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En439Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En440"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En440Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde368" /><gams:textualContent>y le pondréis nuestras pieles, que es lo que dicen que hacéis; pero aún os ha de costar caro .En cuanto a venir a haceros guerra, el rey y el conde de Lemus, nuestros naturales señores, lo</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En440Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En440Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En440Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>pero aún os ha de costar caro .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>pero aún os ha de [v|costar|costar|is] [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En440Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>costar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En440Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En441"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En441Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde169" /><gams:textualContent>Tolox—.Pues que el otro quiere que nos vistamos a su gusto, y que el azúcar se compre caro , y yo —decía Capita— me excusaría de tomar cartas en este fregado si la azúcar no sirviese</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En441Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En441Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En441Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En441Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>que el azúcar se compre caro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>que [s|el azúcar|ms] se [v|compre|comprar|rs] [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En441Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>el azúcar</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En441Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>compre</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#comprar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En441Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En442"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En442Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde218" /><gams:textualContent>— Pero una broma que me cuesta caro , pues mi mujer me saca los ojos.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En442Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En442Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En442Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En442Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Pero una broma que me cuesta caro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Pero [s|una broma|fs] que me [v|cuesta|costar|is] [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En442Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>una broma</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En442Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>cuesta</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En442Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En443"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En443Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde282" /><gams:textualContent>— Estos ricos —repuso Amador— quieren andar engañando muchachas;  éste la pagará caro .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En443Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En443Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En443Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En443Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> éste la pagará caro .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|éste|ms] la [v|pagará|pagar|ts] [a|caro|caro|auonqnnn] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En443Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>éste</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En443Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>pagará</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#pagar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En443Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En444"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En444Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde282" /><gams:textualContent>sabe también la que tiene el niño y lo sabrán todos; ¡ maldito futre; le ha de costar caro !</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En444Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En444Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En444Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>¡ maldito futre; le ha de costar caro !</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>¡ maldito futre; le ha de [v|costar|costar|is] [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn] !</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En444Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>costar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En444Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En445"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En445Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde248" /><gams:textualContent>te quejarás mañana de las ratas como la otra vez:  una mala noche que te hicieron pasar les ha costado carísimo : les he hecho desde entonces guerra a muerte.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En445Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En445Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En445Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En445Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> una mala noche que te hicieron pasar les ha costado carísimo </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|una mala noche que te hicieron pasar|fs] les [v|ha costado|costar|is] [a|carísimo|caro|ausnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En445Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>una mala noche que te hicieron pasar</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En445Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>ha costado</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En445Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>carísimo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En446"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En446Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde482" /><gams:textualContent>, yo encontré al mozo la noche del día 5 y regresé a Zacoalco y volví a despacharle caro el carruaje.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En446Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En446Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En446Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>volví a despacharle caro el carruaje</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>volví a [v|despacharle|despachar|ts] [a|caro|caro|auonqnnn] el carruaje</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En446Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>despacharle</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#despachar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En446Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En447"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En447Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde374" /><gams:textualContent>desarmado.Podía llegar el caso de tener que perder la vida, y era menester ir preparado a venderla cara .Hay una idea a la que el hombre no se resigna sino cuando es santo, y es a</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En447Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En447Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En447Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>tener que perder la vida, y era menester ir preparado a venderla cara </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>tener que perder la vida, y era menester ir preparado a [v|venderla|vender|ts] [a|cara|caro|afonqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En447Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>venderla</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vender" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En447Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cara</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FeminineSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En448"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En448Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde374" /><gams:textualContent>enojaba conmigo, también.Mi madre me dijo que ella sabía por qué era: que me había de costar caro , por no escuchar sus consejos; que cómo me imaginaba que la Dolores podía ser mi mujer: que</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En448Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En448Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En448Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>que me había de costar caro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>que me había de [v|costar|costar|is] [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En448Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>costar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En448Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En449"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En449Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde374" /><gams:textualContent>fondo de su alma.La salida de Macías, a quien tanto habían mortificado y ultrajado, haciéndole pagar caro el pedazo de carne que le daban, los contrariaba</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En449Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En449Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En449Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>haciéndole pagar caro el pedazo de carne</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>haciéndole [v|pagar|pagar|ts] [a|caro|caro|auonqnnn] el pedazo de carne</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En449Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>pagar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#pagar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En449Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En450"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En450Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde483" /><gams:textualContent>mar, ni por la tierra, Cláudia, contestó dulcemente el jóven, hay nadie que le haga pagar caro á Francisco Estévan nada de lo que haga.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En450Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En450Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En450Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>hay nadie que le haga pagar caro á Francisco Estévan nada de lo que haga.</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>hay nadie que le haga [v|pagar|pagar|ts] [a|caro|caro|auonqnnn] á Francisco Estévan nada de lo que haga.</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En450Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>pagar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#pagar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En450Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En451"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En451Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde376" /><gams:textualContent>que la verdad siempre triunfa y no se me pudo probar el hecho, que si no, me cuesta cara  la calumnia de mi vecino .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En451Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En451Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En451Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En451Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>me cuesta cara  la calumnia de mi vecino </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>me [v|cuesta|costar|is] [a|cara|caro|afsnqnnn]  [s|la calumnia de mi vecino|fs] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En451Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>la calumnia de mi vecino</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En451Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>cuesta</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En451Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cara</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FeminineSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En452"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En452Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde484" /><gams:textualContent>algunos por mi pago&lt;lb/&gt;que me tienen por ladino.&lt;lb/&gt;No ha de haber achocao* otro;&lt;lb/&gt;le salió cara  la broma ;&lt;lb/&gt;a su amigo cuando toma&lt;lb/&gt;se le despeja el sentido,&lt;lb/&gt;y el pobrecito había sido&lt;lb/&gt;como</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En452Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En452Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En452Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En452Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>le salió cara  la broma </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>le [v|salió|salir|is] [a|cara|caro|afonqnnn]  [s|la broma|fs] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En452Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>la broma</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En452Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>salió</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#salir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En452Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cara</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FeminineSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En453"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En453Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde485" /><gams:textualContent>los suyos, y a los ojos de aquella cuya deshonra iba a vengar.Cercado de enemigos, vendioles caro su vida; pero cayó, en fin, atravesado por las balas realistas al lado de las víctimas que acababa de sacrificar</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En453Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En453Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En453Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Cercado de enemigos, vendioles caro su vida</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Cercado de enemigos, [v|vendioles|vender|ts] [a|caro|caro|auonqnnn] su vida</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En453Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vendioles</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vender" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En453Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En454"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En454Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde181" /><gams:textualContent>"Éste será el talón de Aquiles. Ese desaire te costará caro .Lo explotaré."</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En454Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En454Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En454Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En454Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Ese desaire te costará caro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Ese desaire|ms] te [v|costará|costar|is] [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En454Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Ese desaire</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En454Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>costará</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En454Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En455"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En455Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde181" /><gams:textualContent>una casa; limosna para la Santa Obra del Catecismo; limosna para la novena de la Concepción, porque habría que pagar caro un predicador, jesuita, que vendría de lejos."Era mucho, sí; pero si los buenos católicos</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En455Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En455Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En455Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>porque habría que pagar caro un predicador</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>porque habría que [v|pagar|pagar|ts] [a|caro|caro|auonqnnn] un predicador</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En455Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>pagar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#pagar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En455Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En456"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En456Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde181" /><gams:textualContent>y mucho de lo que él había heredado.¡Pero ay del sastre si le quería engañar cobrándole caros los remiendos de sus pantalones!¿No sabía él lo que eran remiendos?¿No había zurcido su</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En456Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En456Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En456Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>ay del sastre si le quería engañar cobrándole caros los remiendos de sus pantalones</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>ay del sastre si le quería engañar [v|cobrándole|cobrar|ts] [a|caros|caro|aponqnnn] los remiendos de sus pantalones</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En456Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>cobrándole</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cobrar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En456Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caros</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#MasculinePlural" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En457"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En457Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde181" /><gams:textualContent>el cochero dormía en el pescante.Había encendido los faroles del coche y esperaba, seguro de cobrar caro aquel sueño.Don Fermín entró en casa de don Pompeyo a las nueve menos cuarto.La sala estaba</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En457Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En457Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En457Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>seguro de cobrar caro aquel sueño</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>seguro de [v|cobrar|cobrar|ts] [a|caro|caro|auonqnnn] aquel sueño</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En457Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>cobrar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cobrar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En457Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En458"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En458Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde380" /><gams:textualContent>— Sean pocos o muchos,  esos kilómetros nos habrían de salir caros .Además, ¿cómo ir sin llevarles un regalo?¿Te parece bien entrar en su casa con las manos vacías</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En458Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En458Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En458Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En458Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> esos kilómetros nos habrían de salir caros </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|esos kilómetros|mp] nos habrían de [v|salir|salir|is] [a|caros|caro|apsnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En458Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>esos kilómetros</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En458Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>salir</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#salir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En458Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caros</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#MasculinePlural" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En459"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En459Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde249" /><gams:textualContent>dijo un día tía Sidora—, que  ese mimo con que tratas a esa bestia te ha de costar caro ..., porque la cabra siempre tira al monte, y de jugar con lobos no se saca más</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En459Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En459Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En459Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En459Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> ese mimo con que tratas a esa bestia te ha de costar caro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|ese mimo con que tratas a esa bestia|ms] te ha de [v|costar|costar|is] [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En459Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>ese mimo con que tratas a esa bestia</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En459Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>costar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En459Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En460"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En460Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde433" /><gams:textualContent>de lo que haces, reflexiona, mira de no poner a prueba mi paciencia , que podría tal vez costarte caro !</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En460Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En460Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En460Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En460Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>mira de no poner a prueba mi paciencia , que podría tal vez costarte caro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>mira de [s|no poner a prueba mi paciencia|ms] , que podría tal vez [v|costarte|costar|is] [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En460Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>no poner a prueba mi paciencia</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En460Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>costarte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En460Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En461"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En461Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde250" /><gams:textualContent>quiere quedar chasqueado y hoy habrá campaña en el Congreso.¡Pobre revoltoso!,  eso le va a costar caro , porque parece que el Gobierno le lanzará de la Legislatura, en lo que hará muy bien.La</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En461Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En461Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En461Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En461Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> eso le va a costar caro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|eso|ms] le va a [v|costar|costar|is] [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En461Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>eso</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En461Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>costar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En461Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En462"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En462Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde384" /><gams:textualContent>convenía ocultar lo de la jugada, y yo ya estoy hasta el cogote de cuestiones que me han costado caras , me contuve.Hay tiempo; cualquier día lo hiendo...» </gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En462Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En462Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En462Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En462Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>estoy hasta el cogote de cuestiones que me han costado caras </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>estoy hasta el cogote de [s|cuestiones|fp] que me [v|han costado|costar|is] [a|caras|caro|axsnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En462Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>cuestiones</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En462Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>han costado</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En462Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caras</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FemininePlural" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En463"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En463Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde384" /><gams:textualContent>Sin embargo, no... La usurpación del catre de Andújar podría costarle cara .En una mala hora cualquiera se queda dormido, y ¡bonito papel haría él roncando allí con el</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En463Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En463Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En463Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En463Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> La usurpación del catre de Andújar podría costarle cara </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|La usurpación del catre de Andújar|fs] podría [v|costarle|costar|is] [a|cara|caro|afsnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En463Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>La usurpación del catre de Andújar</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En463Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>costarle</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En463Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cara</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FeminineSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En464"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En464Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde385" /><gams:textualContent>a su propósito, lanzóse a la manigua, seguido de  unos cuantos desalmados , dispuestos como él a vender caras sus vidas y a ganar por medio del bandolerismo no sólo el oro perdido sino cuanto pudieran sumar como revancha.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En464Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En464Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En464Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En464Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> unos cuantos desalmados , dispuestos como él a vender caras sus vidas</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|unos cuantos desalmados|mp] , dispuestos como él a [v|vender|vender|ts] [a|caras|caro|axonqnnn] sus vidas</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En464Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>unos cuantos desalmados</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En464Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vender</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vender" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En464Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caras</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FemininePlural" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En465"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En465Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde385" /><gams:textualContent>— Dar lecciones, tener discípulas, y he pensado que poniendo un anuncio... El anuncio  cuesta caro .¡Si me hicieran una rebaja!</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En465Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En465Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En465Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En465Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> El anuncio  cuesta caro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|El anuncio|ms]  [v|cuesta|costar|is] [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En465Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>El anuncio</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En465Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>cuesta</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En465Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En466"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En466Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde385" /><gams:textualContent>en una mano y la cajita de cápsulas en otra!Y ¿te acuerdas? El abrazo me costó caro .Inmediatamente me pidió dos monedas.He sido la primera víctima de sus disparos.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En466Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En466Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En466Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En466Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> El abrazo me costó caro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|El abrazo|ms] me [v|costó|costar|is] [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En466Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>El abrazo</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En466Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>costó</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En466Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En467"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En467Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde486" /><gams:textualContent>más daño hacen.(Con dureza.) Mire usté en qué emplea la suya, porque puede salirle caro .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En467Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En467Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En467Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Mire usté en qué emplea la suya, porque puede salirle caro .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Mire usté en qué emplea la suya, porque puede [v|salirle|salir|is] [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En467Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>salirle</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#salir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En467Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En468"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En468Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde22" /><gams:textualContent>»Quedaban todavía de diez a doce tiros en cada winchester, lo que nos permitía vender caras nuestras vidas sí, como todo lo hacía presumir, llegaban los onas con intenciones hostiles.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En468Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En468Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En468Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>nos permitía vender caras nuestras vidas</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>nos permitía [v|vender|vender|ts] [a|caras|caro|axsnqnnn] nuestras vidas</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En468Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vender</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vender" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En468Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caras</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FemininePlural" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En469"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En469Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde113" /><gams:textualContent>vivir.Además, en el estado en que estoy, dice mamá que si caigo enferma me puede costar caro . &lt;lb/&gt;Si mi tía te escribe diciéndote el disgustillo que ha habido, no le des importancia.Cuando vengas</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En469Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En469Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En469Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>dice mamá que si caigo enferma me puede costar caro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>dice mamá que si caigo enferma me puede [v|costar|costar|is] [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En469Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>costar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En469Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En470"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En470Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde221" /><gams:textualContent>buscar la vida en los campos, y en septiembre, cuando recogían el arroz y los jornales se pagaban caros  abandonaba la barca, haciéndose segador, como muchos otros que excitaban la indignación del tío Paloma.Esta</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En470Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En470Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En470Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En470Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>cuando recogían el arroz y los jornales se pagaban caros </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>cuando recogían el arroz y [s|los jornales|mp] se [v|pagaban|pagar|rs] [a|caros|caro|apsnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En470Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>los jornales</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En470Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>pagaban</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#pagar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En470Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caros</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#MasculinePlural" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En471"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En471Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde251" /><gams:textualContent>hambre y miseria me muero;&lt;lb/&gt;y por último que deje&lt;lb/&gt;de amolarme con sus ruegos,&lt;lb/&gt;porque va a costarle caro &lt;lb/&gt;si lo sabe mi Sotero;&lt;lb/&gt;y se sacará la rifa,&lt;lb/&gt;porque es un león en lo fiero,</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En471Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En471Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En471Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>amolarme con sus ruegos,&lt;lb\/&gt;porque va a costarle caro &lt;lb\/&gt;si lo sabe mi Sotero</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>amolarme con sus ruegos,&lt;lb\/&gt;porque [v|va a costarle|costar|is] [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn] &lt;lb\/&gt;si lo sabe mi Sotero</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En471Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>va a costarle</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En471Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En472"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En472Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde115" /><gams:textualContent>— Solamente, añadió, como tú subes, habrá que pagar caro : quince ó veinte por ciento.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En472Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En472Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En472Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>habrá que pagar caro : quince ó veinte por ciento</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>habrá que [v|pagar|pagar|is] [a|caro|caro|auonqnnn] : quince ó veinte por ciento</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En472Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>pagar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#pagar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En472Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En473"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En473Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde25" /><gams:textualContent>Sus modelos -la hembra, una criatura delgadita, sin plástica, con algo de airoso y delicado en las líneas, la gracia parisiense, que se percibe hasta en la mujer despojada de sus ropas, y el macho, un guapo borrachín en la flor de la vida, no desfigurado aún por el abuso del alcohol- le referían indiscreciones de taller, rarezas de artistas famosos, lances de pingües ventas de cuadros, que no se colocaban en París, y que un cliente americano paga carísimos , llevándoselos inmediatamente en una caja de embalaje.Se veía que este aspecto lucrativo de la profesión artística era lo que danzaba la cabeza de los pobres diablos de modelos, cuya existencia precaria se revelaba en la empobrecida constitución de ella, en los estigmas con que el alcohol, recurso contra el hambre, empezaba a marcar la cabeza hermosa, de Cristo rubio, de él.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En473Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En473Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En473Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En473Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>rarezas de artistas famosos, lances de pingües ventas de cuadros, que no se colocaban en París, y que un cliente americano paga carísimos </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>rarezas de artistas famosos, lances de pingües ventas de cuadros, que no se colocaban en París, y que [s|un cliente americano|ms] [v|paga|pagar|ts] [a|carísimos|caro|aponqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En473Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>un cliente americano</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En473Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>paga</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#pagar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En473Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>carísimos</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#MasculinePlural" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En474"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En474Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde172" /><gams:textualContent>«Su Señoría es hombre sagaz.Quiere saber si comemos carne vacuna.Evidentemente, aunque el ganado cuesta carísimo , en aquel botalón apegamos las resecitas.» </gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En474Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En474Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En474Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En474Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>aunque el ganado cuesta carísimo </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>aunque [s|el ganado|ms] [v|cuesta|costar|is] [a|carísimo|caro|ausnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En474Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>el ganado</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En474Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>cuesta</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En474Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>carísimo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En475"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En475Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde172" /><gams:textualContent>— ¡No me lo recordés!¡La pagó caro por atrevío!¡Preguntale a Fidel, si querés detayes, pero no me lo recordés!¡He</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En475Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En475Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En475Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>¡La pagó caro por atrevío!</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>¡La [v|pagó|pagar|ts] [a|caro|caro|auonqnnn] por atrevío!</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En475Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>pagó</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#pagar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En475Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En476"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En476Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde487" /><gams:textualContent>ella la ofensora, no tuvo a bien cesar las hostilidades.¡Esta vez su agresión iba a costarle cara !</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En476Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En476Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En476Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En476Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>¡Esta vez su agresión iba a costarle cara !</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>¡Esta vez [s|su agresión|fs] iba a [v|costarle|costar|is] [a|cara|caro|afsnqnnn] !</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En476Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>su agresión</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En476Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>costarle</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En476Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cara</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FeminineSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En477"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En477Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde33" /><gams:textualContent>Pero ya se detenían en la puerta de la jefatura doña Bárbara y míster Danger, y ño Pernalete se reservó para después lo que todavía tenía que decirle al secretario. No le convenía que las personas citadas se enterasen de que allí se podía hacer nada sin consentimiento suyo, y salió a recibirlas,dispuesto a cobrárselo caro .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En477Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En477Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En477Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>dispuesto a cobrárselo caro .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>dispuesto a [v|cobrárselo|cobrar|ts] [a|caro|caro|auonqnnn] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En477Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>cobrárselo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cobrar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En477Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En478"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En478Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde227" /><gams:textualContent>rescate de la libertad».«En París —escribe John William Ward— tienen una Policía admirable; pero pagan caras sus ventajas.Prefiero ver que cada tres o cuatro años se degüella a media docena de hombres en Ratcliffe Road</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En478Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En478Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En478Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>pero pagan caras sus ventajas</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>pero [v|pagan|pagar|ts] [a|caras|caro|axonqnnn] sus ventajas</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En478Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>pagan</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#pagar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En478Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caras</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FemininePlural" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En479"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En479Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde34" /><gams:textualContent>para aumentarlo, todos los terrenos que le vendieran. Los propietarios se aprovechaban del capricho, y vendían caro .Pero esto importaba poco.Rosendo vendió todas sus fincas distantes, y después de mucho esfuerzo logró hacer</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En479Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En479Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En479Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En479Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Los propietarios se aprovechaban del capricho, y vendían caro .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Los propietarios|mp] se aprovechaban del capricho, y [v|vendían|vender|is] [a|caro|caro|auonqnnn] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En479Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Los propietarios</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En479Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vendían</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vender" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En479Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En480"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En480Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde255" /><gams:textualContent>puede encontrar en cualquier hombre no he de proporcionárselo nunca.Si el mío le interesa, que lo pague caro ; que sepa encontrarlo implícito en mi mordacidad.La hubiese parecido de perlas que la elogiase ese cutis tan</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En480Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En480Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En480Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Si el mío le interesa, que lo pague caro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Si el mío le interesa, que lo [v|pague|pagar|ts] [a|caro|caro|auonqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En480Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>pague</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#pagar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En480Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En481"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En481Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde185" /><gams:textualContent>permití ir conmigo para escogerlo.Yo fuí sola a la agencia y separé un roadster Plymouth elegantísimo. Costaba  caro , pero, ¿qué me importaba?Podrá objetárseme que todo aquello era absurdo hasta el extremo de poner</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En481Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En481Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En481Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Costaba  caro , pero, ¿qué me importaba?</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|Costaba|costar|is]  [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn] , pero, ¿qué me importaba?</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En481Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>Costaba</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En481Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En482"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En482Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde42" /><gams:textualContent>la madre de Pilara—.Así compró una era y un trozo de monte el último invierno. Cobra  caro .Y sin embargo, ¿qué gastos tiene para hacerse pagar tanto?</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En482Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En482Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En482Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Cobra  caro .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|Cobra|cobrar|is]  [a|caro|caro|auonqnnn] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En482Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>Cobra</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cobrar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En482Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En483"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En483Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde2" /><gams:textualContent>quien contestaba indistintamente "no sé" o "ha de ser una diablura de Gabriel que va a costarle cara ".</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En483Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En483Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En483Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En483Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>ha de ser una diablura de Gabriel que va a costarle cara </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>ha de ser [s|una diablura de Gabriel|fs] que va a [v|costarle|costar|is] [a|cara|caro|afsnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En483Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>una diablura de Gabriel</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En483Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>costarle</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En483Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cara</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FeminineSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En484"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En484Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde45" /><gams:textualContent>compunciones, floreos de cursilería, comentarios de falaz decencia, y el que sale de esa rutina lo paga caro .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En484Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En484Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En484Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En484Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>y el que sale de esa rutina lo paga caro .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>y [s|el que sale de esa rutina|ms] lo [v|paga|pagar|ts] [a|caro|caro|auonqnnn] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En484Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>el que sale de esa rutina</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En484Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>paga</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#pagar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En484Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En485"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En485Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde45" /><gams:textualContent>, llego a verdades delirantes que algún día podrá leer la posteridad en una edición facsimilar que habrá que vender cara , porque un libro de este tamaño y encuadernado como para la eternidad de la revisión y balance último,</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En485Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En485Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En485Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>algún día podrá leer la posteridad en una edición facsimilar que habrá que vender cara </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>algún día podrá leer la posteridad en una edición facsimilar que habrá que [v|vender|vender|ts] [a|cara|caro|afonqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En485Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vender</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vender" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En485Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cara</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FeminineSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En486"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En486Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde404" /><gams:textualContent>— Pues si el méiz se vende caro , te la concedo.A un rico no se le dice que no.Vos con reales en la</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En486Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En486Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En486Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En486Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Pues si el méiz se vende caro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Pues si [s|el méiz|ms] se [v|vende|vender|rs] [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En486Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>el méiz</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En486Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vende</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vender" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En486Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En487"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En487Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde404" /><gams:textualContent>atrevían...polvos para enamorar...los que no dejan que llegue el olvido nunca, aunque se le pague caro , y tarjetas postales con frases de amor y nombres evocadores...Carmen...María...Luisa...Margarita...</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En487Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En487Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En487Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>aunque se le pague caro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>aunque se le [v|pague|pagar|ts] [a|caro|caro|auonqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En487Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>pague</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#pagar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En487Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En488"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En488Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde488" /><gams:textualContent>¡Qué bien trasteas a los padres, marrano, hipócrita!¡Pero los pitillos te van a costar caros !</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En488Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En488Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En488Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En488Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>¡Pero los pitillos te van a costar caros !</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>¡Pero [s|los pitillos|mp] te van a [v|costar|costar|is] [a|caros|caro|apsnqnnn] !</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En488Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>los pitillos</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En488Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>costar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En488Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caros</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#MasculinePlural" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En489"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En489Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde186" /><gams:textualContent>— Te va a salir caro .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En489Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En489Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En489Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Te va a salir caro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Te va a [v|salir|salir|is] [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En489Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>salir</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#salir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En489Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En490"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En490Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde186" /><gams:textualContent>lugares aquéllos para que los cristianos anduvieran solos a la luz de las estrellas y que aun cuando fuéramos pobres pudiera salirnos cara nuestra nocturna soledad .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En490Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En490Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En490Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En490Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>aun cuando fuéramos pobres pudiera salirnos cara nuestra nocturna soledad .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>aun cuando fuéramos pobres pudiera [v|salirnos|salir|is] [a|cara|caro|afsnqnnn] [s|nuestra nocturna soledad|fs] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En490Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>nuestra nocturna soledad</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En490Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>salirnos</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#salir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En490Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cara</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FeminineSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En491"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En491Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde186" /><gams:textualContent>usted tanta falta el dinero —le dije al médico—.Pero supongo que se habrá vendido bastante caro , ¿no?</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En491Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En491Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En491Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Pero supongo que se habrá vendido bastante caro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Pero supongo que se [v|habrá vendido|vender|rs] bastante [a|caro|caro|auonqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En491Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>habrá vendido</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vender" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En491Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En492"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En492Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde407" /><gams:textualContent>este tiempo.Y si los cría pos se los come.Y si los vende, * los vende caros .Y no hay * dinero pa mercarlos, * demás de esto.Se acabó el negocio, padre</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En492Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En492Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En492Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Y si los vende, * los vende caros .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Y si los vende, * los [v|vende|vender|ts] [a|caros|caro|aponqnnn] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En492Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vende</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vender" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En492Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caros</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#MasculinePlural" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En493"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En493Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde407" /><gams:textualContent>con la cara levantada, amenazándonos a todos con la mano y como diciendo: "Ya me las pagarán caro ."</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En493Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En493Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En493Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Ya me las pagarán caro .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Ya me las [v|pagarán|pagar|ts] [a|caro|caro|auonqnnn] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En493Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>pagarán</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#pagar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En493Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En494"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En494Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde407" /><gams:textualContent>— Mejor cállate, Lucas Lucatero.Dios no te perdonará lo que hiciste conmigo.Lo pagarás caro .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En494Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En494Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En494Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Lo pagarás caro .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Lo [v|pagarás|pagar|ts] [a|caro|caro|auonqnnn] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En494Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>pagarás</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#pagar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En494Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En495"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En495Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde287" /><gams:textualContent>estuvo obligado a darme y nunca me dio...El olvido en que nos tuvo, mi hijo, cóbraselo caro .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En495Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En495Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En495Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>El olvido en que nos tuvo, mi hijo, cóbraselo caro .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>El olvido en que nos tuvo, mi hijo, [v|cóbraselo|cobrar|ts] [a|caro|caro|auonqnnn] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En495Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>cóbraselo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cobrar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En495Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En496"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En496Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde287" /><gams:textualContent>la familia de usted lo absorbió todo.Pedían y pedían, * sin devolver nada. Eso se paga caro .Ya lo decía yo: "A la larga acabarán con todo." Bueno, pues acabaron.Aunque hay</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En496Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En496Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En496Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En496Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Eso se paga caro .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Eso|ms] se [v|paga|pagar|rs] [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En496Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Eso</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En496Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>paga</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#pagar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En496Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En497"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En497Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde287" /><gams:textualContent>— ¿La ilusión? Eso  cuesta caro .A mí me costó vivir más de lo debido.Pagué con eso la deuda de encontrar a mi</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En497Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En497Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En497Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En497Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Eso  cuesta caro .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Eso|ms]  [v|cuesta|costar|is] [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En497Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Eso</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En497Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>cuesta</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En497Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En498"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En498Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde1" /><gams:textualContent>.Yo le ofrezco veinte pesos metro...lo que oye...tiene usted muchas deudas, amiguito,  cuesta  caro vivir del cuento ...no, si no lo amenazo; nada más por intercesión de Silvia me he</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En498Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En498Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En498Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En498Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> cuesta  caro vivir del cuento ...</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|cuesta|costar|is]  [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn] [s|vivir del cuento|ms] ...</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En498Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>vivir del cuento</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En498Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>cuesta</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En498Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En499"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En499Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde489" /><gams:textualContent>hijo acribillado nueve meses antes en la gallera, por distribuir información clandestina.«Es una ilusión que cuesta caro », dijo la mujer.«Cuando se acabe el maíz tendremos que alimentarlo con nuestros hígados».</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En499Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En499Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En499Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En499Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Es una ilusión que cuesta caro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Es [s|una ilusión|fs] que [v|cuesta|costar|is] [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En499Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>una ilusión</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En499Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>cuesta</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En499Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En500"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En500Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde490" /><gams:textualContent>uno, ideal, metido en la cabeza.Desgraciadamente, para los ideales no hay liquidaciones, siempre salen caros .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En500Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En500Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En500Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En500Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>para los ideales no hay liquidaciones, siempre salen caros .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>para [s|los ideales|mp] no hay liquidaciones, siempre [v|salen|salir|is] [a|caros|caro|apsnqnnn] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En500Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>los ideales</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En500Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>salen</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#salir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En500Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caros</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#MasculinePlural" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En501"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En501Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde411" /><gams:textualContent>de los historiadores más famosos de aquel tiempo, en que también se advierte que  más de una mujer  pagó caro el tener reputación de tal.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En501Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En501Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En501Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En501Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> más de una mujer  pagó caro el tener reputación de tal</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|más de una mujer|fs]  [v|pagó|pagar|ts] [a|caro|caro|auonqnnn] el tener reputación de tal</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En501Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>más de una mujer</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En501Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>pagó</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#pagar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En501Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En502"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En502Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde51" /><gams:textualContent>— Sí —dijo—.Hay que defenderse.Nos vengaremos de los de cuarto, les haremos pagar caro sus gracias.Lo principal es recordar las caras y, si es posible, la sección y los nombres</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En502Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En502Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En502Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>les haremos pagar caro sus gracias.</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>les haremos [v|pagar|pagar|ts] [a|caro|caro|auonqnnn] sus gracias.</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En502Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>pagar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#pagar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En502Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En503"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En503Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde51" /><gams:textualContent>el teniente, "no ven que las usuras se oyen en las tribunas, me la van a pagar caro ." Como si lloviera, tu madre por aquí, chajuí, la tuya, rá-rá-rá.Esta vez</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En503Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En503Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En503Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>me la van a pagar caro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>me la van a [v|pagar|pagar|ts] [a|caro|caro|auonqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En503Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>pagar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#pagar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En503Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En504"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En504Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde51" /><gams:textualContent>fuera así, una roca.¿Sabe lo que nos dijo?En el Ejército los errores se pagan caros , así, tal como se lo cuento.Y nos dio explicaciones, que los peritos revisaron el arma</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En504Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En504Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En504Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En504Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>En el Ejército los errores se pagan caros </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>En el Ejército [s|los errores|mp] se [v|pagan|pagar|rs] [a|caros|caro|apsnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En504Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>los errores</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En504Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>pagan</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#pagar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En504Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caros</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#MasculinePlural" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En505"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En505Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde51" /><gams:textualContent>engañarme, hijo de perra, he visto la cara que tienes, te juro que las vas a pagar caro .Pero ¿debía?" Alberto mira y, con sorpresa, descubre ante él la vasta explanada cubierta </gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En505Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En505Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En505Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>te juro que las vas a pagar caro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>te juro que las vas a [v|pagar|pagar|ts] [a|caro|caro|auonqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En505Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>pagar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#pagar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En505Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En506"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En506Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde51" /><gams:textualContent>sea usted, ahora.En el Ejército no se admiten esta clase de juegos, cadete.Puede costarle caro .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En506Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En506Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En506Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Puede costarle caro .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Puede [v|costarle|costar|is] [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En506Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>costarle</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En506Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En507"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En507Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde51" /><gams:textualContent>la mano por las frenéticas mandíbulas—. Todos ustedes son los responsables verdaderos y me las van a pagar caro , carajo.Es su culpa y de nadie más.¿Qué hace ahí con la boca abierta?Vaya y haga</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En507Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En507Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En507Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En507Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Todos ustedes son los responsables verdaderos y me las van a pagar caro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Todos ustedes|mp] son los responsables verdaderos y me las van a [v|pagar|pagar|ts] [a|caro|caro|auonqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En507Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Todos ustedes</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En507Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>pagar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#pagar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En507Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En508"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En508Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde51" /><gams:textualContent>así no más.Y no sólo en el Ejército.Figúrese que en la vida civil también se pagan caras estas bromas.Si usted quiere acusar a alguien de asesino, tiene que apoyarse en algo, ¿cómo</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En508Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En508Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En508Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>en la vida civil también se pagan caras estas bromas</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>en la vida civil también se [v|pagan|pagar|rs] [a|caras|caro|axonqnnn] estas bromas</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En508Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>pagan</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#pagar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En508Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caras</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FemininePlural" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En509"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En509Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde52" /><gams:textualContent>.Había hallado ésta en pleno invierno, y se la compré, pensando que podría servirme.La pagué cara .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En509Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En509Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En509Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>La pagué cara .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>La [v|pagué|pagar|ts] [a|cara|caro|afonqnnn] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En509Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>pagué</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#pagar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En509Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cara</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FeminineSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En510"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En510Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde262" /><gams:textualContent>vos ni yo tenemos demasiado la culpa.No somos adultos, Lucía.Es un mérito pero se paga caro .Los chicos se tiran siempre de los pelos después de haber jugado.Debe ser algo así.Habría</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En510Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En510Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En510Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Es un mérito pero se paga caro .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Es un mérito pero se [v|paga|pagar|rs] [a|caro|caro|auonqnnn] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En510Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>paga</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#pagar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En510Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En511"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En511Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde263" /><gams:textualContent>y cómoda y fresca, casi fría por el aire acondicionado.Estaba bien el hotel.Verdad que cobraban caro , pero lo valía.Si alguna cosa han aprendido los cubanos de nosotros es el sentido del comfort</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En511Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En511Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En511Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Verdad que cobraban caro , pero lo valía</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Verdad que [v|cobraban|cobrar|is] [a|caro|caro|auonqnnn] , pero lo valía</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En511Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>cobraban</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cobrar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En511Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En512"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En512Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde53" /><gams:textualContent>un restaurante de la Barceloneta y ahora vienen en busca de puta."Chaval, este polvo te costará caro ", se dijo observando al que acababa de dejar la motocicleta.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En512Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En512Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En512Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En512Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Chaval, este polvo te costará caro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Chaval, [s|este polvo|ms] te [v|costará|costar|is] [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En512Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>este polvo</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En512Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>costará</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En512Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En513"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En513Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde54" /><gams:textualContent>Los vamos a pagar caro  (te decías) la perdida guerra civil, los veinte años de miedo hirsuto, la ominosa facilidad que nos</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En513Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En513Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En513Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Los vamos a pagar caro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Los vamos a [v|pagar|pagar|ts] [a|caro|caro|auonqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En513Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>pagar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#pagar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En513Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En514"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En514Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde54" /><gams:textualContent>— Me la haces pagar cara .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En514Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En514Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En514Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Me la haces pagar cara .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Me la haces [v|pagar|pagar|ts] [a|cara|caro|afonqnnn] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En514Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>pagar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#pagar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En514Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cara</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FeminineSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En515"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En515Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde55" /><gams:textualContent>— Se descompusieron las cañerías y costó carísimo , señor Lozano.Además, la clientela disminuye cada día.Los limeños ya ni cachan, señor,</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En515Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En515Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En515Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Se descompusieron las cañerías y costó carísimo </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Se descompusieron las cañerías y [v|costó|costar|is] [a|carísimo|caro|ausnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En515Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>costó</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En515Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>carísimo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En516"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En516Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde55" /><gams:textualContent>— Te sentías un Sherlok Holmes escarbando esa historia apestosa —dijo Carlitos—.Lo pagaste caro , Zavalita.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En516Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En516Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En516Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Lo pagaste caro , Zavalita.</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Lo [v|pagaste|pagar|ts] [a|caro|caro|auonqnnn] , Zavalita.</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En516Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>pagaste</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#pagar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En516Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En517"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En517Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde55" /><gams:textualContent>es una buena muchacha, Becerrita —dijo Ivonne, a media voz—.No la hundas.Te podría costar caro , además.Tiene muy buenos amigos, te lo advierto.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En517Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En517Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En517Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Te podría costar caro , además</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Te podría [v|costar|costar|is] [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn] , además</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En517Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>costar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En517Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En518"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En518Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde55" /><gams:textualContent>¿Sólo dos de Lima, sólo cinco de Ica?—dijo Cayo Bermúdez—. Esto le puede costar caro , Molina.¿Dónde está la demás gente?</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En518Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En518Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En518Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En518Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Esto le puede costar caro , Molina</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Esto|ms] le puede [v|costar|costar|is] [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn] , Molina</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En518Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Esto</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En518Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>costar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En518Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En519"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En519Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde55" /><gams:textualContent>— Ya ves, este capricho te cuesta caro  —dijo Queta, alzando los hombros—.Bueno, tú sabes lo que haces.Sácate el pantalón</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En519Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En519Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En519Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En519Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Ya ves, este capricho te cuesta caro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Ya ves, [s|este capricho|ms] te [v|cuesta|costar|is] [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En519Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>este capricho</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En519Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>cuesta</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En519Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En520"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En520Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde55" /><gams:textualContent>volvió a reír, con la misma lenta risa burlona—.También los tuyos ¿no?Te cuesta caro  venir a pasar un par de horas aquí  ¿no?</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En520Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En520Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En520Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En520Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Te cuesta caro  venir a pasar un par de horas aquí </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Te [v|cuesta|costar|is] [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn]  [s|venir a pasar un par de horas aquí|ms] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En520Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>venir a pasar un par de horas aquí</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En520Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>cuesta</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En520Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En521"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En521Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde6" /><gams:textualContent>Egipto, le había cobrado la propina de un mes y le había contagiado una gonorrea que Juan Lucas había pagado carísimo .Susan empezó a enterarse de cosas increíbles, ella lo supo todo a los dieciocho, pero esas grabaciones</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En521Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En521Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En521Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En521Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>una gonorrea que Juan Lucas había pagado carísimo </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>una gonorrea que [s|Juan Lucas|ms] [v|había pagado|pagar|ts] [a|carísimo|caro|auonqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En521Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Juan Lucas</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En521Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>había pagado</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#pagar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En521Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>carísimo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En522"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En522Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde187" /><gams:textualContent>pero algo, es el colmo que nos hayan olvidado así, pero no importa, la van a pagar caro  con la sorpresa que se van a llevar cuando se den cuenta que no queda nadie en la Casa.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En522Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En522Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En522Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>la van a pagar caro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>la van a [v|pagar|pagar|ts] [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En522Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>pagar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#pagar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En522Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En523"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En523Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde415" /><gams:textualContent>que hacer aquí la muerte?¿Quién la llamaba?¿En qué se metió?Ni siquiera vendió cara ni barata su vida; la regaló con un sencillo resbalón.En tierra nada ha de resolver cuando tanto</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En523Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En523Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En523Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En523Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text>Ni siquiera vendió cara ni barata su vida</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Ni siquiera [v|vendió|vender|ts] [a|cara|caro|afonqnnC] ni [a|barata|barato|afonqnnC] su vida</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En523Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vendió</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vender" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En523Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cara</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FeminineSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En523Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>barata</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#barato" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FeminineSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En524"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En524Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde57" /><gams:textualContent>retirar solamente al Almirante, o, con más exactitud, sustituirlo por otro." " Eso  costaría caro , habría que iniciar un expediente, ¡qué sé yo!El tiempo, además, no está para</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En524Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En524Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En524Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En524Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Eso  costaría caro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Eso|ms]  [v|costaría|costar|is] [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En524Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Eso</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En524Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>costaría</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En524Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En525"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En525Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde57" /><gams:textualContent>en su sustancia y si le dicen a uno que el Demonio no fue creado por Dios, que cuesta caro  creerlo , caray, para qué había que crear un tipo como ése, sino que existe desde siempre,</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En525Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En525Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En525Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En525Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>que cuesta caro  creerlo </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>que [v|cuesta|costar|is] [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn]  [s|creerlo|ms] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En525Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>creerlo</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En525Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>cuesta</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En525Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En526"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En526Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde57" /><gams:textualContent>la experiencia más audaz que se hacía en la Cristiandad, y que, de distinta manera,  ambos  pagaríamos cara nuestra osadía.Por lo demás, entre ella y Coralina no había la menor semejanza.Quienes dicen que todas las</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En526Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En526Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En526Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En526Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> ambos  pagaríamos cara nuestra osadía</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|ambos|mp]  [v|pagaríamos|pagar|ts] [a|cara|caro|afonqnnn] nuestra osadía</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En526Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>ambos</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En526Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>pagaríamos</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#pagar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En526Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cara</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FeminineSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En527"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En527Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde58" /><gams:textualContent>— Creo que haces mal —opinó Carlitos—. Una interrupción en la carrera se paga cara  el día que se vuelve.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En527Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En527Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En527Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En527Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Una interrupción en la carrera se paga cara </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Una interrupción en la carrera|fs] se [v|paga|pagar|rs] [a|cara|caro|afsnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En527Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Una interrupción en la carrera</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En527Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>paga</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#pagar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En527Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cara</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FeminineSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En528"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En528Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde58" /><gams:textualContent>Me la vendieron en una sublimería.Y nadie puede decir que me haya dado mal resultado.Me costó cara , pero es de mucha duración.No os cuento más historias lastimeras.Adela, ¿tienes algún amante</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En528Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En528Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En528Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Me costó cara </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Me [v|costó|costar|is] [a|cara|caro|afsnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En528Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>costó</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En528Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cara</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FeminineSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En529"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En529Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde420" /><gams:textualContent>Lepprince, sin embargo, cometió un error que había de costarle caro : se enamoró de María Coral.Una mujer no podía por menos de entorpecer sus planes, pero fue débil</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En529Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En529Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En529Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En529Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>cometió un error que había de costarle caro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>cometió [s|un error|ms] que había de [v|costarle|costar|is] [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En529Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>un error</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En529Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>costarle</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En529Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En530"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En530Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde491" /><gams:textualContent>de aguas perfumadas y cremas para las mujeres.Venían a cobrar los fines de semana.Venían a  cobrar caro .El secreto es no deberles, comprarles lo necesario, pelearles el precio y no deberles.El que</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En530Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En530Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En530Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Venían a  cobrar caro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Venían a  [v|cobrar|cobrar|is] [a|caro|caro|auonqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En530Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>cobrar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cobrar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En530Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En531"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En531Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde60" /><gams:textualContent>Si no lo hace, me encargaré yo, moviendo las influencias que haga falta, de hacerle pagar caro su audacia.En cuanto a ti, quiero que sepas que ando armado y que no permitiré que te burles de</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En531Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En531Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En531Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>me encargaré yo, moviendo las influencias que haga falta, de hacerle pagar caro su audacia</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>me encargaré yo, moviendo las influencias que haga falta, de hacerle [v|pagar|pagar|ts] [a|caro|caro|auonqnnn] su audacia</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En531Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>pagar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#pagar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En531Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En532"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En532Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde60" /><gams:textualContent>lunes, les conté lo ocurrido con la damita mexicana y el hombre importante.Fue un error que pagué caro  porque esta anécdota les pareció mucho más divertida que mi cuento.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En532Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En532Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En532Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Fue un error que pagué caro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Fue un error que [v|pagué|pagar|is] [a|caro|caro|auonqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En532Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>pagué</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#pagar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En532Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En533"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En533Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde60" /><gams:textualContent>tía Julia saldría escoltada por soldados hasta el avión.En cuanto a mí, si no le obedecía, lo pagaría caro .Y, lo mismo que a Javier, también a mis tíos les había mostrado el revólver.Completé</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En533Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En533Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En533Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>si no le obedecía, lo pagaría caro .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>si no le obedecía, lo [v|pagaría|pagar|ts] [a|caro|caro|auonqnnn] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En533Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>pagaría</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#pagar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En533Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En534"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En534Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde132" /><gams:textualContent>mi general, me atrevo'.'Es usted valiente, capitán, pero esto le va a costar caro ', dijo el mismísimo general Pancho Villa y comenzó a contar con los dedos las batallas que había ganado en</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En534Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En534Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En534Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En534Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>pero esto le va a costar caro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>pero [s|esto|ms] le [v|va a costar|costar|is] [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En534Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>esto</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En534Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>va a costar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En534Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En535"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En535Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde132" /><gams:textualContent>«Esta injuria me la vas a pagar cara », me dijo desde atrás de la servilleta, blanco del coraje quizás porque la servilleta era blanca</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En535Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En535Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En535Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Esta injuria me la vas a pagar cara </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Esta injuria me la vas a [v|pagar|pagar|ts] [a|cara|caro|afonqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En535Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>pagar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#pagar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En535Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cara</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FeminineSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En536"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En536Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde492" /><gams:textualContent>si...que yo había hecho mal a un hijo de un coronel... y que me iba a costar caro .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En536Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En536Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En536Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>y que me iba a costar caro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>y que me iba a [v|costar|costar|is] [a|caro|caro|auonqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En536Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>costar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En536Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En537"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En537Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde61" /><gams:textualContent>emigran, los laboratorios y las universidades no tienen recursos,  el know how industrial es siempre extranjero y se paga carísimo , pero, ¿por qué no reconocer un cierto mérito de creatividad en el desarrollo de una tecnología del</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En537Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En537Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En537Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En537Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> el know how industrial es siempre extranjero y se paga carísimo </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|el know how industrial|ms] es siempre extranjero y se [v|paga|pagar|rs] [a|carísimo|caro|ausnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En537Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>el know how industrial</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En537Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>paga</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#pagar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En537Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>carísimo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En538"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En538Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde493" /><gams:textualContent>momentos cruciales.A todos nos fascina, dijo, pensar en eso y a algunos esa fascinación les cuesta cara .Por ejemplo, dijo, a un amigo mío ese tipo de pensamiento le costó la vida.El</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En538Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En538Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En538Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En538Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>a algunos esa fascinación les cuesta cara </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>a algunos [s|esa fascinación|fs] les [v|cuesta|costar|is] [a|cara|caro|afsnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En538Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>esa fascinación</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En538Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>cuesta</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En538Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cara</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FeminineSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En539"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En539Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde120" /><gams:textualContent>— Es que te van a costar carísimos , Martín.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En539Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En539Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En539Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Es que te van a costar carísimos , Martín</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Es que te [v|van a costar|costar|is] [a|carísimos|caro|apsnqnnn] , Martín</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En539Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>van a costar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En539Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>carísimos</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#MasculinePlural" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En540"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En540Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde63" /><gams:textualContent>de sus trenzas, mientras él, descalzo en el barro, se juraba que algún día le haría pagar cara su arrogancia y se vengaría de su maldito destino de bastardo.Rígida y ausente, desnuda y temblando de</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En540Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En540Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En540Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>algún día le haría pagar cara su arrogancia</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>algún día le haría [v|pagar|pagar|ts] [a|cara|caro|afonqnnn] su arrogancia</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En540Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>pagar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#pagar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En540Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cara</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FeminineSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En541"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En541Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde494" /><gams:textualContent>—  Mi tiempo  cuesta caro  —decía—, estoy perdiendo clientes.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En541Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En541Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En541Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En541Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Mi tiempo  cuesta caro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Mi tiempo|ms]  [v|cuesta|costar|is] [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En541Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Mi tiempo</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En541Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>cuesta</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En541Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En542"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En542Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde268" /><gams:textualContent>puede ser exigente.Andrea por haber resuelto el incidente: no quiere enemistarse con  esa mujer , que vende caro pero donde compra la gente más distinguida.Así, alta la cabeza, Andrea regresa a su casa,</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En542Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En542Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En542Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En542Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> esa mujer , que vende caro pero donde compra la gente más distinguida</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|esa mujer|fs] , que [v|vende|vender|is] [a|caro|caro|auonqnnn] pero donde compra la gente más distinguida</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En542Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>esa mujer</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En542Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vende</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vender" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En542Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En543"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En543Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde268" /><gams:textualContent>es un decir», piensa el viejo.«Mucho papel de plata y mucho plástico, para  cobrar caro , pero a saber lo que meten dentro.Química, como en el mal vino...¿Y eso</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En543Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En543Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En543Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Mucho papel de plata y mucho plástico, para  cobrar caro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Mucho papel de plata y mucho plástico, para  [v|cobrar|cobrar|is] [a|caro|caro|auonqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En543Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>cobrar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cobrar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En543Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En544"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En544Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde268" /><gams:textualContent>— Muchísimo, ¡vaya cuero bueno!...Te habrán costado caros ...Pero mira mis manos, mujer; no caben.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En544Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En544Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En544Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Te habrán costado caros ...</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Te [v|habrán costado|costar|is] [a|caros|caro|apsnqnnn] ...</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En544Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>habrán costado</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En544Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caros</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#MasculinePlural" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En545"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En545Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde188" /><gams:textualContent>los días tendría la suerte de que Daughter le ofreciera quedarse un día más.Y que le había costado caro  saber qué era lo opuesto a la palabra Pureza .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En545Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En545Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En545Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En545Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>le había costado caro  saber qué era lo opuesto a la palabra Pureza </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>le [v|había costado|costar|is] [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn]  [s|saber qué era lo opuesto a la palabra Pureza|ms] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En545Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>saber qué era lo opuesto a la palabra Pureza</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En545Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>había costado</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En545Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En546"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En546Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde188" /><gams:textualContent>mierda en vez de sangre, pásame la bota hermano, acelérale, hermano,  la piel de un indio no cuesta caro , eso lo escribió un tal Ribeyro, vive en París como tú, Javier, ¡pum!, </gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En546Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En546Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En546Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En546Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> la piel de un indio no cuesta caro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|la piel de un indio|fs] no [v|cuesta|costar|is] [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En546Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>la piel de un indio</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En546Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>cuesta</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En546Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En547"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En547Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde495" /><gams:textualContent>«Me temo que el mariscal Fusio ha cometido aquí un error de estrategia que le ha de costar caro .» Y le costaba caro, tarde o temprano.Gil se admiraba de la perspicacia de Gregorio, </gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En547Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En547Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En547Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En547Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>ha cometido aquí un error de estrategia que le ha de costar caro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>ha cometido aquí [s|un error de estrategia|ms] que le ha de [v|costar|costar|is] [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En547Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>un error de estrategia</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En547Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>costar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En547Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En548"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En548Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde495" /><gams:textualContent>mariscal Fusio ha cometido aquí un error de estrategia que le ha de costar caro.» Y le costaba caro , tarde o temprano.Gil se admiraba de la perspicacia de Gregorio, y su respeto por él crecía</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En548Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En548Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En548Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Y le costaba caro , tarde o temprano</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Y le [v|costaba|costar|is] [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn] , tarde o temprano</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En548Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>costaba</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En548Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En549"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En549Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde233" /><gams:textualContent>las tabernas finas y en las hosterías donde van los comerciantes de la calle de los Francos.Lo venden carísimo , en tazones, aunque no tengan idea de cómo lo preparaban los mexicanos.Los holandeses lo ofrecen en</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En549Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En549Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En549Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Lo venden carísimo , en tazones, aunque no tengan idea de cómo lo preparaban los mexicanos</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Lo [v|venden|vender|ts] [a|carísimo|caro|auonqnnn] , en tazones, aunque no tengan idea de cómo lo preparaban los mexicanos</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En549Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>venden</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vender" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En549Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>carísimo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En550"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En550Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde173" /><gams:textualContent>una locura, una especie de bofetada a su entorno social —todavía invisible e ignorante—que seguro pagarían caro .Conclusiones semejantes podía elaborar también la policía, agregaba Virginia con una dulce sensatez a la luz tenue de</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En550Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En550Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En550Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>una especie de bofetada a su entorno social —todavía invisible e ignorante—que seguro pagarían caro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>una especie de bofetada a su entorno social —todavía invisible e ignorante—que seguro [v|pagarían|pagar|is] [a|caro|caro|auonqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En550Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>pagarían</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#pagar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En550Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En551"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En551Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde78" /><gams:textualContent>—  Viajar  cuesta caro .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En551Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En551Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En551Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En551Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Viajar  cuesta caro .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Viajar|ms]  [v|cuesta|costar|is] [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En551Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Viajar</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En551Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>cuesta</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En551Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En552"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En552Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde134" /><gams:textualContent>la piel, como catorce pies cuadrados de piel por cada pájaro,  la piel del avestruz se vendía cara en el mercado.Mi madre, pese a todo, no se dejaba convencer: que tirara su dinero como</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En552Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En552Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En552Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En552Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> la piel del avestruz se vendía cara en el mercado</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|la piel del avestruz|fs] se [v|vendía|vender|rs] [a|cara|caro|afsnqnnn] en el mercado</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En552Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>la piel del avestruz</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En552Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vendía</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vender" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En552Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cara</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FeminineSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En553"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En553Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde79" /><gams:textualContent>—  Sale  caro  saber el futuro , ¿no?—dijo la gitana, tranquilamente, y al sonreír dejó ver</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En553Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En553Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En553Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En553Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Sale  caro  saber el futuro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|Sale|salir|is]  [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn]  [s|saber el futuro|ms] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En553Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>saber el futuro</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En553Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>Sale</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#salir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En553Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En554"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En554Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde272" /><gams:textualContent>— Apúrenle, si no les cobran carísimo  —agregó.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En554Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En554Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En554Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Apúrenle, si no les cobran carísimo </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Apúrenle, si no les [v|cobran|cobrar|is] [a|carísimo|caro|auonqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En554Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>cobran</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cobrar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En554Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>carísimo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En555"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En555Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde106" /><gams:textualContent>esclerosis uretral perineal», «uretrografías», «prostatitis acinosa») formuló  aquel diagnóstico que le costaría caro :</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En555Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En555Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En555Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En555Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> aquel diagnóstico que le costaría caro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|aquel diagnóstico|ms] que le [v|costaría|costar|is] [a|caro|caro|ausnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En555Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>aquel diagnóstico</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En555Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>costaría</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#costar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En555Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En556"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En556Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde122" /><gams:textualContent>la destrucción Canaima, Doña Bárbara, La Vorágine o La Revolución, lo no sujeto a controles humanos  cobra  caro la intensidad que proporciona, y el Pueblo existe sólo para ser elevado un instante por las fuerzas que lo</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En556Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En556Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En556Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> cobra  caro la intensidad que proporciona</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|cobra|cobrar|ts]  [a|caro|caro|auonqnnn] la intensidad que proporciona</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En556Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>cobra</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cobrar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En556Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En557"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En557Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde422" /><gams:textualContent>mendigos que venían a comer las sobras del mercado, y los gritos agoreros de  los indios que cobraban caro para no cantarle al cliente el día y la hora en que iba a morir.Las goletas d</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En557Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En557Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En557Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En557Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> los indios que cobraban caro para no cantarle al cliente</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|los indios|mp] que [v|cobraban|cobrar|is] [a|caro|caro|auonqnnn] para no cantarle al cliente</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En557Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>los indios</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En557Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>cobraban</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cobrar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En557Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En558"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En558Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde435" /><gams:textualContent>Et dixo Digna: — Cuídol', et tengo que es así, que  el omne agudo de buen entendimiento a las vezes sabe el estado de sus amigos et su poridat, por lo que le semeja et por lo que vee de su estado et de su fazienda, et, poniéndose en ello, sábelo çierto .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En558Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En558Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En558Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En558Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> el omne agudo de buen entendimiento a las vezes sabe el estado de sus amigos et su poridat, por lo que le semeja et por lo que vee de su estado et de su fazienda, et, poniéndose en ello, sábelo çierto .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|el omne agudo de buen entendimiento|ms] a las vezes sabe el estado de sus amigos et su poridat, por lo que le semeja et por lo que vee de su estado et de su fazienda, et, poniéndose en ello, [v|sábelo|saber|ts] [a|çierto|cierto|auvnmnnn] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En558Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>el omne agudo de buen entendimiento</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En558Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sábelo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#saber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En558Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>çierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En559"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En559Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde435" /><gams:textualContent>Dixo Belet: — Tres son los que responden çierto : el que cunple su mandamiento en su regno et en su poderío; et el omne que sabe la ley et faze sus obras; et el maestro bueno que faze bien la obra, et en conparaçión del que non la sabe.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En559Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En559Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En559Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En559Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Tres son los que responden çierto </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Tres son [s|los que|mp] [v|responden|responder|is] [a|çierto|cierto|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En559Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>los que</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En559Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>responden</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#responder" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En559Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>çierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En560"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En560Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde273" /><gams:textualContent>que quieran rescebir a aquélla por tu muger &amp; a Garfín &amp; a Roboán por tus fijos, que sey cierto que los rescebirán muy de grado.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En560Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En560Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En560Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>que sey cierto que los rescebirán muy de grado.</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>que [v|sey|saber|ts] [a|cierto|cierto|auvnmnnn] que los rescebirán muy de grado.</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En560Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sey</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#saber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En560Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En561"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En561Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde497" /><gams:textualContent> el omne bueno que andaua pedricando por la tierra, ca commo quier que avia con el grant afaçimiento, non sabie çierto do lo podrie fallar, por que Iulio non estaua sienpre en vn lugar, ante andaua por las tierras do</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En561Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En561Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En561Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En561Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> el omne bueno que andaua pedricando por la tierra, ca commo quier que avia con el grant afaçimiento, non sabie çierto do lo podrie fallar</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|el omne bueno|ms] que andaua pedricando por la tierra, ca commo quier que avia con el grant afaçimiento, non [v|sabie|saber|ts] [a|çierto|cierto|auvnmnnn] do lo podrie fallar</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En561Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>el omne bueno</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En561Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sabie</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#saber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En561Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>çierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En562"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En562Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde497" /><gams:textualContent>Ynfierno, que nunca an de auer ninguna redenpçion.Et por que  los que biuen en este mundo non saben çierto do son las almas de los que finan, teniendo que son en Purgatorio, fazen por ellos los bienes</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En562Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En562Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En562Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En562Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> los que biuen en este mundo non saben çierto do son las almas de los que finan</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|los que biuen en este mundo|mp] non [v|saben|saber|is] [a|çierto|cierto|auvnmnnn] do son las almas de los que finan</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En562Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>los que biuen en este mundo</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En562Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>saben</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#saber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En562Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>çierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En563"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En563Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde498" /><gams:textualContent>Muy * grande fue el miedo quel rrey de Granada con sus moros ovieron del ynfante don Pedro, * e veyendo el mal que del rresçebian, fizieron mucho por auer con el amor e avenençia e * de le dar tributo çierto de * cada año por que los dexase beuir en paz en sus tierras.* E andudieron mensajeros sobre esta rrazon, * e el ynfante don Pedro ouo de * fazer grand parte de lo que los moros quisieron.E esto fue por que llego mandado al ynfante don Pedro de la rreyna su madre de commo el ynfante don Iohan andaua bolliçiando * quanto podia con los de la tierra contra el; * asi que por esto, e otrosi por que algunos rricos omes e caualleros gelo consejaron, deziendo que tomase algo de los moros e pusiese pazes con ellos, * pues sabia çierto quel ynfante don Iohan le fazia mal en la su tutoria, * e que por esta rrazon era bien se avenir con el rrey de Granada * e yrse para Castilla a * poner paz e concordia en la tutoria que tenia del rrey.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En563Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En563Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En563Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>pues sabia çierto quel ynfante don Iohan le fazia mal en la su tutoria</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>pues [v|sabia|saber|ts] [a|çierto|cierto|auvnmnnn] quel ynfante don Iohan le fazia mal en la su tutoria</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En563Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sabia</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#saber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En563Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>çierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En564"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En564Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde498" /><gams:textualContent>que la guerra se alongaua e que lo auia con enemigos muy poderosos e de gran auer, quanto mas que  sabia  çierto que el rrey de Benamarin se aperçebia para pasar aquende, entendio que le cunplia catar aver para mantener la</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En564Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En564Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En564Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> sabia  çierto que el rrey de Benamarin se aperçebia para pasar aquende</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|sabia|saber|ts]  [a|çierto|cierto|auvnmnnn] que el rrey de Benamarin se aperçebia para pasar aquende</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En564Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sabia</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#saber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En564Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>çierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En565"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En565Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde498" /><gams:textualContent>E desque  los rreyes  supieron çierto que el rrey de Granada era con el rrey Alboaçen plugoles mucho, por que entendieron que pues ally era venido</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En565Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En565Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En565Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En565Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> los rreyes  supieron çierto que el rrey de Granada era con el rrey Alboaçen</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|los rreyes|mp]  [v|supieron|saber|ts] [a|çierto|cierto|auvnmnnn] que el rrey de Granada era con el rrey Alboaçen</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En565Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>los rreyes</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En565Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>supieron</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#saber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En565Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>çierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En566"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En566Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde499" /><gams:textualContent>Et sey çierto , amigo, que por esto nos viene muchas persecuçiones de muchas maneras.Et sepas çierto que esto que nos Dios da, dalo por nuestros pecados.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En566Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En566Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En566Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Et sey çierto , amigo, que por esto nos viene muchas persecuçiones</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Et [v|sey|saber|ts] [a|çierto|cierto|auvnmnnn] , amigo, que por esto nos viene muchas persecuçiones</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En566Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sey</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#saber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En566Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>çierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En567"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En567Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde499" /><gams:textualContent>Et sey çierto, amigo, que por esto nos viene muchas persecuçiones de muchas maneras.Et sepas çierto que esto que nos Dios da, dalo por nuestros pecados.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En567Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En567Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En567Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Et sepas çierto que esto que nos Dios da</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Et [v|sepas|saber|ts] [a|çierto|cierto|auvnmnnn] que esto que nos Dios da</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En567Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sepas</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#saber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En567Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>çierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En568"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En568Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde455" /><gams:textualContent>, si quier' ayan soltura,&lt;lb/&gt;a qualquier' dellos es la entençión asaz dura.*&lt;lb/&gt;Mayor pena rrecresçe cierto a los casados,&lt;lb/&gt;que a deleites de la carne, están más allegados;&lt;lb/&gt;mas bien veemos que otros</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En568Ph1"><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En568Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Mayor pena rrecresçe cierto a los casados</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Mayor pena rrecresçe [a|cierto|cierto|auSndnnn] a los casados</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En568Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Sentence" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Discourse" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En569"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En569Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde275" /><gams:textualContent>mandastes venir,&lt;lb/&gt;queredme fablar e oír&lt;lb/&gt;con paçiençia e con dulçor.&lt;lb/&gt;3  Álvaro señor, señor ,&lt;lb/&gt; sabed  çierto que emagino&lt;lb/&gt;que algunt bestión mohino *&lt;lb/&gt;me será estorvador;&lt;lb/&gt;mas vos, por bondat seguir,&lt;lb/&gt;non querades</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En569Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En569Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En569Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En569Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Álvaro señor, señor ,&lt;lb\/&gt; sabed  çierto que emagino</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Álvaro señor, señor|ms] ,&lt;lb\/&gt; [v|sabed|saber|ts]  [a|çierto|cierto|auvnmnnn] que emagino</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En569Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Álvaro señor, señor</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En569Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sabed</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#saber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En569Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>çierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En570"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En570Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde437" /><gams:textualContent>en el, e faziendole esto sienpre estara guardado de non venir a aver menester estas purgas, ca sey çierto que las purgas destruyen e gastan el cuerpo del falcon.Pero a la entrada dela muda e a</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En570Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En570Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En570Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>ca sey çierto que las purgas destruyen</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>ca [v|sey|saber|ts] [a|çierto|cierto|auvnmnnn] que las purgas destruyen</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En570Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sey</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#saber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En570Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>çierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En571"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En571Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde588" /><gams:textualContent>lo que le dexistes.E vos, señores ricosombres, ruégoos que le no queráis mal, ca  sabed cierto que él emendará tan complidamente este yerro a la corte, que bien mostrará que deve aver la batalla de</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En571Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En571Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En571Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En571Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>ca  sabed cierto que él emendará</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>ca [s||mp] [v|sabed|saber|ts] [a|cierto|cierto|auvnmnnn] que él emendará</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En571Ph1Su1"><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En571Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sabed</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#saber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En571Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En572"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En572Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde588" /><gams:textualContent>fue empós de Baalín, al salir de la villa falló el rastro dél, pero no sabía cierto que era él; mas su ventura lo levó por aquel mesmo camino por do el otro iva.E anduvo</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En572Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En572Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En572Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>pero no sabía cierto que era él</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>pero no [v|sabía|saber|ts] [a|cierto|cierto|auvnmnnn] que era él</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En572Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sabía</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#saber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En572Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En573"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En573Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde510" /><gams:textualContent>Munitor, concebió dos niños, que fueron llamados Rómulus e Remus; los quales, por quanto  ella non sabía cierto quién o quales fueron sus padres, dixo ella que los engendrara del dios que llamavan Mars.Mas</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En573Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En573Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En573Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En573Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> ella non sabía cierto quién o quales fueron sus padres</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|ella|fs] non [v|sabía|saber|ts] [a|cierto|cierto|auvnmnnn] quién o quales fueron sus padres</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En573Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>ella</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En573Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sabía</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#saber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En573Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En574"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En574Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde510" /><gams:textualContent>los padres se dubdavan de la desavenencia del pueblo si él estudiase en la cibdat, e  non sabían cierto lo qual les sería más provechoso, qu'el pueblo fuesse o que fincase.E así non sabían ellos</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En574Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En574Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En574Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En574Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>e  non sabían cierto lo qual les sería más provechoso</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>e [s||mp] non [v|sabían|saber|ts] [a|cierto|cierto|auvnmnnn] lo qual les sería más provechoso</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En574Ph1Su1"><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En574Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sabían</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#saber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En574Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En575"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En575Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde510" /><gams:textualContent>, e dexó al prefecto por guardar la cibdat, que avía nonbre Quincius Servilius.Mas él non falló cierto los enemigos en el canpo, ca ellos eran ya tornados.E el otro cónsul avía ya la fazienda</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En575Ph1"><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En575Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Mas él non falló cierto los enemigos en el canpo</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Mas él non falló [a|cierto|cierto|auSndnnn] los enemigos en el canpo</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En575Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Sentence" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Discourse" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En576"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En576Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde589" /><gams:textualContent>que es en la muerte, las almas de los buenos onbres han muy grand mjedo, ca no saben çierto a do van, si van a auer bien o a auer pena.Otrosi ay algunos escogidos e buenos</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En576Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En576Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En576Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>ca no saben çierto a do van</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>ca no [v|saben|saber|ts] [a|çierto|cierto|auvnmnnn] a do van</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En576Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>saben</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#saber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En576Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>çierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En577"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En577Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde590" /><gams:textualContent>Iohan Nuñez.E mandole que se llamasse 'señor de Lara e de Vizcaya', por quanto  el rrey  sabia çierto que don Tello, que era casado con doña Iohana, la hermana mayor, trataua con el conde don</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En577Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En577Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En577Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En577Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> el rrey  sabia çierto que don Tello</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|el rrey|ms]  [v|sabia|saber|ts] [a|çierto|cierto|auvnmnnn] que don Tello</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En577Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>el rrey</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En577Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sabia</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#saber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En577Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>çierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En578"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En578Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde547" /><gams:textualContent>de vuestra fazienda».«No os dire mas, dixo Galaz, por ninguna cosa; esto sabed cierto ».Y entonce se ensaño Eliazer, e dixo: «Cierto, este es el mas argulloso que</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En578Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En578Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En578Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>No os dire mas, dixo Galaz, por ninguna cosa; esto sabed cierto </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>No os dire mas, dixo Galaz, por ninguna cosa; esto [v|sabed|saber|ts] [a|cierto|cierto|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En578Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sabed</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#saber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En578Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En579"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En579Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde195" /><gams:textualContent>don Juan de Portogal degolló por justiçia al duque de Bergança, vn gran señor de aquel reyno.No sabemos çierto la causa desta justiçia, pero sabemos que quando le lleuauan al cadahalso, donde fué degollado,</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En579Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En579Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En579Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>No sabemos çierto la causa desta justiçia</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>No [v|sabemos|saber|ts] [a|çierto|cierto|auvnmnnn] la causa desta justiçia</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En579Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sabemos</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#saber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En579Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>çierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En580"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En580Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde90" /><gams:textualContent>que en Belén&lt;lb/&gt;avía nacido el bien&lt;lb/&gt;que tanto ver dessearon;&lt;lb/&gt;y allí por él preguntaron,&lt;lb/&gt;por saber cierto lo cierto&lt;lb/&gt;toda la ciudad turbaron,&lt;lb/&gt;a Herodes alteraron&lt;lb/&gt;de temor y espanto muerto.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En580Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En580Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En580Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>por saber cierto lo cierto</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>por [v|saber|saber|ts] [a|cierto|cierto|auvnmnnn] lo cierto</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En580Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>saber</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#saber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En580Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En581"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En581Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde90" /><gams:textualContent>mezquita,&lt;lb/&gt;do naçió la Madre de Christo bendita,&lt;lb/&gt;a do está so tierra una capilleta.&lt;lb/&gt;Allí naçió çierto la Virgen perfeta,&lt;lb/&gt;segund que lo tienen ya todos de coro,&lt;lb/&gt;y allí le çelebra el turco y</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En581Ph1"><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En581Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Allí naçió çierto la Virgen perfeta</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Allí naçió [a|çierto|cierto|auSndnnn] la Virgen perfeta</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En581Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>çierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Sentence" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Discourse" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En582"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En582Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde90" /><gams:textualContent>a un hijo muerto&lt;lb/&gt;tanbién sacó la asadura&lt;lb/&gt;y en sí le dio sepoltura,&lt;lb/&gt;que diz que la comió çierto .&lt;lb/&gt;¡O cosa de maravilla,&lt;lb/&gt;orrible, de gran manzilla,&lt;lb/&gt;de gran conpasión y duelo,&lt;lb/&gt;que</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En582Ph1"><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En582Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>que diz que la comió çierto </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>que diz que la comió [a|çierto|cierto|auSndnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En582Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>çierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Sentence" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Discourse" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En583"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En583Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde90" /><gams:textualContent>y desaliño,&lt;lb/&gt;por mi mal,&lt;lb/&gt;me será más que mortal.&lt;lb/&gt;— Si te tuviera amorío,&lt;lb/&gt; sábete  cierto y notorio &lt;lb/&gt;que aburriera el desposorio&lt;lb/&gt;con todo su poderío.&lt;lb/&gt;Su querer es muy crudío,</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En583Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En583Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En583Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En583Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text>Si te tuviera amorío,&lt;lb\/&gt; sábete  cierto y notorio &lt;lb\/&gt;que aburriera el desposorio</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Si te tuviera amorío,&lt;lb\/&gt; [v|sábete|saber|ts]  [a|cierto|cierto|auvnmnnC] y [a|notorio|notorio|auvnmnnC] &lt;lb\/&gt;que aburriera el desposorio</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En583Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sábete</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#saber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En583Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En583Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>notorio</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#notorio" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En584"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En584Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde462" /><gams:textualContent>— Mucho me plaze —dixo el hombre bueno—, que yo sé cierto que della es muy amado de todo su coraçón.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En584Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En584Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En584Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En584Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>que yo sé cierto que della es muy amado de todo su coraçón</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>que [s|yo|ms] [v|sé|saber|ts] [a|cierto|cierto|auvnmnnn] que della es muy amado de todo su coraçón</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En584Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>yo</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En584Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sé</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#saber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En584Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En585"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En585Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde462" /><gams:textualContent>ser, y rogó mucho al hombre bueno que lo criava que gelo dixiesse.Mas él , sabiendo cierto que en siendo cavallero se avía de combatir con el gigante Albadán, viniéronle las lágrimas a los ojos,</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En585Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En585Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En585Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En585Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Mas él , sabiendo cierto que en siendo cavallero se avía de combatir</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Mas [s|él|ms] , [v|sabiendo|saber|ts] [a|cierto|cierto|auvnmnnn] que en siendo cavallero se avía de combatir</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En585Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>él</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En585Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sabiendo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#saber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En585Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En586"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En586Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde462" /><gams:textualContent>su prisión sin que la dueña supiesse quién eran, que la donzella no lo quiso dezir, porque sabía cierto que en la hora los haría matar, de lo cual se ternía por la donzella más sin ventura</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En586Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En586Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En586Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>porque sabía cierto que en la hora los haría matar</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>porque [v|sabía|saber|ts] [a|cierto|cierto|auvnmnnn] que en la hora los haría matar</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En586Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sabía</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#saber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En586Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En587"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En587Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde462" /><gams:textualContent>Buen escudero, no os desesperéis por lo que no sabéis cierto , que no hazéis pro de vuestro señor, y más vos conviene buscarlo hasta saber su muerte o su</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En587Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En587Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En587Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>no os desesperéis por lo que no sabéis cierto </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>no os desesperéis por lo que no [v|sabéis|saber|ts] [a|cierto|cierto|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En587Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sabéis</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#saber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En587Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En588"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En588Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde462" /><gams:textualContent>a Dios quedéis, señora, que yo me buelvo a aquellos que a vos me embiaron; que sé cierto que me havrán bien menester, ahunque sea de poco valor.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En588Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En588Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En588Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>que sé cierto que me havrán bien menester</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>que [v|sé|saber|ts] [a|cierto|cierto|auvnmnnn] que me havrán bien menester</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En588Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sé</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#saber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En588Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En589"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En589Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde462" /><gams:textualContent>Y con esto les dixo todo lo que con él avían passado, y cómo sabían cierto que embiava al Emperador de Roma y a otros sus amigos.Agrages, a quien nada desto</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En589Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En589Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En589Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>cómo sabían cierto que embiava</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>cómo [v|sabían|saber|ts] [a|cierto|cierto|auvnmnnn] que embiava</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En589Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sabían</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#saber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En589Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En590"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En590Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde91" /><gams:textualContent>CALISTO.Bien has dicho.Madre mía,  yo  sé cierto que jamás igualarán tu trabajo y mi liviano galardón.En lugar de manto y saya, por que no se dé parte</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En590Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En590Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En590Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En590Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> yo  sé cierto que jamás igualarán</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|yo|ms]  [v|sé|saber|ts] [a|cierto|cierto|auvnmnnn] que jamás igualarán</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En590Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>yo</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En590Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sé</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#saber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En590Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En591"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En591Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde91" /><gams:textualContent>TRISTÁN.¡Oh mala fortuna la nuestra si es verdad!¿Vístelos cierto o habláronte?</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En591Ph1"><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En591Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>¿Vístelos cierto o habláronte?</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>¿Vístelos [a|cierto|cierto|auSndnnn] o habláronte?</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En591Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Sentence" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Discourse" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En592"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En592Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde304" /><gams:textualContent>A. No du[da]rás quando vieres &lt;lb/&gt;los bienes que en mí s'encier[r]an. &lt;lb/&gt;S.¡Ha ha ha! &lt;lb/&gt;A. Oye, si quieres, &lt;lb/&gt;y verás que mis plazeres &lt;lb/&gt;vuestros pesares destier[r]an. &lt;lb/&gt;S. Cata, que a mucho te obligas. &lt;lb/&gt;A. ¿Qué dirás, si lo hago cierto ?&lt;lb/&gt;S. Que, por mucho que me digas, &lt;lb/&gt;son tus obras enemigas &lt;lb/&gt;de plazer y de concierto.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En592Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En592Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En592Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>¿Qué dirás, si lo hago cierto ?</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>¿Qué dirás, si lo [v|hago|hacer|ts] [a|cierto|cierto|auvnmnnn] ?</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En592Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>hago</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hacer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En592Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En593"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En593Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde593" /><gams:textualContent>E comoquier el home non deue creer por estas cosas ni por tales visiones,  yo lo sé cierto por otra parte, porque me aparesçio esta noche señor San Pedro, &amp; non dormía, &amp; despierto estaua.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En593Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En593Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En593Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En593Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> yo lo sé cierto por otra parte</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|yo|us] lo [v|sé|saber|ts] [a|cierto|cierto|auvnmnnn] por otra parte</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En593Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>yo</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Undefined" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En593Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sé</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#saber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En593Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En594"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En594Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde594" /><gams:textualContent>Do está el coraçón abierto,&lt;lb/&gt;las puertas se abren de suyo.&lt;lb/&gt;No verná,  yo lo sé cierto :&lt;lb/&gt;con otra tiene concierto.&lt;lb/&gt;¡Cuitada!¿Por qué no huyo&lt;lb/&gt;donde estoy?&lt;lb/&gt;No sé por qué no</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En594Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En594Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En594Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En594Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> yo lo sé cierto :&lt;lb\/&gt;con otra tiene concierto.</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|yo|us] lo [v|sé|saber|ts] [a|cierto|cierto|auvnmnnn] :&lt;lb\/&gt;con otra tiene concierto.</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En594Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>yo</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Undefined" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En594Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sé</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#saber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En594Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En595"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En595Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde94" /><gams:textualContent>SALICIO ¡Loco!&lt;lb/&gt;ALBANIO Paso, que duermo un poco.&lt;lb/&gt;SALICIO ¿Duermes cierto ?&lt;lb/&gt;ALBANIO ¿No me ves como un muerto?Pues ¿qué hago?</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En595Ph1"><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En595Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>¿Duermes cierto ?</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>¿Duermes [a|cierto|cierto|auSndnnn] ?</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En595Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Sentence" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Discourse" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En596"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En596Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde464" /><gams:textualContent>alma y el cuerpo, y que junto uno con otro sea sepultado en el profundo del infierno, que entra cierto algo más en hondo que la otra desonrra del cuerpo de Hetor.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En596Ph1"><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En596Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>que entra cierto algo más en hondo que la otra desonrra</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>que entra [a|cierto|cierto|auSndnnn] algo más en hondo que la otra desonrra</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En596Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Sentence" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Discourse" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En597"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En597Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde464" /><gams:textualContent>ni tanpoco es muy cuerdo el que toma una pequeña ganancia que le viene a las manos, si sabe cierto que de aquélla se le ha de seguir muy crecida pérdida.¿Pues quánto menos seso es proveer con</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En597Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En597Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En597Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>si sabe cierto que de aquélla</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>si [v|sabe|saber|ts] [a|cierto|cierto|auvnmnnn] que de aquélla</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En597Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sabe</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#saber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En597Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En598"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En598Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde183" /><gams:textualContent>le hiciese ser agradable a todo el mundo.La gracia y la hermosura del rostro ya yo sé cierto que la tengo, y por eso tantas mujeres (como sabéis) se mueren por mí de amores.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En598Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En598Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En598Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En598Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>La gracia y la hermosura del rostro ya yo sé cierto que la tengo</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>La gracia y la hermosura del rostro ya [s|yo|ms] [v|sé|saber|ts] [a|cierto|cierto|auvnmnnn] que la tengo</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En598Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>yo</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En598Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sé</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#saber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En598Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En599"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En599Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde277" /><gams:textualContent>ciudad si por cierta parte della mandara poner fuego, no lo quiso ni osó hazer, porque supo cierto que una tabla que Protógenes avía pintado estava hazia aquella misma parte y tuvo por mejor de no tomar la</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En599Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En599Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En599Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>porque supo cierto que una tabla que Protógenes avía pintado estava hazia aquella misma parte</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>porque [v|supo|saber|ts] [a|cierto|cierto|auvnmnnn] que una tabla que Protógenes avía pintado estava hazia aquella misma parte</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En599Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>supo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#saber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En599Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En600"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En600Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde547" /><gams:textualContent>cauallero, yo vos ruego, por Dios e por cortesia, que me digades quien soys, que sabed cierto que de vuestra muerte me pesa mucho, por la gran bondad que en vos falle»; e Yuan</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En600Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En600Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En600Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>que sabed cierto que de vuestra muerte me pesa mucho</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>que [v|sabed|saber|ts] [a|cierto|cierto|auvnmnnn] que de vuestra muerte me pesa mucho</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En600Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sabed</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#saber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En600Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En601"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En601Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde277" /><gams:textualContent>bien, que él determinava de mirar mucho por su vida y salud; que, pues avía de yr cierto al infierno, que quería trabajar de yr lo más tarde que pudiese.Quedando en este propósito y</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En601Ph1"><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En601Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>pues avía de yr cierto al infierno</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>pues avía de yr [a|cierto|cierto|auSndnnn] al infierno</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En601Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Sentence" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Discourse" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En602"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En602Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde101" /><gams:textualContent>, corre por muchas y diversas provincias y partes otras que no hay poblado.De largura no se sabe cierto lo que tiene; de anchura, a partes tiene veinte leguas, y a partes mucho más, y a cabos</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En602Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En602Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En602Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>De largura no se sabe cierto lo que tiene</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>De largura no se [v|sabe|saber|rs] [a|cierto|cierto|auvnmnnn] lo que tiene</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En602Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sabe</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#saber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En602Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En603"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En603Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde101" /><gams:textualContent>dentro de un río de agua dulce, y echa el agua della un vapor a manera de humo, que debe cierto salir de algún metal que corre por aquella parte; y desta agua hacen los indios sal blanca y</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En603Ph1"><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En603Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>un vapor a manera de humo, que debe cierto salir de algún metal</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>un vapor a manera de humo, que debe [a|cierto|cierto|auSndnnn] salir de algún metal</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En603Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Sentence" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Discourse" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En604"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En604Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde307" /><gams:textualContent>ciego u ascuras, que, aunque habla con una persona y ve que está con ella, porque sabe cierto que está allí (digo que entiende y cree que está allí, más no la ve), de</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En604Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En604Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En604Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>porque sabe cierto que está allí</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>porque [v|sabe|saber|ts] [a|cierto|cierto|auvnmnnn] que está allí</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En604Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sabe</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#saber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En604Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En605"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En605Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde307" /><gams:textualContent>cielo, y paréceme a mí que ansí como allá sin hablar se entiende (lo que yo nunca supe cierto es ansí, hasta que el Señor por su bondad quiso que lo viese y me lo mostró en un</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En605Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En605Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En605Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En605Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>lo que yo nunca supe cierto es ansí</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>lo que [s|yo|fs] nunca [v|supe|saber|ts] [a|cierto|cierto|auvnmnnn] es ansí</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En605Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>yo</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En605Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>supe</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#saber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En605Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En606"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En606Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde308" /><gams:textualContent>ni aun México tampoco.Puesto que no valía mucho aquel presente que trajeron, tuvímoslo por bueno por saber cierto que tenían oro, y desque lo hubieron presentado, dijeron que nos fuésemos luego adelante, y el capitán</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En606Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En606Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En606Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>por saber cierto que tenían oro</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>por [v|saber|saber|ts] [a|cierto|cierto|auvnmnnn] que tenían oro</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En606Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>saber</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#saber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En606Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En607"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En607Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde308" /><gams:textualContent>que en cosa ninguna le obedeciesen; y esto le tornaron a enviar a decir tres veces, porque sabían cierto que no les quería obedecer, y tenía determinado el Xicotenga que una noche había de dar otra vez en nuestro</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En607Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En607Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En607Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>porque sabían cierto que no les quería obedecer</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>porque [v|sabían|saber|ts] [a|cierto|cierto|auvnmnnn] que no les quería obedecer</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En607Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sabían</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#saber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En607Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En608"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En608Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde308" /><gams:textualContent>aquí con nosotros, y os daremos de lo que tuviéremos; e no vais a México, que sabemos cierto que, según es fuerte y de muchos guerreros, no os dejarán con las vidas"; y Cortés</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En608Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En608Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En608Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>que sabemos cierto que, según es fuerte y de muchos guerreros, no os dejarán</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>que [v|sabemos|saber|ts] [a|cierto|cierto|auvnmnnn] que, según es fuerte y de muchos guerreros, no os dejarán</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En608Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sabemos</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#saber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En608Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En609"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En609Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde308" /><gams:textualContent>de su majestad; y Cortés se holgó tanto con el oro como si fueran treinta mil pesos, en saber cierto que había buenas minas; e a los caciques que trajeron el presente les mostró mucho amor y les mandó</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En609Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En609Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En609Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>en saber cierto que había buenas minas</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>en [v|saber|saber|ts] [a|cierto|cierto|auvnmnnn] que había buenas minas</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En609Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>saber</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#saber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En609Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En610"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En610Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde308" /><gams:textualContent>cabe Tlascala, y como las vimos, nos alegramos como si fueran nuestras casas.Pues: quizá sabíamos cierto que nos habían de ser leales o qué voluntad tendrían, o qué había acontecido a los que estaban poblados</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En610Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En610Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En610Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>quizá sabíamos cierto que nos habían de ser leales</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>quizá [v|sabíamos|saber|ts] [a|cierto|cierto|auvnmnnn] que nos habían de ser leales</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En610Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sabíamos</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#saber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En610Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En611"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En611Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde308" /><gams:textualContent>nuestro fardaje para caminar, Cortés comenzó a hacer un parlamento acerca del peligro en que estábamos, porque sabíamos cierto que en los caminos e pasos malos nos estaba aguardando todo el poder de México y otros muchos guerreros puestos</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En611Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En611Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En611Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>porque sabíamos cierto que en los caminos e pasos malos</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>porque [v|sabíamos|saber|ts] [a|cierto|cierto|auvnmnnn] que en los caminos e pasos malos</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En611Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sabíamos</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#saber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En611Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En612"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En612Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde308" /><gams:textualContent>buscar guías y camino; y esto lo dijo con palabras amorosas y a manera de ruegos, por causa que supo cierto que yo estaba malo, como dicho tengo, que aún tenía calenturas; y aun me habían apercibido antes</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En612Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En612Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En612Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>por causa que supo cierto que yo estaba malo</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>por causa que [v|supo|saber|ts] [a|cierto|cierto|auvnmnnn] que yo estaba malo</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En612Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>supo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#saber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En612Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En613"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En613Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde308" /><gams:textualContent>voluntad, que renegaban de Cortés y aun de su viaje, y tenían mucha razón; porque no sabían cierto si la tierra por donde habían de ir estaba de paz.Acordó Sandoval de demandar a los caciques de</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En613Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En613Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En613Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>porque no sabían cierto si la tierra</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>porque no [v|sabían|saber|ts] [a|cierto|cierto|auvnmnnn] si la tierra</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En613Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sabían</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#saber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En613Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En614"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En614Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde308" /><gams:textualContent>la recámara, ni por nuestra parte fuese compelido Cortés a que pagase ninguna cosa dello, y decíamos que sabíamos cierto y claramente que lo enviaba a su majestad, y lo hubimos por bueno hacer aquel servicio a nuestro rey</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En614Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En614Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En614Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>decíamos que sabíamos cierto y claramente que lo enviaba a su majestad</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>decíamos que [v|sabíamos|saber|ts] [a|cierto|cierto|auvnmnnC] y claramente que lo enviaba a su majestad</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En614Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sabíamos</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#saber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En614Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En615"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En615Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde311" /><gams:textualContent>me honra.&lt;lb/&gt;Al fin yo estó en que muera resumido&lt;lb/&gt;en la prisión, pues ha de morir cierto &lt;lb/&gt;por justicia, su término cumplido;&lt;lb/&gt;así será mi daño más cubierto,&lt;lb/&gt;que no verla sacar de las</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En615Ph1"><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En615Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>pues ha de morir cierto &lt;lb\/&gt;por justicia</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>pues ha de morir [a|cierto|cierto|auSndnnn] &lt;lb\/&gt;por justicia</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En615Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Sentence" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Discourse" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En616"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En616Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde312" /><gams:textualContent>son, como dice Esaías, los que ponen un muro de división entre Dios y él, y sepa cierto que tanto mayor cuidado tendrá Dios dél que de la hormiga, cuanto es él más noble criatura que</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En616Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En616Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En616Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>y sepa cierto que tanto mayor cuidado tendrá Dios dél</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>y [v|sepa|saber|ts] [a|cierto|cierto|auvnmnnn] que tanto mayor cuidado tendrá Dios dél</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En616Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sepa</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#saber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En616Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En617"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En617Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde550" /><gams:textualContent>a Tyresias después de ciego para adevinar denota que el que no ve el mundo ni le ama,  adivina  cierto su ser, o que los ciegos son más aparejados para especular secretos de naturaleza que los otros.O</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En617Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En617Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En617Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> adivina  cierto su ser</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|adivina|adivinar|ts]  [a|cierto|cierto|auvnmnnn] su ser</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En617Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>adivina</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#adivinar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En617Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En618"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En618Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde144" /><gams:textualContent>el plaudite; que he sido el huésped, tengo que mantener la conuersación hasta el fin, pues sé cierto que no os enoja.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En618Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En618Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En618Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>pues sé cierto que no os enoja</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>pues [v|sé|saber|ts] [a|cierto|cierto|auvnmnnn] que no os enoja</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En618Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sé</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#saber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En618Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En619"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En619Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde9" /><gams:textualContent>yo daré razón de algunos,&lt;lb/&gt;porque vengo del Infierno.&lt;lb/&gt;Allá queda barajando&lt;lb/&gt;aquel que acá supo cierto &lt;lb/&gt;a cuántos venia su carta,&lt;lb/&gt;cual si fuera del correo.&lt;lb/&gt;Un letrado y su mujer</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En619Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En619Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En619Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>aquel que acá supo cierto &lt;lb\/&gt;a cuántos venia su carta</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>aquel que acá [v|supo|saber|ts] [a|cierto|cierto|auvnmnnn] &lt;lb\/&gt;a cuántos venia su carta</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En619Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>supo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#saber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En619Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En620"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En620Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde317" /><gams:textualContent>que viuio, ni de quantos vino a las cueuas de Guisando, ni quanto tiempo fue Prior:  sabese  cierto , que no era Prior al tiempo de la vnion de la Orden, porque en aquella sazon lo</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En620Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En620Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En620Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> sabese  cierto , que no era Prior al tiempo de la vnion de la Orden</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|sabese|saber|rs]  [a|cierto|cierto|auvnmnnn] , que no era Prior al tiempo de la vnion de la Orden</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En620Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sabese</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#saber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En620Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En621"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En621Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde104" /><gams:textualContent>no es su gran humildad.&lt;lb/&gt;Si de verla os satisface,&lt;lb/&gt;pues que visto no la habéis,&lt;lb/&gt; yo  sé cierto que diréis&lt;lb/&gt;que todo lo nuevo aplace.&lt;lb/&gt;Y si queréis mirar,&lt;lb/&gt;llamarélos luego aquí.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En621Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En621Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En621Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En621Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> yo  sé cierto que diréis&lt;lb\/&gt;que todo lo nuevo aplace</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|yo|us]  [v|sé|saber|ts] [a|cierto|cierto|auvnmnnn] que diréis&lt;lb\/&gt;que todo lo nuevo aplace</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En621Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>yo</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Undefined" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En621Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sé</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#saber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En621Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En622"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En622Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde146" /><gams:textualContent>y otras muchas cosas de plata para el servicio del altar, y está en el campo,  entendí  cierto que me querían hacer algún agravio, porque no sabía lo que pasaba; y aunque me pedían que los</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En622Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En622Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En622Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> entendí  cierto que me querían hacer algún agravio</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|entendí|entender|ts]  [a|cierto|cierto|auvnmnnn] que me querían hacer algún agravio</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En622Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>entendí</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#entender" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En622Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En623"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En623Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde468" /><gams:textualContent>la paga, que yo no puedo contravenir a la orden de los caballeros andantes, de los cuales  sé  cierto , sin que hasta ahora haya leído cosa en contrario, que jamás pagaron posada ni otra cosa en venta donde estuviesen</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En623Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En623Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En623Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> sé  cierto , sin que hasta ahora haya leído cosa en contrario</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|sé|saber|ts]  [a|cierto|cierto|auvnmnnn] , sin que hasta ahora haya leído cosa en contrario</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En623Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sé</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#saber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En623Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En624"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En624Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde326" /><gams:textualContent>Lugo Llévelo en cólera,&lt;lb/&gt;que tanto monta.&lt;lb/&gt;Alguacil Ahora, yo sé cierto &lt;lb/&gt;que ha de romper el diablo sus zapatos&lt;lb/&gt;alguna vez.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En624Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En624Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En624Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En624Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Ahora, yo sé cierto &lt;lb\/&gt;que ha de romper</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Ahora, [s|yo|ms] [v|sé|saber|ts] [a|cierto|cierto|auvnmnnn] &lt;lb\/&gt;que ha de romper</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En624Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>yo</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En624Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sé</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#saber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En624Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En625"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En625Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde326" /><gams:textualContent>Corchete 1 So Cristóbal, ¡vive&lt;lb/&gt;que no le conocí!; ¡sí, juro cierto !</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En625Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En625Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En625Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>¡sí, juro cierto !</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>¡sí, [v|juro|jurar|is] [a|cierto|cierto|auOnunnn] !</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En625Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>juro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#jurar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En625Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Other" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Other" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En626"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En626Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde326" /><gams:textualContent>Médico  Vuesa merced  sepa cierto &lt;lb/&gt;que aquesta su enfermedad&lt;lb/&gt;es de muy ruin calidad;&lt;lb/&gt;hablo en ella como experto.&lt;lb/&gt;Mi oficio obliga a</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En626Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En626Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En626Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En626Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Vuesa merced  sepa cierto &lt;lb\/&gt;que aquesta su enfermedad</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Vuesa merced|ms]  [v|sepa|saber|ts] [a|cierto|cierto|auvnmnnn] &lt;lb\/&gt;que aquesta su enfermedad</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En626Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Vuesa merced</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En626Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sepa</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#saber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En626Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En627"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En627Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde585" /><gams:textualContent>en sus manos,&lt;lb/&gt;por tener los pies ligeros.&lt;lb/&gt;Esta noche la llevaba&lt;lb/&gt;no sé adónde, aunque sé cierto &lt;lb/&gt;que, si fortuna quisiera,&lt;lb/&gt;fuéramos los dos al cielo".&lt;lb/&gt;A la nueva triste y nueva</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En627Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En627Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En627Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>aunque sé cierto &lt;lb\/&gt;que</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>aunque [v|sé|saber|ts] [a|cierto|cierto|auvnmnnn] &lt;lb\/&gt;que</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En627Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sé</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#saber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En627Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En628"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En628Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde585" /><gams:textualContent>Mamí ¿Qué piensas que me quería&lt;lb/&gt;el Gran Sultán?&lt;lb/&gt;Rustán No sé cierto ;&lt;lb/&gt;pero saberlo querría.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En628Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En628Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En628Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>No sé cierto ;&lt;lb\/&gt;pero saberlo querría.</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>No [v|sé|saber|is] [a|cierto|cierto|auvnmnnn] ;&lt;lb\/&gt;pero saberlo querría.</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En628Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sé</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#saber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En628Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En629"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En629Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde600" /><gams:textualContent>D.Fernando&lt;lb/&gt;Aparte ¿Es ido cierto ?</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En629Ph1"><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En629Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>¿Es ido cierto ?</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>¿Es ido [a|cierto|cierto|auSndnnn] ?</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En629Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Sentence" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Discourse" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En630"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En630Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde152" /><gams:textualContent>De Ero murmuráis, yo lo sé cierto ,&lt;lb/&gt;que fue muy blanda en el primer concierto.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En630Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En630Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En630Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En630Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>De Ero murmuráis, yo lo sé cierto ,</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>De Ero murmuráis, [s|yo|us] lo [v|sé|saber|ts] [a|cierto|cierto|auvnmnnn] ,</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En630Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>yo</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Undefined" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En630Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sé</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#saber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En630Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En631"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En631Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde604" /><gams:textualContent>mayor fundamento es que la dama&lt;lb/&gt;la voy a ver, y piensa que la acecho.&lt;lb/&gt; Yo no sé cierto con qué mano llama&lt;lb/&gt;a una puerta cerrada y solicita&lt;lb/&gt;entrarse a una mujer hasta la cama&lt;lb/&gt;el que armado</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En631Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En631Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En631Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En631Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Yo no sé cierto con qué mano llama</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Yo|us] no [v|sé|saber|ts] [a|cierto|cierto|auvnmnnn] con qué mano llama</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En631Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Yo</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Undefined" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En631Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sé</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#saber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En631Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En632"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En632Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde212" /><gams:textualContent>73. después de referir la opinión contraria a las mugeres: Soy de muy diferente opinión, y creo cierto ay muchas de gran juicio.Vi, y traté algunas en España, y fuera de ella.Por</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En632Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En632Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En632Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>y creo cierto ay muchas de gran juicio</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>y [v|creo|creer|ts] [a|cierto|cierto|auvnmnnn] ay muchas de gran juicio</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En632Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>creo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#creer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En632Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En633"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En633Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde606" /><gams:textualContent>¿qué importará que el ilustrísimo señor Valero, en aquella su célebre carta pastoral (que no sé cierto por qué la han alabado tanto los hombres más doctos &lt;lb/&gt;de la monarquía), haga una sangrienta sátira contra el</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En633Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En633Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En633Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>que no sé cierto por qué</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>que no [v|sé|saber|ts] [a|cierto|cierto|auvnmnnn] por qué</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En633Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sé</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#saber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En633Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En634"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En634Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde613" /><gams:textualContent>Yo en mi sueño letárgico y profundo&lt;lb/&gt;la doy estable paz, descanso cierto ;&lt;lb/&gt;yo contra el recio temporal del mundo&lt;lb/&gt;aseguro su gloria, y soy su puerto.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En634Ph1"><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En634Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>la doy estable paz, descanso cierto </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>la doy estable paz, descanso [a|cierto|cierto|auSndnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En634Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Sentence" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Discourse" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En635"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En635Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde252" /><gams:textualContent>su patria, su naturaleza, sus haciendas, y tanto bien como tenían, y aún no sabían cierto lo que se haría de sus cabezas (18)».</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En635Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En635Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En635Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>aún no sabían cierto lo que se haría de sus cabezas</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>aún no [v|sabían|saber|ts] [a|cierto|cierto|auvnmnnn] lo que se haría de sus cabezas</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En635Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sabían</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#saber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En635Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En636"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En636Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde252" /><gams:textualContent>mande, aunque temo la dificultad de la adulación que me dicen hay en Italia. Vuestra majestad me crea cierto que ni deseo honor ni bien sino para mejor &lt;lb/&gt;servirle como con él se hace, pero la consideración d</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En636Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En636Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En636Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En636Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Vuestra majestad me crea cierto que ni deseo honor</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Vuestra majestad|ms] me [v|crea|creer|ts] [a|cierto|cierto|auvnmnnn] que ni deseo honor</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En636Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Vuestra majestad</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En636Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>crea</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#creer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En636Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En637"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En637Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde252" /><gams:textualContent>de vuestra majestad, témome de dónde le pueda haber venido.Al fin, yo no lo sé cierto , ni no sabiéndolo lo diré, sino que por amor de Nuestro Señor &lt;lb/&gt;suplico a vuestra majestad con cuanto encarecimiento puedo</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En637Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En637Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En637Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En637Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Al fin, yo no lo sé cierto , ni no sabiéndolo lo diré</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Al fin, [s|yo|us] no lo [v|sé|saber|ts] [a|cierto|cierto|auvnmnnn] , ni no sabiéndolo lo diré</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En637Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>yo</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Undefined" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En637Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sé</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#saber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En637Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En638"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En638Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde263" /><gams:textualContent>maneras, no iba a dejar que se fuera con él solamente porque era un morón y yo no iba cierto a comprarlo, extorsionándome a mí mismo.«No soy un hombre a &lt;lb/&gt;chantajear», le dije,</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En638Ph1"><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En638Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>yo no iba cierto a comprarlo</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>yo no iba [a|cierto|cierto|auSndnnn] a comprarlo</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En638Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Sentence" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Discourse" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En639"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En639Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde415" /><gams:textualContent>(Lo único que no creo cierto en el texto, en verso y prosa, de León, es su referencia a una fotografía de Picasso</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En639Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En639Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En639Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Lo único que no creo cierto en el texto</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Lo único que no [v|creo|creer|is] [a|cierto|cierto|auvnmnnn] en el texto</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En639Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>creo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#creer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En639Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En640"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En640Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde291" /><gams:textualContent>aquel viçio lorando &lt;lb/&gt;estido con la su amiga *&lt;lb/&gt;el infante muy cuytado &lt;lb/&gt;besando la noche toda.&lt;lb/&gt;Mas vieno claro  el dia &lt;lb/&gt;que partio aquella boda, &lt;lb/&gt;partio aquella alegria.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En640Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En640Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En640Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En640Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Mas vieno claro  el dia &lt;lb\/&gt;que partio aquella boda</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Mas [v|vieno|venir|is] [a|claro|claro|ausnmnnn]  [s|el dia|ms] &lt;lb\/&gt;que partio aquella boda</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En640Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>el dia</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En640Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vieno</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#venir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En640Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En641"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En641Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde292" /><gams:textualContent>uey otrossi la estrella de hercules &amp; ueras como se entristece.&amp;  la estrella de Juppiter  luze clara  &amp; estando Neptanabo catando suso all cielo daquella guisa.llegosse alexandre mas a el &amp; aremetiosse contra</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En641Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En641Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En641Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En641Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> la estrella de Juppiter  luze clara </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|la estrella de Juppiter|fs]  [v|luze|lucir|is] [a|clara|claro|afsnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En641Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>la estrella de Juppiter</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En641Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>luze</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#lucir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En641Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>clara</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FeminineSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En642"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En642Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde293" /><gams:textualContent>enojo por el affincamiento que vos fago.Pero commo quier que segund el mío flaco saber querría más que me fablássedes claro que oscuro , pero tanto tengo que me cunple lo que vós dezides, que querría ante que me fablássedes</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En642Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En642Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En642Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En642Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text>querría más que me fablássedes claro que oscuro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>querría más que me [v|fablássedes|hablar|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnC] que [a|oscuro|oscuro|auvnmnnC] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En642Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>fablássedes</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En642Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En642Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>oscuro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#oscuro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En643"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En643Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde296" /><gams:textualContent>coraçon de los torpes entendera sçiençia, e la lengua de los que son balbuçientes correra e festinara a fablar claro .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En643Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En643Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En643Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>la lengua de los que son balbuçientes correra e festinara a fablar claro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>la lengua de los que son balbuçientes correra e festinara a [v|fablar|hablar|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En643Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>fablar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En643Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En644"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En644Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde296" /><gams:textualContent>yo fablo con los prophetas que vos castiguen por diuisas maneras, dello que vos fablan claro , dello en prosa, dello retoricado, dello por ensienplo, asy como aquello que puso Ysayas</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En644Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En644Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En644Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>con los prophetas que vos castiguen por diuisas maneras, dello que vos fablan claro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>con los prophetas que vos castiguen por diuisas maneras, dello que vos [v|fablan|hablar|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En644Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>fablan</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En644Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En645"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En645Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde125" /><gams:textualContent>combite e la orden de los asentamientos e solempnidat de las viandas e durada de aquél, nin lo dize claro en el original latín, e por eso lo declaré en el vulgar, porque entre tales e tan grandes</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En645Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En645Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En645Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>nin lo dize claro en el original latín</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>nin lo [v|dize|decir|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] en el original latín</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En645Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>dize</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#decir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En645Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En646"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En646Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde297" /><gams:textualContent>çielo, como sea çircular, non puede ser ynfinito”.Dixo el Entendimiento: “Agora lo veo claro ”.Dixo la Verdad: “Non te diré muchos enxenplos en estas pruevas, que son muy çiertas</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En646Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En646Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En646Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Agora lo veo claro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Agora lo [v|veo|ver|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En646Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>veo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En646Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En647"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En647Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde239" /><gams:textualContent>quiere dezir: “¿fasta quando nos sacas el anima?; si tu eres el Messias, dinoslo claro ”.Et aunque algunos actos a Cristo fazer veian, los quales le demostravan seer Messias, enpero del todo</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En647Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En647Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En647Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>si tu eres el Messias, dinoslo claro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>si tu eres el Messias, [v|dinoslo|decir|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En647Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>dinoslo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#decir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En647Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En648"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En648Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde240" /><gams:textualContent>Tal que los buenos d’aquí, &lt;lb/&gt;queriendo guardar su loa, &lt;lb/&gt;algunas vezes lo vý, &lt;lb/&gt;no sabían claro sy &lt;lb/&gt;fuesen Oñez o Gamboa, &lt;lb/&gt;mas con lealtad no poca &lt;lb/&gt;y muy clarífica ley &lt;lb/&gt;por cobrir muy blanca toca</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En648Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En648Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En648Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>no sabían claro sy &lt;lb\/&gt;fuesen Oñez o Gamboa</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>no [v|sabían|saber|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] sy &lt;lb\/&gt;fuesen Oñez o Gamboa</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En648Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sabían</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#saber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En648Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En649"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En649Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde298" /><gams:textualContent>[Mena] 3 ¿ Quién non vos servirá claro , &lt;lb/&gt;Rey de virtudes exemplo, &lt;lb/&gt;siendo vos concorde templo &lt;lb/&gt;con vuestro fijo muy caro? &lt;lb/&gt;De lo futuro reparo &lt;lb/&gt;</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En649Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En649Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En649Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En649Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>¿ Quién non vos servirá claro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>¿ [s|Quién|us] non vos [v|servirá|servir|ts] [a|claro|claro|auOnunnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En649Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Quién</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Undefined" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En649Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>servirá</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#servir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En649Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Other" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Other" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En650"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En650Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde299" /><gams:textualContent>regla, señora, &lt;lb/&gt; por lo qual puedo dezir &lt;lb/&gt; que vos fuestes cabsadora; &lt;lb/&gt; y por no ser lisongero &lt;lb/&gt; fablo  claro sin falsía &lt;lb/&gt; que diga que bien vos quiero &lt;lb/&gt; es çierto que mentiría.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En650Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En650Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En650Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>por no ser lisongero &lt;lb\/&gt; fablo  claro sin falsía</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>por no ser lisongero &lt;lb\/&gt; [v|fablo|hablar|is]  [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnC] sin falsía</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En650Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>fablo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En650Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En651"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En651Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde300" /><gams:textualContent>de las espremir por la lengua o sy basta pensarlas en el coraçon.E aca entre los omnes fablando claro  es que non averia mos por petiçion la que non se dixiese porque non sabemos lo que el otro desea</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En651Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En651Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En651Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>entre los omnes fablando claro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>entre los omnes [v|fablando|hablar|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En651Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>fablando</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En651Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En652"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En652Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde195" /><gams:textualContent>paçífico al rrey Eduarte, que mató al padre e al fijo.»E como quier que veemos claros de cada día estos semejantes efectos, ni somos ni podemos ser acá juezes de sus causas, en espeçial de los rreyes</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En652Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En652Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En652Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>E como quier que veemos claros de cada día estos semejantes efectos</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>E como quier que [v|veemos|ver|ts] [a|claros|claro|apvnmnnn] de cada día estos semejantes efectos</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En652Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>veemos</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En652Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claros</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#MasculinePlural" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En653"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En653Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde195" /><gams:textualContent>quiso otorgar victoria.Pero ¿qué podemos decir desta enpresa que tomastes de Castilla, syno que veemos claro que no le plaza ni quiere que la prosigáys, segúnd los grandes siniestros &amp; ynfortunios que en ella vemos</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En653Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En653Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En653Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>syno que veemos claro que no le plaza ni quiere que la prosigáys</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>syno que [v|veemos|ver|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] que no le plaza ni quiere que la prosigáys</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En653Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>veemos</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En653Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En654"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En654Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde195" /><gams:textualContent>arriba, fiziese entregar al Rey e a la Reyna las çibdades de Guadix &amp; Almería, pues que vía claro que nin tenía ni esperaua tener fuerças para las defender al poderío grande de sus gentes.E que</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En654Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En654Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En654Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>pues que vía claro que nin tenía</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>pues que [v|vía|ver|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] que nin tenía</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En654Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vía</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En654Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En655"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En655Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde90" /><gams:textualContent>él allá no falta un pelo &lt;lb/&gt; en el trono de su Padre, &lt;lb/&gt; él acá nos da consuelo, &lt;lb/&gt;  dásenos  claro , sin velo &lt;lb/&gt; oy, del vientre de su Madre.&lt;lb/&gt; &lt;lb/&gt; Tomemos oy nuevo estado &lt;lb/&gt; pues tomamos nuevo nombre &lt;lb/&gt; </gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En655Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En655Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En655Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>él acá nos da consuelo, &lt;lb\/&gt;  dásenos  claro , sin velo</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>él acá nos da consuelo, &lt;lb\/&gt;  [v|dásenos|dar|ts]  [a|claro|claro|auOnunnC] , sin velo</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En655Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>dásenos</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#dar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En655Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Other" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Other" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En656"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En656Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde301" /><gams:textualContent>Por que ami asy sse dio &lt;lb/&gt; sseyendo verde madero &lt;lb/&gt; dolor que asy me ffirio &lt;lb/&gt; que haral que sse sseco &lt;lb/&gt;  vedlo  claro por entero;&lt;lb/&gt; por que sy estas cosas son &lt;lb/&gt; fechas ami syn pecado &lt;lb/&gt; ques fara enel varon &lt;lb/&gt; que tanta pena &lt;lb/&gt; </gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En656Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En656Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En656Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> vedlo  claro por entero</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|vedlo|ver|ts]  [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnC] por entero</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En656Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vedlo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En656Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En657"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En657Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde302" /><gams:textualContent>ençerrado el Criador de todo el mundo, ençendíase en el fuego del su rresplandor en el qual veya clara la eternidad syenpre duradera de aquel rrey del çielo y de la tierra delante de quien estaua y dando /</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En657Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En657Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En657Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>en el qual veya clara la eternidad syenpre duradera de aquel rrey</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>en el qual [v|veya|ver|ts] [a|clara|claro|afonmnnn] la eternidad syenpre duradera de aquel rrey</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En657Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>veya</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En657Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>clara</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FeminineSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En658"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En658Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde302" /><gams:textualContent>este mundo a los quales eres çercano en sus bocas y alongado en sus coraçones’.Paresçe que vía claro  este propheta las ypocresías y maluadas obras que de los erejes oy son descubiertas que blasfemando secretamente de Dios con</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En658Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En658Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En658Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En658Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Paresçe que vía claro  este propheta las ypocresías y maluadas obras</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Paresçe que [v|vía|ver|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn]  [s|este propheta|ms] las ypocresías y maluadas obras</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En658Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>este propheta</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En658Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vía</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En658Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En659"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En659Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde303" /><gams:textualContent>los dioses lo consientan.Y pienso yo que Fortuna tan presto me lo ha trocado, aunque lo viese claro apenas lo creyera, que más dolor sentiría de tu pérdida que de mi pena.No es posible que</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En659Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En659Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En659Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>aunque lo viese claro apenas lo creyera</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>aunque lo [v|viese|ver|ts] [a|claro|claro|auonmnnn] apenas lo creyera</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En659Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>viese</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En659Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En660"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En660Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde141" /><gams:textualContent>pequeño que claro es que no podran pocas abejas hinchir tanto como las muchas, y esto se deue conoscer claro por la gente, que quien tiene pocos hijos, o criados no ha menester tan gran casa, como</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En660Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En660Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En660Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>esto se deue conoscer claro por la gente</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>esto se deue [v|conoscer|conocer|rs] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] por la gente</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En660Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>conoscer</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#conocer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En660Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En661"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En661Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde141" /><gams:textualContent>aclaren: que empapen bien vn colladero en azeyte de arrayhan y cuelen por ello el vino y que colara claro  y la hez y asiento quedara enel coladero y el vino no cobrara mal sabor, las vuas d</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En661Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En661Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En661Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En661Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>cuelen por ello el vino y que colara claro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>cuelen por ello [s|el vino|ms] y que [v|colara|colar|is] [a|claro|claro|ausnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En661Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>el vino</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En661Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>colara</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#colar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En661Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En662"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En662Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde93" /><gams:textualContent>GALTERIO ¡Pese al ciego!&lt;lb/&gt; Pues que tanto te lo ruego, &lt;lb/&gt;  dime  claro por qué mueres.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En662Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En662Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En662Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> dime  claro por qué mueres</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|dime|decir|ts]  [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] por qué mueres</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En662Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>dime</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#decir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En662Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En663"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En663Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde94" /><gams:textualContent>, por mi dolor, con esa mano, &lt;lb/&gt; que aun a su mismo pecho no perdona: &lt;lb/&gt; donde vi claro mi esperanza muerta &lt;lb/&gt; y el golpe, que en vos hizo amor en vano, &lt;lb/&gt; non esservi passato oltra la gona &lt;lb/&gt; </gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En663Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En663Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En663Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>donde vi claro mi esperanza muerta</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>donde [v|vi|ver|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] mi esperanza muerta</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En663Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vi</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En663Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En664"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En664Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde94" /><gams:textualContent>solo el pensamiento &lt;lb/&gt; de la esperanza, cierta o mentirosa;&lt;lb/&gt; en este dulce error muero contento, &lt;lb/&gt; porque ver claro y conocer mi’stado &lt;lb/&gt; no puede ya curar el mal que siento, &lt;lb/&gt; y acabo como aquel que’n un templado &lt;lb/&gt; baño</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En664Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En664Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En664Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>porque ver claro y conocer mi’stado</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>porque [v|ver|ver|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] y conocer mi’stado</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En664Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>ver</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En664Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En665"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En665Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde94" /><gams:textualContent>ALBANIO Amor quiere que muera sin reparo, &lt;lb/&gt; y conociendo claro que bastaba &lt;lb/&gt; lo que yo descansaba en este llanto &lt;lb/&gt; contigo a que entretanto m’aliviase &lt;lb/&gt; y aquel tiempo probase a</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En665Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En665Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En665Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Amor quiere que muera sin reparo, &lt;lb\/&gt; y conociendo claro que bastaba</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Amor quiere que muera sin reparo, &lt;lb\/&gt; y [v|conociendo|conocer|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] que bastaba</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En665Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>conociendo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#conocer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En665Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En666"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En666Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde305" /><gams:textualContent>no hay persona que haya conocido la señora Lozana, en Roma o fuera de Roma, que no vea claro ser sacado de sus actos y meneos y palabras; y asimismo porque yo he trabajado de no escrebir cosa</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En666Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En666Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En666Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>no hay persona que haya conocido la señora Lozana, en Roma o fuera de Roma, que no vea claro ser sacado de sus actos</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>no hay persona que haya conocido la señora Lozana, en Roma o fuera de Roma, que no [v|vea|ver|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] ser sacado de sus actos</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En666Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vea</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En666Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En667"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En667Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde305" /><gams:textualContent>un dicho que munchas veces leí, que, quidquid agunt homines, intentio salvat omnes.Donde se ve claro que vuestra intención es buscar la vida en diversas maneras, de tal modo que otro cría las gallinas y</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En667Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En667Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En667Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Donde se ve claro que vuestra intención es buscar la vida en diversas maneras</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Donde se [v|ve|ver|rs] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] que vuestra intención es buscar la vida en diversas maneras</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En667Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>ve</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En667Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En668"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En668Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde305" /><gams:textualContent>de pan nos hacen allá como acá.Coridón, esto podrás decir, que es cosa que se ve claro : Vittoria, vittoria, el emperador y rey de las Españas habrá gran gloria.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En668Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En668Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En668Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>que es cosa que se ve claro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>que es cosa que se [v|ve|ver|rs] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En668Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>ve</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En668Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En669"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En669Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde95" /><gams:textualContent>enfermo y que, estando a la muerte tan propinco,  ninguno de sus parientes y amigos le osava hablar claro , acordó él mismo hazerle un razonamiento, en el qual mostró muy bien lo mucho que él valía y</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En669Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En669Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En669Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En669Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> ninguno de sus parientes y amigos le osava hablar claro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|ninguno de sus parientes y amigos|ms] le osava [v|hablar|hablar|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En669Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>ninguno de sus parientes y amigos</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En669Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>hablar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En669Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En670"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En670Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde277" /><gams:textualContent>día dél, se començaron a descobrir las alturas y cabeças de los montes.Por do se vee claro ser falso que el año no tuviesse sino tres meses, pues nombra el seteno y el dezeno mes;</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En670Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En670Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En670Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Por do se vee claro ser falso que el año no tuviesse sino tres meses</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Por do se [v|vee|ver|rs] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] ser falso que el año no tuviesse sino tres meses</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En670Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vee</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En670Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En671"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En671Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde277" /><gams:textualContent>gastar y enfría y humedesce proporcionadamente y no opila ni avienta ni altera tanto.Y de aquí se vee claro que el agua de los pozos es menos buena que la otra, porque allí participa más de la tierra</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En671Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En671Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En671Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Y de aquí se vee claro que el agua de los pozos es menos buena que la otra</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Y de aquí se [v|vee|ver|rs] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] que el agua de los pozos es menos buena que la otra</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En671Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vee</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En671Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En672"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En672Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde277" /><gams:textualContent>que Octaviano imperó después, que fueron quinze años, y conformándolo con la hedad de Jesuchristo, se vee claro que forçosamente eran andados diez y ocho años de Tiberio quando padesció.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En672Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En672Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En672Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>se vee claro que forçosamente eran andados diez y ocho años de Tiberio quando padesció</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>se [v|vee|ver|rs] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] que forçosamente eran andados diez y ocho años de Tiberio quando padesció</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En672Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vee</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En672Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En673"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En673Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde100" /><gams:textualContent>Gallo No en verdad.Quiero que lo veas claro , y para esto quiero que sepas que no es otra cosa muerte sino apartamiento del ánima y cuerpo</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En673Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En673Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En673Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Quiero que lo veas claro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Quiero que lo [v|veas|ver|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En673Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>veas</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En673Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En674"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En674Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde100" /><gams:textualContent>ojo a sólo el interés, y que no tienes confiança ni respeto al señor;y aunque ves claro tu daño no te osas despedir, porque todos dirán que no tienes sosiego ni eres para sufrir y servir</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En674Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En674Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En674Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>aunque ves claro tu daño</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>aunque [v|ves|ver|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] tu daño</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En674Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>ves</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En674Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En675"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En675Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde101" /><gams:textualContent>y viene ventado con grandes aguaceros.Razón natural de lo susodicho no se sabe, mas de que vemos claro que de cuatro grados de la línea a la parte del sur hasta pasar del trópico de Capricornio</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En675Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En675Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En675Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>mas de que vemos claro que de cuatro grados de la línea a la parte del sur</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>mas de que [v|vemos|ver|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] que de cuatro grados de la línea a la parte del sur</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En675Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vemos</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En675Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En676"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En676Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde101" /><gams:textualContent>se pudiese decir que por aquello era más largo el camino que para él se hizo.Y esto vemos claro , porque yo he visto junto a Bilcas tres o cuatro caminos; y aun una vez me perdía por el</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En676Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En676Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En676Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Y esto vemos claro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Y esto [v|vemos|ver|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En676Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vemos</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En676Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En677"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En677Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde101" /><gams:textualContent>muy lejos grandes sierras blancas de la mucha nieve que tenían: esparcían los ojos por todas partes,  conocían  claro que la sierra prolongaba grande espacio de tierra y que por fuerza la habían de atravesar sin saber su anchura,</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En677Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En677Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En677Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> conocían  claro que la sierra prolongaba grande espacio de tierra</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|conocían|conocer|ts]  [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] que la sierra prolongaba grande espacio de tierra</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En677Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>conocían</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#conocer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En677Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En678"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En678Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde306" /><gams:textualContent>podría aprovechar para librarle del peligro y pasión que padescía, por amor de Dios lo hiciese, pues ellos veían clara la culpa del culpado y la verdad y bondad suya, pues a su petición y venganza el Señor</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En678Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En678Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En678Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En678Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>pues ellos veían clara la culpa del culpado</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>pues [s|ellos|mp] [v|veían|ver|ts] [a|clara|claro|afonmnnn] la culpa del culpado</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En678Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>ellos</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En678Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>veían</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En678Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>clara</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FeminineSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En679"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En679Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde107" /><gams:textualContent>apenas declinando, &lt;lb/&gt;alçó nueva bandera, &lt;lb/&gt;mostró bien claramente &lt;lb/&gt;de valor no vencible lo excelente.&lt;lb/&gt; Él pues relumbre claro &lt;lb/&gt;sobre sus claros padres;mas tú en tanto, &lt;lb/&gt;dechado de bien raro, &lt;lb/&gt;abraça el ocio santo: &lt;lb/&gt;</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En679Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En679Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En679Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En679Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Él pues relumbre claro &lt;lb\/&gt;sobre sus claros padres</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Él|ms] pues [v|relumbre|relumbrar|is] [a|claro|claro|ausnmnnn] &lt;lb\/&gt;sobre sus claros padres</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En679Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Él</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En679Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>relumbre</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#relumbrar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En679Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En680"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En680Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde307" /><gams:textualContent>y regaládose mi alma de ver su gran magnificencia y misericordia.Sea bendito por todo, que he visto claro no dejar sin pagarme, aún en esta vida, ningún deseo bueno.Por ruines y imperfectas que fuesen</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En680Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En680Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En680Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>que he visto claro no dejar sin pagarme</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>que [v|he visto|ver|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] no dejar sin pagarme</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En680Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>he visto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En680Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En681"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En681Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde307" /><gams:textualContent>espanto y tengo por gran merced del Señor la paciencia que Su Majestad me dio, que se vía claro venir de Él.Mucho me aprovechó para tenerla haver leído la historia de Job en los Morales de san</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En681Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En681Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En681Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>la paciencia que Su Majestad me dio, que se vía claro venir de Él</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>la paciencia que Su Majestad me dio, que se [v|vía|ver|rs] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] venir de Él</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En681Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vía</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En681Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En682"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En682Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde307" /><gams:textualContent>; y tomé por abogado y señor a el glorioso san Josef, y encomendáme mucho a él. Vi  claro que ansí de esta necesidad, como de otras mayores de honra y pérdida de alma, este padre y</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En682Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En682Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En682Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Vi  claro que ansí de esta necesidad</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|Vi|ver|ts]  [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] que ansí de esta necesidad</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En682Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>Vi</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En682Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En683"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En683Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde307" /><gams:textualContent>Con todo,  veo  claro la gran misericordia que el Señor hizo conmigo, ya que havía de tratar en el mundo, que tuviese ánimo</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En683Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En683Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En683Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> veo  claro la gran misericordia que el Señor hizo conmigo</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|veo|ver|ts]  [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] la gran misericordia que el Señor hizo conmigo</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En683Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>veo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En683Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En684"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En684Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde307" /><gams:textualContent>sustentar.Mas hase de comer con tasa, que después que un alma se ve ya rendida y entiende claro no tiene cosa buena de sí, y se ve avergonzada delante de tan gran Rey, y ve lo poco</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En684Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En684Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En684Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>después que un alma se ve ya rendida y entiende claro no tiene cosa buena de sí</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>después que un alma se ve ya rendida y [v|entiende|entender|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] no tiene cosa buena de sí</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En684Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>entiende</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#entender" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En684Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En685"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En685Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde307" /><gams:textualContent>en oración.Y ansí me parece es grandísima ventaja, cuando lo escrivo estar en ello; porque veo claro no soy yo quien lo dice, que ni lo ordeno con el entendimiento ni sé después cómo lo acerté</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En685Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En685Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En685Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>porque veo claro no soy yo quien lo dice</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>porque [v|veo|ver|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] no soy yo quien lo dice</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En685Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>veo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En685Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En686"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En686Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde307" /><gams:textualContent>en tantito si son bien dichas, pensará hace algo.La razón que aquí ha de haver es entender claro que no hay ninguna para que Dios nos haga tan gran merced, sino sola su bondad, y ver que</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En686Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En686Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En686Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>La razón que aquí ha de haver es entender claro que no hay</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>La razón que aquí ha de haver es [v|entender|entender|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] que no hay</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En686Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>entender</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#entender" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En686Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En687"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En687Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde307" /><gams:textualContent>Es muy gran cosa traer esto siempre delante, en especial en los principios; que después tanto se ve claro , que antes es menester olvidarlo para vivir, que procurarlo traer a la memoria lo poco que dura todo</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En687Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En687Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En687Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>después tanto se ve claro , que antes es menester olvidarlo para vivir</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>después tanto se [v|ve|ver|rs] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] , que antes es menester olvidarlo para vivir</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En687Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>ve</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En687Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En688"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En688Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde307" /><gams:textualContent>conocer.Bien ve que no es suyo, ni sabe cómo se le dio tanto bien, mas entiende claro el grandísimo provecho que cada rabto de éstos trai.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En688Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En688Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En688Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>mas entiende claro el grandísimo provecho</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>mas [v|entiende|entender|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] el grandísimo provecho</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En688Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>entiende</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#entender" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En688Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En689"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En689Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde307" /><gams:textualContent>deleita.Muy, muy muchas veces lo he visto por espiriencia.Hámelo dicho el Señor. He visto  claro que por esta puerta hemos de entrar si queremos nos muestre la soberana Majestad grandes secretos.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En689Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En689Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En689Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> He visto  claro que por esta puerta hemos de entrar</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|He visto|ver|ts]  [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] que por esta puerta hemos de entrar</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En689Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>He visto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En689Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En690"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En690Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde307" /><gams:textualContent>hablar no puede;y si habla, es de suerte que ve que no le entienden, u como quien habla claro y despierto a quien ve que de buena gana le está oyendo.Lo uno se pide, digamos ahora, como</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En690Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En690Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En690Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En690Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En690Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text>como quien habla claro y despierto a quien ve que de buena gana le está oyendo</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>como [s|quien|ms] [v|habla|hablar|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnC] y [a|despierto|despierto|auvnmnnC] a quien ve que de buena gana le está oyendo</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En690Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>quien</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En690Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>habla</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En690Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En690Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>despierto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#despierto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">4</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En691"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En691Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde308" /><gams:textualContent>cosas malas, que se llaman diablos.Y para que vuestra merced lo conozca y todos sus papas lo vean claro , hacedme una merced, que hayáis por bien que en lo alto desta torre pongamos una cruz, y</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En691Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En691Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En691Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En691Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>para que vuestra merced lo conozca y todos sus papas lo vean claro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>para que vuestra merced lo conozca y [s|todos sus papas|mp] lo [v|vean|ver|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En691Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>todos sus papas</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En691Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vean</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En691Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En692"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En692Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde309" /><gams:textualContent>GUZMÁN.Harto me holgara de oíros esta materia, siquiera por ver claros algunos repelones de los que sacan estas cortesías a luz, y de sus secretarios, que las escriben, </gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En692Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En692Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En692Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>por ver claros algunos repelones de los que sacan estas cortesías a luz</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>por [v|ver|ver|ts] [a|claros|claro|aponmnnn] algunos repelones de los que sacan estas cortesías a luz</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En692Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>ver</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En692Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claros</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#MasculinePlural" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En693"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En693Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde102" /><gams:textualContent>justicia, &lt;lb/&gt; sino según la gravedad del caso &lt;lb/&gt; y la importancia y fin de la malicia; &lt;lb/&gt; pues vemos claro en el presente paso &lt;lb/&gt; que al cabo, corrompida de avaricia, &lt;lb/&gt; dio a la maldad lugar que se</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En693Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En693Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En693Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>pues vemos claro en el presente paso &lt;lb\/&gt; que al cabo</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>pues [v|vemos|ver|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] en el presente paso &lt;lb\/&gt; que al cabo</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En693Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vemos</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En693Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En694"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En694Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde143" /><gams:textualContent>11. Con esto se juntaron todas las dificultades que podían poner los que mucho lo habían murmurado, y entendí claro que tenían razón.Parecíame imposible ir adelante con lo que había comenzado; porque así como antes todo me</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En694Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En694Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En694Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>y entendí claro que tenían razón</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>y [v|entendí|entender|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] que tenían razón</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En694Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>entendí</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#entender" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En694Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En695"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En695Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde143" /><gams:textualContent>la obediencia, pone tantos disgustos y dificultades debajo de color de bien.Y esto se note bien y  verán  claro que digo verdad.En lo que está la suma perfección claro está que no es en regalos interiores ni</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En695Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En695Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En695Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> verán  claro que digo verdad</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|verán|ver|ts]  [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] que digo verdad</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En695Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>verán</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En695Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En696"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En696Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde143" /><gams:textualContent>determiné concertar lo que estaba comenzado de darles la capilla, y nunca me ha pesado, porque  hemos visto  claro el mal remedio que tuviéramos para comprar casa;porque con su ayuda compramos en la que ahora están,</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En696Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En696Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En696Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> hemos visto  claro el mal remedio</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|hemos visto|ver|ts]  [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] el mal remedio</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En696Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>hemos visto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En696Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En697"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En697Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde143" /><gams:textualContent>que se acabara el consuelo grande que tenía en aquel lugar; mas no duró más.Y  ella  entendió claro que era aquel santo San Andrés, sin decírselo nadie, y también que era la voluntad de Nuestro Señor que</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En697Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En697Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En697Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En697Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> ella  entendió claro que era aquel santo San Andrés</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|ella|fs]  [v|entendió|entender|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] que era aquel santo San Andrés</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En697Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>ella</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En697Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>entendió</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#entender" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En697Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En698"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En698Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde143" /><gams:textualContent>, que en ninguna manera las quisiera, y a las que iban con nosotras.Después se ha visto claro que el demonio hizo mucho de su parte, porque le pesaba de que fuésemos allí.Los dos canónigos que andaban</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En698Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En698Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En698Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Después se ha visto claro que el demonio hizo mucho de su parte</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Después se [v|ha visto|ver|rs] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] que el demonio hizo mucho de su parte</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En698Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>ha visto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En698Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En699"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En699Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde310" /><gams:textualContent>alma por vía de paso, es darla claramente a entender y sentir tan altamente de Dios, que entienda claro que no se puede entender ni sentir del todo.Porque es, en alguna manera, al modo de</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En699Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En699Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En699Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>que entienda claro que no se puede entender ni sentir del todo</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>que [v|entienda|entender|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] que no se puede entender ni sentir del todo</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En699Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>entienda</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#entender" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En699Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En700"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En700Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde310" /><gams:textualContent>o sentir alteça de Dios y grandeça.Y en aquel sentir siente tan alto de Dios, que  entiende  claro se queda todo por entender; y aquel entender y sentir ser tan inmensa la Diuinidad, que no se</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En700Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En700Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En700Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> entiende  claro se queda todo por entender</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|entiende|entender|ts]  [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] se queda todo por entender</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En700Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>entiende</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#entender" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En700Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En701"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En701Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde310" /><gams:textualContent>merced de estar Dios en el alma comunicándole su sabiduría y confortándola con esta bebida de amor para que lo uea claro , según da a entender Salomón, diciendo: Esta es la visión que vio y habló el varón con</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En701Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En701Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En701Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>para que lo uea claro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>para que lo [v|uea|ver|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En701Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>uea</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En701Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En702"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En702Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde310" /><gams:textualContent>8. De lo dicho queda entendido claro que el alma que á llegado a este estado de desposorio espiritual no sabe otra cosa sino amar y andar</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En702Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En702Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En702Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>De lo dicho queda entendido claro que el alma que á llegado a este estado de desposorio espiritual no sabe otra cosa</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>De lo dicho queda [v|entendido|entender|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] que el alma que á llegado a este estado de desposorio espiritual no sabe otra cosa</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En702Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>entendido</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#entender" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En702Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En703"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En703Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde311" /><gams:textualContent>aún no la has conocido? &lt;lb/&gt; ¡Espántome que tanto se detenga &lt;lb/&gt; en ti una pertinacia tan molesta, &lt;lb/&gt;  sabiendo  claro que tan poco presta! &lt;lb/&gt;</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En703Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En703Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En703Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> sabiendo  claro que tan poco presta</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|sabiendo|saber|ts]  [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] que tan poco presta</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En703Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sabiendo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#saber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En703Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En704"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En704Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde311" /><gams:textualContent>Leucino.¿Qué tengo que llorar?¡Calla, cobarde, &lt;lb/&gt; que hoy te haré que veas claro y sientas &lt;lb/&gt; quién soy!</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En704Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En704Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En704Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>hoy te haré que veas claro y sientas &lt;lb\/&gt; quién soy</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>hoy te haré que [v|veas|ver|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] y sientas &lt;lb\/&gt; quién soy</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En704Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>veas</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En704Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En705"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En705Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde313" /><gams:textualContent>Servirá también esta doctrina para esforzar nuestra confianza.Porque considerando  el hombre cuán perfectamente aquella infinita Bondad provee de lo necesario a todos los animales brutos, por pequeños que sean (como es la hormiga, el mosquito, la araña, y otros semejantes) verá claro cuánta razón tiene para fiar de Dios, que no faltará á la más noble de sus criaturas (para cuyo servicio crió todo este mundo inferior) en lo que fuere necesario para la provisión de su cuerpo y santificación de su ánima.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En705Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En705Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En705Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En705Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> el hombre cuán perfectamente aquella infinita Bondad provee de lo necesario a todos los animales brutos, por pequeños que sean (como es la hormiga, el mosquito, la araña, y otros semejantes) verá claro cuánta razón tiene para fiar de Dios</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|el hombre|ms] cuán perfectamente aquella infinita Bondad provee de lo necesario a todos los animales brutos, por pequeños que sean (como es la hormiga, el mosquito, la araña, y otros semejantes) [v|verá|ver|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] cuánta razón tiene para fiar de Dios</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En705Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>el hombre</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En705Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>verá</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En705Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En706"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En706Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde312" /><gams:textualContent>en los hijos, y así volvió por los mismos pasos á traerlos á su primer lugar.En lo cual se ve claro cuán perfecta sea aquella divina Providencia en todas las cosas, pues tanta fuerza de amor puso en los padres</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En706Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En706Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En706Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>En lo cual se ve claro cuán perfecta sea aquella divina Providencia</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>En lo cual se [v|ve|ver|rs] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] cuán perfecta sea aquella divina Providencia</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En706Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>ve</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En706Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En707"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En707Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde313" /><gams:textualContent>Mas así en esto como en todo lo demás que aquí se trata, conviene repetir aquella sentencia del Apóstol: “¿Por ventura tiene Dios cuidado de los bueyes y de las golondrinas?”.Claro está que todo esto es querer El darse a conocer a los hombres, para ser adorado y reverenciado dellos.Porque  quien tuviere ojos para notar así la fábrica de los cuerpos de todos los animales como las habilidades que tienen para su conservación, verá claro que todas ellas predican su sabiduría, y que cuantas son las criaturas, tantos son los testigos de su gloria.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En707Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En707Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En707Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En707Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> quien tuviere ojos para notar así la fábrica de los cuerpos de todos los animales como las habilidades que tienen para su conservación, verá claro que todas ellas predican su sabiduría</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|quien tuviere ojos|ms] para notar así la fábrica de los cuerpos de todos los animales como las habilidades que tienen para su conservación, [v|verá|ver|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] que todas ellas predican su sabiduría</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En707Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>quien tuviere ojos</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En707Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>verá</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En707Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En708"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En708Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde312" /><gams:textualContent>los espíritus que causan el movimiento, y otros los que dan el sentido.La cual diferencia se ve claro en algunos paralíticos, que por tener entupidos los niervos que son causa del movimiento, no pueden mover</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En708Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En708Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En708Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>La cual diferencia se ve claro en algunos paralíticos</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>La cual diferencia se [v|ve|ver|rs] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] en algunos paralíticos</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En708Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>ve</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En708Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En709"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En709Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde278" /><gams:textualContent>Y porque se viesse claro que este fructo que se llama trigo no es trigo, y que aquesta abundancia no es buena disposición de</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En709Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En709Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En709Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>porque se viesse claro que este fructo que se llama trigo no es trigo</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>porque se [v|viesse|ver|rs] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] que este fructo que se llama trigo no es trigo</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En709Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>viesse</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En709Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En710"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En710Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde314" /><gams:textualContent>le daban también el tercero —le dije yo—; mas hablando la verdad, entended que todos conocían claro que la corona y el ojo de toda la festividad era vuestra hija.Gran contento tomaba desto Caricles</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En710Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En710Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En710Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En710Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>entended que todos conocían claro que la corona y el ojo de toda la festividad era vuestra hija</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>entended que [s|todos|mp] [v|conocían|conocer|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] que la corona y el ojo de toda la festividad era vuestra hija</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En710Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>todos</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En710Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>conocían</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#conocer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En710Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En711"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En711Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde103" /><gams:textualContent>porque a los viejos, como les falta la fuerza de la vista, paréceles que ni el sol alumbra claro para ellos, como solía, ni la luna da luz, ni las estrellas resplandor.Dice que vuelven</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En711Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En711Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En711Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En711Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>paréceles que ni el sol alumbra claro para ellos,</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>paréceles que [s|ni el sol|ms] [v|alumbra|alumbrar|is] [a|claro|claro|ausnmnnn] para ellos,</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En711Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>ni el sol</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En711Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>alumbra</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#alumbrar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En711Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En712"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En712Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde315" /><gams:textualContent>pretende ser galateo y bien quisto, a jugar con cobdicia de ganar, especialmente naipes, pues se vee claro que quien consume su tiempo y hazienda en esto, no le queda lugar para usar de la cortesía,</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En712Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En712Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En712Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>pues se vee claro que quien consume su tiempo y hazienda en esto, no le queda lugar para usar de la cortesía</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>pues se [v|vee|ver|rs] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] que quien consume su tiempo y hazienda en esto, no le queda lugar para usar de la cortesía</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En712Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vee</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En712Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En713"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En713Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde315" /><gams:textualContent>Sentencia de hombre sabio, y que no se preciava de lisonjas ni adulaciones.Porque el lisonjero muestra claro que el que se paga de sus lisonjas, sea vano y arrogante, simple y de poco ingenio,</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En713Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En713Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En713Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En713Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Porque el lisonjero muestra claro que el que se paga de sus lisonjas</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Porque [s|el lisonjero|ms] [v|muestra|mostrar|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] que el que se paga de sus lisonjas</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En713Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>el lisonjero</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En713Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>muestra</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mostrar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En713Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En714"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En714Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde315" /><gams:textualContent>en esto, y es que el que moteja no sea muy confiado de sí mismo.Porque se vee claro , que quando el mote es bueno y agradable, se le pagan luego de contado, solemnizándole con la risa</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En714Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En714Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En714Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Porque se vee claro , que quando el mote es bueno y agradable, se le pagan luego de contado</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Porque se [v|vee|ver|rs] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] , que quando el mote es bueno y agradable, se le pagan luego de contado</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En714Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vee</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En714Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En715"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En715Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde144" /><gams:textualContent>Fadrique respondió:  Véyslo  claro por vn exemplo: viene el apetito y echa contra el hombre la pasión y afecto, dicho amor lasciuo</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En715Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En715Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En715Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Véyslo  claro por vn exemplo</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|Véyslo|ver|ts]  [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] por vn exemplo</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En715Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>Véyslo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En715Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En716"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En716Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde144" /><gams:textualContent>por ellos;y no todos los niños vsan los mismos, sino diferentes;de lo qual se vee claro la opinión de Fadrique: que, según el concepto diferente, haría diferentes vocablos el de Leuante que el</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En716Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En716Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En716Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>de lo qual se vee claro la opinión de Fadrique</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>de lo qual se [v|vee|ver|rs] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] la opinión de Fadrique</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En716Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vee</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En716Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En717"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En717Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde144" /><gams:textualContent>y esto lo suele hazer por guardar el indiuiduo, como dizen los italianos;que si el Petrarca hablara claro en aquella canción que dezís, y Mingo Rebulgo en su égloga, pudiera ser que no le conseruaran,</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En717Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En717Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En717Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En717Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>si el Petrarca hablara claro en aquella canción que dezís</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>si [s|el Petrarca|ms] [v|hablara|hablar|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] en aquella canción que dezís</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En717Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>el Petrarca</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En717Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>hablara</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En717Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En718"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En718Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde144" /><gams:textualContent>dixo: Vos, señor Vgo, auéys dudado muy bien por cierto, pero, si yo os mostrasse claro que el exámetro se puede reduzir al castellano y italiano, ¿quedaréys contento?</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En718Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En718Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En718Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En718Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>si yo os mostrasse claro que el exámetro se puede reduzir al castellano y italiano</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>si [s|yo|ms] os [v|mostrasse|mostrar|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] que el exámetro se puede reduzir al castellano y italiano</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En718Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>yo</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En718Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>mostrasse</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mostrar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En718Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En719"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En719Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde9" /><gams:textualContent>¿Tienes nuevas de tu alma?&lt;lb/&gt; ¿Sabes de tu vida propria?&lt;lb/&gt; ¿Qué dices? Responde  claro : &lt;lb/&gt; no tengas vergüenza agora.&lt;lb/&gt; Dirás que la medicina &lt;lb/&gt; viene a tal dolencia corta;&lt;lb/&gt; que son peores que &lt;lb/&gt; </gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En719Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En719Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En719Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Responde  claro : &lt;lb\/&gt; no tengas vergüenza agora</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|Responde|responder|is]  [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] : &lt;lb\/&gt; no tengas vergüenza agora</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En719Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>Responde</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#responder" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En719Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En720"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En720Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde145" /><gams:textualContent>Porque o él me lo daba o en su presencia yo me lo tomaba en buen donaire.Y hablando claro , yo era su gracioso, aunque otros me llamaban truhán chocarrero.* Cuando teníamos convidados, que nunca</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En720Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En720Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En720Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Y hablando claro , yo era su gracioso</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Y [v|hablando|hablar|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] , yo era su gracioso</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En720Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>hablando</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En720Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En721"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En721Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde145" /><gams:textualContent>ello.Dime tan buena maña que, aunque había mucho, ya se vía la falta, y conocióse claro por una zamboa * castellana que, como fuese muy grande y estuviese toda dorada, me incliné a ella</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En721Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En721Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En721Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>y conocióse claro por una zamboa * castellana</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>y [v|conocióse|conocer|rs] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] por una zamboa * castellana</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En721Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>conocióse</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#conocer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En721Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En722"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En722Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde316" /><gams:textualContent>Longinos hiere a Dios tres vezes ciego, &lt;lb/&gt; ciego del cuerpo, como se ve claro , &lt;lb/&gt; ciego del alma, sin buscar reparo, &lt;lb/&gt; y ciego de la colera, y su fuego.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En722Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En722Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En722Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>ciego del cuerpo, como se ve claro ,</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>ciego del cuerpo, como se [v|ve|ver|rs] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] ,</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En722Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>ve</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En722Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En723"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En723Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde316" /><gams:textualContent>Huyd temor que han venido &lt;lb/&gt; fortaleza, y dessengaño, &lt;lb/&gt; y estos dos Inquisidores, &lt;lb/&gt; son amigos que hable claro .&lt;lb/&gt; O terribles agravios &lt;lb/&gt; matanme el alma, &lt;lb/&gt; y cierranme los labios?&lt;lb/&gt;</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En723Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En723Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En723Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>estos dos Inquisidores, &lt;lb\/&gt; son amigos que hable claro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>estos dos Inquisidores, &lt;lb\/&gt; son amigos que [v|hable|hablar|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En723Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>hable</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En723Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En724"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En724Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde316" /><gams:textualContent>paje con vna hacha &lt;lb/&gt; haze que os vaya alumbrando.&lt;lb/&gt; &lt;lb/&gt; Es noche oscura este mundo, &lt;lb/&gt; donde nada se ve claro , &lt;lb/&gt; que vapores de la culpa &lt;lb/&gt; han todo el cielo añublado.&lt;lb/&gt; Es la calle desta vida, &lt;lb/&gt; por</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En724Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En724Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En724Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>donde nada se ve claro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>donde nada se [v|ve|ver|rs] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En724Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>ve</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En724Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En725"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En725Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde316" /><gams:textualContent>carneros, y de ouejas, &lt;lb/&gt; por Ventura vuestro amo.&lt;lb/&gt; La misma pobrera soys, &lt;lb/&gt; mas amalda, pues veys claro , &lt;lb/&gt; que ay ventura en la pobreza, &lt;lb/&gt; y dulçura en los trabajos.&lt;lb/&gt;</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En725Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En725Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En725Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>pues veys claro , &lt;lb\/&gt; que ay ventura en la pobreza</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>pues [v|veys|ver|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] , &lt;lb\/&gt; que ay ventura en la pobreza</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En725Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>veys</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En725Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En726"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En726Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde317" /><gams:textualContent>ninguna: sossegaua mal su pecho, y bulliale dentro mas generosa empresa.Estaua lleno de disgusto,  viendo  clara la vanidad que tiene todo lo del mundo, aun dentro de lo mas precioso.Los ratos que se</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En726Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En726Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En726Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> viendo  clara la vanidad que tiene todo lo del mundo</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|viendo|ver|ts]  [a|clara|claro|afonmnnn] la vanidad que tiene todo lo del mundo</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En726Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>viendo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En726Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>clara</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FeminineSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En727"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En727Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde317" /><gams:textualContent>buen vezino, y ansi gozan de todos los priuilegios de aquella ciudad tan ilustre, de donde se vee claro el amor, y el respecto que tuuieron a aquellos primeros fundadores.De otras casas hijas desta, </gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En727Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En727Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En727Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>de donde se vee claro el amor</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>de donde se [v|vee|ver|rs] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] el amor</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En727Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vee</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En727Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En728"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En728Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde317" /><gams:textualContent>dezirlo ansi) vno motiuo del espiritu de Dios, para que despertassen este celestial estatuto, donde se descubre claro lo que voy muchas vezes aduirtiendo, que no fue traça, ni ingenio de hombres, y que se</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En728Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En728Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En728Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>este celestial estatuto, donde se descubre claro lo que voy muchas vezes aduirtiendo</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>este celestial estatuto, donde se [v|descubre|descubrir|rs] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] lo que voy muchas vezes aduirtiendo</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En728Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>descubre</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#descubrir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En728Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En729"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En729Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde317" /><gams:textualContent>y no dize, que fueron pedidos, ni embiados a llamar por otra alguna razon; donde se vee claro , que salian como desterrados los vnos, y los otros se yuan tras ellos de su voluntad.Y</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En729Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En729Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En729Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>donde se vee claro , que salian como desterrados los vnos</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>donde se [v|vee|ver|rs] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] , que salian como desterrados los vnos</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En729Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vee</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En729Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En730"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En730Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde317" /><gams:textualContent>: sin dezir nada a nadie determinò estar la siguiente noche sobre auiso: vio lo mismo, y entendio claro , que tan admirable luz significaua alguna grande cosa.De la misma forma la vio otras muchas noches continuas</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En730Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En730Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En730Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>y entendio claro , que tan admirable luz significaua alguna grande cosa</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>y [v|entendio|entender|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] , que tan admirable luz significaua alguna grande cosa</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En730Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>entendio</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#entender" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En730Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En731"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En731Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde317" /><gams:textualContent>8 En tanto grado, y a tanta miseria dite, que le auia traydo esta enfermedad, que vio claro en este espejo, que estaua peor que si estuuiera muerto en el cuerpo.En conociendo esto de si</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En731Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En731Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En731Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>que vio claro en este espejo</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>que [v|vio|ver|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] en este espejo</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En731Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vio</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En731Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En732"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En732Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde317" /><gams:textualContent>Enderezado tambien contra la ignorancia de algunos fíeles que vinieron de los Gentiles a nuestra fe, para mostrarles claro , que hemos de ser nosotros, y los que vinieron de los Iudios, a entrar en la yglesia</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En732Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En732Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En732Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>para mostrarles claro , que hemos de ser nosotros</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>para [v|mostrarles|mostrar|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] , que hemos de ser nosotros</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En732Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>mostrarles</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mostrar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En732Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En733"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En733Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde317" /><gams:textualContent>donada, sin licencia del General: y esta no la diesse sin gran informacion, y se viesse clara la virtud, y el aprouechamiento, pues con estas condiciones bien miradas, se recibirian pocas, ni ay</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En733Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En733Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En733Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>se viesse clara la virtud</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>se [v|viesse|ver|rs] [a|clara|claro|afonmnnn] la virtud</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En733Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>viesse</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En733Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>clara</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FeminineSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En734"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En734Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde317" /><gams:textualContent>esta alli, buscanle en los demas, y en todo el pueblo, ni hasta oy parecio. Entendiose  claro de donde venia la cobrança, pagaron la prouision, y hizieron gracias a la Reyna del cielo,</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En734Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En734Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En734Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Entendiose  claro de donde venia la cobrança</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|Entendiose|entender|rs]  [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] de donde venia la cobrança</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En734Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>Entendiose</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#entender" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En734Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En735"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En735Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde317" /><gams:textualContent>encubrirlo a los que estauan presentes, porque el gozo y la ternura fue tanta, que se le vio claro en el rostro, y lo dixo de palabra, con tan buena compañia despidio el alma.Ansi alcança la</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En735Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En735Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En735Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>el gozo y la ternura fue tanta, que se le vio claro en el rostro</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>el gozo y la ternura fue tanta, que se le [v|vio|ver|rs] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] en el rostro</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En735Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vio</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En735Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En736"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En736Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde317" /><gams:textualContent>estas cosas, como embelesado, y despertando como de vn sueño, cayo en la cuenta, y vio claro el engaño del enemigo, començò a derramar lagrymas, entendiendo que aquello todo lo auia permitido Dios por</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En736Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En736Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En736Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>y vio claro el engaño del enemigo</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>y [v|vio|ver|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] el engaño del enemigo</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En736Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vio</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En736Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En737"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En737Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde317" /><gams:textualContent>entonces les parecio que deuia de hablar a tiento, o no la entendian, despues se desengañaron, y vieron claro que el Señor les auisaua por la boca de su sierua.Acabado esto pidio la extrema vncion, recibiola</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En737Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En737Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En737Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>y vieron claro que el Señor les auisaua por la boca de su sierua</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>y [v|vieron|ver|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] que el Señor les auisaua por la boca de su sierua</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En737Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vieron</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En737Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En738"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En738Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde109" /><gams:textualContent>desvelo, &lt;lb/&gt; ver mi segura sangre entretenida, &lt;lb/&gt; dando rojo matiz al suelo avaro;&lt;lb/&gt;  claras sospechas lo mostraban claro .&lt;lb/&gt; &lt;lb/&gt; Bañando el suelo con humilde lloro &lt;lb/&gt; la que el ser me prestó y aliento humano &lt;lb/&gt; “No imites —</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En738Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En738Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En738Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En738Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> claras sospechas lo mostraban claro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|claras sospechas|fp] lo [v|mostraban|mostrar|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En738Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>claras sospechas</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En738Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>mostraban</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mostrar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En738Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En739"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En739Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde109" /><gams:textualContent>ella, turbada, &lt;lb/&gt; del bello rostro la color desvía, &lt;lb/&gt; los dos se yelan; Marcelina luego &lt;lb/&gt; conoce  claro , de su yelo el fuego.&lt;lb/&gt; &lt;lb/&gt; Auséntase Bermudo más turbado &lt;lb/&gt; que si viera las sombras de la muerte;&lt;lb/&gt;</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En739Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En739Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En739Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En739Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Marcelina luego &lt;lb\/&gt; conoce  claro , de su yelo el fuego</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Marcelina|fs] luego &lt;lb\/&gt; [v|conoce|conocer|ts]  [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] , de su yelo el fuego</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En739Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Marcelina</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En739Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>conoce</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#conocer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En739Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En740"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En740Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde318" /><gams:textualContent>, con trabajo continuo de diez y ocho años, si ya ha sacado otras obras que también por ellas se conoce claro la fuerza del natural, adornado y vestido con las luces y matices del arte, mezcla difícil</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En740Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En740Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En740Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>por ellas se conoce claro la fuerza del natural, adornado y vestido con las luces y matices del arte</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>por ellas se [v|conoce|conocer|rs] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] la fuerza del natural, adornado y vestido con las luces y matices del arte</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En740Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>conoce</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#conocer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En740Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En741"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En741Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde320" /><gams:textualContent>SONETO VI &lt;lb/&gt; Al sepulcro de Amor, que contra el filo &lt;lb/&gt; del tiempo hizo Artemisa vivir claro , &lt;lb/&gt; a la Torre bellísima de Faro, &lt;lb/&gt; un tiempo de las naves luz y asilo;&lt;lb/&gt; &lt;lb/&gt; al templo efesio, de famoso estilo, &lt;lb/&gt; al coloso del sol, único y raro, &lt;lb/&gt; al muro, de Semíramis reparo, &lt;lb/&gt; y a las altas pirámides del Nilo;&lt;lb/&gt; &lt;lb/&gt; en fin, a los milagros inauditos, &lt;lb/&gt; a Júpiter olímpico y al templo, &lt;lb/&gt; pirámides, coloso y mauseolo, &lt;lb/&gt; &lt;lb/&gt; y a cuantos oy el mundo tiene escritos, &lt;lb/&gt; en fama vence de mi fe el exemplo: &lt;lb/&gt; que es mayor maravilla mi amor solo.&lt;lb/&gt; </gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En741Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En741Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En741Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En741Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Al sepulcro de Amor, que contra el filo &lt;lb\/&gt; del tiempo hizo Artemisa vivir claro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Al sepulcro de Amor, que contra el filo &lt;lb\/&gt; del tiempo hizo [s|Artemisa|fs] [v|vivir|vivir|is] [a|claro|claro|auOnunnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En741Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Artemisa</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En741Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vivir</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vivir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En741Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Other" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Other" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En742"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En742Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde321" /><gams:textualContent>hacer pelo, &lt;lb/&gt; antes que reducirlo a breve suma.&lt;lb/&gt; Pensar, divino Rojas, alabaros, &lt;lb/&gt; bien se vee claro que mi lengua yerra, &lt;lb/&gt; que engrandeceros ella es humillaros.&lt;lb/&gt;</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En742Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En742Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En742Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>bien se vee claro que mi lengua yerra</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>bien se [v|vee|ver|rs] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] que mi lengua yerra</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En742Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vee</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En742Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En743"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En743Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde104" /><gams:textualContent>Ram.Ahora, señores, hablemos claro : ¿qué trae Ríos?</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En743Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En743Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En743Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Ahora, señores, hablemos claro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Ahora, señores, [v|hablemos|hablar|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En743Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>hablemos</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En743Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En744"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En744Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde104" /><gams:textualContent>Ram.Es sin duda cierto todo lo que della os han dicho, pues vemos claro que en obra, aparencias, ventanaje y campanas, es la mejor del suelo.Sin esto, </gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En744Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En744Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En744Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>pues vemos claro que en obra, aparencias, ventanaje y campanas, es la mejor del suelo</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>pues [v|vemos|ver|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] que en obra, aparencias, ventanaje y campanas, es la mejor del suelo</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En744Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vemos</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En744Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En745"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En745Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde104" /><gams:textualContent>querer y al adorar &lt;lb/&gt; fue la respuesta el reír.&lt;lb/&gt; Y ansí callando, otorgó, &lt;lb/&gt; como se ve claro aquí: &lt;lb/&gt; al interés dijo sí &lt;lb/&gt; y al amor dijo que no.&lt;lb/&gt; ¿Quiere saber más?&lt;lb/&gt;</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En745Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En745Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En745Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>como se ve claro aquí</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>como se [v|ve|ver|rs] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] aquí</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En745Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>ve</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En745Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En746"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En746Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde104" /><gams:textualContent>tiempo las naciones &lt;lb/&gt; y en éste que agora estamos, &lt;lb/&gt; se han sujetado a mil reyes, &lt;lb/&gt; como agora veréis claro ;&lt;lb/&gt; si fue rey de los asirios &lt;lb/&gt; un Nino, tan justo y sabio, &lt;lb/&gt; Licurgo lacedemones, &lt;lb/&gt; Ptolomeo de</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En746Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En746Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En746Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>como agora veréis claro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>como agora [v|veréis|ver|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En746Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>veréis</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En746Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En747"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En747Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde104" /><gams:textualContent>quién eres, &lt;lb/&gt; si por ventura me vieres &lt;lb/&gt; de aquí a un mes o de aquí a un año, &lt;lb/&gt;  verás  claro el desengaño &lt;lb/&gt; y me dirás que acerté, &lt;lb/&gt; yo en guardarte amor y fe &lt;lb/&gt; y tú en conocer tu engaño &lt;lb/&gt;</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En747Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En747Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En747Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> verás  claro el desengaño</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|verás|ver|ts]  [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] el desengaño</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En747Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>verás</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En747Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En748"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En748Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde104" /><gams:textualContent>en él un privilegio &lt;lb/&gt; en que se aventaja a todos &lt;lb/&gt; los demás que conocemos.&lt;lb/&gt; Ya es cierto y sabemos claro &lt;lb/&gt; que el asno, después de muerto, &lt;lb/&gt; cría siempre escarabajos, &lt;lb/&gt; como cada día lo vemos;&lt;lb/&gt; el caballo</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En748Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En748Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En748Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Ya es cierto y sabemos claro &lt;lb\/&gt; que el asno, después de muerto, &lt;lb\/&gt; cría siempre escarabajos</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Ya es cierto y [v|sabemos|saber|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] &lt;lb\/&gt; que el asno, después de muerto, &lt;lb\/&gt; cría siempre escarabajos</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En748Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sabemos</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#saber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En748Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En749"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En749Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde322" /><gams:textualContent>circunstancias que mucho agravan la culpa es cuando se da muerte al prójimo para llevarle su hacienda. Véese  claro en la amenaza que el profeta Elías hizo al rey Acab, por mandado de Dios, diciéndole : </gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En749Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En749Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En749Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Véese  claro en la amenaza que el profeta Elías hizo al rey Acab</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|Véese|ver|rs]  [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] en la amenaza que el profeta Elías hizo al rey Acab</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En749Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>Véese</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En749Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En750"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En750Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde323" /><gams:textualContent>redondez de las boticas que tenga enemistad ni fuerzas para destruir ni desasosegar las finas bubas.Por donde consta claro que no es enfermedad, aunque se lo llaman muchos por no las conocer; porque si consideramos que este</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En750Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En750Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En750Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Por donde consta claro que no es enfermedad</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Por donde [v|consta|constar|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] que no es enfermedad</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En750Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>consta</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#constar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En750Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En751"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En751Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde324" /><gams:textualContent>que las semillas desenvolvió y escura &lt;lb/&gt; confusión desató [...], por la otra parte &lt;lb/&gt; del hueco el fuego resplandece claro , &lt;lb/&gt; y sin peso escogió del alto alcázar &lt;lb/&gt; sumo lugar.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En751Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En751Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En751Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En751Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>por la otra parte &lt;lb\/&gt; del hueco el fuego resplandece claro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>por la otra parte &lt;lb\/&gt; del hueco [s|el fuego|ms] [v|resplandece|resplandecer|is] [a|claro|claro|ausnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En751Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>el fuego</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En751Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>resplandece</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#resplandecer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En751Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En752"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En752Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde148" /><gams:textualContent>cuando Pizarro y Almagro armaron para ir allá”.Etc.Hasta aquí es de Gómara, de donde consta claro que la imposición del nombre Perú fue mucho antes que la ida de los conquistadores que ganaron aquel Imperio</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En752Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En752Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En752Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>donde consta claro que la imposición del nombre Perú fue mucho antes que la ida de los conquistadores que ganaron aquel Imperio</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>donde [v|consta|constar|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] que la imposición del nombre Perú fue mucho antes que la ida de los conquistadores que ganaron aquel Imperio</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En752Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>consta</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#constar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En752Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En753"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En753Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde148" /><gams:textualContent>a sus huacas; y que Pachacámac lo había criado todo lo que allí había, etc.De donde consta claro que aquellos indios le tenían por hacedor de todas las cosas</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En753Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En753Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En753Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>De donde consta claro que aquellos indios le tenían por hacedor de todas las cosas</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>De donde [v|consta|constar|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] que aquellos indios le tenían por hacedor de todas las cosas</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En753Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>consta</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#constar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En753Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En754"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En754Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde148" /><gams:textualContent>con el cuerpo, que es darle ser, vida, aumento y sustento, etc.Por lo cual consta claro la impropiedad de los nombres nuevamente compuestos para dárselos a Dios (si han de hablar en la propia significación</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En754Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En754Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En754Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Por lo cual consta claro la impropiedad de los nombres nuevamente compuestos para dárselos a Dios</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Por lo cual [v|consta|constar|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] la impropiedad de los nombres nuevamente compuestos para dárselos a Dios</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En754Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>consta</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#constar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En754Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En755"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En755Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde148" /><gams:textualContent>aborreció para siempre, acordándose de los muchos trabajos y necesidades en que cada día le ponía.Donde se ve claro cuánto ayuda la ociosidad al vicio y cuán de provecho sea la ocupación a la virtud.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En755Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En755Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En755Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Donde se ve claro cuánto ayuda la ociosidad al vicio y cuán de provecho sea la ocupación a la virtud.</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Donde se [v|ve|ver|rs] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] cuánto ayuda la ociosidad al vicio y cuán de provecho sea la ocupación a la virtud.</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En755Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>ve</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En755Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En756"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En756Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde148" /><gams:textualContent>Quedaba entre ella y el templo del Sol otra isla grandísima de casas y una plaza grande que hay delante del templo.De donde se ve claro la falta de relación verdadera que tuvieron los historiadores que dicen que las vírgenes estaban en el templo del Sol, y que eran sacerdotisas y que ayudaban a los sacerdotes en los sacrificios, habiendo tanta distancia de la una casa a la otra y siendo la principal intención de aquellos Reyes Incas que en ésta de las monjas no entrasen hombres ni en la del Sol mujeres.Llamábase casa de escogidas porque las escogían o por linaje o por hermosura: habían de ser vírgenes, y para seguridad de que lo eran las escogían de ocho años abajo.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En756Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En756Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En756Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>De donde se ve claro la falta de relación verdadera que tuvieron los historiadores que dicen que las vírgenes estaban en el templo del Sol, y que eran sacerdotisas y que ayudaban a los sacerdotes en los sacrificios,</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>De donde se [v|ve|ver|rs] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] la falta de relación verdadera que tuvieron los historiadores que dicen que las vírgenes estaban en el templo del Sol, y que eran sacerdotisas y que ayudaban a los sacerdotes en los sacrificios,</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En756Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>ve</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En756Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En757"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En757Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde148" /><gams:textualContent>Mudaba, cuando era menester, los habitadores de una provincia a otra;proveíanles de heredades, casas, criados y ganados, en abundancia bastante;y en lugar de aquéllos, llevaban ciudadanos del Cuzco o de otras provincias fieles, para que, haciendo oficio de soldados en presidio, enseñasen a los comarcanos las leyes, ritos y ceremonias y la lengua general del reino.”Lo restante del gobierno suave que los Reyes Incas tuvieron, en que hicieron ventaja a todos los demás Reyes y naciones del Nuevo Mundo, consta claro no solamente por las cuentas y nudos anales de los indios, mas también por los cuadernos fidedignos, escritos de mano, que el visorrey don Francisco de Toledo mandó a sus visitadores y jueces y a sus escribanos que escribiesen, habiéndose informado largamente de los indios de cada provincia, los cuales papeles están hoy en los archivos públicos, donde se ve claro cuán benignamente trataron los Incas Reyes del Perú a los suyos.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En757Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En757Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En757Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Lo restante del gobierno suave que los Reyes Incas tuvieron, en que hicieron ventaja a todos los demás Reyes y naciones del Nuevo Mundo, consta claro no solamente por las cuentas y nudos anales de los indios</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Lo restante del gobierno suave que los Reyes Incas tuvieron, en que hicieron ventaja a todos los demás Reyes y naciones del Nuevo Mundo, [v|consta|constar|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] no solamente por las cuentas y nudos anales de los indios</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En757Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>consta</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#constar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En757Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En758"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En758Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde148" /><gams:textualContent>de los indios de cada provincia, los cuales papeles están hoy en los archivos públicos, donde se ve claro cuán benignamente trataron los Incas Reyes del Perú a los suyos.Porque, como ya se ha dicho</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En758Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En758Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En758Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>donde se ve claro cuán benignamente trataron los Incas Reyes del Perú a los suyos</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>donde se [v|ve|ver|rs] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] cuán benignamente trataron los Incas Reyes del Perú a los suyos</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En758Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>ve</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En758Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En759"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En759Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde149" /><gams:textualContent>D.Diego. Pregunta  claro si es muerta.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En759Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En759Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En759Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Pregunta  claro si es muerta.</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|Pregunta|preguntar|ts]  [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] si es muerta.</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En759Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>Pregunta</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#preguntar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En759Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En760"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En760Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde325" /><gams:textualContent>pueden &lt;lb/&gt; piedad y devoción en competencia.&lt;lb/&gt; &lt;lb/&gt; Sus hojas por oráculos nos queden;&lt;lb/&gt; no sibilinos ya, pues vemos claro &lt;lb/&gt; que en misteriosas letras los exceden, &lt;lb/&gt; &lt;lb/&gt; angélicos se llamen y el avaro &lt;lb/&gt; imperio de este siglo no se espante &lt;lb/&gt; </gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En760Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En760Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En760Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>pues vemos claro &lt;lb\/&gt; que en misteriosas letras los exceden</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>pues [v|vemos|ver|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] &lt;lb\/&gt; que en misteriosas letras los exceden</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En760Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vemos</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En760Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En761"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En761Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde326" /><gams:textualContent>para el gobierno que requiere &lt;lb/&gt; tan peligroso y trabajoso oficio &lt;lb/&gt; como el de ser prior?¿No lo ven claro ? &lt;lb/&gt;</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En761Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En761Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En761Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>¿No lo ven claro ?</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>¿No lo [v|ven|ver|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] ?</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En761Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>ven</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En761Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En762"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En762Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde327" /><gams:textualContent>carnem suam.* Que este velo sea el del Sagrario, o Sancta Sanctorum,  las palabras lo dicen claro .Cómo se pueda entrar por él, debe ser lo dificultoso, porque el velo del Sagrario y</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En762Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En762Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En762Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En762Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> las palabras lo dicen claro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|las palabras|fp] lo [v|dicen|decir|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En762Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>las palabras</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En762Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>dicen</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#decir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En762Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En763"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En763Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde328" /><gams:textualContent> Narra  claro  quien lo dize todo distinctamente , poniendo ante los ojos las cosas, personas, tiempos, lugares y ocasiones</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En763Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En763Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En763Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En763Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Narra  claro  quien lo dize todo distinctamente </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|Narra|narrar|is]  [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn]  [s|quien lo dize todo distinctamente|ms] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En763Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>quien lo dize todo distinctamente</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En763Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>Narra</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#narrar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En763Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En764"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En764Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde328" /><gams:textualContent>consecutivamente van haziendo las cosas como si entonces passassen, sin dexar lagunas ni blancos ningunos, como se ve claro en Homero y en Virgilio, dos espejos de poesía.Pues si la actión propuesta corre de grado en grado, continúa</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En764Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En764Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En764Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>como se ve claro en Homero y en Virgilio</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>como se [v|ve|ver|rs] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] en Homero y en Virgilio</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En764Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>ve</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En764Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En765"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En765Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde328" /><gams:textualContent>imitación la comedia consta, porque no sería poesía si le faltasse la imitación.Que sea dramática, véese claro , pues el poeta cómico nunca habla él proprio, sino que siempre introduze otros que hablen.Que sea</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En765Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En765Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En765Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Que sea dramática, véese claro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Que sea dramática, [v|véese|ver|rs] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En765Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>véese</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En765Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En766"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En766Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde328" /><gams:textualContent>Castalio.Pues con esso se ve claro la diferencia del heroyco al lýrico en una misma cosa; y se prueva nuestro intento, que</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En766Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En766Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En766Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Pues con esso se ve claro la diferencia del heroyco al lýrico</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Pues con esso se [v|ve|ver|rs] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] la diferencia del heroyco al lýrico</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En766Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>ve</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En766Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En767"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En767Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde329" /><gams:textualContent>una estocada, a quien su majestad mandó dar cien escudos para curarse; en cuyo ejercicio se ha visto claro que excede la fuerza, ligereza y osadía a toda cualquier destreza del arte.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En767Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En767Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En767Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>en cuyo ejercicio se ha visto claro que excede la fuerza, ligereza y osadía a toda cualquier destreza del arte.</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>en cuyo ejercicio se [v|ha visto|ver|rs] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] que excede la fuerza, ligereza y osadía a toda cualquier destreza del arte.</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En767Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>ha visto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En767Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En768"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En768Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde330" /><gams:textualContent>hallan pardos, aun cuando están más rasos, y, en fin, ya dicen la verdad los gestos y hablan claro las edades .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En768Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En768Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En768Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En768Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>dicen la verdad los gestos y hablan claro las edades .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>dicen la verdad los gestos y [v|hablan|hablar|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] [s|las edades|fp] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En768Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>las edades</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En768Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>hablan</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En768Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En769"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En769Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde152" /><gams:textualContent>a los grandes príncipes, se valen de su favor.Porque yo veo, Gerarda, que no hablas claro .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En769Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En769Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En769Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Porque yo veo, Gerarda, que no hablas claro .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Porque yo veo, Gerarda, que no [v|hablas|hablar|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En769Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>hablas</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En769Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En770"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En770Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde331" /><gams:textualContent>Salvador ¿Por qué lo deja? Hable  claro .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En770Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En770Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En770Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Hable  claro .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|Hable|hablar|is]  [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En770Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>Hable</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En770Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En771"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En771Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde332" /><gams:textualContent>Osorio &lt;lb/&gt; Nego.&lt;lb/&gt; Mire, Ascanio, hablemos claro : &lt;lb/&gt; hoy, por los pecados nuestros, &lt;lb/&gt; está Madrid chorreando &lt;lb/&gt; graciosos, que es plaga el verlos;&lt;lb/&gt; verbigratia</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En771Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En771Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En771Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Mire, Ascanio, hablemos claro :</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Mire, Ascanio, [v|hablemos|hablar|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] :</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En771Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>hablemos</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En771Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En772"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En772Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde333" /><gams:textualContent>CARRANZA ¿Qué objeto? Habladme  claro , señor mío.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En772Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En772Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En772Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Habladme  claro , señor mío.</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|Habladme|hablar|is]  [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] , señor mío.</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En772Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>Habladme</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En772Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En773"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En773Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde334" /><gams:textualContent>, por el tiempo que habéis tenido privado.A los treinta y ocho años de vuestra edad os dignasteis de alumbrar claro y sereno al mundo, después que a los treinta y tres, por consideración natural del sol, os</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En773Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En773Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En773Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En773Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text>os dignasteis de alumbrar claro y sereno al mundo</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>os dignasteis de [v|alumbrar|alumbrar|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnC] y [a|sereno|sereno|auvnmnnC] al mundo</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En773Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>alumbrar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#alumbrar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En773Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En773Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>sereno</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#sereno" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En774"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En774Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde130" /><gams:textualContent>por linia recta, y, como hijos de tal padre, siguen sus pasos y costumbres.» Hablemos  claro , dueño mío; enmendemos con este adbitrio los pasados: vuelvan los tesoros al archivo donde salieron,</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En774Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En774Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En774Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Hablemos  claro , dueño mío</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|Hablemos|hablar|is]  [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] , dueño mío</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En774Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>Hablemos</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En774Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En775"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En775Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde130" /><gams:textualContent>Estado: &lt;lb/&gt; no te me enojes, mi valido caro, &lt;lb/&gt; que, como soy tu amigo, te hablo claro .&lt;lb/&gt; »Dime, ¿en qué te fundaste &lt;lb/&gt; cuando el mundo asolaste &lt;lb/&gt; con tanto maquidiablo * día y noche &lt;lb/&gt; robando a troche moche &lt;lb/&gt; </gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En775Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En775Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En775Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>como soy tu amigo, te hablo claro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>como soy tu amigo, te [v|hablo|hablar|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En775Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>hablo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En775Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En776"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En776Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde335" /><gams:textualContent>más que perder, cantan alguna verdad.Y de aquí se dijo que tal predicador o tal ministro hablaron claro , el secretario Fulano desbuchó muchas verdades, el otro consejero descubrió su pecho, estando todos para morir.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En776Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En776Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En776Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En776Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>se dijo que tal predicador o tal ministro hablaron claro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>se dijo que [s|tal predicador o tal ministro|mp] [v|hablaron|hablar|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En776Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>tal predicador o tal ministro</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En776Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>hablaron</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En776Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En777"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En777Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde335" /><gams:textualContent>— ¿Yo engaño?¿Yo engaño?¡Qué bueno es eso para mí!Antes yo hablo claro a todo el mundo.Yo no prometo cielos, sino infiernos acá, y allá fuegos, que no</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En777Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En777Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En777Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En777Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Antes yo hablo claro a todo el mundo</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Antes [s|yo|us] [v|hablo|hablar|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] a todo el mundo</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En777Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>yo</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Undefined" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En777Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>hablo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En777Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En778"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En778Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde209" /><gams:textualContent>¿Qué quiere que le diga, si no le entiendo?Si quiere que le responda, hable claro .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En778Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En778Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En778Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Si quiere que le responda, hable claro .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Si quiere que le responda, [v|hable|hablar|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En778Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>hable</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En778Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En779"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En779Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde280" /><gams:textualContent>para su dicha: siempre alla el corazón que le falta, lo que en el otro considera. Vedlo  claro en el otro rico, que allándose tan lleno de bienes, que no le cabian en casa, el</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En779Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En779Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En779Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Vedlo  claro en el otro rico</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|Vedlo|ver|ts]  [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] en el otro rico</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En779Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>Vedlo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En779Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En780"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En780Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde280" /><gams:textualContent>et pater vester caelestis perfectus est.Mat.5. 48. y en el mismo Texto se vé claro , que llama essa perfección, el perdonar.Esto pues a de azerte semejante a Dios.Si esto</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En780Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En780Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En780Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>en el mismo Texto se vé claro , que llama essa perfección, el perdonar</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>en el mismo Texto se [v|vé|ver|rs] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] , que llama essa perfección, el perdonar</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En780Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vé</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En780Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En781"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En781Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde280" /><gams:textualContent>piedras se conviertan en pan en una palabra, es temeridad esperarlo, y toca en presunción pretenderlo. Digamoslo  claro .Pensar que una peña, un coraçón de un guijarro, se a de ablandar de repente, para ser</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En781Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En781Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En781Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Digamoslo  claro .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|Digamoslo|decir|ts]  [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En781Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>Digamoslo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#decir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En781Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En782"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En782Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde280" /><gams:textualContent>se ocupa quando la razón le amanece, le suele emplear quando ya la razón se le turba. Miralo  claro en los combidados de la Cena, que es por la tarde, o a la noche: y uno</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En782Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En782Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En782Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Miralo  claro en los combidados de la Cena</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|Miralo|mirar|ts]  [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] en los combidados de la Cena</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En782Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>Miralo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mirar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En782Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En783"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En783Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde280" /><gams:textualContent>los jardines, o huertos, sino que la tierra se cubre de tinieblas.Si florecieras con virtudes luzieras claro con luzes.Lo cierto es, que mientras jazia en tinieblas oculta la tierra, ni se vió tarazeada</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En783Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En783Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En783Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Si florecieras con virtudes luzieras claro con luzes.</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Si florecieras con virtudes [v|luzieras|lucir|is] [a|claro|claro|ausnmnnn] con luzes.</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En783Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>luzieras</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#lucir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En783Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En784"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En784Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde280" /><gams:textualContent>que será?que será?que será?Y para que nadie piense que es esto encarecida ponderación,  oigamosselo  claro a la misma verdad de Jesús, que ablando del día del juízio dize: Erit tunc tribulatio</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En784Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En784Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En784Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> oigamosselo  claro a la misma verdad de Jesús</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|oigamosselo|oír|ts]  [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] a la misma verdad de Jesús</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En784Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>oigamosselo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#oír" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En784Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En785"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En785Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde336" /><gams:textualContent>leñosas, toscas, y las mas carcomidas con abundancia de leche; pero al acabarlo de cortar muestran claro su mal color verdoso y oscuro, y dejandolo secar se torna casi negro: por lo contrario el blanco es muy</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En785Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En785Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En785Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>al acabarlo de cortar muestran claro su mal color verdoso y oscuro</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>al acabarlo de cortar [v|muestran|mostrar|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] su mal color verdoso y oscuro</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En785Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>muestran</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mostrar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En785Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En786"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En786Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde336" /><gams:textualContent>resignacion, en las manos del Todo-Poderoso, con tales ejemplos de humildad, y claridad, que mostró claro el gran caudal que llevó al Cielo ¡justo premio de sus virtudes!qué cierto, éra digna</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En786Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En786Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En786Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>que mostró claro el gran caudal que llevó al Cielo</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>que [v|mostró|mostrar|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] el gran caudal que llevó al Cielo</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En786Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>mostró</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mostrar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En786Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En787"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En787Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde337" /><gams:textualContent>Señor mío, hablemos claros : vuestra merced no sabe lo que se astrologa, pues lo principal todo lo yerra.Los eclipses y</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En787Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En787Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En787Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Señor mío, hablemos claros :</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Señor mío, [v|hablemos|hablar|is] [a|claros|claro|apsnmnnn] :</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En787Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>hablemos</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En787Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claros</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#MasculinePlural" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En788"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En788Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde211" /><gams:textualContent>tu intención muchas capas, &lt;lb/&gt; precisas son las solapas, &lt;lb/&gt; hablar turbio y con reparo, &lt;lb/&gt; pues solo porque habló claro &lt;lb/&gt; Juan Redondo está en gurapas.&lt;lb/&gt; En mal tono y buen teclado &lt;lb/&gt; cantan su prolixa queja &lt;lb/&gt; un Papagayo de rexa, &lt;lb/&gt;</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En788Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En788Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En788Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>pues solo porque habló claro &lt;lb\/&gt; Juan Redondo está en gurapas</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>pues solo porque [v|habló|hablar|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] &lt;lb\/&gt; Juan Redondo está en gurapas</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En788Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>habló</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En788Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En789"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En789Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde212" /><gams:textualContent>Y por otra parte los Astros, que solo por esse medio han de causar la muerte, solo pueden representársela al Astrólogo, en quanto contienen la inclinación de el matador en su influxo.&lt;lb/&gt; 10 Y que no depende, ni el género, ni el tiempo de la muerte de los hombres de la constitución de el Cielo, que reyna quando nacen, se ve claro en que mueren muchíssimos a vn tiempo, y de vn mismo modo, los quales nacieron debaxo de aspectos muy diferentes.Por ventura (como dice bien Juan Barclayo) quando la tormenta precipita al fondo de el Mar vna grande Nao, y perecen todos los que iban en ella, se ha de pensar, que todos aquellos infelices nacieron debaxo de vn systema celeste, que amenazaba naufragio, disponiendo los mismos Astros, que solo se juntassen en aquella Nave, los que avían nacido debaxo de aquel systema?Buenas creederas tendrá quien lo tragare.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En789Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En789Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En789Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>se ve claro en que mueren muchíssimos a vn tiempo</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>se [v|ve|ver|rs] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] en que mueren muchíssimos a vn tiempo</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En789Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>ve</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En789Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En790"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En790Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde212" /><gams:textualContent>Mar con el tumulto de las ondas mucho limo, y arena a las orillas: lo que se ve claro en algunas partes donde el Mar se ha retirado por largo trecho de los antiguos términos.En nuestro Monasterio</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En790Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En790Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En790Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>lo que se ve claro en algunas partes donde el Mar se ha retirado</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>lo que se [v|ve|ver|rs] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] en algunas partes donde el Mar se ha retirado</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En790Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>ve</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En790Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En791"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En791Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde213" /><gams:textualContent>66. En este experimento se ve claro que no interviene causa alguna extrínseca que positivamente enrarezca el aire de la vexiga.Él por sí mismo,</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En791Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En791Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En791Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>En este experimento se ve claro que no interviene causa alguna extrínseca que positivamente enrarezca el aire de la vexiga.</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>En este experimento se [v|ve|ver|rs] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] que no interviene causa alguna extrínseca que positivamente enrarezca el aire de la vexiga.</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En791Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>ve</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En791Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En792"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En792Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde10" /><gams:textualContent>propiedad y pureza de las voces son las principales virtudes de la locución.La perspicuidad hace que se entienda claro y sin tropiezo alguno el sentido, al modo que por un terso transparente cristal se ven distintamente los</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En792Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En792Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En792Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>La perspicuidad hace que se entienda claro y sin tropiezo alguno el sentido</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>La perspicuidad hace que se [v|entienda|entender|rs] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnC] y sin tropiezo alguno el sentido</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En792Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>entienda</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#entender" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En792Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En793"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En793Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde338" /><gams:textualContent>Asimismo en el poema épico el héroe, que es la persona principal, se lleva la primera atención del poeta, que nos pinta todo entero su carácter y sus costumbres;síguense después las demás personas que tienen mayor papel en el poema, cuyas costumbres y carácter deben también mostrarse, aunque no tan por entero, como el héroe;otras, que tienen poco o ningún papel, apenas descubren algo de sus costumbres;algunas sólo sirven para hacer número, y el poeta no hace más que nombrarlas, dejando sus costumbres y su genio en obscuridad y olvido.&lt;lb/&gt; Véase cómo en la Eneida el carácter y la pintura de Eneas ocuparon todo el esmero del poeta, que por todo el poema nos le deja ver claro y entero .Dido y Turno son, después de Eneas, dos personas muy principales en la acción de la fábula, y de entrambas se ven también con bastante distinción las costumbres y el genio.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En793Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En793Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En793Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En793Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text>el carácter y la pintura de Eneas ocuparon todo el esmero del poeta, que por todo el poema nos le deja ver claro y entero .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>el carácter y la pintura de Eneas ocuparon todo el esmero del poeta, que por todo el poema nos le deja [v|ver|ver|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnC] y [a|entero|entero|auvnmnnC] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En793Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>ver</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En793Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En793Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>entero</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#entero" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En794"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En794Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde214" /><gams:textualContent>I buelvo a decir, i me afirmo, que no he visto lo que he visto, ni ha passado por mí lo que ha passado...Entró acaso el alcalde del pueblo en el mesón con un escrivano, ante el qual alcalde pidió Don Quijote por una petición, de que a su derecho convenía, de que don Álvaro Tarfe, aquel cavallero que allí estava presente, declarasse ante su merced cómo no conocía a Don Quijote de la Mancha, que assimismo estava allí presente, i que no era aquel que andava impresso en una historia intitulada Segunda parte de Don Quijote de la Mancha, compuesta por un tal de Avellaneda, natural de Tordesillas.Finalmente, el alcalde proveyó jurídicamente.La declaración se hizo con todas las fuerzas que en tales casos devían hacerse, con lo que quedaron Don Quijote i Sancho mui alegres, como si les importara mucho semejante declaración i no mostrara claro la diferencia de los dos Don Quijotes i la de los dos Sanchos sus obras i sus palabras.Muchas cortesías i ofrecimientos passaron entre don Álvaro i Don Quijote, en las quales mostró el gran manchego su discreción de modo que desengañó a don Álvaro del error en que estava, el qual se dio a entender que devía de estar encantado, pues tocava con la mano dos tan contrarios Don Quijotes.”</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En794Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En794Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En794Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>como si les importara mucho semejante declaración i no mostrara claro la diferencia de los dos Don Quijotes i la de los dos Sanchos sus obras i sus palabras</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>como si les importara mucho semejante declaración i no [v|mostrara|mostrar|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] la diferencia de los dos Don Quijotes i la de los dos Sanchos sus obras i sus palabras</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En794Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>mostrara</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mostrar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En794Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En795"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En795Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde214" /><gams:textualContent>después que diste al patrio suelo &lt;lb/&gt; tu alma sana i tu garganta suelta &lt;lb/&gt; dentro las fuerzas bárbaras confusas &lt;lb/&gt; descubre claro tu valor el cielo, &lt;lb/&gt; gózase el mundo en tu felice buelta &lt;lb/&gt; i cobra España las perdidas musas.&lt;lb/&gt; </gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En795Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En795Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En795Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>dentro las fuerzas bárbaras confusas &lt;lb\/&gt; descubre claro tu valor el cielo</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>dentro las fuerzas bárbaras confusas &lt;lb\/&gt; [v|descubre|descubrir|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] tu valor el cielo</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En795Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>descubre</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#descubrir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En795Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En796"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En796Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde339" /><gams:textualContent>común la percepción de essa impressión.Esto no es privativo de la vista.En el tacto se ve claro esto.Llegando a tocar con la punta de el dedo la agua, quando está en el mismo grado</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En796Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En796Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En796Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>En el tacto se ve claro esto.</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>En el tacto se [v|ve|ver|rs] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] esto.</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En796Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>ve</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En796Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En797"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En797Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde339" /><gams:textualContent>23. Otro exemplo pondremos claro en el mismo órgano de la vista.En el ambiente de los quartos que habitamos, anda vagueando siempre</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En797Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En797Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En797Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Otro exemplo pondremos claro en el mismo órgano de la vista.</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Otro exemplo [v|pondremos|poner|ts] [a|claro|claro|auonmnnn] en el mismo órgano de la vista.</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En797Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>pondremos</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#poner" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En797Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En798"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En798Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde340" /><gams:textualContent>FÉLIX ¿Y si os pesa &lt;lb/&gt; de que os hable claro yo ?</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En798Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En798Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En798Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En798Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>¿Y si os pesa &lt;lb\/&gt; de que os hable claro yo ?</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>¿Y si os pesa &lt;lb\/&gt; de que os [v|hable|hablar|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] [s|yo|ms] ?</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En798Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>yo</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En798Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>hable</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En798Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En799"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En799Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde340" /><gams:textualContent>los dos &lt;lb/&gt; solos, y no me das blanca, *&lt;lb/&gt; cobrar quiero en modo raro, &lt;lb/&gt; porque por hablarte claro &lt;lb/&gt; el corazón se me arranca.&lt;lb/&gt; Dime, infeliz mequetrefe, *&lt;lb/&gt; pobre trompeta, holgazán, *&lt;lb/&gt; que eres</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En799Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En799Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En799Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>porque por hablarte claro &lt;lb\/&gt; el corazón se me arranca.</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>porque por [v|hablarte|hablar|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] &lt;lb\/&gt; el corazón se me arranca.</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En799Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>hablarte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En799Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En800"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En800Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde340" /><gams:textualContent>saber, &lt;lb/&gt; que a estotro yo le haré hacer &lt;lb/&gt; lo que fuere de razón.&lt;lb/&gt; Don Félix, hablemos claros , &lt;lb/&gt; ¿qué os he dicho cara a cara?&lt;lb/&gt;</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En800Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En800Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En800Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Don Félix, hablemos claros , &lt;lb\/&gt; ¿qué os he dicho cara a cara?</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Don Félix, [v|hablemos|hablar|is] [a|claros|claro|apsnmnnn] , &lt;lb\/&gt; ¿qué os he dicho cara a cara?</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En800Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>hablemos</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En800Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claros</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#MasculinePlural" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En801"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En801Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde341" /><gams:textualContent>el pulso * &lt;lb/&gt; al pobre que llego, &lt;lb/&gt; viendo aqueste aparato &lt;lb/&gt; juzgan Galeno.&lt;lb/&gt; &lt;lb/&gt; Pero, señores, &lt;lb/&gt; hablando clarito , &lt;lb/&gt; en mi vida he pensado &lt;lb/&gt; abrir un libro.&lt;lb/&gt; &lt;lb/&gt; A una cierta viudilla &lt;lb/&gt; ahora a visitar voy, &lt;lb/&gt; que</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En801Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En801Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En801Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Pero, señores, &lt;lb\/&gt; hablando clarito , &lt;lb\/&gt; en mi vida he pensado &lt;lb\/&gt; abrir un libro.</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Pero, señores, &lt;lb\/&gt; [v|hablando|hablar|is] [a|clarito|claro|auvnmnnn] , &lt;lb\/&gt; en mi vida he pensado &lt;lb\/&gt; abrir un libro.</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En801Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>hablando</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En801Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>clarito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En802"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En802Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde342" /><gams:textualContent>DOÑA ELVIRA Yo lo estimo; pero hablemos &lt;lb/&gt; clarito : don Fausto y yo &lt;lb/&gt; ha diez años que tenemos &lt;lb/&gt; una materia pendiente, &lt;lb/&gt; cuyo asunto no reservo &lt;lb/&gt; de nadie</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En802Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En802Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En802Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>pero hablemos &lt;lb\/&gt; clarito :</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>pero [v|hablemos|hablar|is] &lt;lb\/&gt; [a|clarito|claro|auvnmnnn] :</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En802Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>hablemos</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En802Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>clarito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En803"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En803Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde198" /><gams:textualContent>y cantidad, bajo de otro que parezca más ventajoso al Real Erario; pero si es lícito hablar claro , todas las ventajas en ahorros de sueldos son imaginarias.¿Faltarán en Lima sujetos de capacidad y talentos</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En803Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En803Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En803Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>pero si es lícito hablar claro , todas las ventajas en ahorros de sueldos son imaginarias.</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>pero si es lícito [v|hablar|hablar|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] , todas las ventajas en ahorros de sueldos son imaginarias.</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En803Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>hablar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En803Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En804"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En804Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde343" /><gams:textualContent>EPIGRAMA CXXXVII.&lt;lb/&gt; A Don Andres &lt;lb/&gt; &lt;lb/&gt; Porque hablo clara la verdad, me notas &lt;lb/&gt; de libre, Don Andres;y yo al contrario, &lt;lb/&gt; á tí que adulas, y hablas con mentira, &lt;lb/&gt; te noto por el mas infame esclavo.&lt;lb/&gt; ¿Que es mas digno de nota en esta vida, &lt;lb/&gt; la libertad que goza el hombre sabio &lt;lb/&gt; con verdad, ó la baxa servidumbre &lt;lb/&gt; del necio mentiroso con halagos?&lt;lb/&gt;</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En804Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En804Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En804Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Porque hablo clara la verdad, me notas &lt;lb\/&gt; de libre, Don Andres</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Porque [v|hablo|hablar|ts] [a|clara|claro|afonmnnn] la verdad, me notas &lt;lb\/&gt; de libre, Don Andres</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En804Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>hablo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En804Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>clara</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FeminineSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En805"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En805Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde343" /><gams:textualContent>pequeña, &lt;lb/&gt; en tu balcon, que esta seña &lt;lb/&gt; de tu doncellez mantienes.&lt;lb/&gt; Pero si se ha de decir &lt;lb/&gt; claro el modo de pensar, &lt;lb/&gt; Luisa, llego á maliciar &lt;lb/&gt; quiere al dátil aludir.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En805Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En805Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En805Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Pero si se ha de decir &lt;lb\/&gt; claro el modo de pensar</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Pero si se ha de [v|decir|decir|ts] &lt;lb\/&gt; [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] el modo de pensar</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En805Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>decir</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#decir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En805Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En806"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En806Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde343" /><gams:textualContent>EPIGRAMA CVIII.&lt;lb/&gt; A Pablo &lt;lb/&gt; Murmúrasme escribo claro , &lt;lb/&gt; Pablo, lo que á nadie ofende, &lt;lb/&gt; y que sin algun melindre &lt;lb/&gt; leerlo una Monja puede.&lt;lb/&gt; Y en tanto que me murmuras, &lt;lb/&gt; tú bárbaro é imprudente &lt;lb/&gt; escribes allá en tu gerga &lt;lb/&gt; las mayores sordideces.&lt;lb/&gt;</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En806Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En806Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En806Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Murmúrasme escribo claro , &lt;lb\/&gt; Pablo, lo que á nadie ofende,</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Murmúrasme [v|escribo|escribir|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] , &lt;lb\/&gt; Pablo, lo que á nadie ofende,</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En806Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>escribo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#escribir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En806Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En807"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En807Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde344" /><gams:textualContent>, yo que sólo deseo su bien, no haría otra cosa que hacer más pesada su infelicidad. Hablaré  claro : ella no se declarará; mas no será imposible conocer su intención.Yo seré dichoso si me ama</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En807Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En807Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En807Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Hablaré  claro : ella no se declarará;</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|Hablaré|hablar|is]  [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] : ella no se declarará;</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En807Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>Hablaré</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En807Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En808"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En808Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde344" /><gams:textualContent>D. PRUDENCIO.¡Basta, basta!Con no responder y con ese rubor dices bastante claro que no es esa tu vocación; y yo me alegro de que no lo sea.Resta proseguir.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En808Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En808Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En808Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Con no responder y con ese rubor dices bastante claro que no es esa tu vocación</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Con no responder y con ese rubor [v|dices|decir|ts] bastante [a|claro|claro|auvmmnnn] que no es esa tu vocación</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En808Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>dices</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#decir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En808Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En809"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En809Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde344" /><gams:textualContent>acuerdo con tu corazón.Hoy te pretendo más ingenua que jamás.Depón todo rubor: véncete y háblame claro .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En809Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En809Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En809Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>véncete y háblame claro .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>véncete y [v|háblame|hablar|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En809Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>háblame</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En809Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En810"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En810Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde344" /><gams:textualContent>D. PRUDENCIO.Pero, a lo menos, las veces que escribiste, aunque pocas, pudieras haber hablado claro ...</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En810Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En810Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En810Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>las veces que escribiste, aunque pocas, pudieras haber hablado claro ...</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>las veces que escribiste, aunque pocas, pudieras [v|haber hablado|hablar|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] ...</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En810Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>haber hablado</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En810Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En811"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En811Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde281" /><gams:textualContent>quedásemos en Dartford; o si lo dijisteis, no os entendí; ver qué consecuencia lleva el no hablar claro .Aquí se me encendió en ira toda la sangre viendo el descaro de Oates; y sin duda me contuvo</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En811Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En811Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En811Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>ver qué consecuencia lleva el no hablar claro .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>ver qué consecuencia lleva el no [v|hablar|hablar|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En811Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>hablar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En811Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En812"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En812Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde200" /><gams:textualContent>Nunca parece el sol más hermoso que cuando amanece claro después de muchas nieblas, obscuridades y lluvias, ni es más apreciable la calma y serenidad que cuando ha</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En812Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En812Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En812Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En812Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Nunca parece el sol más hermoso que cuando amanece claro después de muchas nieblas, obscuridades y lluvias</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Nunca parece [s|el sol|ms] más hermoso que cuando [v|amanece|amanecer|is] [a|claro|claro|ausnmnnn] después de muchas nieblas, obscuridades y lluvias</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En812Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>el sol</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En812Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>amanece</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#amanecer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En812Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En813"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En813Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde245" /><gams:textualContent>D.CRISTÓBAL  Habla  claro .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En813Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En813Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En813Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Habla  claro .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|Habla|hablar|is]  [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En813Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>Habla</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En813Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En814"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En814Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde345" /><gams:textualContent>contra la tropa bárbara me irritas;&lt;lb/&gt; »Que al rayo de tu luz, aunque lejano, &lt;lb/&gt; veo clara la impura turbulencia &lt;lb/&gt; y horror me causa su progreso insano.&lt;lb/&gt; »¿Dónde estás?, ¿dónde estás </gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En814Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En814Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En814Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Que al rayo de tu luz, aunque lejano, &lt;lb\/&gt; veo clara la impura turbulencia</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Que al rayo de tu luz, aunque lejano, &lt;lb\/&gt; [v|veo|ver|ts] [a|clara|claro|afonmnnn] la impura turbulencia</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En814Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>veo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En814Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>clara</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FeminineSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En815"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En815Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde346" /><gams:textualContent>nuestra posición al amanecer, no distábamos de ella sino unas tres leguas, y a pesar del tiempo calimoso, veíamos clara toda la costa a una y otra parte.Nuestro rumbo era al E.con viento del</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En815Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En815Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En815Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>a pesar del tiempo calimoso, veíamos clara toda la costa a una y otra parte.</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>a pesar del tiempo calimoso, [v|veíamos|ver|ts] [a|clara|claro|afonmnnn] toda la costa a una y otra parte.</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En815Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>veíamos</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En815Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>clara</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FeminineSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En816"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En816Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde347" /><gams:textualContent>año 1727; y esta raridad del fenómeno, como también observa Plinio, no permitía que se viese clara la causa ni que se tuviesen de este meteoro las noticias que de los otros.En 1726 hizo grande</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En816Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En816Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En816Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>no permitía que se viese clara la causa</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>no permitía que se [v|viese|ver|rs] [a|clara|claro|afonmnnn] la causa</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En816Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>viese</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En816Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>clara</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FeminineSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En817"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En817Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde201" /><gams:textualContent>la oración?De fuera de la puerta.¡Qué lástima que los obispos no tengan amigos que les hablen claro !</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En817Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En817Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En817Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>¡Qué lástima que los obispos no tengan amigos que les hablen claro !</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>¡Qué lástima que los obispos no tengan amigos que les [v|hablen|hablar|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] !</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En817Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>hablen</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En817Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En818"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En818Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde348" /><gams:textualContent>que pasan las pobrecillas.&lt;lb/&gt; &lt;lb/&gt; Esta preciosa ciencia &lt;lb/&gt; tiene la gracia &lt;lb/&gt; que no esfuerza talento &lt;lb/&gt; para estudiarla.&lt;lb/&gt; Lo verán claro , &lt;lb/&gt; y la segunda parte &lt;lb/&gt; a estudiar vamos.&lt;lb/&gt; </gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En818Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En818Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En818Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Lo verán claro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Lo [v|verán|ver|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En818Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>verán</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En818Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En819"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En819Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde349" /><gams:textualContent>alguno de ellos, &lt;lb/&gt; por Dios que me quedara sin ninguno.&lt;lb/&gt; (Cantado.) &lt;lb/&gt; Y para hacer ver claro &lt;lb/&gt; de mi razón la prueba, &lt;lb/&gt; de todos mis maridos &lt;lb/&gt; referiré las prendas, &lt;lb/&gt; porque sirva de ejemplo &lt;lb/&gt; a las</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En819Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En819Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En819Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Y para hacer ver claro &lt;lb\/&gt; de mi razón la prueba</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Y para hacer [v|ver|ver|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] &lt;lb\/&gt; de mi razón la prueba</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En819Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>ver</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En819Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En820"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En820Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde350" /><gams:textualContent>Sargento.Y si queréis verlo claro , &lt;lb/&gt; decidle cuatro palabras &lt;lb/&gt; a Isabelita.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En820Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En820Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En820Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Y si queréis verlo claro , &lt;lb\/&gt; decidle cuatro palabras</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Y si queréis [v|verlo|ver|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] , &lt;lb\/&gt; decidle cuatro palabras</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En820Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>verlo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En820Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En821"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En821Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde350" /><gams:textualContent>Lucas. Habla  claro .&lt;lb/&gt; ¿Para qué es fingir, si es fuerza &lt;lb/&gt; que estés por dentro rabiando?&lt;lb/&gt; </gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En821Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En821Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En821Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Habla  claro .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|Habla|hablar|is]  [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En821Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>Habla</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En821Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En822"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En822Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde351" /><gams:textualContent>nadie &lt;lb/&gt; debe tener afición;&lt;lb/&gt; que está la filosofía &lt;lb/&gt; reñida con el amor.&lt;lb/&gt; &lt;lb/&gt; En lo mismo que enseño &lt;lb/&gt; demuestro claro &lt;lb/&gt; del amor las maldades &lt;lb/&gt; y los engaños.&lt;lb/&gt; Tan rara idea &lt;lb/&gt; con unas seguidillas &lt;lb/&gt; aquí fin tenga.&lt;lb/&gt;</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En822Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En822Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En822Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>En lo mismo que enseño &lt;lb\/&gt; demuestro claro &lt;lb\/&gt; del amor las maldades &lt;lb\/&gt; y los engaños.</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>En lo mismo que enseño &lt;lb\/&gt; [v|demuestro|demostrar|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] &lt;lb\/&gt; del amor las maldades &lt;lb\/&gt; y los engaños.</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En822Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>demuestro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#demostrar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En822Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En823"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En823Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde352" /><gams:textualContent>Dolores.&lt;lb/&gt; Si he de hablaros claro , &lt;lb/&gt; porque sois poeta. </gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En823Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En823Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En823Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Si he de hablaros claro , &lt;lb\/&gt; porque sois poeta.</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Si he de [v|hablaros|hablar|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] , &lt;lb\/&gt; porque sois poeta.</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En823Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>hablaros</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En823Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En824"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En824Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde353" /><gams:textualContent>o del misterio: &lt;lb/&gt; Nacer de la franqueza no es muy raro &lt;lb/&gt; Pues aquí aunque no limpio se ama claro .&lt;lb/&gt; «Estos que aglomerados aquí miras &lt;lb/&gt; Son mi ejército fiel, ministros míos, &lt;lb/&gt; Agiles siempre a ejecutar mis </gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En824Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En824Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En824Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En824Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text>Pues aquí aunque no limpio se ama claro .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Pues aquí aunque no [a|limpio|limpio|auvnmnnC] se [v|ama|amar|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnC] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En824Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>ama</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#amar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En824Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>limpio</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#limpio" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En824Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En825"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En825Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde164" /><gams:textualContent>a un truquito indecente que estaba en la misma calle, en el que había juego de pillaje. Hablaré  claro : era un arrastraderito como aquel donde me metió Januario.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En825Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En825Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En825Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Hablaré  claro :</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|Hablaré|hablar|is]  [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] :</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En825Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>Hablaré</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En825Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En826"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En826Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde204" /><gams:textualContent>, todos españoles, a quienes educa e instruye. El, su familia y sus discípulos, todos  hablan claro y corriente como Dios manda; de suerte que las criadas son las únicas que nos hacen acordar que no estamos en</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En826Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En826Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En826Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En826Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En826Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text> El, su familia y sus discípulos, todos  hablan claro y corriente como Dios manda</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|El, su familia y sus discípulos, todos|mp]  [v|hablan|hablar|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnC] y [a|corriente|corriente|auvnmnnC] como Dios manda</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En826Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>El, su familia y sus discípulos, todos</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En826Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>hablan</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En826Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En826Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>corriente</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#corriente" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">4</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En827"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En827Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde354" /><gams:textualContent>— Señor, hablemos claro , y ahorrémonos de palabras; vengo a animar a usted a que escriba, y a que escriba para</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En827Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En827Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En827Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Señor, hablemos claro , y ahorrémonos de palabras;</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Señor, [v|hablemos|hablar|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] , y ahorrémonos de palabras;</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En827Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>hablemos</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En827Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En828"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En828Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde355" /><gams:textualContent>¿Hay nada más ridículo que estas gentes que quieren pasar por finas en medio de la más crasa ignorancia de los usos sociales;que para obsequiarle le obligan a usted a comer y beber por fuerza, y no le dejan medio de hacer su gusto?¿Por qué habrá gentes que sólo quieren comer con alguna más limpieza los días de días?&lt;lb/&gt; A todo esto, el niño que a mi izquierda tenía, hacía saltar las aceitunas a un plato de magras con tomate, y una vino a parar a uno de mis ojos, que no volvió a ver claro en todo el día;y el señor gordo de mi derecha había tenido la precaución de ir dejando en el mantel, al lado de mi pan, los huesos de las suyas, y los de las aves que había roído;el convidado de enfrente, que se preciaba de trinchador, se había encargado de hacer la autopsia de un capón, o sea gallo, que esto nunca se supo: fuese por la edad avanzada de la víctima, fuese por los ningunos conocimientos anatómicos del victimario, jamás parecieron las coyunturas.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En828Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En828Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En828Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>un plato de magras con tomate, y una vino a parar a uno de mis ojos, que no volvió a ver claro en todo el día</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>un plato de magras con tomate, y una vino a parar a uno de mis ojos, que no volvió a [v|ver|ver|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] en todo el día</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En828Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>ver</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En828Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En829"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En829Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde356" /><gams:textualContent>Pero no ocupemos a nuestros lectores con inútiles digresiones.Amaneció en Vitoria y en Álava uno de los primeros días del corriente, y amanecía poco más o menos como en los demás países del mundo;es decir, que se empezaba a ver claro , digámoslo así, por aquellas provincias, cuando una nubecilla de ligero polvo anunció en la carretera de Francia la precipitada carrera de algún carruaje procedente de la vecina nación.Dos importantes viajeros, francés el uno, español el otro, envuelto éste en su capa y aquel en su capote, venían dentro.El primero hacía castillos en España, el segundo los hacía en el aire, porque venían echando cuentas acerca del día y hora en que llegar debían a la villa de Madrid, leal y coronada (sea dicho con permiso del padre Vaca).Llegó el veloz carruaje a las puertas de Vitoria, y una voz estentórea, de estas que salen de un cuerpo bien nutrido, intimó la orden de detener a los ilusos viajeros.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En829Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En829Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En829Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>se empezaba a ver claro , digámoslo así, por aquellas provincias,</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>se empezaba a [v|ver|ver|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] , digámoslo así, por aquellas provincias,</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En829Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>ver</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En829Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En830"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En830Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde357" /><gams:textualContent>para, que hacer llegar al público un mal artículo.Verdad es que, si hemos de hablar claro , es más fácil saber dónde está el público que dónde está Rodil: ya ves que no te lo</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En830Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En830Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En830Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Verdad es que, si hemos de hablar claro , es más fácil saber dónde está el público</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Verdad es que, si hemos de [v|hablar|hablar|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] , es más fácil saber dónde está el público</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En830Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>hablar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En830Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En831"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En831Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde358" /><gams:textualContent>Yo quisiera ver al señor Locke en Madrid en el día, y entonces veríamos si seguía sosteniendo que porque un hombre sea ciego y sordo desde que nació no ha de tener por eso ideas de cosa alguna que a esos sentidos ataña y pertenezca.Es cosa probada que el que no ve ni oye claro a cierta edad, ni ha visto nunca, ni verá.Pues bien, hombres conozco yo en Madrid de cierta edad, y no uno ni dos, sino lo menos cinco, que así ven y oyen claro como yo vuelo.Hábleles usted, sin embargo, de ideas;no sólo las tienen sino que ¡ojalá no las tuvieran!Y de que estas ideas son innatas, así me queda la menor duda como pienso en ser nunca ministerial;porque si no nacen precisamente con el hombre, nacen con el empleo, y sabido se está que el hombre en tanto es hombre en cuanto tiene empleo.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En831Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En831Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En831Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En831Ph1Ve2" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En831Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Es cosa probada que el que no ve ni oye claro a cierta edad, ni ha visto nunca, ni verá.</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Es cosa probada que [s|el que|ms] no [v|ve|ver|is] ni [v|oye|oír|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] a cierta edad, ni ha visto nunca, ni verá.</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En831Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>el que</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En831Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>ve</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En831Ph1Ve2"><aaif:text>oye</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#oír" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En831Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">4</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En832"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En832Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde358" /><gams:textualContent>Yo quisiera ver al señor Locke en Madrid en el día, y entonces veríamos si seguía sosteniendo que porque un hombre sea ciego y sordo desde que nació no ha de tener por eso ideas de cosa alguna que a esos sentidos ataña y pertenezca.Es cosa probada que el que no ve ni oye claro a cierta edad, ni ha visto nunca, ni verá.Pues bien, hombres conozco yo en Madrid de cierta edad, y no uno ni dos, sino lo menos cinco, que así ven y oyen claro como yo vuelo.Hábleles usted, sin embargo, de ideas;no sólo las tienen sino que ¡ojalá no las tuvieran!Y de que estas ideas son innatas, así me queda la menor duda como pienso en ser nunca ministerial;porque si no nacen precisamente con el hombre, nacen con el empleo, y sabido se está que el hombre en tanto es hombre en cuanto tiene empleo.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En832Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En832Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En832Ph1Ve2" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En832Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>hombres conozco yo en Madrid de cierta edad, y no uno ni dos, sino lo menos cinco, que así ven y oyen claro como yo vuelo.</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>hombres conozco yo en Madrid de cierta edad, y no uno ni dos, sino lo menos cinco, que así [v|ven|ver|is] y [v|oyen|oír|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] como yo vuelo.</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En832Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>ven</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En832Ph1Ve2"><aaif:text>oyen</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#oír" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En832Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En833"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En833Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde246" /><gams:textualContent>todas sus partes destrozador para la infeliz  Elvira , que por los antecedentes que tenía no podía prescindir de ver claro en este desdichado asunto; cada palabra retumbaba en su alma como el golpe del martillo que hace entrar</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En833Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En833Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En833Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En833Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Elvira , que por los antecedentes que tenía no podía prescindir de ver claro en este desdichado asunto</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Elvira|fs] , que por los antecedentes que tenía no podía prescindir de [v|ver|ver|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] en este desdichado asunto</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En833Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Elvira</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En833Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>ver</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En833Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En834"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En834Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde246" /><gams:textualContent>llaves de los candados que cerraban aquella salida al campo.Todos conjeturaban, todos hablaban,  nadie  veía clara la verdad.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En834Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En834Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En834Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En834Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> nadie  veía clara la verdad.</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|nadie|ms]  [v|veía|ver|ts] [a|clara|claro|afonmnnn] la verdad.</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En834Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>nadie</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En834Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>veía</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En834Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>clara</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FeminineSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En835"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En835Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde246" /><gams:textualContent>Elvira apretó la mano del inteligente pajecillo con expresión de gratitud, y ambos salieron de la cámara que acababa de ser teatro de tan extraordinarias escenas.Buscó Elvira a su esposo sin más demora, porque si bien sospechaba que don Enrique hubiera tenido parte en la pérfida desaparición de la condesa, ni veía claro en esto ni menos lo podía asegurar.¡Tan bien se había representado por todos la farsa que dejamos descrita!Ni por otra parte, aunque a pies juntillas hubiera creído la traición del conde, cabía en su imaginación la menor sospecha acerca del extremado honor de su esposo;sabíale ligado a los intereses de su señor, pero que él hubiese tomado parte activa en el mal hecho no le era lícito a Elvira imaginarlo siquiera.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En835Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En835Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En835Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>si bien sospechaba que don Enrique hubiera tenido parte en la pérfida desaparición de la condesa, ni veía claro en esto ni menos lo podía asegurar</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>si bien sospechaba que don Enrique hubiera tenido parte en la pérfida desaparición de la condesa, ni [v|veía|ver|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] en esto ni menos lo podía asegurar</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En835Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>veía</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En835Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En836"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En836Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde359" /><gams:textualContent>de los empleos, por ejemplo: he aquí una cuestión de pura gasa.Aquí es donde se ve claro : detrás de ella no se necesita lente para echar de ver los empleos, y no tamaños como avellanas</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En836Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En836Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En836Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Aquí es donde se ve claro : detrás de ella no se necesita lente para echar de ver los empleos</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Aquí es donde se [v|ve|ver|rs] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] : detrás de ella no se necesita lente para echar de ver los empleos</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En836Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>ve</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En836Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En837"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En837Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde360" /><gams:textualContent>eso, ¿a qué tanto misterio?Ya no estamos en tiempo de Calomarde; ahora se puede hablar claro y sin rodeos todo lo que se piensa, cuando se piensa.Aquí se habla mal de muchos ministros</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En837Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En837Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En837Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>ahora se puede hablar claro y sin rodeos todo lo que se piensa</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>ahora se puede [v|hablar|hablar|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnC] y sin rodeos todo lo que se piensa</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En837Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>hablar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En837Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En838"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En838Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde361" /><gams:textualContent>pelo le abruma, sus ojos no tienen objeto fijo, ven sin mirar, y en consecuencia no ven nada claro .Cuando una causa, ajena de él, le conmueve, produce un son confuso, bárbaro y profundo</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En838Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En838Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En838Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>sus ojos no tienen objeto fijo, ven sin mirar, y en consecuencia no ven nada claro .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>sus ojos no tienen objeto fijo, ven sin mirar, y en consecuencia no [v|ven|ver|ts] nada [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En838Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>ven</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En838Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En839"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En839Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde362" /><gams:textualContent>la educación establece entre unas y otros; que tenga, además de un instinto de observación certero para ver claro lo que mira a veces oscuro, suma delicadeza para no manchar sus cuadros con aquella parte de las escenas domésticas</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En839Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En839Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En839Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>instinto de observación certero para ver claro lo que mira a veces oscuro</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>instinto de observación certero para [v|ver|ver|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] lo que mira a veces oscuro</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En839Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>ver</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En839Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En840"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En840Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde363" /><gams:textualContent>Si este libro puede conquistar a la causa liberal muchos de los fanáticos que creen que la religión se opone a las instituciones libres, si puede convencer a la multitud poco instruida de que la religión cristiana es una religión democrática y popular, si puede cimentar la libertad, destruyendo su mayor enemigo, el fanatismo, el traductor corre con gusto el riesgo de aquella doble inculpación;no, empero, sin declarar que ningún escritor ha escrito nunca para los que no saben leer. Los autores mismos del código que en el día nos rige hubieron de conocer esta importante verdad; sin duda vieron claro que no había llegado el término de la religión cristiana en España, que no llegaría jamás, cuando, en vez de declararla imprudentemente la guerra, a imitación de los filósofos franceses del siglo pasado, trataron de hacerla suya, y granjeársela, consignando en ese mismo código que la religión cristiana es la única verdadera y la del Estado.En eso dieron una gran prueba de su conocimiento del corazón humano y del mundo, además de una muestra importante de fe y de convicción religiosas.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En840Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En840Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En840Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En840Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Los autores mismos del código que en el día nos rige hubieron de conocer esta importante verdad; sin duda vieron claro que no había llegado</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Los autores mismos del código que en el día nos rige|mp] hubieron de conocer esta importante verdad; sin duda [v|vieron|ver|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] que no había llegado</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En840Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Los autores mismos del código que en el día nos rige</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En840Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vieron</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En840Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En841"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En841Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde364" /><gams:textualContent>el cementerio?¿Fuera o dentro?Un vértigo espantoso se apoderó de mí, y comencé a ver claro .El cementerio está dentro de Madrid.Madrid es el cementerio.Pero vasto cementerio donde cada casa es el</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En841Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En841Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En841Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>comencé a ver claro .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>comencé a [v|ver|ver|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En841Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>ver</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En841Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En842"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En842Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde365" /><gams:textualContent>no son para ti; no es ahí, sino aquí, donde nos hemos quedado a oscuras.¿ Ves  claras ahora las buenas noches?¿Tampoco?Manos pues a la obra, y escucha, que hay que</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En842Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En842Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En842Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>¿ Ves  claras ahora las buenas noches?</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>¿ [v|Ves|ver|ts]  [a|claras|claro|axonmnnn] ahora las buenas noches?</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En842Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>Ves</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En842Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claras</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FemininePlural" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En843"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En843Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde365" /><gams:textualContent>aconsejo que eches manos de las sesiones de Cortes y te las leas de cabo a rabo, y si llegas a entender claro en el asunto te aconsejo también que te des la enhorabuena, y te tengas en lo sucesivo por hombre de talento</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En843Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En843Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En843Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>si llegas a entender claro en el asunto te aconsejo también que</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>si llegas a [v|entender|entender|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] en el asunto te aconsejo también que</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En843Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>entender</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#entender" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En843Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En844"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En844Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde365" /><gams:textualContent>De suerte que yo por el pronto sólo veo clara una cosa, y es que para el 22 de marzo se reunirán de nuevo en Madrid otras Cortes, uno de cuyos</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En844Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En844Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En844Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En844Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>De suerte que yo por el pronto sólo veo clara una cosa,</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>De suerte que [s|yo|us] por el pronto sólo [v|veo|ver|ts] [a|clara|claro|afonmnnn] una cosa,</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En844Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>yo</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Undefined" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En844Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>veo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En844Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>clara</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FeminineSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En845"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En845Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde247" /><gams:textualContent>Perdone V., señó Uribe, yo no vine a recibir esa prenda, si hemos de hablar claro , hasta ayer por la mañana.Antier toqué la misa mayor del Santo Ángel Custodio, a prima toqué la</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En845Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En845Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En845Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>si hemos de hablar claro ,</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>si hemos de [v|hablar|hablar|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] ,</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En845Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>hablar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En845Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En846"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En846Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde247" /><gams:textualContent>decir verdad, ya no tengo manos para todo el trabajo que me ha caído.Por donde se ve claro que la competencia del inglés Federico, lejos de dañificarme, me ha favorecido.Conque, mi querido</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En846Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En846Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En846Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Por donde se ve claro que la competencia del inglés Federico, lejos de dañificarme, me ha favorecido.</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Por donde se [v|ve|ver|rs] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] que la competencia del inglés Federico, lejos de dañificarme, me ha favorecido.</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En846Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>ve</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En846Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En847"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En847Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde247" /><gams:textualContent>cuartel del cuerpo de guardia y dejar expedito el camino.A pesar de su natural torpeza, esto lo vio claro , desde luego, el centinela ; así que ordenó con la mano al malojero que se parase y avanzó a paso de carga</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En847Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En847Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En847Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En847Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>A pesar de su natural torpeza, esto lo vio claro , desde luego, el centinela ;</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>A pesar de su natural torpeza, esto lo [v|vio|ver|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] , desde luego, [s|el centinela|ms] ;</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En847Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>el centinela</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En847Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vio</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En847Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En848"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En848Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde247" /><gams:textualContent> La carencia absoluta del alumbrado público, junto con la oscuridad de una noche sin luna, impedían ver claro los movimientos de los combatientes, no obstante la proximidad a que estaban del grupo espectador.Suponiendo que Dionisio</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En848Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En848Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En848Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En848Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> La carencia absoluta del alumbrado público, junto con la oscuridad de una noche sin luna, impedían ver claro los movimientos de los combatientes</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|La carencia absoluta del alumbrado público, junto con la oscuridad de una noche sin luna,|fp] impedían [v|ver|ver|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] los movimientos de los combatientes</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En848Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>La carencia absoluta del alumbrado público, junto con la oscuridad de una noche sin luna,</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En848Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>ver</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En848Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En849"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En849Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde247" /><gams:textualContent>, mucho más densa para  los ojos de los que le aguardaban y que del sobresalto no podían ver claro .Venía riente, ligero como un gamo, envainaba el cuchillo y se ponía el sombrero hecho trizas.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En849Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En849Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En849Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En849Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> los ojos de los que le aguardaban y que del sobresalto no podían ver claro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|los ojos|mp] de los que le aguardaban y que del sobresalto no podían [v|ver|ver|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En849Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>los ojos</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En849Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>ver</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En849Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En850"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En850Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde247" /><gams:textualContent> Ni Leonardo ni Diego se hallaban en aptitud de leer claro en semblante de sus amigas lo que pasaba en sus espíritus cuando llegó el momento de saludarse, según el</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En850Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En850Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En850Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En850Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Ni Leonardo ni Diego se hallaban en aptitud de leer claro en semblante de sus amigas lo que pasaba en sus espíritus</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Ni Leonardo ni Diego|mp] se hallaban en aptitud de [v|leer|leer|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] en semblante de sus amigas lo que pasaba en sus espíritus</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En850Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Ni Leonardo ni Diego</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En850Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>leer</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#leer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En850Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En851"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En851Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde247" /><gams:textualContent>—  Habla , canta claro , mulata de mis culpas —añadió alto Leonardo para que le oyese Cecilia si estaba en el aposento inmediato—</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En851Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En851Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En851Ph1Ve2" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En851Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Habla , canta claro , mulata de mis culpas</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|Habla|hablar|is] , [v|canta|cantar|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] , mulata de mis culpas</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En851Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>Habla</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En851Ph1Ve2"><aaif:text>canta</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cantar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En851Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En852"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En852Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde366" /><gams:textualContent>de disipar.Es tan extrardinariamente complicada la situación del Perú, que ni nosotros los santos podemos prever claro el porvenir.¡Cuántos elementos contrarios fermentando en un solo vaso!La-Fuente, Torrico, Vidal, Vivanco</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En852Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En852Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En852Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En852Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>ni nosotros los santos podemos prever claro el porvenir</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>ni [s|nosotros los santos|mp] podemos [v|prever|prever|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] el porvenir</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En852Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>nosotros los santos</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En852Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>prever</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#prever" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En852Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En853"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En853Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde367" /><gams:textualContent>del cortesano; en vano la incansable locura quiere prolongar por más tiempo su dominio;  sus adoradores  ven clara a la luz del sol su desencajada y mortecina faz...y envolviéndose avergonzados de sí mismos, en</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En853Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En853Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En853Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En853Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> sus adoradores  ven clara a la luz del sol su desencajada y mortecina faz</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|sus adoradores|mp]  [v|ven|ver|ts] [a|clara|claro|afonmnnn] a la luz del sol su desencajada y mortecina faz</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En853Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>sus adoradores</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En853Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>ven</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En853Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>clara</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FeminineSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En854"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En854Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde368" /><gams:textualContent>horrorizados porque apenas sabían a qué atribuir aquel repentino accidente, corrieron también contra la puerta.Entonces se vio claro lo que tales gritos arrancaba y tan grandes estragos hacía.Aquellos desdichados mal armados, morían abrasados bajo una</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En854Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En854Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En854Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Entonces se vio claro lo que tales gritos arrancaba y tan grandes estragos hacía.</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Entonces se [v|vio|ver|rs] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] lo que tales gritos arrancaba y tan grandes estragos hacía.</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En854Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vio</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En854Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En855"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En855Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde369" /><gams:textualContent>trabajar a causa del deterioro de mi salud y de la cortedad de mi vista; pero esta vez le hablaré claro , se lo diré todo, y no será tan desnaturalizado como muchos creen.¡Qué dicha la mía</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En855Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En855Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En855Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>pero esta vez le hablaré claro , se lo diré todo</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>pero esta vez le [v|hablaré|hablar|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] , se lo diré todo</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En855Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>hablaré</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En855Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En856"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En856Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde218" /><gams:textualContent>- Sí, pronto, no hay que perder un momento -mientras que Luisa, prendida del vestido de su señora, quería darla apoyo también para subir ligero.&lt;lb/&gt; Apenas habrían caminado dos minutos cuando una segunda descarga los paró maquinalmente a todos, haciéndoles volver la vista a la dirección que traía el sonido, y entonces percibieron claro , aunque a larga distancia, una súbita claridad en el río, y el sonido de otra descarga.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En856Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En856Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En856Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>entonces percibieron claro , aunque a larga distancia, una súbita claridad en el río</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>entonces [v|percibieron|percebir|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] , aunque a larga distancia, una súbita claridad en el río</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En856Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>percibieron</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#percebir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En856Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En857"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En857Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde218" /><gams:textualContent>presidente; porque si hemos de andar paso a paso, como el jefe de policía, es mejor que lo digamos claro , y no andemos engañando al Restaurador.Por mi parte, comandante, yo ya ni sé lo que es</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En857Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En857Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En857Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>es mejor que lo digamos claro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>es mejor que lo [v|digamos|decir|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En857Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>digamos</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#decir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En857Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En858"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En858Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde370" /><gams:textualContent>pasos a mi espalda, y volviéndome rápidamente, columbré —pues no puedo decir con verdad que las vi claro , aunque pasasen cerca de mí, según lo espeso de la neblina y lo pasajero de la aparición—</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En858Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En858Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En858Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>no puedo decir con verdad que las vi claro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>no puedo decir con verdad que las [v|vi|ver|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En858Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vi</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En858Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En859"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En859Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde371" /><gams:textualContent>¡ Habla  claro !Exclamó una voz.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En859Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En859Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En859Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>¡ Habla  claro !</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>¡ [v|Habla|hablar|is]  [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] !</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En859Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>Habla</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En859Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En860"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En860Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde282" /><gams:textualContent>Por lo que yo le contesté hoy, ya lo creo; pero es que no podía hablar claro  —dijo Agustín mirando a Rivas.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En860Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En860Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En860Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>es que no podía hablar claro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>es que no podía [v|hablar|hablar|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En860Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>hablar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En860Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En861"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En861Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde372" /><gams:textualContent>de nuestra relación, que, como ya habrán sospechado ustedes, y si no lo han sospechado lo verán claro más adelante, debía ser un magicazo de tomo y lomo, no satisfecho con haber trepado a la eminencia</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En861Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En861Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En861Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>si no lo han sospechado lo verán claro más adelante</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>si no lo han sospechado lo [v|verán|ver|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] más adelante</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En861Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>verán</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En861Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En862"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En862Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde373" /><gams:textualContent>el sol, deslumbra la luz de la felicidad.Nublado el cielo de mi dicha, todo lo vi claro y distinto .Recordé un sí ardiente como el amor y otro sí tibio como la gratitud*, únicamente</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En862Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En862Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En862Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En862Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text>todo lo vi claro y distinto .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>todo lo [v|vi|ver|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnC] y [a|distinto|distinto|auvnmnnC] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En862Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vi</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En862Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En862Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>distinto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#distinto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En863"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En863Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde373" /><gams:textualContent>Yorick Si te digo que ya empiezo a ver claro , que ya voy entendiendo todo.¿Ignoras quién es mi rival?Ayúdame a buscarlo.¿Será</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En863Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En863Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En863Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>ya empiezo a ver claro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>ya empiezo a [v|ver|ver|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En863Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>ver</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En863Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En864"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En864Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde374" /><gams:textualContent>Al llegar a las calles del pueblo, la sangre se me iba calentando; y  veía  claro en la obscuridad y oía bien.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En864Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En864Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En864Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> veía  claro en la obscuridad y oía bien.</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|veía|ver|is]  [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] en la obscuridad y oía bien.</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En864Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>veía</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En864Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En865"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En865Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde374" /><gams:textualContent>Recién comencé a ver claro y explicarme la actitud indiferente, reconcentrada, ceñuda de mi compadre durante toda la junta.A fuer de diplomático,</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En865Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En865Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En865Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Recién comencé a ver claro y explicarme la actitud indiferente</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Recién comencé a [v|ver|ver|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] y explicarme la actitud indiferente</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En865Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>ver</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En865Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En866"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En866Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde375" /><gams:textualContent>No, y no; que bien sé lo que digo; le oí decir clarito que es demócrata.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En866Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En866Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En866Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>le oí decir clarito que es demócrata.</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>le oí [v|decir|decir|ts] [a|clarito|claro|auvnmnnn] que es demócrata.</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En866Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>decir</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#decir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En866Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>clarito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En867"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En867Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde375" /><gams:textualContent>de hora despachó; y ví con el rabo del ojo la mano del padre Martinez y  oí  clarito clarito el ego te absolvo.— Ahora sí, dije, para mí, ya el diablo la llevó</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En867Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En867Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En867Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> oí  clarito clarito el ego te absolvo.</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|oí|oír|ts]  [a|clarito|claro|auvnmrnn] clarito el ego te absolvo.</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En867Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>oí</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#oír" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En867Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>clarito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En868"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En868Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde376" /><gams:textualContent>Y si eso juera, ¿por qué el otro día, hablando la Miruella de la mi hija con la mi sobrina Anestasia, la decía: “se empeñan en sanar a Juana curándola de la palotilla, y no es ésa la melecina que la conviene?”. Es decir, señor don Prefeuto, que la Miruella sabe la enfermedá de Juana, y conoce la melecina y tiene sastifación en verla morir, porque ni quiere descobrir la enfermedá, ni decir éste es el remedio. &lt;lb/&gt; - Lo que eso quiere decir, Teresa, es que  tía Bernarda tiene más sentido que tú, y conoce que es una barbaridad descoyuntar los huesos a las jóvenes porque están pálidas y macilentas, y ve claro que así no pueden sanar.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En868Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En868Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En868Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En868Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> tía Bernarda tiene más sentido que tú, y conoce que es una barbaridad descoyuntar los huesos a las jóvenes porque están pálidas y macilentas, y ve claro que así no pueden sanar.</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|tía Bernarda|fs] tiene más sentido que tú, y conoce que es una barbaridad descoyuntar los huesos a las jóvenes porque están pálidas y macilentas, y [v|ve|ver|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] que así no pueden sanar.</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En868Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>tía Bernarda</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En868Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>ve</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En868Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En869"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En869Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde376" /><gams:textualContent>augurios de la adivina y con el de las proposiciones de doña Rosaura.A veces temía algo que no veía claro , y medio se decidía a no asistir; pero las raras coincidencias de la víspera, aquellas promesas de</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En869Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En869Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En869Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>A veces temía algo que no veía claro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>A veces temía algo que no [v|veía|ver|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En869Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>veía</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En869Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En870"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En870Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde376" /><gams:textualContent>Pos si lo estipulara claro desde su descomienzo, buena habilidad sería dar con el ite.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En870Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En870Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En870Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>si lo estipulara claro desde su descomienzo, buena habilidad sería dar con el ite.</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>si lo [v|estipulara|estipular|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] desde su descomienzo, buena habilidad sería dar con el ite.</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En870Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>estipulara</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#estipular" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En870Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En871"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En871Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde377" /><gams:textualContent>libres de la manera más gloriosa; pero en el punto en que concluyó aquella hazaña, comenzó a verse claro el peligro en que nos encontrábamos, pues el Santa Ana debía ser remolcado hasta Cádiz, a causa del mal estado</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En871Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En871Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En871Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>comenzó a verse claro el peligro en que nos encontrábamos</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>comenzó a [v|verse|ver|rs] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] el peligro en que nos encontrábamos</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En871Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>verse</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En871Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En872"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En872Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde378" /><gams:textualContent>ve la cadera de los angelitos que bajan á buscar el alma de Fausto.Y á propósito, y hablando claro , nunca transigiré con los que hacen de la mujer la representación del demonio, pues me parecen descendientes</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En872Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En872Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En872Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>á propósito, y hablando claro ,</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>á propósito, y [v|hablando|hablar|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] ,</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En872Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>hablando</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En872Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En873"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En873Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde181" /><gams:textualContent>cabeza de la sombra de mujer desapareció un momento; hubo un silencio solemne y en medio de él sonó claro , casi estridente , el chasquido de un beso bilateral, después un chillido como el de Rosina en el</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En873Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En873Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En873Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En873Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text>hubo un silencio solemne y en medio de él sonó claro , casi estridente , el chasquido de un beso bilateral</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>hubo un silencio solemne y en medio de él [v|sonó|sonar|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnC] , casi [a|estridente|estridente|auvmmnnC] , el chasquido de un beso bilateral</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En873Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sonó</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#sonar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En873Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En873Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>estridente</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#estridente" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En874"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En874Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde181" /><gams:textualContent>; no sería jamás suya, eso no; ese verano ardiente no vendría, ni siquiera le consentiría hablarle claro , insistir en sus pretensiones; pero tenerle a su lado, sentirle quererla, adorarla, eso sí: </gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En874Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En874Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En874Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>ni siquiera le consentiría hablarle claro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>ni siquiera le consentiría [v|hablarle|hablar|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En874Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>hablarle</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En874Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En875"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En875Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde181" /><gams:textualContent> Petra tampoco veía claro .Estaba desorientada.La conducta de su ama le parecía propia de una loca.”¿A qué</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En875Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En875Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En875Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En875Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Petra tampoco veía claro .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Petra|fs] tampoco [v|veía|ver|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En875Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Petra</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En875Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>veía</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En875Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En876"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En876Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde181" /><gams:textualContent>y de beber regulares tragos, don Víctor sintió su pena con intensidad cuatro veces mayor.Todo lo veía claro , toda la trascendencia de su descubrimiento del amanecer se le aparecía como un tratado clásico de historia.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En876Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En876Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En876Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Todo lo veía claro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Todo lo [v|veía|ver|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En876Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>veía</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En876Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En877"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En877Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde181" /><gams:textualContent>En aquel momento estaba muy satisfecho de sí mismo el Magistral, porque acababa de ver claro .Ya sabía qué camino era el suyo.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En877Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En877Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En877Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>estaba muy satisfecho de sí mismo el Magistral, porque acababa de ver claro .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>estaba muy satisfecho de sí mismo el Magistral, porque acababa de [v|ver|ver|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En877Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>ver</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En877Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En878"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En878Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde379" /><gams:textualContent>primeros establecimientos de América, era por entonces un caos como organización interna.Cuando me incrusté bien y vi claro , comprendí que tris las sombras ostensibles de la vida claustral había des acommodements, no sólo con el cielo</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En878Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En878Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En878Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Cuando me incrusté bien y vi claro ,</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Cuando me incrusté bien y [v|vi|ver|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] ,</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En878Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vi</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En878Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En879"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En879Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde379" /><gams:textualContent>pero sí recuerdo que, aunque el honor quedó en salvo, salí de la arena mal acontecido, sin ver claro , con una variante en la forma nasal y un dedo de la mano derecha fuera de su posición normal</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En879Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En879Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En879Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>salí de la arena mal acontecido, sin ver claro ,</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>salí de la arena mal acontecido, sin [v|ver|ver|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] ,</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En879Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>ver</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En879Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En880"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En880Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde380" /><gams:textualContent>?...¿Qué es esto?¿Qué pasa aquí?...De ello nos ocuparemos cuando yo vea claro y sin dolor, que Dios quiera sea muy pronto.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En880Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En880Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En880Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En880Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>cuando yo vea claro y sin dolor</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>cuando [s|yo|us] [v|vea|ver|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnC] y sin dolor</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En880Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>yo</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Undefined" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En880Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vea</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En880Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En881"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En881Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde249" /><gams:textualContent>dar fondo en el momento oportuno; algún espectador creía distinguir caras conocidas sobre el puente; llegó a verse claro y distinto al piloto Sama, sobre el castillo de proa, con sus botas de agua, su</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En881Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En881Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En881Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En881Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text>llegó a verse claro y distinto al piloto Sama</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>llegó a [v|verse|ver|rs] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnC] y [a|distinto|distinto|auvnmnnC] al piloto Sama</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En881Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>verse</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En881Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En881Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>distinto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#distinto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En882"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En882Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde249" /><gams:textualContent>¡Ñules!...Y miá tú, chaquetín de la bodega, si quiés decir algo, lo dices claro y a la cara, y no escondío entre el porreto como los pulpes...* ¡ojo!</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En882Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En882Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En882Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>si quiés decir algo, lo dices claro y a la cara</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>si quiés decir algo, lo [v|dices|decir|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnC] y a la cara</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En882Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>dices</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#decir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En882Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En883"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En883Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde381" /><gams:textualContent>resistir aquella tirantez, se quebraría al fin, y moría también: pero lo que D. Manuelillo veía claro , era que moría de todos modos.Lo cual, ¡ay!fue verdad, cuatro años más</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En883Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En883Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En883Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En883Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>lo que D. Manuelillo veía claro , era que moría de todos modos</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>lo que [s|D. Manuelillo|ms] [v|veía|ver|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] , era que moría de todos modos</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En883Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>D. Manuelillo</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En883Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>veía</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En883Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En884"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En884Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde140" /><gams:textualContent>— Yo soy un pecador —replicó Julián— solamente que veo claro en este asunto y, por los favores que debo a usted, y el pan que le he comido</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En884Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En884Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En884Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>solamente que veo claro en este asunto</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>solamente que [v|veo|ver|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] en este asunto</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En884Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>veo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En884Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En885"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En885Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde140" /><gams:textualContent>—  Hable  claro : ¿usted piensa como el abad de San Clemente de Boán?Ese dice que a Suñer y a los revolucionarios no</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En885Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En885Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En885Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Hable  claro :</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|Hable|hablar|is]  [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] :</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En885Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>Hable</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En885Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En886"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En886Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde140" /><gams:textualContent>su misa con gran atención y minuciosidad en las ceremonias. El repique de la campanilla del acólito  resonaba claro y argentino en la vetusta capilla vacía.Oíanse fuera gorjeos de pájaros en los árboles del huerto,</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En886Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En886Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En886Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En886Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En886Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text> El repique de la campanilla del acólito  resonaba claro y argentino en la vetusta capilla vacía.</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|El repique de la campanilla del acólito|ms]  [v|resonaba|resonar|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnC] y [a|argentino|argentino|auvnmnnC] en la vetusta capilla vacía.</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En886Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>El repique de la campanilla del acólito</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En886Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>resonaba</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#resonar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En886Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En886Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>argentino</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#argentino" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">4</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En887"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En887Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde250" /><gams:textualContent>No bien cerró la noche me encaminé a casa de Pérez Gavilán, resuelto y determinado a hablarle claro, muy claro , sobre todo aquello y a exigirle que me dijese lo que pensaba, lo que haría</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En887Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En887Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En887Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>me encaminé a casa de Pérez Gavilán, resuelto y determinado a hablarle claro, muy claro , sobre todo aquello</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>me encaminé a casa de Pérez Gavilán, resuelto y determinado a [v|hablarle|hablar|is] claro, muy [a|claro|claro|auvmmrnn] , sobre todo aquello</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En887Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>hablarle</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En887Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En888"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En888Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde20" /><gams:textualContent>— No veo claro el peligro, hermano.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En888Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En888Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En888Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>No veo claro el peligro, hermano.</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>No [v|veo|ver|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] el peligro, hermano.</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En888Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>veo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En888Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En889"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En889Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde382" /><gams:textualContent>Estoy apenada con todo lo que nos pasa; tú me has hecho ver claro que la vida te desespera...</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En889Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En889Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En889Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>tú me has hecho ver claro que la vida te desespera</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>tú me has hecho [v|ver|ver|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] que la vida te desespera</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En889Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>ver</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En889Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En890"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En890Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde382" /><gams:textualContent>no tardó en saltar a la lengua, mojada por el puro de Majes, y aquí la de hablar claro de pe a pa.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En890Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En890Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En890Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>aquí la de hablar claro de pe a pa.</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>aquí la de [v|hablar|hablar|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] de pe a pa.</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En890Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>hablar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En890Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En891"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En891Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde382" /><gams:textualContent>tiene usted para qué darle a saber nada.Y, usando de nuestra antigua franqueza, voy a decirle claro a usted, mi don Sebastián: necesito de su brazo; he venido contando con usted.Esta Subprefectura</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En891Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En891Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En891Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>voy a decirle claro a usted</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>voy a [v|decirle|decir|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] a usted</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En891Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>decirle</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#decir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En891Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En892"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En892Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde382" /><gams:textualContent>¡Guá!¿Por qué no he de hablar claro  —continuó doña Petronila—, si don Fernando los conoce muchísimo y asimismo la señora Lucía?—y</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En892Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En892Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En892Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>¿Por qué no he de hablar claro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>¿Por qué no he de [v|hablar|hablar|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En892Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>hablar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En892Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En893"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En893Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde383" /><gams:textualContent>en ondas tenues del lecho, una gran cama de matrimonio, donde, cuando sus ojos pudieron ver claro , advirtió en la blancura de las sábanas un rostro casi de niña, coronado por el yelmo de bronce</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En893Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En893Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En893Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En893Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>cuando sus ojos pudieron ver claro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>cuando [s|sus ojos|mp] pudieron [v|ver|ver|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En893Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>sus ojos</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En893Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>ver</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En893Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En894"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En894Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde384" /><gams:textualContent>continuó Juan— es que no titubeas en decir mentiras para ocultar las faltas de ese hijo. Dilo  claro : mi hijo se emborrachó ayer domingo en el ventorrillo de Andújar; mi hijo estaba esta mañana imposible para</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En894Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En894Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En894Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Dilo  claro :</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|Dilo|decir|ts]  [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] :</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En894Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>Dilo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#decir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En894Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En895"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En895Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde384" /><gams:textualContent>en mí este movimiento de afecto; pero me hablas de las tormentas y las marejadas.Sí;  veo  claro .Mis hermanos flotan en las tormentas de un difícil renacimiento.¿Qué quisieran?Una patria libre, </gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En895Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En895Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En895Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> veo  claro .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|veo|ver|is]  [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En895Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>veo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En895Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En896"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En896Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde384" /><gams:textualContent>Si te prendían, ¿quién garantizaba la discreción de Silvina? Ella iría también a la cárcel, hablaría claro  y entonces le fastidiaría para siempre.El único partido aceptable era huir.Lejos, bien lejos.Y su</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En896Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En896Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En896Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En896Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Ella iría también a la cárcel, hablaría claro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Ella|fs] iría también a la cárcel, [v|hablaría|hablar|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En896Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Ella</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En896Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>hablaría</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En896Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En897"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En897Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde384" /><gams:textualContent>No veía claro , e inútilmente trataba de explicarse la intrincada urdimbre del crimen.De todos modos quedaba libre del</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En897Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En897Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En897Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>No veía claro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>No [v|veía|ver|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En897Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>veía</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En897Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En898"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En898Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde384" /><gams:textualContent>de todos le imponía un esfuerzo...Debía dejarse llevar por sus instintos, disponerse al sacrificio. Veía  claro lo que otros desconocían, explicábase lo que otros no acertaban a comprender.Su deber era preciso, indudable</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En898Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En898Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En898Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Veía  claro lo que otros desconocían,</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|Veía|ver|ts]  [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] lo que otros desconocían,</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En898Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>Veía</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En898Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En899"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En899Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde384" /><gams:textualContent>No vio claro  el juez en aquellos hechos coincidentes: precisamente en la tarde antes del atentado, Andújar sustraía sus valores</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En899Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En899Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En899Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En899Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>No vio claro  el juez en aquellos hechos coincidentes</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>No [v|vio|ver|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn]  [s|el juez|ms] en aquellos hechos coincidentes</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En899Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>el juez</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En899Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vio</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En899Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En900"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En900Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde384" /><gams:textualContent>Vamos, pater, hablemos claro : los convencionalismos místicos no conducen a ninguna parte.El culto se complace en la pompa hueca de sus</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En900Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En900Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En900Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Vamos, pater, hablemos claro :</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Vamos, pater, [v|hablemos|hablar|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] :</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En900Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>hablemos</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En900Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En901"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En901Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde220" /><gams:textualContent> Escribe  claro  el que concibe e imagina claro ; con vigor, quien con vigor piensa, por ser la lengua un</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En901Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En901Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En901Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En901Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Escribe  claro  el que concibe e imagina claro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|Escribe|escribir|is]  [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn]  [s|el que concibe e imagina claro|ms] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En901Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>el que concibe e imagina claro</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En901Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>Escribe</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#escribir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En901Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En902"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En902Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde220" /><gams:textualContent>Escribe claro  el que  concibe e imagina claro ; con vigor, quien con vigor piensa, por ser la lengua un</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En902Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En902Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En902Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En902Ph1Ve2" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En902Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> el que  concibe e imagina claro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|el que|ms]  [v|concibe|concebir|is] e [v|imagina|imaginar|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En902Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>el que</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En902Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>concibe</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#concebir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En902Ph1Ve2"><aaif:text>imagina</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#imaginar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En902Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">4</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En903"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En903Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde220" /><gams:textualContent>No le retenga al lector de seguirme la aparente incoherencia que aquí reina; espero que al fin de la jornada vea claro el hilo, y, además ¡es tan difícil y tan muerto alinear en fila lógica lo que se mueve</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En903Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En903Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En903Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>espero que al fin de la jornada vea claro el hilo</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>espero que al fin de la jornada [v|vea|ver|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] el hilo</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En903Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vea</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En903Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En904"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En904Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde385" /><gams:textualContent>Al verle entrar, demudado, con los ojos brillantes, y en ellos la mirada expresándose clara la grosería de los instintos, Solita palideció.Luego, con voz segura, con la entonación tranquila de</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En904Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En904Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En904Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En904Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>en ellos la mirada expresándose clara la grosería de los instintos</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>en ellos [s|la mirada|fs] [v|expresándose|expresar|rs] [a|clara|claro|afsnmnnn] la grosería de los instintos</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En904Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>la mirada</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En904Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>expresándose</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#expresar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En904Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>clara</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FeminineSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En905"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En905Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde386" /><gams:textualContent>de treinta años que infunden vigor nuevo y calientan la sangre; y por encima de todo eso está un analista que ve claro en sí mismo y que lleva sus contradictorios impulsos múltiples, armado de una voluntad de hierro, como llevaban</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En905Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En905Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En905Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>un analista que ve claro en sí mismo</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>un analista que [v|ve|ver|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] en sí mismo</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En905Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>ve</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En905Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En906"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En906Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde21" /><gams:textualContent>que se extienden encima y debajo, delante y detrás, fuera y dentro del nuestro,  sus ojos  veían claro , cuando veían, mismo como vosotras ver migo.Bueno: pues se le aparecieron dos ángeles, y</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En906Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En906Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En906Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En906Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> sus ojos  veían claro , cuando veían,</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|sus ojos|mp]  [v|veían|ver|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] , cuando veían,</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En906Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>sus ojos</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En906Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>veían</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En906Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En907"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En907Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde21" /><gams:textualContent>Mira, hija, yo te quiero mucho, y como señora tuya y amiga te aconsejo que le hables clarito , que le cuentes tus faltas y caídas.Así, el buen señor no se llamará a engaño,</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En907Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En907Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En907Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>te aconsejo que le hables clarito </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>te aconsejo que le [v|hables|hablar|is] [a|clarito|claro|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En907Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>hables</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En907Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>clarito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En908"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En908Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde21" /><gams:textualContent>Haga lo que yo, que me estoy donde estaba, y no dejaré mi trabajo hasta que no vea claro eso de la herencia, y me entere de lo que da de sí el cortijo.Quítele a su</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En908Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En908Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En908Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>hasta que no vea claro eso de la herencia</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>hasta que no [v|vea|ver|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] eso de la herencia</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En908Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vea</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En908Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En909"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En909Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde21" /><gams:textualContent>usted me lo afirma, lo creeré, y me curaré de esta maldita idea...Porque...lo digo claro : yo he pecado, yo soy mala...—Pues, hija, bien fácil es curarte.Yo</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En909Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En909Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En909Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>lo digo claro : yo he pecado, yo soy mala</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>lo [v|digo|decir|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] : yo he pecado, yo soy mala</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En909Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>digo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#decir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En909Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En910"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En910Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde113" /><gams:textualContent>Todo lo que has dicho —contestó Pío Cid— me ha complacido en extremo, y ahora veo claro por cuán naturales y sencillos caminos has llegado ser gobernador de esta provincia.Lo único que no me ha</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En910Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En910Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En910Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>ahora veo claro por cuán naturales y sencillos caminos has llegado</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>ahora [v|veo|ver|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] por cuán naturales y sencillos caminos has llegado</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En910Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>veo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En910Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En911"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En911Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde113" /><gams:textualContent>pagaba los vidrios rotos.Comenzaron los insultos, y vinieron después los golpes; al principio no hablaba claro , porque comprendía que no llevaba la razón; pero después su egoísmo se hizo tan brutal que a todas horas estaba</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En911Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En911Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En911Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>al principio no hablaba claro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>al principio no [v|hablaba|hablar|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En911Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>hablaba</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En911Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En912"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En912Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde113" /><gams:textualContent>reducen todos a un fenómeno único: la vibración del éter.Con el tiempo se llegará a ver claro que no hay éter ni tal vibración.Pero sin meternos en honduras, para que usted no se fatigue,</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En912Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En912Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En912Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Con el tiempo se llegará a ver claro que no hay éter ni tal vibración.</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Con el tiempo se llegará a [v|ver|ver|rs] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] que no hay éter ni tal vibración.</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En912Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>ver</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En912Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En913"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En913Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde221" /><gams:textualContent> El barquero  vió claro : lo que su nieto odiaba, con una repulsión instintiva que ponía de pie su voluntad, era el trabajo</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En913Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En913Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En913Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En913Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> El barquero  vió claro :</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|El barquero|ms]  [v|vió|ver|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] :</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En913Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>El barquero</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En913Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vió</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En913Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En914"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En914Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde221" /><gams:textualContent>, que volviese por más.No debía tener escrúpulos.¡A reventar al abuelo!Ya veía claro cuál era su porvenir en plena ancianidad: trabajar como un esclavo, para que el señor se diese la gran</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En914Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En914Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En914Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Ya veía claro cuál era su porvenir</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Ya [v|veía|ver|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] cuál era su porvenir</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En914Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>veía</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En914Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En915"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En915Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde115" /><gams:textualContent>daba ímpetus de saltar de su escondite, prorrumpir en insultos contra aquellas personas que parecían complacerse en no hablar claro , convenciéndolo así de la inutilidad del sacrificio que se había impuesto.Su ira se dirigía principalmente contra</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En915Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En915Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En915Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>contra aquellas personas que parecían complacerse en no hablar claro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>contra aquellas personas que parecían complacerse en no [v|hablar|hablar|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En915Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>hablar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En915Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En916"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En916Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde115" /><gams:textualContent>— ¿Qué paso, hombre? Habla , claro y déjate de enigmas, gritó con impaciencia Canalejas.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En916Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En916Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En916Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Habla , claro y déjate de enigmas</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|Habla|hablar|is] , [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] y déjate de enigmas</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En916Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>Habla</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En916Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En917"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En917Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde115" /><gams:textualContent>— Habla, habla claro , ¡por la Virgen Santísima!insistió ella.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En917Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En917Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En917Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Habla, habla claro , ¡por la Virgen Santísima!</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Habla, [v|habla|hablar|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] , ¡por la Virgen Santísima!</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En917Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>habla</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En917Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En918"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En918Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde25" /><gams:textualContent>mi habitación, al abrir, como siempre, la ventana, antes de mi aseo nocturno,  vi  claro mi arcano, y sufrí el primer acceso del mal que acabará conmigo</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En918Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En918Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En918Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> vi  claro mi arcano</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|vi|ver|ts]  [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] mi arcano</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En918Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vi</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En918Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En919"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En919Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde387" /><gams:textualContent>Sin meternos en estadísticas aparecerá claro que allá casi toda la población, indiferente a la política, se consagra a empresas de iniciativa libre, </gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En919Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En919Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En919Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Sin meternos en estadísticas aparecerá claro que allá casi toda la población, indiferente a la política, se consagra a empresas de iniciativa libre</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Sin meternos en estadísticas [v|aparecerá|aparecer|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] que allá casi toda la población, indiferente a la política, se consagra a empresas de iniciativa libre</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En919Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>aparecerá</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#aparecer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En919Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En920"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En920Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde388" /><gams:textualContent>Don Segismundo.Pues, ¿no lo ves claro , mujer?</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En920Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En920Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En920Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>¿no lo ves claro , mujer?</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>¿no lo [v|ves|ver|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] , mujer?</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En920Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>ves</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En920Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En921"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En921Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde389" /><gams:textualContent>No veo claro .Todo eso me parece poesía.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En921Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En921Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En921Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>No veo claro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>No [v|veo|ver|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En921Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>veo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En921Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En922"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En922Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde389" /><gams:textualContent>produce un fenómeno secundario, una fosforescencia cerebral, un reflejo, que es la inteligencia.Ya se ve claro en estos dos principios: vida y verdad, voluntad e inteligencia.*</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En922Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En922Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En922Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Ya se ve claro en estos dos principios</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Ya se [v|ve|ver|rs] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] en estos dos principios</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En922Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>ve</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En922Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En923"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En923Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde390" /><gams:textualContent>— Así, lealtad por lealtad.Y ahora, como debemos hablar claro , he de decirle que después de todo lo pasado y de cuanto le dije, no podría yo, </gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En923Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En923Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En923Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>como debemos hablar claro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>como debemos [v|hablar|hablar|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En923Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>hablar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En923Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En924"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En924Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde224" /><gams:textualContent>No te abandono, mujer.Te animo á ser valiente, á ver claro , á elegir el camino más corto para llegar al cielo, á desconfiar de la dicha que buscas</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En924Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En924Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En924Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Te animo á ser valiente, á ver claro ,</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Te animo á ser valiente, á [v|ver|ver|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] ,</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En924Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>ver</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En924Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En925"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En925Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde391" /><gams:textualContent>diferentes de presentarse; pero cada cual en su orden igualmente claras.No es solo lo que se ve claro .Con la misma claridad se nos ofrece la tercera dimensión de un cuerpo que las otras dos, y</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En925Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En925Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En925Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>No es solo lo que se ve claro .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>No es solo lo que se [v|ve|ver|rs] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En925Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>ve</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En925Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En926"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En926Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde391" /><gams:textualContent>una retina germánica.Pero esta vez la comparación decide en favor nuestro.Los mediterráneos, que no pensamos claro , vemos claro .Si desmontamos el complicado andamiaje conceptual de alegoría filosófica y teológica que forma la arquitectura de</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En926Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En926Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En926Ph1Ve2" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En926Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En926Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text>Los mediterráneos, que no pensamos claro , vemos claro .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Los mediterráneos, que no [v|pensamos|pensar|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] , [v|vemos|ver|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En926Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>pensamos</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#pensar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En926Ph1Ve2"><aaif:text>vemos</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En926Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En926Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">4</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En927"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En927Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde391" /><gams:textualContent>Esto me parece de una importancia suma para que veamos claro el sentido de la novela.Después de Homero fueron necesarios a Grecia muchos siglos hasta aceptar lo actual como</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En927Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En927Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En927Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>para que veamos claro el sentido de la novela</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>para que [v|veamos|ver|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] el sentido de la novela</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En927Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>veamos</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En927Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En928"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En928Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde391" /><gams:textualContent>Solo vemos claro que los poetas trágicos de Grecia nos hablan personalmente desde las máscaras de sus héroes.¿Cuándo hace esto</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En928Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En928Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En928Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Solo vemos claro que los poetas trágicos de Grecia nos hablan personalmente</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Solo [v|vemos|ver|ts] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] que los poetas trágicos de Grecia nos hablan personalmente</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En928Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vemos</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En928Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En929"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En929Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde392" /><gams:textualContent>pesadilla...Ya no me he vuelto a acordar de los ahorcados.Es de veras un balazo; lo oí clarito ...</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En929Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En929Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En929Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>lo oí clarito </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>lo [v|oí|oír|ts] [a|clarito|claro|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En929Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>oí</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#oír" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En929Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>clarito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En930"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En930Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde392" /><gams:textualContent> La voz se oyó clara y distinta en las inmediaciones.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En930Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En930Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En930Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En930Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En930Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text> La voz se oyó clara y distinta en las inmediaciones.</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|La voz|fs] se [v|oyó|oír|rs] [a|clara|claro|afsnmnnC] y [a|distinta|distinto|afsnmnnC] en las inmediaciones.</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En930Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>La voz</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En930Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>oyó</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#oír" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En930Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>clara</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FeminineSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En930Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>distinta</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#distinto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">4</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FeminineSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En931"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En931Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde392" /><gams:textualContent>, oficiales y a todos los superiores, sintió que de sus ojos caía hasta la última telaraña y  vio  claro el resultado final de la lucha.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En931Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En931Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En931Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> vio  claro el resultado final de la lucha</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|vio|ver|ts]  [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] el resultado final de la lucha</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En931Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vio</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En931Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En932"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En932Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde30" /><gams:textualContent>ruidos más leves de sus alas, de sus picos, como cuando, por el campo, se oye clara la palabra de alguno que va lejos...</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En932Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En932Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En932Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>se oye clara la palabra de alguno que va lejos</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>se [v|oye|oír|rs] [a|clara|claro|afonmnnn] la palabra de alguno que va lejos</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En932Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>oye</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#oír" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En932Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>clara</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FeminineSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En933"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En933Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde393" /><gams:textualContent>, ¡a ocho!me dijo usté dende la cocina, el jueves ya oscureciendo. Yo lo oyí clarito , y por eso jué que me ecedí a mercar seis reales.¡Y el trato es trato,</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En933Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En933Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En933Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En933Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Yo lo oyí clarito </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Yo|us] lo [v|oyí|oír|ts] [a|clarito|claro|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En933Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Yo</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Undefined" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En933Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>oyí</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#oír" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En933Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>clarito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En934"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En934Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde394" /><gams:textualContent>Sntiéndome generoso quise hablarle claro .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En934Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En934Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En934Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>quise hablarle claro </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>quise [v|hablarle|hablar|is] [a|claro|claro|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#