://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1098"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1098Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde392" /><gams:textualContent>La voz se oyó clara y distinta en las inmediaciones.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1098Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1098Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1098Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1098Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text>La voz se oyó clara y distinta en las inmediaciones.</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>La voz se [v|oyó|oír|rs] [a|clara|claro|afsnmnnC] y [a|distinta|distinto|afsnmnnC] en las inmediaciones.</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1098Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>oyó</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#oír" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1098Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>clara</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FeminineSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1098Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>distinta</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#distinto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FeminineSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1099"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1099Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde33" /><gams:textualContent>Hundió la frente ardorosa entre las manos ateridas y así permaneció largo rato, en silencio y sin pensamientos.Chisporroteó con más fuerza la llama de la lamparilla, ya para extinguirse, y a los oídos alucinados de doña Bárbara llegó clara y distinta esta frase : - Si quieres que él venga a ti, entrega tus obras.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1099Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1099Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1099Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1099Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1099Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text>a los oídos alucinados de doña Bárbara llegó clara y distinta esta frase :</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>a los oídos alucinados de doña Bárbara [v|llegó|llegar|is] [a|clara|claro|afsnmnnC] y [a|distinta|distinto|afsnmnnC] [s|esta frase|fs] :</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1099Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>esta frase</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">4</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1099Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>llegó</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#llegar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1099Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>clara</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#claro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FeminineSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1099Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>distinta</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#distinto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FeminineSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1100"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1100Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde137" /><gams:textualContent>chico enemigo &amp;&lt;lb/&gt;entre los otros muchos males en que caemos&lt;lb/&gt;conla saña / o yra / vno vee espeçial &lt;lb/&gt;quel sañoso cobdiciando penas&lt;lb/&gt;para otro dalas asi mesmo en lo qual&lt;lb/&gt;da logar de vengança a sus contrario</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1100Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1100Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1100Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1100Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>conla saña \/ o yra \/ vno vee espeçial &lt;lb\/&gt;quel sañoso cobdiciando penas</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>conla saña \/ o yra \/ [s|vno|ms] [v|vee|ver|ts] [a|espeçial|especial|auvnmnnn] &lt;lb\/&gt;quel sañoso cobdiciando penas</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1100Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>vno</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1100Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vee</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1100Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>espeçial</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#especial" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1101"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1101Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde19" /><gams:textualContent>su fama y refinan su gloria; y en el de Ricaurte la trompa del porvenir, que sonará estupenda , si el Nuevo Mundo da algun día un Tito Livio.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1101Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1101Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1101Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>en el de Ricaurte la trompa del porvenir, que sonará estupenda </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>en el de Ricaurte la trompa del porvenir, que [v|sonará|sonar|is] [a|estupenda|estupendo|afsnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1101Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sonará</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#sonar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1101Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>estupenda</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#estupendo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FeminineSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1102"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1102Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde49" /><gams:textualContent>llega nuevo, pero ya sabes, pasa como en todas partes, en cuanto te ambientas, lo puedes pasar estupendo .Dentro, claro está, de la limitación de una capital de provincia.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1102Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1102Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1102Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>en cuanto te ambientas, lo puedes pasar estupendo </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>en cuanto te ambientas, lo puedes [v|pasar|pasar|ts] [a|estupendo|estupendo|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1102Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>pasar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#pasar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1102Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>estupendo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#estupendo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1103"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1103Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde6" /><gams:textualContent>A otro que iba a tener que tocarle la cabeza era a Juan Lucas: acababa de enterarse de que el asunto continuaba en el colegio y estaba furioso.Resulta que ahora había que saludar a las monjas y agradecerles todo lo que hacían por sus hijos...Y luego esperar que terminaran de desayunar...Y que les tomaran más fotografías...Como si no les hubieran tomado ya suficientes...Susana, horrible, explicaba, pidiendo calma, y Susan le decía que ella sí estaba enterada de todo porque había leído la circular que le enviaron las madres.Gozaba, burlona: anoche él se pasó horas conversando con la embajadora de Chile, me toca vengarme.&lt;lb/&gt;- Darling, te voy a presentar a la Madre Superiora;cuéntale que tienes una tía monja en los Sagrados Corazones...Le vas a caer estupendo , darling...</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1103Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1103Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1103Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Le vas a caer estupendo , darling</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Le vas a [v|caer|caer|is] [a|estupendo|estupendo|ausnmnnn] , darling</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1103Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>caer</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1103Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>estupendo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#estupendo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1104"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1104Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde120" /><gams:textualContent>Y es que Octavia había regresado desde la escalera gritando que me adoraba y que por nada de este mundo me abandonaría mientras estuviera bajo tratamiento médico.No he conocido a nadie tan distinto a Inés como Octavia.Pero, en fin, eso no viene al caso aquí.En cambio sí viene al caso la forma en que colgué el teléfono.Si la analizamos, podremos deducir que incluso la suerte como que empezaba a acompañarme, gracias al Anafranil: Inés colgó primero, con violencia, yo después, y aunque lo hice también con violencia, ella no se enteró o sea que en nada la ofendí.Y Octavia, que regresaba adorándome a pesar de haberse sacado el alma en la escalera, me dijo que por fin estaba aprendiendo a defenderme y que así tenía que seguir colgándole al mundo entero menos a ella, realmente había colgado estupendo , según Octavia.Y me besó pésimo y perfecto por andar gritando al mismo tiempo que me adoraba</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1104Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1104Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1104Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>tenía que seguir colgándole al mundo entero menos a ella, realmente había colgado estupendo </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>tenía que seguir colgándole al mundo entero menos a ella, realmente [v|había colgado|colgar|is] [a|estupendo|estupendo|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1104Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>había colgado</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#colgar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1104Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>estupendo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#estupendo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1105"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1105Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde78" /><gams:textualContent>No me importa vivir menos —agregó luego, pasándose la lengua por los labios—.Lo estoy pasando estupendo .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1105Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1105Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1105Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Lo estoy pasando estupendo .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Lo estoy [v|pasando|pasar|ts] [a|estupendo|estupendo|auvnmnnn] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1105Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>pasando</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#pasar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1105Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>estupendo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#estupendo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1106"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1106Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde183" /><gams:textualContent>particularidad, ni certificarse que aquello fuesen amores; y esto todo se hacía porque tenían estos dos que hablaban estraño aviso y cuidado de todo lo que pasaban y llevaban tal arte en esto que sin mostrar estar recatados de</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1106Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1106Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1106Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>esto todo se hacía porque tenían estos dos que hablaban estraño aviso y cuidado de todo lo que pasaban</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>esto todo se hacía porque tenían estos dos que [v|hablaban|hablar|is] [a|estraño|extraño|auvnmnnn] aviso y cuidado de todo lo que pasaban</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1106Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>hablaban</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1106Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>estraño</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#extraño" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1107"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1107Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde442" /><gams:textualContent>Crujidos de cadenas, ayes y suspiros dentro.&lt;lb/&gt;¡Válgame Dios! ¿Qué ruido&lt;lb/&gt;es este que suena estraño ?&lt;lb/&gt;¿Estoy despierto, o dormido?&lt;lb/&gt;¿Engáñome o no me engaño?&lt;lb/&gt;Otra vez llega al oído</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1107Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1107Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1107Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>¿Qué ruido&lt;lb\/&gt;es este que suena estraño ?</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>¿Qué ruido&lt;lb\/&gt;es este que [v|suena|sonar|is] [a|estraño|extraño|auvnmnnn] ?</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1107Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>suena</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#sonar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1107Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>estraño</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#extraño" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1108"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1108Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde224" /><gams:textualContent>Y  aquel nombre, dulce y solemne, le suena extraño y nuevo , muy remoto . </gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1108Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1108Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1108Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1108Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1108Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1108Ph1Ad3" /><aaif:text> aquel nombre, dulce y solemne, le suena extraño y nuevo , muy remoto .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|aquel nombre, dulce y solemne,|ms] le [v|suena|sonar|is] [a|extraño|extraño|ausnmnnC] y [a|nuevo|nuevo|ausnmnnC] , muy [a|remoto|remoto|ausmmnnC] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1108Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>aquel nombre, dulce y solemne,</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1108Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>suena</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#sonar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1108Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>extraño</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#extraño" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1108Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>nuevo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#nuevo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">4</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1108Ph1Ad3"><aaif:text>remoto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#remoto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">5</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1109"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1109Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde48" /><gams:textualContent>y sutil ("y va por dentro, mano a la raíz de la lechuga"),  hablando  extraño en la crudeza existencial de la intemperie (puercos, palmas, lombriz, hija, cinta del sombrero</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1109Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1109Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1109Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> hablando  extraño en la crudeza existencial de la intemperie</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|hablando|hablar|is]  [a|extraño|extraño|auvnmnnn] en la crudeza existencial de la intemperie</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1109Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>hablando</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1109Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>extraño</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#extraño" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1110"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1110Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde260" /><gams:textualContent>Pero aun ese nombre sonaría extraño para él. No hizo ningún gesto. No hizo caso. Siguió andando lentamente, como si además de</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1110Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1110Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1110Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1110Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Pero aun ese nombre sonaría extraño para él</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Pero aun [s|ese nombre|ms] [v|sonaría|sonar|is] [a|extraño|extraño|ausnmnnn] para él</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1110Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>ese nombre</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1110Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sonaría</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#sonar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1110Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>extraño</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#extraño" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1111"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1111Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde6" /><gams:textualContent>en Londres nadie me ha vuelto a llamar así, sólo mami en sus cartas, ya hasta me suena extraño , Cinthia, será terrible separarse de ti, Susan, no llores, Cinthia, lloro siempre, soy</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1111Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1111Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1111Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>hasta me suena extraño </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>hasta me [v|suena|sonar|is] [a|extraño|extraño|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1111Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>suena</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#sonar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1111Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>extraño</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#extraño" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1112"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1112Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde264" /><gams:textualContent>M. sobre esa aparición, y ahora pienso que fue natural.  Lo que en cambio se me ocurre extraño es que jamás le hablara en los años que siguieron, no sólo sobre aquel encuentro sino sobre los que</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1112Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1112Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1112Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1112Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Lo que en cambio se me ocurre extraño es que jamás le hablara</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Lo que|ms] en cambio se me [v|ocurre|ocurrir|is] [a|extraño|extraño|ausnmnnn] es que jamás le hablara</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1112Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Lo que</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1112Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>ocurre</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ocurrir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1112Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>extraño</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#extraño" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1113"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1113Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde76" /><gams:textualContent>¿Qué pasaría?, se preguntaba. ¿Qué significaba aquella repentina irrupción a media noche?  Ellos  olían extraño , a peligro, a desesperación.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1113Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1113Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1113Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1113Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Ellos  olían extraño , a peligro, a desesperación.</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Ellos|mp]  [v|olían|oler|is] [a|extraño|extraño|auvnmnnC] , a peligro, a desesperación.</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1113Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Ellos</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1113Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>olían</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#oler" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1113Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>extraño</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#extraño" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1114"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1114Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde443" /><gams:textualContent>Y lo que musitó después en la atormentada noche,&lt;lb/&gt;Añadiendo  un nombre que en la cabina sonaba extraño &lt;lb/&gt;Como una flor de otro planeta.&lt;lb/&gt;¿Y podrá creer que la playa maravillosa,&lt;lb/&gt;Con su cadera de</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1114Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1114Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1114Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1114Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> un nombre que en la cabina sonaba extraño </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|un nombre|ms] que en la cabina [v|sonaba|sonar|is] [a|extraño|extraño|ausnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1114Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>un nombre</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1114Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sonaba</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#sonar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1114Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>extraño</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#extraño" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1115"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1115Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde136" /><gams:textualContent>Esposo.  La palabra  sonaba extraña .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1115Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1115Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1115Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1115Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> La palabra  sonaba extraña .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|La palabra|fs]  [v|sonaba|sonar|is] [a|extraña|extraño|afsnmnnn] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1115Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>La palabra</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1115Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sonaba</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#sonar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1115Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>extraña</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#extraño" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FeminineSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1116"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1116Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde49" /><gams:textualContent>mis espirtus, pensando que la vían, &lt;lb/&gt; se mueven y se encienden sin medida; &lt;lb/&gt; mas no hallando fácil el camino &lt;lb/&gt; que los suyos entrando derretían &lt;lb/&gt; revientan por salir do no hay salida.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1116Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1116Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1116Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>mas no hallando fácil el camino</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>mas no [v|hallando|hallar|ts] [a|fácil|fácil|auvnmnnn] el camino</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1116Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>hallando</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hallar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1116Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fácil</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fácil" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1117"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1117Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde416" /><gams:textualContent>Problema es muy preguntado (no solamente de la gente docta y sabia, pero aun los hombres vulgares han caído ya en la cuenta y lo ponen cada día en cuestión) qué sea la razón y causa que en siendo un teólogo grande hombre de escuelas, * en disputar agudo , en responder fácil , en escrebir y leer de admirable doctrina, y subido en un púlpito no sabe predicar;y por lo contrario , en saliendo galano * predicador, elocuente, gracioso y que se lleva la gente tras sí, por maravilla * sabe mucha teología escolástica.Por donde no admiten por buena consecuencia: "Fulano es gran teólogo escolástico, luego será gran predicador";ni quieren conceder al revés: "Es gran predicador, luego sabe mucha teología escolásatica";porque, para deshacer la una consecuencia y la otra, se le ofrecerán a cualquiera más instancias que cabellos tenga en la cabeza.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1117Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1117Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1117Ph1Ve2" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1117Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1117Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text>siendo un teólogo grande hombre de escuelas, * en disputar agudo , en responder fácil , en escrebir y leer de admirable doctrina</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>siendo un teólogo grande hombre de escuelas, * en [v|disputar|disputar|is] [a|agudo|agudo|auvnmnnn] , en [v|responder|responder|is] [a|fácil|fácil|auvnmnnn] , en escrebir y leer de admirable doctrina</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1117Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>disputar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#disputar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1117Ph1Ve2"><aaif:text>responder</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#responder" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1117Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>agudo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#agudo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1117Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>fácil</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fácil" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">4</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1118"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1118Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde317" /><gams:textualContent>que tanto le atormenta.Los religiosos entendieron que por ser el hombre tan poderoso, no auian de hallar facil el remedio.Acordaron de dar parte de sus agrauios al buen Rey D.Henrique el tercero, que</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1118Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1118Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1118Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Los religiosos entendieron que por ser el hombre tan poderoso, no auian de hallar facil el remedio.</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Los religiosos entendieron que por ser el hombre tan poderoso, no auian de [v|hallar|hallar|ts] [a|facil|fácil|auvnmnnn] el remedio.</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1118Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>hallar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hallar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1118Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>facil</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fácil" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1119"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1119Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde317" /><gams:textualContent>l fin passada la ocasion passase mucho.Anduuo algunos dias reboluiendo en su fantasia como vengarse, no hallando facil el camino, y resfriandose el enojo, y la passion, cayò en la cuenta, dio lugar a</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1119Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1119Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1119Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Anduuo algunos dias reboluiendo en su fantasia como vengarse, no hallando facil el camino</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Anduuo algunos dias reboluiendo en su fantasia como vengarse, no [v|hallando|hallar|ts] [a|facil|fácil|auonmnnn] el camino</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1119Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>hallando</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hallar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1119Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>facil</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fácil" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1120"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1120Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde110" /><gams:textualContent>la sombra dilataba, &lt;lb/&gt; por ella Ulises a la margen vino, &lt;lb/&gt; donde la puerta habitación mostraba; &lt;lb/&gt; y  señalando fácil el camino &lt;lb/&gt; que el arena entre céspedes formaba, &lt;lb/&gt; a Euríloco mandó, sabio y valiente, &lt;lb/&gt; que el verde</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1120Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1120Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1120Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>y  señalando fácil el camino &lt;lb\/&gt; que el arena entre céspedes formaba</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>y  [v|señalando|señalar|ts] [a|fácil|fácil|auonmnnn] el camino &lt;lb\/&gt; que el arena entre céspedes formaba</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1120Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>señalando</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#señalar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1120Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fácil</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fácil" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1121"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1121Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde280" /><gams:textualContent>10.Ninguna verdadera virtud quiso ser ija del vicio, ni de la violencia el valor, como tan noble, no puede reconocer padre tan ruin: y como libre;no puede ser ija de la esclavitud, ni vivir forzada.Es hierro pesado, querer con hierros atar el alma.Podrá la violencia, y no sin trabajo, aprisionar para el mal las manos: mas no podrá atar la voluntad al amor del bien, ni menos soltar el corazón para seguir la razón.El pecho umano, dize Séneca, es por su naturaleza contumaz, y forzeja siempre con corage a lo vedado: sigue fácil ; mas no se deja sin mucha dificultad arrastrar: Naturâ contumax humanus animus, et in contrarium arduum nitens</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1121Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1121Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1121Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>El pecho umano, dize Séneca, es por su naturaleza contumaz, y forzeja siempre con corage a lo vedado: sigue fácil </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>El pecho umano, dize Séneca, es por su naturaleza contumaz, y forzeja siempre con corage a lo vedado: [v|sigue|seguir|is] [a|fácil|fácil|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1121Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sigue</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#seguir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1121Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fácil</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fácil" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1122"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1122Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde280" /><gams:textualContent>padre: Pater peccavi in Coelum, et coram te: Luc.15. 18. Y assí perdonó fácil  el Señor al que le avía urtado diez mil talentos: Misertus Dominus servi illius dimissit eum, et debitum</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1122Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1122Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1122Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1122Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Y assí perdonó fácil  el Señor al que le avía urtado diez mil talentos</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Y assí [v|perdonó|perdonar|ts] [a|fácil|fácil|auvnmnnn]  [s|el Señor|ms] al que le avía urtado diez mil talentos</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1122Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>el Señor</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1122Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>perdonó</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#perdonar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1122Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fácil</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fácil" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1123"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1123Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde215" /><gams:textualContent>Éste no ha visto a los héroes como son en sí, sino como se los han querido representar, ya sea por ignorancia del comediante o por conveniencia del poeta.No nos engañemos contra nosotros mismos: la comedia es copia de hombres regulares y comunes; la tragedia, verdadero retrato de almas grandes, conque, por más que tenga el comediante llena la imaginación de ideas, nunca podrá expresar exactamente ambas pinturas, al modo que  el pincel más diestro raras o ninguna vez corre fácil y arreglado en uno y en otro género.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1123Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1123Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1123Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1123Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1123Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text> el pincel más diestro raras o ninguna vez corre fácil y arreglado en uno y en otro género</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|el pincel más diestro|ms] raras o ninguna vez [v|corre|correr|is] [a|fácil|fácil|auvnmnnC] y [a|arreglado|arreglado|auvnmnnC] en uno y en otro género</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1123Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>el pincel más diestro</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1123Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>corre</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#correr" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1123Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fácil</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fácil" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1123Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>arreglado</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#arreglado" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">4</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1124"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1124Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde13" /><gams:textualContent>indecentes modos &lt;lb/&gt; De plaza en plaza la plebeya risa.&lt;lb/&gt; Culta y civil se muestre en sus gracejos: &lt;lb/&gt;  Suéltese  facil  su dificil nudo : &lt;lb/&gt; Guíela el juicio á que jamas incauta &lt;lb/&gt; Caiga en escena de interes vacia: &lt;lb/&gt; Su llano</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1124Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1124Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1124Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1124Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Suéltese  facil  su dificil nudo </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|Suéltese|soltar|rs]  [a|facil|fácil|auvnmnnn]  [s|su dificil nudo|ms] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1124Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>su dificil nudo</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1124Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>Suéltese</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#soltar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1124Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>facil</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fácil" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1125"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1125Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde417" /><gams:textualContent>de tu docta lima, &lt;lb/&gt; fáciles versos.&lt;lb/&gt; &lt;lb/&gt; Ese que duermes en ebúrnea cuna &lt;lb/&gt; pequeño infante.&lt;lb/&gt; &lt;lb/&gt; Esta que inspiró fácil  Talía  &lt;lb/&gt; moral lección...&lt;lb/&gt; &lt;lb/&gt; Esta que ves llegar máquina lenta.&lt;lb/&gt; &lt;lb/&gt; ...La de cisnes cándidos tirada &lt;lb/&gt; concha de Venus</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1125Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1125Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1125Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1125Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Esta que inspiró fácil  Talía </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Esta que [v|inspiró|inspirar|ts] [a|fácil|fácil|auvnmnnn]  [s|Talía|fs] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1125Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Talía</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1125Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>inspiró</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#inspirar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1125Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fácil</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fácil" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1126"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1126Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde418" /><gams:textualContent>Espero, pues, Señor Ministro, que el Gobierno del Perú se prestará fácil y justo a esta solicitud, y que se dignará dar las órdenes convenientes para que se nos entreguen los restos</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1126Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1126Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1126Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1126Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1126Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text>Espero, pues, Señor Ministro, que el Gobierno del Perú se prestará fácil y justo a esta solicitud</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Espero, pues, Señor Ministro, que [s|el Gobierno del Perú|ms] se [v|prestará|prestar|rs] [a|fácil|fácil|ausnmnnC] y [a|justo|justo|ausnmnnC] a esta solicitud</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1126Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>el Gobierno del Perú</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1126Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>prestará</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#prestar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1126Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fácil</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fácil" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1126Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>justo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#justo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">4</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1127"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1127Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde227" /><gams:textualContent>, los doctrinarios.A mí no me sorprende.Cuando veo que hacia un hombre o grupo se dirige fácil e insistente  el aplauso , surge en mí la vehemente sospecha de que en ese hombre o en ese grupo</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1127Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1127Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1127Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1127Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1127Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text>Cuando veo que hacia un hombre o grupo se dirige fácil e insistente  el aplauso </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Cuando veo que hacia un hombre o grupo se [v|dirige|dirigir|rs] [a|fácil|fácil|auvnmnnC] e [a|insistente|insistente|auvnmnnC]  [s|el aplauso|ms] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1127Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>el aplauso</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">4</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1127Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>dirige</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#dirigir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1127Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fácil</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fácil" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1127Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>insistente</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#insistente" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1128"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1128Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde41" /><gams:textualContent>— Eso es muy fácil, tío; vea,  nosotros podemos hallarlo facilito  y luego si salimos a pedir limosna con el Santo, por aldeas y hatos; yo sé que nayde</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1128Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1128Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1128Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1128Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> nosotros podemos hallarlo facilito </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|nosotros|mp] podemos [v|hallarlo|hallar|ts] [a|facilito|fácil|auonmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1128Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>nosotros</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1128Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>hallarlo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hallar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1128Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>facilito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fácil" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1129"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1129Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde406" /><gams:textualContent>— Tres mil pesetas te las presta fácil .Las vas a estar pagando toda la vida, pero te las presta fácil.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1129Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1129Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1129Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Tres mil pesetas te las presta fácil .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Tres mil pesetas te las [v|presta|prestar|ts] [a|fácil|fácil|auvnmnnn] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1129Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>presta</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#prestar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1129Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fácil</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fácil" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1130"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1130Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde176" /><gams:textualContent>en equis tiempo, ¿no me comprende?Y así seguir vendiendo cada vez más. Eso se explica fácil .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1130Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1130Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1130Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1130Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Eso se explica fácil .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Eso|ms] se [v|explica|explicar|rs] [a|fácil|fácil|auvnmnnn] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1130Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Eso</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1130Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>explica</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#explicar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1130Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fácil</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fácil" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1131"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1131Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde176" /><gams:textualContent>-Eduardo, pues verás...-reflexionaba-.Sí, hombre, hay ese otro que le llaman Dúa, ¿no es Eduardo de nombre ése también?&lt;lb/&gt; -Ah, sí, es verdad, ya salió otro, mira.Vamos, que de pila también se llama Eduardo, ¿no me entiendes?, no es más que le dicen de esta otra manera, o sea como un apodo, ya sabes tú la gente, o incluso los mismos familiares; de Eduardo, pues Dúa, se saca fácil .&lt;lb/&gt; -Pues como no sea éste, no sé yo cuál más.¿Cómo hace aquél de apellido, tú te acuerdas?</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1131Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1131Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1131Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>o sea como un apodo, ya sabes tú la gente, o incluso los mismos familiares; de Eduardo, pues Dúa, se saca fácil .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>o sea como un apodo, ya sabes tú la gente, o incluso los mismos familiares; de Eduardo, pues Dúa, se [v|saca|sacar|rs] [a|fácil|fácil|auvnmnnn] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1131Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>saca</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#sacar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1131Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fácil</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fácil" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1132"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1132Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde1" /><gams:textualContent>noches deformadas por la ciudad, noches de aprendizaje en la triquiñuela, noches en que los caminos se abrían fáciles  y las aristas eran limadas por la solicitud y el engaño a sabiendas y la justificación tácita.Peldaño de Feliciano Sánchez</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1132Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1132Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1132Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1132Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>noches en que los caminos se abrían fáciles </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>noches en que [s|los caminos|mp] se [v|abrían|abrir|rs] [a|fáciles|fácil|apsnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1132Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>los caminos</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1132Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>abrían</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#abrir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1132Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fáciles</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fácil" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#MasculinePlural" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1133"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1133Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde48" /><gams:textualContent> Las décimas que se enhebraban fáciles en los frescos cantares del Cucalambé, que cristalizaron en el Trópico de Florit y cogieron gustosa voluta en</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1133Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1133Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1133Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1133Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Las décimas que se enhebraban fáciles en los frescos cantares del Cucalambé</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Las décimas|fp] que se [v|enhebraban|enhebrar|rs] [a|fáciles|fácil|apsnmnnn] en los frescos cantares del Cucalambé</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1133Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Las décimas</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1133Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>enhebraban</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#enhebrar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1133Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fáciles</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fácil" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#MasculinePlural" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1134"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1134Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde117" /><gams:textualContent>- ¡Sí, "Markask'a"!-grité-.¡Que venga doña Felipa!Un hombre que está llorando, porque desde antiguo le zurran en la cara, sin causa, puede enfurecerse más que un toro que oye dinamitazos, que siente el pico del cóndor en su cogote.¡Vamos a la calle, "Markask'a"!¡Vamos a Huanupata!&lt;lb/&gt; Antero me miró largo rato.Sus lunares tenían como brillo.Sus ojos negrísimos se hundían en mí.—  Yo , hermano, si los indios se levantaran, los iría matando , fácil  —dijo.- ¡No te entiendo, Antero!-le contesté, espantado-.¿Y lo que has dicho que llorabas?&lt;lb/&gt; - Lloraba.¿Quién no?Pero a los indios hay que sujetarlos bien.Tú no puedes entender, porque no eres dueño.¡Vamos a Condebamba, mejor!</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1134Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1134Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1134Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1134Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Yo , hermano, si los indios se levantaran, los iría matando , fácil </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Yo|ms] , hermano, si los indios se levantaran, los [v|iría matando|matar|ts] , [a|fácil|fácil|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1134Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Yo</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1134Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>iría matando</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#matar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1134Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fácil</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fácil" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1135"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1135Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde261" /><gams:textualContent>, casi preferiría no tener vestíbulo, ¿ves?, se echaría a perder. Un apartamento se arregla fácil .Ya verás.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1135Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1135Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1135Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1135Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Un apartamento se arregla fácil .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Un apartamento|ms] se [v|arregla|arreglar|rs] [a|fácil|fácil|auvnmnnn] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1135Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Un apartamento</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1135Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>arregla</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#arreglar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1135Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fácil</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fácil" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1136"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1136Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde119" /><gams:textualContent>el viento en contra, escapan gateando.«— Demasiado calor» —comenta el alférez—, « prende fácil ».El pueblo parecía después un incendio con las casas negras y huecas («Nadie, nadie»</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1136Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1136Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1136Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>«— Demasiado calor» —comenta el alférez—, « prende fácil </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>«— Demasiado calor» —comenta el alférez—, « [v|prende|prender|is] [a|fácil|fácil|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1136Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>prende</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#prender" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1136Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fácil</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fácil" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1137"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1137Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde419" /><gams:textualContent>, cuñao, &lt;lb/&gt; que a veces por una tuna &lt;lb/&gt; se nublen noches de luna &lt;lb/&gt; y cielitos estrellaos.&lt;lb/&gt;  Una canción  sale fácil &lt;lb/&gt; cuando uno quiere cantar.&lt;lb/&gt; Cuestión de ver y pensar &lt;lb/&gt; sobre las cosas del mundo.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1137Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1137Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1137Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1137Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Una canción  sale fácil &lt;lb\/&gt; cuando uno quiere cantar.</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Una canción|fs]  [v|sale|salir|is] [a|fácil|fácil|auvnmnnn] &lt;lb\/&gt; cuando uno quiere cantar.</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1137Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Una canción</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1137Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sale</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#salir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1137Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fácil</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fácil" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1138"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1138Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde420" /><gams:textualContent>Justicia y en él aparecía un artículo de Domingo Pajarito de Soto relativo a la empresa Savolta. Las ideas  brotaron fáciles , arrolladoras .En menos de una hora todo estaba programado y decidido.Lepprince consultó con Víctor Pratz y éste</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1138Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1138Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1138Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1138Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1138Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text> Las ideas  brotaron fáciles , arrolladoras .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Las ideas|fp]  [v|brotaron|brotar|is] [a|fáciles|fácil|axsnmnnC] , [a|arrolladoras|arrollador|axsnmnnC] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1138Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Las ideas</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1138Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>brotaron</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#brotar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1138Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fáciles</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fácil" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FemininePlural" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1138Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>arrolladoras</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#arrollador" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">4</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FemininePlural" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1139"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1139Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde61" /><gams:textualContent>, por esa zona que los porteños llaman la City.Le costaba caminar; andaba lento , se cansaba fácil .Le costaba pero quería, y parecía bastante contento, aunque decía que no reconocía las calles y los</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1139Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1139Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1139Ph1Ve2" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1139Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1139Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text>Le costaba caminar; andaba lento , se cansaba fácil .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Le costaba caminar; [v|andaba|andar|is] [a|lento|lento|auvnmnnn] , se [v|cansaba|cansar|rs] [a|fácil|fácil|auvnmnnn] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1139Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>andaba</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#andar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1139Ph1Ve2"><aaif:text>cansaba</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cansar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1139Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>lento</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#lento" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1139Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>fácil</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fácil" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">4</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1140"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1140Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde266" /><gams:textualContent>, y apartar lentamente la mano y decirle que no, mejor no, sabes, aquí vas a encontrar fácil , es un gran cruce, y la osezna acatando como bruscamente golpeada y lejana, comiéndose cara abajo los</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1140Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1140Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1140Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>aquí vas a encontrar fácil , es un gran cruce</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>aquí vas a [v|encontrar|encontrar|is] [a|fácil|fácil|auvnmnnn] , es un gran cruce</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1140Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>encontrar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#encontrar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1140Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fácil</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fácil" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1141"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1141Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde3" /><gams:textualContent>historia como un fundador de cinco repúblicas independientes, porque la soberanía nacional se ha quebrantado.  Esto se dice fácil , como si no tuviera trascendencia.Es un terreno apartado, nadie va a ir por allá.No</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1141Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1141Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1141Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1141Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Esto se dice fácil , como si no tuviera trascendencia</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Esto|ms] se [v|dice|decir|rs] [a|fácil|fácil|auvnmnnn] , como si no tuviera trascendencia</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1141Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Esto</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1141Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>dice</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#decir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1141Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fácil</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fácil" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1142"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1142Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde189" /><gams:textualContent>y avanzar por la Quinta Avenida, blanca y silenciosa y brillante y más viva que nunca.Un deslizarse fácil , como si no hubiera posibilidad alguna de caída.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1142Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1142Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1142Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Un deslizarse fácil , como si no hubiera posibilidad alguna de caída</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Un [v|deslizarse|deslizar|rs] [a|fácil|fácil|auvnmnnn] , como si no hubiera posibilidad alguna de caída</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1142Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>deslizarse</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#deslizar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1142Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fácil</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fácil" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1143"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1143Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde79" /><gams:textualContent>hasta el sótano y pregunta por Berenjena Avalos —dijo Francisco—.Si no, ¿sabes cómo llegas facilito ?Sigue el olor a pezuña y llegas derecho.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1143Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1143Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1143Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>¿sabes cómo llegas facilito ?</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>¿sabes cómo [v|llegas|llegar|is] [a|facilito|fácil|auvnmnnn] ?</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1143Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>llegas</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#llegar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1143Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>facilito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fácil" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1144"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1144Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde79" /><gams:textualContent>— Hay que entrar entonces —dijo el Tigre—.Hay que forzar la puerta.&lt;lb/&gt; — Sí, maestro —dijo Aliaga—. Esa puerta se rompe fácil .&lt;lb/&gt; — ¿Se puede?—le preguntó el Tigre a Miguel Romero.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1144Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1144Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1144Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1144Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Esa puerta se rompe fácil .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Esa puerta|fs] se [v|rompe|romper|rs] [a|fácil|fácil|auvnmnnn] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1144Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Esa puerta</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1144Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>rompe</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#romper" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1144Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fácil</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fácil" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1145"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1145Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde421" /><gams:textualContent>Stabile de Génova, al Maly Teatr de Moscú, al Piraikón de Atenas.¡Se dice fácil !Es quizás el único entretenimiento que no me produce remordimientos; la escena me fascina, me da temas</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1145Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1145Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1145Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>¡Se dice fácil !</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>¡Se [v|dice|decir|rs] [a|fácil|fácil|auvnmnnn] !</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1145Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>dice</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#decir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1145Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fácil</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fácil" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1146"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1146Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde272" /><gams:textualContent>No había ascensor y tuvo que llevarla alzada por las escaleras hasta el tercer piso, y luego encontró fácil la puerta.La depositó en la cama dando un suspiro de alivio.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1146Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1146Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1146Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>luego encontró fácil la puerta</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>luego [v|encontró|encontrar|ts] [a|fácil|fácil|auvnmnnn] la puerta</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1146Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>encontró</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#encontrar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1146Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fácil</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fácil" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1147"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1147Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde422" /><gams:textualContent>ocurrió la travesura romántica de desempolvar el violín para acompañarla, aunque le faltaba una cuerda. Ella se acopló fácil a su estilo de madrugada romántica, y tocó mejor que nunca, hasta que lo miró complacida por encima del hombro</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1147Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1147Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1147Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1147Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Ella se acopló fácil a su estilo de madrugada romántica</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Ella|fs] se [v|acopló|acoplar|rs] [a|fácil|fácil|auvnmnnn] a su estilo de madrugada romántica</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1147Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Ella</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1147Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>acopló</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#acoplar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1147Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fácil</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fácil" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1148"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1148Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde87" /><gams:textualContent>no podría condenarlo.El abogado Fernández, colega de presidio, le había enseñado la fórmula mágica para librarse fácil del castigo.Si lo agarraban tendría que alegar «hurto famélico»: «Robé comida porque de</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1148Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1148Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1148Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>la fórmula mágica para librarse fácil del castigo</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>la fórmula mágica para [v|librarse|liberar|rs] [a|fácil|fácil|auvnmnnn] del castigo</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1148Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>librarse</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#liberar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1148Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fácil</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fácil" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1149"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1149Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde174" /><gams:textualContent>en tu cadencia,&lt;lb/&gt;igual es tu tristeza con la mía.&lt;lb/&gt;Ya miras á Amphion con qué paciencia&lt;lb/&gt; canta  fatal , atento , y á porfía&lt;lb/&gt;Orfeo con su Laud giro, á giro&lt;lb/&gt;lo que es respirazion buelbe en suspiro</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1149Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1149Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1149Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1149Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text>Ya miras á Amphion con qué paciencia&lt;lb\/&gt; canta  fatal , atento ,</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Ya miras á Amphion con qué paciencia&lt;lb\/&gt; [v|canta|cantar|is]  [a|fatal|fatal|auvnmnnC] , [a|atento|atento|auvnmnnC] ,</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1149Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>canta</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cantar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1149Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fatal</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fatal" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1149Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>atento</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#atento" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1150"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1150Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde13" /><gams:textualContent>Y ¡ay!que si el dia fue funesto y duro,&lt;lb/&gt;Aun mas la noche se enlutó fatal .&lt;lb/&gt;¡Noche terrible, al angustiado padre&lt;lb/&gt;Buscando el hijo que en su hogar faltó!&lt;lb/&gt;¡Noche</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1150Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1150Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1150Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1150Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Aun mas la noche se enlutó fatal </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Aun mas [s|la noche|fs] se [v|enlutó|enlutar|rs] [a|fatal|fatal|ausnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1150Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>la noche</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1150Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>enlutó</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#enlutar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1150Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fatal</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fatal" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1151"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1151Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde175" /><gams:textualContent>es trágico...&lt;lb/&gt;El violín está triste habla mil vaguedades&lt;lb/&gt;Que el piano profundiza con nobles gravedades...&lt;lb/&gt; Encarna  fatal la evocación del lirio...&lt;lb/&gt;&lt;lb/&gt;Violín amoroso parece un gran delirio;&lt;lb/&gt;Onda azul entrañando no sé qué tempestades</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1151Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1151Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1151Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Encarna  fatal la evocación del lirio</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|Encarna|encarnar|ts]  [a|fatal|fatal|auvnmnnn] la evocación del lirio</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1151Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>Encarna</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#encarnar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1151Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fatal</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fatal" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1152"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1152Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde176" /><gams:textualContent>-Lástima de no habernos traído una máquina de retratar.&lt;lb/&gt;-Mira, es verdad.Mi hermano tiene la Boy que se trajo de Marruecos.&lt;lb/&gt;-Se te podía haber ocurrido el pedírsela.&lt;lb/&gt;-También digo.&lt;lb/&gt;-No me acordé.Si es que sacó un par de carretes, mucho entusiasmo con ella los primeros diez días, y luego la ha metido en un cajón y ya ni sabe que la tiene.&lt;lb/&gt;-Pues para eso...&lt;lb/&gt;-Estos del minuto es tirar el dinero.Te sacan fatal .&lt;lb/&gt;-Éstos ni hablar, por supuesto.Pero llevarse unas fotitos de los días así que se sale de jira, es una cosa que está bien.Luego al cabo del tiempo gusta verlas;mira fulano la cara tonto que tenía, y te ríes un rato...</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1152Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1152Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1152Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Te sacan fatal .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Te [v|sacan|sacar|ts] [a|fatal|fatal|ausnmnnn] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1152Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sacan</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#sacar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1152Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fatal</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fatal" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1153"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1153Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde49" /><gams:textualContent>pero me dió las gracias sin nada de apuro.Me dijo que a ella las matemáticas se le dan fatal .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1153Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1153Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1153Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1153Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Me dijo que a ella las matemáticas se le dan fatal .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Me dijo que a ella [s|las matemáticas|fp] se le [v|dan|dar|is] [a|fatal|fatal|auvnmnnn] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1153Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>las matemáticas</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1153Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>dan</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#dar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1153Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fatal</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fatal" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1154"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1154Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde53" /><gams:textualContent>leyenda dorada de un progresismo mal entendido: el compañerismo por narices, sin barreras de clases— lo pasara fatal .Por otra parte, esta confianza que le dispensaba su señorita extrañaba a muchos, por lo menos al principio.Incluso</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1154Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1154Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1154Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>lo pasara fatal .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>lo [v|pasara|pasar|ts] [a|fatal|fatal|auvnmnnn] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1154Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>pasara</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#pasar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1154Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fatal</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fatal" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1155"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1155Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde178" /><gams:textualContent>Pero, nena, en Suiza hace muchísimo frío.Todo está lleno de nieve.Lo vas a pasar fatal ...</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1155Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1155Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1155Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Lo vas a pasar fatal </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Lo vas a [v|pasar|pasar|ts] [a|fatal|fatal|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1155Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>pasar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#pasar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1155Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fatal</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fatal" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1156"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1156Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde58" /><gams:textualContent>, que es de lo más carísimo, nadie se explica que encuentre cosas de tan mal gusto. Viste  fatal .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1156Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1156Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1156Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Viste  fatal .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|Viste|vestir|is]  [a|fatal|fatal|auvnmnnn] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1156Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>Viste</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vestir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1156Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fatal</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fatal" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1157"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1157Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde180" /><gams:textualContent>con que se rindió el indio, sino en una comedia cruel, la misma que yo inventé y volví fatal con mis mentiras.El joven emperador fue el rey de burlas, arrastrado sin pies por la carroza d</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1157Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1157Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1157Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>una comedia cruel, la misma que yo inventé y volví fatal con mis mentiras</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>una comedia cruel, la misma que yo inventé y [v|volví|volver|is] [a|fatal|fatal|auvnmnnn] con mis mentiras</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1157Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>volví</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#volver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1157Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fatal</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fatal" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1158"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1158Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde435" /><gams:textualContent>avería a esto alguna escusaçión, et non la fallé, et menbróme el dicho de  un omne que comía feo et era tragón, et dixéronle que comía mal et feo, et él dixo: — Así comían mis</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1158Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1158Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1158Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1158Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> un omne que comía feo et era tragón</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|un omne|ms] que [v|comía|comer|is] [a|feo|feo|auvnmnnn] et era tragón</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1158Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>un omne</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1158Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>comía</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#comer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1158Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>feo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#feo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1159"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1159Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde435" /><gams:textualContent>et dixéronle que comía mal et feo , et él dixo: — Así comían mis</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1159Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1159Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1159Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>dixéronle que comía mal et feo </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>dixéronle que [v|comía|comer|is] mal et [a|feo|feo|auvnmnnC] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1159Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>comía</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#comer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1159Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>feo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#feo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1160"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1160Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde436" /><gams:textualContent>en vuestra dureza e tema patrimonial queredes estar, e queredes seer como  vno que le preguntaron que por que comia feo , e el respondio que asy comia su padre, sy a este señor queredes conplazer e seruir, dexando</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1160Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1160Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1160Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1160Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> vno que le preguntaron que por que comia feo , e el respondio que asy comia su padre</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|vno|ms] que le preguntaron que por que [v|comia|comer|is] [a|feo|feo|auvnmnnn] , e el respondio que asy comia su padre</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1160Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>vno</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1160Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>comia</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#comer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1160Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>feo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#feo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1161"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1161Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde147" /><gams:textualContent>ver mis manos ni lo que hacían.Bien dicen que el amor es ciego, no sólo porque ama feo , sino porque aquello en quien él pone su blanco le ciega, para que piense que el engaño es gozo</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1161Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1161Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1161Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>el amor es ciego, no sólo porque ama feo </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>el amor es ciego, no sólo porque [v|ama|amar|is] [a|feo|feo|auonmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1161Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>ama</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#amar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1161Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>feo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#feo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1162"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1162Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde382" /><gams:textualContent>— ¡Caracoles!¡ Esto  huele feo ...!No hay más remedio que asegurarse, sí señor...¿A ver, alcalde...?¡</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1162Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1162Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1162Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1162Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Esto  huele feo </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Esto|ms]  [v|huele|oler|is] [a|feo|feo|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1162Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Esto</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1162Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>huele</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#oler" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1162Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>feo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#feo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1163"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1163Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde253" /><gams:textualContent>El otro se quedó medio corrido, y como pensó que le podía ir feo , quiso mejor arreglar el asunto por las buenas:</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1163Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1163Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1163Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>como pensó que le podía ir feo , quiso mejor arreglar el asunto por las buenas</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>como pensó que le podía [v|ir|ir|is] [a|feo|feo|auvnmnnn] , quiso mejor arreglar el asunto por las buenas</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1163Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>ir</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1163Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>feo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#feo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1164"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1164Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde256" /><gams:textualContent>conosco, lo vide bajar a tres domadores y tamién a mi cuñau Sabana, que es jinetazo. Corcovea  feo .Pero con las nasarenas y charqueando un poco...</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1164Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1164Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1164Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Corcovea  feo </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|Corcovea|corcovear|is]  [a|feo|feo|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1164Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>Corcovea</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#corcovear" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1164Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>feo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#feo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1165"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1165Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde256" /><gams:textualContent>— Entonses no tengo perdón de Dios —y reía—.Estás errando feo la picada, rubio.Soy ansina, dada y dicharachera con todos, pero no hago nadita por engatusarlos</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1165Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1165Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1165Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Estás errando feo la picada</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Estás [v|errando|errar|ts] [a|feo|feo|auvnmnnn] la picada</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1165Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>errando</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#errar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1165Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>feo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#feo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1166"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1166Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde256" /><gams:textualContent>— Si hubiera sido el pampa me aventa lejos. Ése sí se hamaca feo .La ves pasada se rompiba los dientes contra el suelo en cada corcovo.No al ñudo basureó</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1166Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1166Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1166Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1166Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Ése sí se hamaca feo </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Ése|ms] sí se [v|hamaca|hamacar|rs] [a|feo|feo|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1166Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Ése</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1166Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>hamaca</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hamacar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1166Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>feo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#feo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1167"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1167Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde256" /><gams:textualContent>levantando la mano derecha como los corredores, y luego volviendo a su posición confesó—, pero se sentó feo ...</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1167Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1167Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1167Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>pero se sentó feo ...</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>pero se [v|sentó|sentar|rs] [a|feo|feo|auvnmnnn] ...</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1167Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sentó</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#sentar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1167Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>feo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#feo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1168"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1168Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde256" /><gams:textualContent>— No hubo delito en sacarle las alhajas.Yo hubiera hecho igual.Pero la erró feo en no desirles nada a los compañeros.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1168Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1168Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1168Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Pero la erró feo en no desirles nada</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Pero la [v|erró|errar|ts] [a|feo|feo|auvnmnnn] en no desirles nada</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1168Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>erró</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#errar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1168Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>feo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#feo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1169"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1169Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde256" /><gams:textualContent>nos llevaron de calle hasta la mesma puerta del patrón.Y él sin oír.Ai la vimos feo .De un repente la puerta se abrió de par en par y aparesió de espada, esa espada que tiene pa' no</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1169Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1169Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1169Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Ai la vimos feo </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Ai la [v|vimos|ver|ts] [a|feo|feo|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1169Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vimos</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1169Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>feo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#feo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1170"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1170Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde401" /><gams:textualContent>sin mediar motivo pa que lo haga, la mula corcovea y lo tumba.Se sujetó bien, pero respingaba feo la condenada.Y yo le digo de usté tovía, que no teníamos amistá: "Don Onofre, </gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1170Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1170Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1170Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Se sujetó bien, pero respingaba feo la condenada</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Se sujetó bien, pero [v|respingaba|respingar|is] [a|feo|feo|auvnmnnn] la condenada</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1170Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>respingaba</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#respingar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1170Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>feo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#feo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1171"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1171Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde116" /><gams:textualContent>el tipo con el guante por los ojos, pucha me daba una bronca.Al final lo fajé feo , me dejó un claro y lo entré con unas ganas...Muñeco al suelo, pibe.Muñeco</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1171Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1171Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1171Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Al final lo fajé feo </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Al final lo [v|fajé|fajar|ts] [a|feo|feo|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1171Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>fajé</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fajar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1171Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>feo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#feo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1172"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1172Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde404" /><gams:textualContent> El Tiburcio Mena se puso color de apazote, * sudó feo  y esa misma noche recogió sus cosas del campamento y desapareció.Mejor ido que muerto.Pablo Pirir ya</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1172Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1172Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1172Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1172Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> El Tiburcio Mena se puso color de apazote, * sudó feo </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|El Tiburcio Mena|ms] se puso color de apazote, * [v|sudó|sudar|is] [a|feo|feo|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1172Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>El Tiburcio Mena</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1172Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sudó</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#sudar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1172Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>feo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#feo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1173"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1173Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde1" /><gams:textualContent>brazos cruzados, a que el agua hirviera: — Podías haber muerto satisfaciendo una necesidad colectiva, " mirando  feo ", dándole gusto a todos.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1173Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1173Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1173Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Podías haber muerto satisfaciendo una necesidad colectiva, \" mirando  feo \", dándole gusto a todos</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Podías haber muerto satisfaciendo una necesidad colectiva, \" [v|mirando|mirar|is]  [a|feo|feo|auvnmnnn] \", dándole gusto a todos</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1173Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>mirando</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mirar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1173Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>feo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#feo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1174"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1174Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde1" /><gams:textualContent>En la esquina de La Libertad encontraron una cantina y entraron pateando las escupideras de cobre y mirando feo a los demás clientes hasta encontrar una mesita de mármol.El tequila comenzó a correr.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1174Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1174Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1174Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>entraron pateando las escupideras de cobre y mirando feo a los demás clientes</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>entraron pateando las escupideras de cobre y [v|mirando|mirar|ts] [a|feo|feo|auvnmnnn] a los demás clientes</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1174Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>mirando</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mirar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1174Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>feo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#feo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1175"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1175Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde117" /><gams:textualContent>Gerardo.¿No le ves sus ojos?¿Son acaso como de un cristiano?Lo has insultado feo .Los guardias te pueden llevar lejos y te pueden degollar.En un rato te comerían los perros y</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1175Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1175Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1175Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Lo has insultado feo </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Lo [v|has insultado|insultar|ts] [a|feo|feo|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1175Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>has insultado</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#insultar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1175Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>feo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#feo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1176"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1176Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde51" /><gams:textualContent>No podía;no te escapes, patito, venga, venga.Le tiene miedo, lo está mirando feo , le muestra el rabo, miren, decía el muy maldito.Pero era verdad que me picoteaba los</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1176Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1176Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1176Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>lo está mirando feo </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>lo está [v|mirando|mirar|ts] [a|feo|feo|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1176Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>mirando</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mirar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1176Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>feo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#feo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1177"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1177Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde57" /><gams:textualContent>por ti.Bueno.Ahórrame las últimas imágenes.Tendría necesariamente que llamarte pelele, y eso siempre suena feo .Pero es un hecho que el ajusticiado cae siempre al suelo como un pelele.A partir de</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1177Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1177Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1177Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1177Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Tendría necesariamente que llamarte pelele, y eso siempre suena feo </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Tendría necesariamente que llamarte pelele, y [s|eso|ms] siempre [v|suena|sonar|is] [a|feo|feo|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1177Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>eso</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1177Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>suena</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#sonar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1177Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>feo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#feo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1178"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1178Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde179" /><gams:textualContent>hicimos?En el lavabo deshicimos los cigarros que encontramos en el coche de Mauricio, los encendimos y olía feo, muy feo .La Vestida de Hombre le dio unas fumadas a uno y todo se llenó de humo</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1178Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1178Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1178Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>deshicimos los cigarros que encontramos en el coche de Mauricio, los encendimos y olía feo, muy feo </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>deshicimos los cigarros que encontramos en el coche de Mauricio, los encendimos y [v|olía|oler|is] feo, muy [a|feo|feo|auvmmrnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1178Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>olía</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#oler" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1178Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>feo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#feo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1179"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1179Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde79" /><gams:textualContent>encanta porque nunca mira los billetes que le echo a su canastita, no como  otros malcriados que me miran feo si les echo un billetito chico.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1179Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1179Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1179Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1179Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> otros malcriados que me miran feo si les echo un billetito chico</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|otros malcriados|mp] que me [v|miran|mirar|ts] [a|feo|feo|auvnmnnn] si les echo un billetito chico</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1179Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>otros malcriados</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1179Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>miran</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mirar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1179Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>feo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#feo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1180"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1180Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde79" /><gams:textualContent>eso mi departamentito lo compré en un segundo piso —dijo Patty—.A mí la altura me choca feo .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1180Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1180Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1180Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1180Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>A mí la altura me choca feo .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>A mí [s|la altura|fs] me [v|choca|chocar|ts] [a|feo|feo|auvnmnnn] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1180Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>la altura</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1180Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>choca</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#chocar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1180Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>feo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#feo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1181"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1181Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde79" /><gams:textualContent> Patty  miró feo a su jefe y salió de la oficina.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1181Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1181Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1181Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1181Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Patty  miró feo a su jefe</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Patty|fs]  [v|miró|mirar|ts] [a|feo|feo|auvnmnnn] a su jefe</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1181Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Patty</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1181Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>miró</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mirar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1181Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>feo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#feo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1182"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1182Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde79" /><gams:textualContent> Doña Inés  mira feo a su esposo y trata de meter el billete verde en la canastita.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1182Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1182Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1182Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1182Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Doña Inés  mira feo a su esposo y trata de meter el billete verde en la canastita.</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Doña Inés|fs]  [v|mira|mirar|ts] [a|feo|feo|auvnmnnn] a su esposo y trata de meter el billete verde en la canastita.</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1182Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Doña Inés</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1182Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>mira</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mirar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1182Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>feo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#feo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1183"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1183Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde79" /><gams:textualContent>y trata de meter sus dolaritos para cumplir con San Felipe, pero  don Rafael no la deja, la agarra fuerte y la mira bien feo  y le dice otra vez:</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1183Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1183Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1183Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1183Ph1Ve2" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1183Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1183Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text> don Rafael no la deja, la agarra fuerte y la mira bien feo </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|don Rafael|ms] no la deja, la [v|agarra|agarrar|ts] [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvnmnnn] y la [v|mira|mirar|ts] bien [a|feo|feo|auvmmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1183Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>don Rafael</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1183Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>agarra</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#agarrar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1183Ph1Ve2"><aaif:text>mira</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mirar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">4</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1183Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1183Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>feo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#feo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">5</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1184"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1184Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde438" /><gams:textualContent>Otrosy deseca(n) el falcon quando es ferido &lt;lb/&gt;enel cuerpo &amp; non es curado como deue &amp; &lt;lb/&gt;de cada dia sele gasta el cuerpo &amp; despues que &lt;lb/&gt;el falcon comjença a dessecar aun que coma non &lt;lb/&gt;le aprouech(n)a njn tiene fuerça ensy &amp; verlo has &lt;lb/&gt;triste &amp; apretado &amp; sacudesse floxo  E non tira &lt;lb/&gt;njn despluma &amp; gastasele la carne E al comjenço &lt;lb/&gt;desta dolençia le deues acorrer.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1184Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1184Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1184Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>aun que coma non &lt;lb\/&gt;le aprouech(n)a njn tiene fuerça ensy &amp; verlo has &lt;lb\/&gt;triste &amp; apretado &amp; sacudesse floxo </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>aun que coma non &lt;lb\/&gt;le aprouech(n)a njn tiene fuerça ensy &amp; verlo has &lt;lb\/&gt;triste &amp; apretado &amp; [v|sacudesse|sacudir|is] [a|floxo|flojo|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1184Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sacudesse</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#sacudir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1184Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>floxo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#flojo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1185"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1185Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde401" /><gams:textualContent>—  Entra  flojo , nadie dirá nada.Así se llega acá...</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1185Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1185Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1185Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Entra  flojo </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|Entra|entrar|is]  [a|flojo|flojo|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1185Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>Entra</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#entrar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1185Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>flojo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#flojo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1186"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1186Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde48" /><gams:textualContent>da la impresión de un profundo cansancio.Las cuerdas mejores se han roto; las que quedan , suenan flojas o destempladas .Las energías líricas del país, reflejo del estado del alma nacional, parecen</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1186Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1186Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1186Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1186Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1186Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text> las que quedan , suenan flojas o destempladas </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|las que quedan|fp] , [v|suenan|sonar|is] [a|flojas|flojo|axsnmnnC] o [a|destempladas|destemplado|axsnmnnC] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1186Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>las que quedan</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1186Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>suenan</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#sonar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1186Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>flojas</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#flojo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FemininePlural" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1186Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>destempladas</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#destemplado" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">4</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FemininePlural" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1187"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1187Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde187" /><gams:textualContent>la luz temblona de una vela rescataba algunos objetos. Las sombras blandas de los barrotes del catre  bailaban flojas sobre el muro donde santos desteñidos bendecían el tiempo agotado de calendarios pretéritos y del puntero único del</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1187Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1187Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1187Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1187Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Las sombras blandas de los barrotes del catre  bailaban flojas sobre el muro</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Las sombras blandas de los barrotes del catre|fp]  [v|bailaban|bailar|is] [a|flojas|flojo|axsnmnnn] sobre el muro</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1187Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Las sombras blandas de los barrotes del catre</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1187Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>bailaban</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bailar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1187Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>flojas</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#flojo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FemininePlural" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1188"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1188Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde58" /><gams:textualContent>— No seas tonta, muchacha — el párpado izquierdo le caía flojo —.¿Quién se ha dejado la barra de labios?</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1188Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1188Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1188Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1188Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> el párpado izquierdo le caía flojo </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|el párpado izquierdo|ms] le [v|caía|caer|is] [a|flojo|flojo|ausnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1188Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>el párpado izquierdo</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1188Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>caía</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1188Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>flojo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#flojo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1189"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1189Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde67" /><gams:textualContent>Por dicha el gato existe y viene, pero además a ellos les entra flojo que yo los siga, en el fondo soy un gato perdido que se parece a un perro, de</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1189Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1189Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1189Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>a ellos les entra flojo que yo los siga</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>a ellos les [v|entra|entrar|ts] [a|flojo|flojo|auvnmnnn] que yo los siga</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1189Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>entra</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#entrar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1189Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>flojo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#flojo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1190"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1190Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde270" /><gams:textualContent>de los hombros, todavía dorados desde el verano, contrastando con la blancura de los tirantes que caían , flojos , a los lados, y avanzó la lengua hasta el cuello ("torre de marfil, edificada como</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1190Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1190Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1190Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>los tirantes que caían , flojos , a los lados</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>los tirantes que [v|caían|caer|is] , [a|flojos|flojos|apsnmnnn] , a los lados</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1190Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>caían</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1190Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>flojos</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#flojos" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#MasculinePlural" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1191"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1191Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde124" /><gams:textualContent>e todo ello es remenbrança e sygna que todos los omnes vengan a penitençia.E esta jubilaçion faziase con cuerno de carnero en remenbrança que en tal dia como este fizo nuestro padre Abraham sacrifiçio del su fijo Ysach, e le enbio Dios el carnero que por su fijo ofreçiese; assy quel misterio del dia de la jubilaçion va syguiente con el misterio del dia de los perdones, e non es dubda que quien verdadera mente contracto e bien penitente fuere, e a Dios como desçimo e prima causa fallare e de el non se partiere, que este angelical quedara, e todos los sus pecados que perdonados le seran.Desy vase el testo a contar la fiesta de las cabanuelas.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1191Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1191Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1191Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>assy quel misterio del dia de la jubilaçion va syguiente con el misterio del dia de los perdones</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>assy quel misterio del dia de la jubilaçion [v|va|ir|is] [a|syguiente|siguiente|auSntnnn] con el misterio del dia de los perdones</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1191Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>va</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1191Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>syguiente</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#siguiente" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Sentence" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Time" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1192"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1192Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde124" /><gams:textualContent>En quanto a lo primero, dizen que dizian Israel, teniendo en merçed al Señor Dios aquellas conssolaçiones fasta aqui mençionadas: este Dios de Israhel, dize el Senado de Israhel, costunbrado es de sienpre me tener en acuçia de grande preuidençia e de grande clemençia, caridat e misiricordia, e desde lueñe, desdel tienpo de los santos padres Abraharn, Ysach e Jacob, se aparesçio el Señor a mi con infinido bien.Por Dios, este gradesçimiento oydo a Israel, respondeles: ¡o, los mis fijos!, por ninguna tribulaçion en que vos veades non cayades en desesperaçion, que amor e caridat perpetua te yo ame, e por tanto te yo tendy e segui la mi misericordia, e avn te yo edeficare como por sienpre / edeficada seas.E va siguiente los bienes que en ellos con la venida del rey Mexias auerian.E en quanto a lo segundo, dizen que se salua el propheta e dize que, como Dios es inuisibile, inconprehendible, que fallaua en sy mismo falta, que las propheçias que las non auia tan claras e manifiestas como el queria, nin sabia en la esençia diuina, tanto que lo que ende sabe omne non se llame segund el poco conprehender del entendimiento humano de lueñe, que ya deximos en los Canticos e en otros muchos logares quantas sçiençias conuiene al omne saber esençial mente ante que llege a algo entender en la esençia diuina;</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1192Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1192Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1192Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>E va siguiente los bienes que en ellos con la venida del rey Mexias auerian</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>E [v|va|ir|ts] [a|siguiente|siguiente|auSntnnn] los bienes que en ellos con la venida del rey Mexias auerian</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1192Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>va</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1192Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>siguiente</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#siguiente" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Sentence" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Time" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1193"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1193Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde124" /><gams:textualContent>que las dos terçias partes seran perdidos e muertos, e quedara en la otra terçia parte.E dize siguiente : e aduzire la tenia parte en fuego, quasy diga, que seran avn con de cabo puestos en</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1193Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1193Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1193Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>E dize siguiente </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>E [v|dize|decir|ts] [a|siguiente|siguiente|auSntnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1193Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>dize</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#decir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1193Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>siguiente</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#siguiente" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Sentence" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Time" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1194"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1194Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde124" /><gams:textualContent>Si la ha ¿por qual razon los justos han mal?e por contra, sy non la ha, luego esta el negocio peor; mas es çierto que ha la acuçia en el regimiento; e destas premissas se vos leuanta a vos vna falssa consequençia, conuiene a saber: lo que pone el testo, que quantos mal fazen son buenos delante del Señor, e que pues bien les faze, en ellos ha voluntad, e de ellos le plaze.E dezides: sy asy es como los prophetas dizen ¿que es del Dios del juyzio?e estas tales habusiones inclinan e mueuen a los omnes a grandes eregias.&lt;lb/&gt;E la respuesta desta quistion pone siguiente .Ahe que vos yo enbiare el mi angel, etc.(27) &lt;lb/&gt;El propheta responde a este sobredicho proceso que oystes, e dize asy: dos cosas vos mueven a vosotros feliçiar e bien dezir del mal: vna, la poca fe que vos auedes en la vida del otro mundo, que non creedes auerla.Segunda, que non veedes proçeder luego el bien nin el mal, e esto vos faze enduresçer.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1194Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1194Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1194Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>la respuesta desta quistion pone siguiente </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>la respuesta desta quistion [v|pone|poner|ts] [a|siguiente|siguiente|auSntnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1194Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>pone</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#poner" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1194Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>siguiente</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#siguiente" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Sentence" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Time" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1195"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1195Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde124" /><gams:textualContent> Dize  syguiente a lo que de suso deximos, que el seso humano e aquella tabla rasa que viene muy tarde e a vagar en su perfecçion, bien asy como viene el fructo del açipres en las viñas de Engedy.E Engedy era vn monte Engedy en el tribu de Juda, e los fructos de los montes vienen mas tarde;pero es vna cosa que, dado el fructo, es muy noble, fermoso e odifero, e tienese mucho tienpo, lo qual non fazen los otros fructos;e tal es la alma, que desque llega en su perfecçion el su fructo es que es puesta en sempiterna gloria.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1195Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1195Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1195Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Dize  syguiente a lo que de suso deximos</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|Dize|decir|ts]  [a|syguiente|siguiente|auSntnnn] a lo que de suso deximos</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1195Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>Dize</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#decir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1195Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>syguiente</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#siguiente" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Sentence" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Time" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1196"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1196Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde124" /><gams:textualContent>Spiritu Santo las mis palabras sean dichas en los mis libros fasta aqui, pero en estas cosas que oyredes syguientes adelante, me fallo muy falto e torpe e non tengo prudençia de omnes, e non aprendy sçiençia nin</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1196Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1196Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1196Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>estas cosas que oyredes syguientes adelante</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>estas cosas que [v|oyredes|oír|ts] [a|syguientes|siguiente|apSntnnn] adelante</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1196Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>oyredes</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#oír" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1196Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>syguientes</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#siguiente" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#MasculinePlural" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Sentence" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Time" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1197"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1197Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde124" /><gams:textualContent>E esto es lo que dixo siguiente en el parrafo 2: non pujes sobre las sus palabras, (310) quasy diga;non pujes</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1197Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1197Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1197Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>E esto es lo que dixo siguiente en el parrafo 2</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>E esto es lo que [v|dixo|decir|ts] [a|siguiente|siguiente|auSntnnn] en el parrafo 2</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1197Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>dixo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#decir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1197Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>siguiente</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#siguiente" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Sentence" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Time" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1198"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1198Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde125" /><gams:textualContent>— «Señor chançiller, yo los fize por aver occasión de fablar al emperador e la suya, esto mediante, alcançar notiçia, inclinándolo a me bien fazer;e non por Cornifiçio, segúnd él contra verdat afirmó, allí puestos, e menos ordenados, fueron.E porque se muestre con mayor evidençia ser ansí, yo añaderé a estos versos otros començados continuativos de razón;veremos si los sabrá Cornifiçio acabar».E puso siguiente de los primeros versos: &lt;lb/&gt;Hos ego versiculos feçi, alter tulit honorem;</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1198Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1198Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1198Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>E puso siguiente de los primeros versos:</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>E [v|puso|poner|ts] [a|siguiente|siguiente|auSntnnn] de los primeros versos:</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1198Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>puso</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#poner" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1198Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>siguiente</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#siguiente" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Sentence" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Time" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1199"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1199Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde126" /><gams:textualContent>de paganos, &lt;lb/&gt;e toda la tierra de los numidanos, &lt;lb/&gt;allí do Iugurta se fizo valiente;&lt;lb/&gt;Pentapolín conosçimos siguiente , &lt;lb/&gt;Getulia e Bisante, con más de otra tanta &lt;lb/&gt;tierra que pueblan los de Garamanta, &lt;lb/&gt;desde que Juba</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1199Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1199Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1199Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Pentapolín conosçimos siguiente , &lt;lb\/&gt;Getulia e Bisante,</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Pentapolín [v|conosçimos|conocer|ts] [a|siguiente|siguiente|auSntnnn] , &lt;lb\/&gt;Getulia e Bisante,</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1199Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>conosçimos</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#conocer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1199Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>siguiente</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#siguiente" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Sentence" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Time" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1200"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1200Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde137" /><gams:textualContent>de cabras&lt;lb/&gt;pura sereuado pongan conello xarab&lt;lb/&gt;de Rosas &amp; açucar / o sin ello si qujsiere&lt;lb/&gt;&amp; beualo frio &lt;lb/&gt;Dizen que el caldo de qual quier pescado&lt;lb/&gt;fresco beuiendolo solo queda a camaras&lt;lb/&gt;&amp; eso mesmo buelto con vino</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1200Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1200Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1200Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>pongan conello xarab&lt;lb\/&gt;de Rosas &amp; açucar \/ o sin ello si qujsiere&lt;lb\/&gt;&amp; beualo frio </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>pongan conello xarab&lt;lb\/&gt;de Rosas &amp; açucar \/ o sin ello si qujsiere&lt;lb\/&gt;&amp; [v|beualo|beber|ts] [a|frio|frío|auonmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1200Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>beualo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#beber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1200Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>frio</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#frío" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1201"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1201Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde103" /><gams:textualContent>andar calzado en el invierno, queréis andar descalzo?¿por qué pudiendo tener refresco en el verano y beber frío , * queréis perecer de sed?Más claro: ¿por qué, alma, pudiendo andar vestida de gracia</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1201Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1201Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1201Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>pudiendo tener refresco en el verano y beber frío , * queréis perecer de sed</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>pudiendo tener refresco en el verano y [v|beber|beber|is] [a|frío|frío|auonmnnn] , * queréis perecer de sed</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1201Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>beber</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#beber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1201Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>frío</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#frío" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1202"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1202Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde9" /><gams:textualContent>donde coge cien enfermos,&lt;lb/&gt;de sólo medio pepino;&lt;lb/&gt;donde le sirve de renta&lt;lb/&gt; el que  suda y bebe frío ,&lt;lb/&gt;y le son juros y censos&lt;lb/&gt;los melones y los higos.&lt;lb/&gt;Que para mí, que deseo</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1202Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1202Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1202Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1202Ph1Ve2" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1202Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> el que  suda y bebe frío </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|el que|ms]  [v|suda|sudar|is] y [v|bebe|beber|is] [a|frío|frío|auonmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1202Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>el que</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1202Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>suda</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#sudar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1202Ph1Ve2"><aaif:text>bebe</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#beber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1202Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>frío</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#frío" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">4</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1203"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1203Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde9" /><gams:textualContent>Un médico, de rebozo,&lt;lb/&gt;va tomando por escrito&lt;lb/&gt;los nombres de  los que cenan&lt;lb/&gt;fiambrera y beben frío .&lt;lb/&gt;Acuérdome que ha tres años&lt;lb/&gt;que dejó de ser Narciso,&lt;lb/&gt;por falta de agua en que verse,</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1203Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1203Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1203Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1203Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> los que cenan&lt;lb\/&gt;fiambrera y beben frío </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|los que|mp] cenan&lt;lb\/&gt;fiambrera y [v|beben|beber|is] [a|frío|frío|auonmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1203Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>los que</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1203Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>beben</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#beber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1203Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>frío</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#frío" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1204"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1204Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde444" /><gams:textualContent>lo más que ay que pedir:&lt;lb/&gt;pues si el mundo se rigiera&lt;lb/&gt;como me parece a mí,&lt;lb/&gt; bever  frío y gozar virgen&lt;lb/&gt;vedara a la gente vil.&lt;lb/&gt;Usurpó su flor primera&lt;lb/&gt;el visnieto de Cegrí, *&lt;lb/&gt;que</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1204Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1204Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1204Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> bever  frío y gozar virgen&lt;lb\/&gt;vedara a la gente vil</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|bever|beber|is]  [a|frío|frío|auonmnnn] y gozar virgen&lt;lb\/&gt;vedara a la gente vil</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1204Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>bever</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#beber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1204Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>frío</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#frío" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1205"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1205Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde445" /><gams:textualContent>alargar, tres cosas advertí en éstos: la grandeza y costa de los platos, comer caliente y beber frío , y sin rumor en la familia (cosa tan impugnada del señor don Pedro de Toledo en diferentes casas a</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1205Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1205Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1205Ph1Ve2" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1205Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1205Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text>tres cosas advertí en éstos: la grandeza y costa de los platos, comer caliente y beber frío , y sin rumor en la familia</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>tres cosas advertí en éstos: la grandeza y costa de los platos, [v|comer|comer|is] [a|caliente|caliente|auonmnnn] y [v|beber|beber|is] [a|frío|frío|auonmnnn] , y sin rumor en la familia</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1205Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>comer</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#comer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1205Ph1Ve2"><aaif:text>beber</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#beber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1205Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caliente</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caliente" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1205Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>frío</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#frío" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">4</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1206"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1206Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde446" /><gams:textualContent>Para decir: «yo gusto de beber frío de nieve», dirá: «bebo con armiño del frío, con requesones de agua, con</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1206Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1206Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1206Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>yo gusto de beber frío de nieve</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>yo gusto de [v|beber|beber|is] [a|frío|frío|auonmnnn] de nieve</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1206Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>beber</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#beber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1206Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>frío</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#frío" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1207"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1207Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde330" /><gams:textualContent>Fingió que venía por una desgracia, como si dejar a España fuera dicha.Añadió a esto mi hipócrita de la caballería el saber de memoria la copia de los duques, el calendario de los marqueses y la letanía de los condes.Guardaba todos los mandamientos de la caballería moderna.El primero porque no bebía vino;el segundo, porque no escribía bien, que está en reputación de bajeza;el tercero, porque temía azares de cualquiera cosa, y esto de ser azareros está vedado a los de menor esfera;el cuarto, porque mentía;el quinto, porque no pagaba las deudas, y esto demás de ser comodidad en los que señorizan, es ya costumbre aun en los plebeyos;el sesto, porque no obedecía al sesto;el séptimo, porque oía misa en pie;el otavo, porque la parlaba toda, que en fin entre los caballeros no se ha de decir callar como en misa sino hablar como en misa;el noveno, porque se levantaba tarde;el décimo, porque bebía frío o lo deseaba, que lo primero era imposible en Panamá.&lt;lb/&gt;- Ese último mandamiento -dijo Amonio- es el de más buen gusto.Y esos diez se encierran en dos: en ser malquisto y mal cristiano.Si los guardare tu chapetón o otro cualquiera, le llevarás al infierno de las señorías y a las penas de las excelencias, para que los imite después de su muerte en los trabajos;si acá en su vida en las costumbres.Si viene a Lima (que es un Ovidio en transformaciones) tu chapetón, hecho de pícaro caballero, no le faltarán hartos del mismo suceso con quien comunique.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1207Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1207Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1207Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>porque bebía frío o lo deseaba</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>porque [v|bebía|beber|is] [a|frío|frío|auonmnnn] o lo deseaba</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1207Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>bebía</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#beber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1207Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>frío</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#frío" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1208"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1208Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde184" /><gams:textualContent>porque vale tan barata la nieve en aquel país que no se tiene por buen navarro el que no bebe frío y come caliente .Menudeamos de tal suerte, al sabor de las anguillas y a la consolación de</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1208Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1208Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1208Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1208Ph1Ve2" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1208Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1208Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text>no se tiene por buen navarro el que no bebe frío y come caliente </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>no se tiene por buen navarro [s|el que|ms] no [v|bebe|beber|is] [a|frío|frío|auonmnnn] y [v|come|comer|is] [a|caliente|caliente|auonmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1208Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>el que</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1208Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>bebe</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#beber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1208Ph1Ve2"><aaif:text>come</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#comer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">4</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1208Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>frío</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#frío" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1208Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>caliente</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caliente" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">5</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1209"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1209Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde447" /><gams:textualContent>Es forzoso.&lt;lb/&gt;Tú eres enfermo dichoso,&lt;lb/&gt;pues te cura el beber frío .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1209Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1209Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1209Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Tú eres enfermo dichoso,&lt;lb\/&gt;pues te cura el beber frío .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Tú eres enfermo dichoso,&lt;lb\/&gt;pues te cura el [v|beber|beber|is] [a|frío|frío|auonmnnn] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1209Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>beber</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#beber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1209Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>frío</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#frío" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1210"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1210Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde213" /><gams:textualContent>sutil y penetrante que la caliente.La qual le pareció probar concluyentemente con la experiencia de que quando bebía frío de nieve en el estío, luego que echaba agua en el vidro, le veía mojarse por la parte exterior</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1210Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1210Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1210Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>la experiencia de que quando bebía frío de nieve en el estío</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>la experiencia de que quando [v|bebía|beber|is] [a|frío|frío|auonmnnn] de nieve en el estío</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1210Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>bebía</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#beber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1210Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>frío</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#frío" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1211"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1211Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde14" /><gams:textualContent>tú me iniciarás.Yo, sometido&lt;lb/&gt;para siempre a tu voz, no perezoso&lt;lb/&gt;rehusaré el afán.O sople frío &lt;lb/&gt; el cierzo nevador , o el rayo ardiente&lt;lb/&gt;lance el sol estival, siempre obediente&lt;lb/&gt;me verás que, incansable</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1211Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1211Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1211Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1211Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>O sople frío &lt;lb\/&gt; el cierzo nevador </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>O [v|sople|soplar|is] [a|frío|frío|ausnmnnn] &lt;lb\/&gt; [s|el cierzo nevador|ms] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1211Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>el cierzo nevador</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1211Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sople</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#soplar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1211Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>frío</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#frío" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1212"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1212Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde448" /><gams:textualContent>y diviértase: lea, pasee, hable y no dispute, coma y no se harte, y beba frío , y no dude que le estima de veras su afmo.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1212Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1212Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1212Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>coma y no se harte, y beba frío </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>coma y no se harte, y [v|beba|beber|is] [a|frío|frío|auonmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1212Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>beba</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#beber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1212Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>frío</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#frío" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1213"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1213Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde25" /><gams:textualContent>...Un hueco vacío...¿Será por eso, por vacío, por lo que me espantó? Sudo  frío aún —añadió, enjugándose con la mano las sienes.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1213Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1213Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1213Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Sudo  frío aún</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|Sudo|sudar|is]  [a|frío|frío|auonmnnn] aún</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1213Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>Sudo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#sudar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1213Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>frío</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#frío" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1214"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1214Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde25" /><gams:textualContent>— Bueno; otro día de comer frío ...—calculó enervado el artista—.¡Cómo se multiplican las necesidades!...Habrá que tomar un</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1214Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1214Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1214Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>otro día de comer frío ...</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>otro día de [v|comer|comer|is] [a|frío|frío|auonmnnn] ...</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1214Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>comer</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#comer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1214Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>frío</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#frío" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1215"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1215Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde400" /><gams:textualContent>calificaba de falso al Ardavín valeroso que quisiera manifestarse en él, sino, por el contrario,  al que  sudaba frío y temblaba por aquél, no permitiéndole revelarse tal cual era.Hasta que por fin esta figuración del desdoblamiento, </gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1215Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1215Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1215Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1215Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> al que  sudaba frío y temblaba por aquél</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|al que|ms]  [v|sudaba|sudar|is] [a|frío|frío|auonmnnn] y temblaba por aquél</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1215Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>al que</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1215Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sudaba</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#sudar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1215Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>frío</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#frío" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1216"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1216Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde117" /><gams:textualContent>asaltaba una especie de deseo de echarme a reír a carcajadas."El Flaco Rondinel te ha hecho sudar frío .El Flaco Rondinel te ha hecho temblar como a un conejo" —decía casi en voz alta.Pero no</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1216Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1216Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1216Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>El Flaco Rondinel te ha hecho sudar frío .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>El Flaco Rondinel te ha hecho [v|sudar|sudar|is] [a|frío|frío|auonmnnn] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1216Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sudar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#sudar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1216Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>frío</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#frío" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1217"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1217Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde51" /><gams:textualContent>la calle?Doctor, se me nubla la vista, me duele la cabeza, tengo palpitaciones, sudo frío , soy un cobarde.Cuando estaban consignados, los cadetes trataban de ingresar a la enfermería.Allí se</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1217Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1217Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1217Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Doctor, se me nubla la vista, me duele la cabeza, tengo palpitaciones, sudo frío , soy un cobarde.</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Doctor, se me nubla la vista, me duele la cabeza, tengo palpitaciones, [v|sudo|sudar|is] [a|frío|frío|auonmnnn] , soy un cobarde.</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1217Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sudo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#sudar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1217Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>frío</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#frío" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1218"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1218Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde262" /><gams:textualContent>Oliveira—.¿Te das cuenta de la palabra?Estar ocupado, tener una ocupación.Me corre frío por la columna, che.Pero mirá, para no ponernos metafísicos te voy a decir que mi ocupación</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1218Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1218Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1218Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Me corre frío por la columna, che</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Me [v|corre|correr|is] [a|frío|frío|auonmnnn] por la columna, che</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1218Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>corre</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#correr" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1218Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>frío</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#frío" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1219"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1219Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde55" /><gams:textualContent>Don Cayo era chiquito, la cara curtida, el pelo amarillento como tabaco pasado,  ojos hundidos que miraban frío y de lejos, arrugas en el cuello, una boca casi sin labios y dientes manchados de fumar, porque</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1219Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1219Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1219Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1219Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> ojos hundidos que miraban frío y de lejos</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|ojos hundidos|mp] que [v|miraban|mirar|is] [a|frío|frío|auvnmnnC] y de lejos</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1219Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>ojos hundidos</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1219Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>miraban</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mirar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1219Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>frío</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#frío" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1220"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1220Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde60" /><gams:textualContent>les reveló que en las noches tenía accesos de terror: permanecía hasta el amanecer encogido y desvelado, sudando frío , pensando en aparecidos, y compadeciéndose a sí mismo de su soledad.Su confesión hizo lagrimear a Rosa</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1220Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1220Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1220Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>permanecía hasta el amanecer encogido y desvelado, sudando frío ,</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>permanecía hasta el amanecer encogido y desvelado, [v|sudando|sudar|is] [a|frío|frío|auonmnnn] ,</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1220Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sudando</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#sudar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1220Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>frío</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#frío" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1221"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1221Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde449" /><gams:textualContent>molido." Pablo Vicario lo encontró todavía abrazado del árbol cuando volvió con los cuchillos." Estaba sudando  frío del dolor —me dijo— y trató de decir que me fuera yo solo porque él no estaba</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1221Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1221Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1221Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Estaba sudando  frío del dolor</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|Estaba sudando|sudar|is]  [a|frío|frío|auonmnnn] del dolor</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1221Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>Estaba sudando</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#sudar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1221Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>frío</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#frío" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1222"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1222Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde450" /><gams:textualContent>su escritorio, buscar viejos papeles y aplicar esa corriente de energía que lo invade.Por un momento suda frío ante la idea de que pudieran no existir los borradores del relato que escribió en su juventud sobre el</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1222Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1222Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1222Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Por un momento suda frío ante la idea</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Por un momento [v|suda|sudar|is] [a|frío|frío|auonmnnn] ante la idea</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1222Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>suda</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#sudar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1222Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>frío</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#frío" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1223"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1223Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde67" /><gams:textualContent>puerta es obvio que sobre mi cabeza se balancea la espada de Damocles.Tengo el estómago revuelto, sudo frío y me invade una desagradable sensación de irrealidad, porque bajo el collar de filigrana hindú la mujer lleva trazas</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1223Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1223Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1223Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Tengo el estómago revuelto, sudo frío y me invade una desagradable sensación</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Tengo el estómago revuelto, [v|sudo|sudar|is] [a|frío|frío|auonmnnn] y me invade una desagradable sensación</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1223Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sudo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#sudar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1223Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>frío</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#frío" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1224"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1224Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde67" /><gams:textualContent>no me oyen,  Antonio parece estar muy mal, se sostiene el lado izquierdo con la mano, suda frío , dice estar al borde del infarto y propone que llamemos la ambulancia.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1224Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1224Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1224Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1224Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Antonio parece estar muy mal, se sostiene el lado izquierdo con la mano, suda frío </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Antonio|ms] parece estar muy mal, se sostiene el lado izquierdo con la mano, [v|suda|sudar|is] [a|frío|frío|auonmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1224Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Antonio</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1224Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>suda</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#sudar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1224Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>frío</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#frío" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1225"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1225Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde269" /><gams:textualContent> Bertoldi empezó a sudar frío .Un rencor sordo, de perro abandonado, se le mezcló con la sangre.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1225Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1225Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1225Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1225Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Bertoldi empezó a sudar frío .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Bertoldi|ms] empezó a [v|sudar|sudar|is] [a|frío|frío|auonmnnn] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1225Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Bertoldi</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1225Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sudar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#sudar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1225Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>frío</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#frío" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1226"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1226Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde188" /><gams:textualContent>palabra sudor, arrojó la esponja Joaquín Bermejo.Se había agotado y no había dicho una sola palabra. Sudaba  frío y se había agotado y eso era lo único que le quedaba del sudor de su frente y todo</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1226Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1226Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1226Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Sudaba  frío y se había agotado</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|Sudaba|sudar|is]  [a|frío|frío|auonmnnn] y se había agotado</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1226Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>Sudaba</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#sudar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1226Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>frío</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#frío" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1227"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1227Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde71" /><gams:textualContent>Faustino estaba estupefacto, boquiabierto.El corazón le palpitaba. Sudaba  frío .Tenía la impresión de que las piernas se le convertirían en lana y dejarían de sostenerlo.Miró, </gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1227Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1227Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1227Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Sudaba  frío .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|Sudaba|sudar|is]  [a|frío|frío|auonmnnn] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1227Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>Sudaba</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#sudar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1227Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>frío</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#frío" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1228"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1228Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde451" /><gams:textualContent>el techo.Dejó en el piso un laberinto fresco: el hilillo de sangre de su meñique. Sudaba  frío . Un zumbido en la cabeza, un puñado de sal de higuera en la lengua; las piernas de</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1228Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1228Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1228Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Sudaba  frío </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|Sudaba|sudar|is]  [a|frío|frío|auonmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1228Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>Sudaba</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#sudar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1228Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>frío</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#frío" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1229"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1229Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde134" /><gams:textualContent>, que cualquier día ella se iba a morir y convenía que yo supiera aquel secreto.Empecé a sudar frío  y miré a Blanche, tuve miedo de que Frou-Frou hablara de nosotros, pero no era ése su secreto</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1229Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1229Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1229Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Empecé a sudar frío </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Empecé a [v|sudar|sudar|is] [a|frío|frío|auonmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1229Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sudar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#sudar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1229Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>frío</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#frío" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1230"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1230Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde272" /><gams:textualContent>ver El inquilino: Chela salió enfurecida diciendo que era una película para sádicos; David dijo que había sudado frío , y los demás que era aburridísima.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1230Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1230Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1230Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>David dijo que había sudado frío </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>David dijo que [v|había sudado|sudar|is] [a|frío|frío|auonmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1230Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>había sudado</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#sudar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1230Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>frío</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#frío" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1231"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1231Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde452" /><gams:textualContent>de las grandezas del Hierro, y de sus virtudes medicinales.Tratado de la nieve y de beuer frío .En Sevilla, Alonso de Escribano, 1574.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1231Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1231Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1231Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Tratado de la nieve y de beuer frío .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Tratado de la nieve y de [v|beuer|beber|is] [a|frío|frío|auonmnnn] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1231Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>beuer</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#beber" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1231Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>frío</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#frío" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1232"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1232Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde23" /><gams:textualContent>Japón!&lt;lb/&gt;El también sufre nostalgias, hondas, diáfanas, impías&lt;lb/&gt;Abejillas de oro y ópalo que se clavan lentas , frías ,&lt;lb/&gt;En el glóbulo de aromas de su raro corazón.&lt;lb/&gt;La enfermita las comprende, las nostalgias</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1232Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1232Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1232Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1232Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text>Abejillas de oro y ópalo que se clavan lentas , frías ,&lt;lb\/&gt;En el glóbulo de aromas de su raro corazón</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Abejillas de oro y ópalo que se [v|clavan|clavar|rs] [a|lentas|lento|axsnmnnC] , [a|frías|frío|axsnmnnC] ,&lt;lb\/&gt;En el glóbulo de aromas de su raro corazón</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1232Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>clavan</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#clavar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1232Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>lentas</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#lento" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FemininePlural" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1232Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>frías</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#frío" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FemininePlural" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1233"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1233Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde191" /><gams:textualContent>entran en los çilleros; &lt;lb/&gt;non parten con los pobres nin con los compañeros, &lt;lb/&gt; alçan lo que les sobra fuerte en los bolseros.&lt;lb/&gt;Estos son con el Dives en infierno fondidos, &lt;lb/&gt;teniendo agua çerca, yazen de set</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1233Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1233Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1233Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> alçan lo que les sobra fuerte en los bolseros</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|alçan|alzar|ts] lo que les sobra [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvnmnnn] en los bolseros</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1233Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>alçan</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#alzar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1233Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1234"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1234Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde503" /><gams:textualContent>las monnecas pequennas e los dedos mesurados de grandez, e las coxas luengas, ca esto demuestra que  saltan  fuerte  pora prender e que son de fuertes mienbros.E que ayan las colas mesuradas e de gordas pénnolas e</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1234Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1234Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1234Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> saltan  fuerte </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|saltan|saltar|is]  [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1234Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>saltan</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#saltar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1234Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1235"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1235Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde503" /><gams:textualContent>a otro, que non sean esparzidas ni una más alta que otra, ca esto demuestra que se debaten fuerte d’alas e que uuelan aýna; e que ayan todas las otras plumas allegadas e que non sean menudas</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1235Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1235Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1235Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>se debaten fuerte d’alas</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>se [v|debaten|debatir|rs] [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvnmnnn] d’alas</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1235Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>debaten</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#debatir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1235Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1236"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1236Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde503" /><gams:textualContent>inchen las moliellas de umores;e a las uezes abren las bocas e an poco sabor de comer, e resollan fuerte ;e quando las ceuan, camian la carne o cierran los ojos much a menudo, o non se pueden</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1236Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1236Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1236Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>a las uezes abren las bocas e an poco sabor de comer, e resollan fuerte </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>a las uezes abren las bocas e an poco sabor de comer, e [v|resollan|resollar|is] [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1236Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>resollan</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#resollar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1236Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1237"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1237Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde504" /><gams:textualContent>dixiera Ihesu Christo: que ante que el gallo cante me negaras tres uezes.Salio Pedro fuera e lloro fuert .E los ombres quel tenien fazien escarnio del, e cubrieron le los oios e firien le</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1237Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1237Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1237Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1237Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Salio Pedro fuera e lloro fuert </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Salio [s|Pedro|ms] fuera e [v|lloro|llorar|is] [a|fuert|fuerte|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1237Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Pedro</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1237Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>lloro</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#llorar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1237Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuert</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1238"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1238Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde505" /><gams:textualContent>fecho.El dando el poder a Dios criador de todas las cosas, dixo a los suyos que lidiassen fuert , e aun fasta la muerte por las leyes e por el templo e por la ciudat e por la</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1238Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1238Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1238Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>dixo a los suyos que lidiassen fuert </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>dixo a los suyos que [v|lidiassen|lidiar|is] [a|fuert|fuerte|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1238Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>lidiassen</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#lidiar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1238Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuert</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1239"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1239Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde291" /><gams:textualContent>muy graue mientre loraua, &lt;lb/&gt;su cabeça quebrantaua &lt;lb/&gt;mill vezes en el escudo; &lt;lb/&gt;toda su fruente rronpia * &lt;lb/&gt; lloraua  fuerte  e dezia: &lt;lb/&gt;«¡ay Pratroclo, ay amigo!&lt;lb/&gt;»amigo, ¿quien cuydaria &lt;lb/&gt;»que muerte</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1239Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1239Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1239Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> lloraua  fuerte </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|lloraua|llorar|is]  [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1239Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>lloraua</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#llorar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1239Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1240"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1240Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde291" /><gams:textualContent>menor: &lt;lb/&gt;en los braços lo tomaua *&lt;lb/&gt;e al palaçio se tornaua, &lt;lb/&gt;grandes apellidos dando, &lt;lb/&gt; plañendo  fuert e llorando.*&lt;lb/&gt;Mas quando ella llegaua, &lt;lb/&gt;Ector a grand priesa estaua&lt;lb/&gt;las brafoneras calçando.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1240Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1240Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1240Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> plañendo  fuert e llorando</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|plañendo|plañir|is]  [a|fuert|fuerte|auvnmnnn] e llorando</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1240Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>plañendo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#plañir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1240Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuert</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1241"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1241Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde506" /><gams:textualContent>enbargalle su ida.&amp; porque uio que los no podie partir de si por ruego.maltroxolos &amp; amenazolos fuerte  &amp; ouieronse a yr sin otra paga.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1241Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1241Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1241Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>maltroxolos &amp; amenazolos fuerte </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>maltroxolos &amp; [v|amenazolos|amenazar|ts] [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1241Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>amenazolos</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#amenazar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1241Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1242"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1242Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde292" /><gams:textualContent>contra el.quando los agenos prendien la su hueste &amp; los estrannos entrauan las sus puertas.&amp;  echauan  fuerte sobre iherusalem tu eras assi como uno dellos.&amp; non despreciaras en el dia de to hermano en</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1242Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1242Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1242Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> echauan  fuerte sobre iherusalem</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|echauan|echar|is]  [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvnmnnn] sobre iherusalem</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1242Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>echauan</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#echar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1242Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1243"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1243Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde507" /><gams:textualContent>e seca.E su calentura es mas que su sequedat.E por eso a en ella humidat afincada fuerte .E es tierra gorda e por eso a menester mucha lauor e rresia.* E conuiene que la</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1243Ph1"><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1243Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>E por eso a en ella humidat afincada fuerte </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>E por eso a en ella humidat afincada [a|fuerte|fuerte|auanmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1243Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1244"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1244Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde453" /><gams:textualContent>por le dar algund confuerto&lt;lb/&gt;al cavallo forrado; contra sí fizo tuerto: &lt;lb/&gt;las coçes el cavallo lançó fuerte , en çierto, &lt;lb/&gt;diole entre los ojos, echóle frío muerto.&lt;lb/&gt;&lt;lb/&gt;»El cavallo, con el miedo</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1244Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1244Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1244Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1244Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>las coçes el cavallo lançó fuerte </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>las coçes [s|el cavallo|ms] [v|lançó|lanzar|ts] [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1244Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>el cavallo</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1244Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>lançó</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#lanzar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1244Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1245"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1245Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde454" /><gams:textualContent>non se querién avenir, &lt;lb/&gt;e matavan los romeros &lt;lb/&gt;que venién a Dios servir.&lt;lb/&gt;&lt;lb/&gt;A la reina pesó fuerte &lt;lb/&gt;de que vio tal pestelencia &lt;lb/&gt;acuitóle de muerte &lt;lb/&gt;una muy fuerte dolencia.&lt;lb/&gt;&lt;lb/&gt;Non sopieron melezina &lt;lb/&gt;e Dios la</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1245Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1245Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1245Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>A la reina pesó fuerte &lt;lb\/&gt;de que vio tal pestelencia</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>A la reina [v|pesó|pesar|is] [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvnmnnn] &lt;lb\/&gt;de que vio tal pestelencia</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1245Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>pesó</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#pesar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1245Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1246"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1246Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde508" /><gams:textualContent>restituydo en el regno, metiolo en carcel alli do era Joachim, rey de Juda.Mas  Eujlmoradac  amo fuert a Joachim, e fizo con el e firmo coujnencias de amjstança.Apres aquesto murio el rey grant Nabugodonosor</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1246Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1246Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1246Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1246Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Eujlmoradac  amo fuert a Joachim</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Eujlmoradac|ms]  [v|amo|amar|ts] [a|fuert|fuerte|auvnmnnn] a Joachim</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1246Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Eujlmoradac</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1246Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>amo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#amar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1246Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuert</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1247"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1247Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde508" /><gams:textualContent>Dario, e assi que no los podie quebrantar mjentre que Dario fues ujuo. La hora , irado Alexandre, menazaua fuert a los iudios.E ajustados montes de tierra fizolos eguales a los muros de la ciudat, e priso</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1247Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1247Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1247Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1247Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> La hora , irado Alexandre, menazaua fuert a los iudios</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|La hora|fs] , irado Alexandre, [v|menazaua|amenazar|ts] [a|fuert|fuerte|auvnmnnn] a los iudios</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1247Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>La hora</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1247Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>menazaua</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#amenazar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1247Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuert</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1248"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1248Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde509" /><gams:textualContent>cuero bollido et son assaz fuertes. Ellos son fuert, buenos hombres en batalla et vallientes, et dubdan fuert la muert, et suffren treballo mas que otras gentes.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1248Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1248Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1248Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1248Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Ellos son fuert, buenos hombres en batalla et vallientes, et dubdan fuert la muert</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Ellos|mp] son fuert, buenos hombres en batalla et vallientes, et [v|dubdan|dudar|ts] [a|fuert|fuerte|auvnmnnn] la muert</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1248Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Ellos</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1248Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>dubdan</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#dudar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1248Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuert</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1249"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1249Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde194" /><gams:textualContent>Asy que los que sirven a tal señor cruel y malo, e se aluengan del bueno e begnino por voluntad perdida, e sospiran por los negoçios presentes, sotenidos apertados dellos, non an mençion de las cosas avinideras, mas desean sienpre deleytes del cuerpo, e dexando las sus almas peresçer por fanbre e atormentarse por males syn cuenta, asmo ellos ser semejables al omne fuyente de la cara del unicornio sañoso;el qual temeroso por el sonido de las bozes espantables del, fuya muy fuerte por que non fuese cargado del;</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1249Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1249Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1249Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>el qual temeroso por el sonido de las bozes espantables del, fuya muy fuerte por que non fuese cargado del</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>el qual temeroso por el sonido de las bozes espantables del, [v|fuya|huir|is] muy [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvmmnnn] por que non fuese cargado del</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1249Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>fuya</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#huir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1249Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1250"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1250Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde194" /><gams:textualContent>de las bozes espantables del, fuya muy fuerte por que non fuese cargado del;e commo corriese fuerte , cayo en un pozo;e commo cayese estendio las manos e tomo un arborçiello, e tovolo fuertemente</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1250Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1250Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1250Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>commo corriese fuerte , cayo en un pozo</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>commo [v|corriese|correr|is] [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvnmnnn] , cayo en un pozo</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1250Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>corriese</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#correr" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1250Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1251"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1251Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde194" /><gams:textualContent>E llorando fuerte el apartamiento, rrogava que fuese conpañero en moriendo e que despues non lo dexase en esta vida, deziendo</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1251Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1251Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1251Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>E llorando fuerte el apartamiento</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>E [v|llorando|llorar|ts] [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvnmnnn] el apartamiento</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1251Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>llorando</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#llorar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1251Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1252"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1252Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde510" /><gams:textualContent>mucho dura e de una parte e de la otra, e muy ásperamente ferida: ca  los romanos  peleavan fuerte e con yra e con saña;e los eques esso mesmo, movidos por la consciencia que ellos avían</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1252Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1252Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1252Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1252Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> los romanos  peleavan fuerte e con yra e con saña</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|los romanos|mp]  [v|peleavan|pelear|is] [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvnmnnC] e con yra e con saña</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1252Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>los romanos</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1252Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>peleavan</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#pelear" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1252Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1253"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1253Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde238" /><gams:textualContent>, que vuestro adversario el diablo assí como león rrugiente çerca buscando a quien trague, al qual rresistit fuertes en la fe’.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1253Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1253Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1253Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>vuestro adversario el diablo assí como león rrugiente çerca buscando a quien trague, al qual rresistit fuertes en la fe’</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>vuestro adversario el diablo assí como león rrugiente çerca buscando a quien trague, al qual [v|rresistit|resistir|is] [a|fuertes|fuerte|apsnmnnn] en la fe’</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1253Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>rresistit</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#resistir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1253Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuertes</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#MasculinePlural" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1254"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1254Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde511" /><gams:textualContent>la u, así como guardar, guiar.Pero cuando se junta con e e con i, entonçes suena fuerte , como quien dize linagge, girón, girconça.En el fin quitan la e pug</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1254Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1254Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1254Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>entonçes suena fuerte </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>entonçes [v|suena|sonar|is] [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1254Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>suena</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#sonar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1254Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1255"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1255Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde512" /><gams:textualContent>2021. La mejor cosa de los pesares es el sofrir fuerte aquellos.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1255Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1255Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1255Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>La mejor cosa de los pesares es el sofrir fuerte aquellos</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>La mejor cosa de los pesares es el [v|sofrir|sufrir|ts] [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvnmnnn] aquellos</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1255Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sofrir</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#sufrir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1255Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1256"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1256Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde514" /><gams:textualContent>tornaron las galeas a Alhabiba, donde avían seýdo vezinos, a grand fuerça de mar, que aún andava fuerte .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1256Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1256Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1256Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>a grand fuerça de mar, que aún andava fuerte </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>a grand fuerça de mar, que aún [v|andava|andar|is] [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1256Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>andava</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#andar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1256Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1257"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1257Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde514" /><gams:textualContent>que avían navegado por aquella vía, que heran ya fuera de todas las yslas, e que si ventase fuerte del norte, que no podrían yr a Françia, ni a Yngalaterra.Bolvieron las galeas la vía</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1257Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1257Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1257Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>ya fuera de todas las yslas, e que si ventase fuerte del norte</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>ya fuera de todas las yslas, e que si [v|ventase|ventar|is] [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvnmnnn] del norte</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1257Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>ventase</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ventar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1257Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1258"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1258Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde514" /><gams:textualContent>Pascuala Essos que sois de ciudad &lt;lb/&gt; perchufáis  huerte de nos.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1258Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1258Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1258Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Pascuala Essos que sois de ciudad &lt;lb\/&gt; perchufáis  huerte de nos</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Pascuala Essos que sois de ciudad &lt;lb\/&gt; [v|perchufáis|perchufar|is]  [a|huerte|fuerte|auvnmnnn] de nos</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1258Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>perchufáis</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#perchufar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1258Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>huerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1259"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1259Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde303" /><gams:textualContent>, por ver si el dolor algo le haría dezir por fuerça, solté los perros dándoles más favor y esforçándoles fuerte contra animal tan flaco.Mas ninguna cosa destas aprovechar no pudieron, que él más pasciente que yo</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1259Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1259Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1259Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>solté los perros dándoles más favor y esforçándoles fuerte contra animal tan flaco</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>solté los perros dándoles más favor y [v|esforçándoles|esforzar|ts] [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvnmnnn] contra animal tan flaco</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1259Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>esforçándoles</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#esforzar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1259Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1260"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1260Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde515" /><gams:textualContent>uerdadero al que siempre adoró e siruió.Estonces el emperador fue más irado e mandólo desnudar e batir fuerte con las coreas menudas que tenién en los cabos sendas maças de plomo e depués mandólo meter en un tormento</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1260Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1260Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1260Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Estonces el emperador fue más irado e mandólo desnudar e batir fuerte con las coreas menudas</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Estonces el emperador fue más irado e mandólo desnudar e [v|batir|batir|ts] [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvnmnnn] con las coreas menudas</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1260Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>batir</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#batir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1260Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1261"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1261Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde102" /><gams:textualContent>dejando aquel lugar della vacío, &lt;lb/&gt;aunque lleno de rabia y nuevo brío: &lt;lb/&gt;&lt;lb/&gt;que a dos manos la maza aprieta fuerte &lt;lb/&gt;y con furia mayor la gobernaba: &lt;lb/&gt;bien se puede llamar de triste suerte&lt;lb/&gt;aquel que el fiero bárbaro alcanzaba</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1261Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1261Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1261Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>a dos manos la maza aprieta fuerte </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>a dos manos la maza [v|aprieta|apretar|ts] [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1261Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>aprieta</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#apretar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1261Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1262"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1262Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde281" /><gams:textualContent>pues, dice Hardyl, he aquí también la llave.Eusebio la toma, baja la escalera pisando fuerte , dando motivo de reír a Hardyl, abre con ruido la bodega, entra en ella y toma una</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1262Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1262Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1262Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Eusebio la toma, baja la escalera pisando fuerte </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Eusebio la toma, baja la escalera [v|pisando|pisar|is] [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1262Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>pisando</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#pisar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1262Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1263"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1263Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde516" /><gams:textualContent>mano las dos extremidades de los cordones y no hay nada de esto;porque si en esta posición tirasen fuerte  para quebrar el hilo los cordones se separarian y las sortijas caerian en tierra;para evitar este acontecimiento y</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1263Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1263Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1263Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>porque si en esta posición tirasen fuerte </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>porque si en esta posición [v|tirasen|tirar|is] [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1263Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>tirasen</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#tirar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1263Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1264"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1264Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde517" /><gams:textualContent>: pálida gimiendo &lt;lb/&gt;Vaga la triste gente.&lt;lb/&gt;Sólo entonces seguro el virtuoso &lt;lb/&gt;No busca el vano asilo &lt;lb/&gt;Y opone fuerte el corazón tranquilo&lt;lb/&gt;Al estrago horroroso.&lt;lb/&gt;Si truena el cielo y de las aves huye &lt;lb/&gt;El temeroso bando</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1264Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1264Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1264Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>el virtuoso &lt;lb\/&gt;No busca el vano asilo &lt;lb\/&gt;Y opone fuerte el corazón tranquilo</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>el virtuoso &lt;lb\/&gt;No busca el vano asilo &lt;lb\/&gt;Y [v|opone|oponer|ts] [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvnmnnn] el corazón tranquilo</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1264Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>opone</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#oponer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><a