>dijo D. Cándido respirando fuerte </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>dijo D. Cándido [v|respirando|respirar|is] [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1265Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>respirando</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#respirar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1265Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1266"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1266Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde367" /><gams:textualContent>Aparece en una de nuestras mil y tantas universidades un estudiantillo despierto y procaz, que argumenta fuerte ad hominem y ad mulierem;* que niega la autoridad del libro, del maestro, de</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1266Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1266Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1266Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>un estudiantillo despierto y procaz, que argumenta fuerte ad hominem y ad mulierem</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>un estudiantillo despierto y procaz, que [v|argumenta|argumentar|is] [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvnmnnn] ad hominem y ad mulierem</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1266Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>argumenta</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#argumentar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1266Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1267"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1267Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde218" /><gams:textualContent>cómo va la salud y cómo están en casa?—preguntó Daniel, que era hombre que jamás pisaba fuerte sin haber tanteado antes el terreno, aun cuando sobre él hubiese caminado la víspera.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1267Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1267Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1267Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>era hombre que jamás pisaba fuerte sin haber tanteado antes el terreno</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>era hombre que jamás [v|pisaba|pisar|is] [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvnmnnn] sin haber tanteado antes el terreno</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1267Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>pisaba</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#pisar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1267Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1268"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1268Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde218" /><gams:textualContent>— Despacio, no hables fuerte .Es su desmayo.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1268Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1268Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1268Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Despacio, no hables fuerte </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Despacio, no [v|hables|hablar|is] [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1268Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>hables</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1268Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1269"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1269Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde218" /><gams:textualContent>María, cuando tenemos que cumplir su voluntad —contestó la madre abadesa—.Pero quiero que lo lea fuerte .Puede ser que se me haya olvidado alguna cosa.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1269Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1269Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1269Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Pero quiero que lo lea fuerte </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Pero quiero que lo [v|lea|leer|ts] [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1269Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>lea</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#leer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1269Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1270"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1270Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde218" /><gams:textualContent>— Pero léalo fuerte ;me gusta mucho oír leer lo que yo escribo</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1270Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1270Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1270Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Pero léalo fuerte </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Pero [v|léalo|leer|ts] [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1270Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>léalo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#leer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1270Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1271"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1271Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde218" /><gams:textualContent>— Bueno. Hablemos  fuerte ahora para que no se fijen.Manuela reclinaba su brazo en uno de los dos del sofá, y</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1271Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1271Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1271Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Hablemos  fuerte ahora para que no se fijen</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|Hablemos|hablar|is]  [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvnmnnn] ahora para que no se fijen</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1271Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>Hablemos</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1271Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1272"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1272Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde218" /><gams:textualContent>— Tenga usted la bondad de leer fuerte para que todos oigan —dijo Amalia.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1272Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1272Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1272Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Tenga usted la bondad de leer fuerte para que todos oigan</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Tenga usted la bondad de [v|leer|leer|is] [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvnmnnn] para que todos oigan</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1272Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>leer</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#leer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1272Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1273"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1273Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde282" /><gams:textualContent>—  Cáscale  fuerte en las narices —decía uno.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1273Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1273Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1273Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Cáscale  fuerte en las narices</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|Cáscale|cascar|ts]  [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvnmnnn] en las narices</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1273Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>Cáscale</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cascar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1273Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1274"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1274Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde282" /><gams:textualContent>—  Pégale  fuerte y feo  —exclamaba un tercero.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1274Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1274Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1274Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1274Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text> Pégale  fuerte y feo </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|Pégale|pegar|ts]  [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvnmnnC] y [a|feo|feo|auvnmnnC] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1274Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>Pégale</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#pegar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1274Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1274Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>feo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#feo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1275"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1275Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde282" /><gams:textualContent>—  Hablando  fuerte se oye desde lejos —le contestó Leonor, con una sonrisa que disimulaba muy mal su turbación.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1275Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1275Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1275Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Hablando  fuerte se oye desde lejos</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|Hablando|hablar|is]  [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvnmnnn] se oye desde lejos</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1275Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>Hablando</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1275Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1276"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1276Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde374" /><gams:textualContent>de los unos, contrastaba singularmente con la desvergüenza de los otros.Cuando ésa subió de punto, hablé fuerte , insulté groseramente, a mi vez, y así conseguí imponerles respeto a aquellos desgraciados o pillos, a quienes,</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1276Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1276Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1276Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Cuando ésa subió de punto, hablé fuerte , insulté groseramente</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Cuando ésa subió de punto, [v|hablé|hablar|is] [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvnmnnn] , insulté groseramente</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1276Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>hablé</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1276Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1277"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1277Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde374" /><gams:textualContent>—  Topando  fuerte , hermano.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1277Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1277Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1277Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Topando  fuerte , hermano</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|Topando|topar|is]  [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvnmnnn] , hermano</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1277Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>Topando</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#topar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1277Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1278"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1278Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde374" /><gams:textualContent> Suspiré  fuerte .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1278Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1278Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1278Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Suspiré  fuerte </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|Suspiré|suspirar|is]  [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1278Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>Suspiré</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#suspirar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1278Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1279"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1279Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde374" /><gams:textualContent>la eché encima, me envolví, me acurruqué bien, me tapé hasta las narices y comencé a resollar fuerte , haciendo de mis labios una especie de válvula para que saliera el aliento condensado y crecieran los grados de la</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1279Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1279Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1279Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>comencé a resollar fuerte </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>comencé a [v|resollar|resollar|is] [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1279Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>resollar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#resollar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1279Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1280"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1280Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde374" /><gams:textualContent>hoy ensillan un caballo, mañana otro y así sucesivamente, y al salir el sol los galopean fuerte por el campo más quebrado, más arenoso, más lleno de médanos.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1280Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1280Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1280Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>los galopean fuerte por el campo más quebrado</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>los [v|galopean|galopear|ts] [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvnmnnn] por el campo más quebrado</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1280Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>galopean</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#galopear" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1280Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1281"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1281Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde518" /><gams:textualContent>— Tendría chiste, ¿eh?¡ Usted  ha cenado fuerte !</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1281Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1281Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1281Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1281Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Usted  ha cenado fuerte </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Usted|us]  [v|ha cenado|cenar|is] [a|fuerte|fuerte|auonmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1281Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Usted</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Undefined" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1281Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>ha cenado</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cenar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1281Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1282"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1282Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde519" /><gams:textualContent>comer, en atención á que, según parece, es bastante general entre los ingleses la costumbre de almorzar fuerte .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1282Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1282Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1282Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>la costumbre de almorzar fuerte </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>la costumbre de [v|almorzar|almorzar|is] [a|fuerte|fuerte|auonmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1282Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>almorzar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#almorzar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1282Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1283"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1283Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde181" /><gams:textualContent>escondía el primero entre sus pliegues y cerraba el cajón.Se acercaba a la mesa, después de respirar fuerte , silbaba la marcha real, y fingía echar un vistazo a los periódicos.¡Periódicos a él!</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1283Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1283Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1283Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>después de respirar fuerte , silbaba la marcha real</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>después de [v|respirar|respirar|is] [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvnmnnn] , silbaba la marcha real</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1283Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>respirar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#respirar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1283Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1284"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1284Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde181" /><gams:textualContent>hombros, las pocas veces que con sus amigos íntimos hablaba de estas cosas: solía ser después de cenar fuerte —.¿Se me habla de extravíos del gusto?Eso es lo excepcional.Pero nadie querrá</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1284Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1284Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1284Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>después de cenar fuerte </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>después de [v|cenar|cenar|is] [a|fuerte|fuerte|auonmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1284Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>cenar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cenar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1284Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1285"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1285Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde181" /><gams:textualContent>su mujer, sin que él lo supiera nunca, la noche de Nochebuena.Verdad es que había cenado fuerte  el buen señor  y se le había ocurrido celebrar a su modo el Nacimiento de Jesús.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1285Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1285Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1285Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1285Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Verdad es que había cenado fuerte  el buen señor </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Verdad es que [v|había cenado|cenar|is] [a|fuerte|fuerte|auonmnnn]  [s|el buen señor|ms] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1285Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>el buen señor</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1285Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>había cenado</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cenar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1285Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1286"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1286Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde181" /><gams:textualContent>Desde que esto supo Ana se creyó menos sola en sus noches tristes.Roto el secreto,  Frígilis  tosía fuerte  abajo a propósito, para que le oyera Ana, como diciendo: “No temas, estoy yo aquí”.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1286Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1286Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1286Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1286Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Frígilis  tosía fuerte </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Frígilis|ms]  [v|tosía|toser|is] [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1286Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Frígilis</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1286Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>tosía</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#toser" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1286Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1287"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1287Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde520" /><gams:textualContent>Sintió el muchacho aquel cálido rostro cerca del suyo, la opresión húmeda de unos labios que besaban fuerte y recio  y el goteo de las lágrimas que le mojaban el cuello.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1287Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1287Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1287Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1287Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text>la opresión húmeda de unos labios que besaban fuerte y recio </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>la opresión húmeda de unos labios que [v|besaban|besar|is] [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvnmnnC] y [a|recio|recio|auvnmnnC] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1287Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>besaban</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#besar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1287Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1287Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>recio</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#recio" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1288"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1288Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde379" /><gams:textualContent>salí, corrí a la puerta que da sobre el atrio de San Ignacio, me saqué el paletó, golpeé fuerte  y cuando el viejo portero pregunto quien era, imité la voz del vicerrector, y una vez la</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1288Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1288Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1288Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>me saqué el paletó, golpeé fuerte </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>me saqué el paletó, [v|golpeé|golpear|is] [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1288Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>golpeé</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#golpear" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1288Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1289"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1289Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde249" /><gams:textualContent>no le necesito, y el único que hay en el pueblo no sale más que los días que repican fuerte .¿En qué se me conoce que no he resobado de muchacho los bancos de las aulas con el</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1289Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1289Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1289Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>los días que repican fuerte </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>los días que [v|repican|repicar|is] [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1289Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>repican</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#repicar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1289Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1290"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1290Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde140" /><gams:textualContent>decir esto golpeábase el marqués su fornido tronco, su pecho varonil, cual si de él quisiese hacer brotar fuerte y adulto ya el codiciado heredero .Julián, lleno de esperanza, iba a animarle en tan buenos propósitos</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1290Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1290Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1290Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1290Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1290Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text>de él quisiese hacer brotar fuerte y adulto ya el codiciado heredero </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>de él quisiese hacer [v|brotar|brotar|is] [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvnmnnC] y [a|adulto|adulto|auvnmnnC] ya [s|el codiciado heredero|ms] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1290Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>el codiciado heredero</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">4</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1290Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>brotar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#brotar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1290Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1290Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>adulto</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#adulto" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1291"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1291Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde140" /><gams:textualContent>— No, no me acaloro —exclamó ella respirando fuerte  y pasándose por la frente la palma extendida</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1291Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1291Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1291Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>exclamó ella respirando fuerte </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>exclamó ella [v|respirando|respirar|is] [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1291Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>respirando</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#respirar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1291Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1292"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1292Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde20" /><gams:textualContent>¡Habría antes que abatir las murallas!—observó Pacheco fijando sus ojos de mirar fuerte en el oficial.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1292Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1292Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1292Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>observó Pacheco fijando sus ojos de mirar fuerte en el oficial</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>observó Pacheco [v|fijando|fijar|ts] sus ojos de mirar [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvnmnnn] en el oficial</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1292Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>fijando</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fijar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1292Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1293"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1293Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde20" /><gams:textualContent>La criolla se encogió de hombros y torcióle la vista con frío desdén.Luego que él estuvo lejos, respiró fuerte , murmurando:</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1293Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1293Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1293Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Luego que él estuvo lejos, respiró fuerte </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Luego que él estuvo lejos, [v|respiró|respirar|is] [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1293Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>respiró</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#respirar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1293Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1294"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1294Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde251" /><gams:textualContent>Tiene el presbítero Mata &lt;lb/&gt;una lora disoluta &lt;lb/&gt;que al punto que ve una beata &lt;lb/&gt; grita  fortísimo : “¡Puta!”</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1294Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1294Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1294Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>una lora disoluta &lt;lb\/&gt;que al punto que ve una beata &lt;lb\/&gt; grita  fortísimo : “¡Puta!”</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>una lora disoluta &lt;lb\/&gt;que al punto que ve una beata &lt;lb\/&gt; [v|grita|gritar|ts]  [a|fortísimo|fuerte|auvnmnnn] : “¡Puta!”</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1294Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>grita</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#gritar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1294Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fortísimo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1295"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1295Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde500" /><gams:textualContent>Pidió la guitarra al moreno, la templó á su gusto, se compuso el pecho, rasgueó fuerte  y largó estas coplitas fregonas:</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1295Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1295Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1295Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>se compuso el pecho, rasgueó fuerte </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>se compuso el pecho, [v|rasgueó|rasguear|is] [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1295Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>rasgueó</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#rasguear" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1295Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1296"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1296Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde500" /><gams:textualContent> “Es favor que me hace” —respondió el guitarrero y despues de rasguear fuerte , tocó una pieza cadenciosa como habanera, cuyo compás seguian los otros paisanos moviendo las piernas que estando sentados</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1296Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1296Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1296Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>despues de rasguear fuerte , tocó una pieza cadenciosa</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>despues de [v|rasguear|rasguear|is] [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvnmnnn] , tocó una pieza cadenciosa</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1296Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>rasguear</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#rasguear" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1296Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1297"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1297Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde384" /><gams:textualContent>fructificación de los cafetos.Montesa, el mayordomo, les empujaba: a los de la sierra les hablaba fuerte , porque era preciso que las tablas desgajadas de los gruesos troncos fueran homogéneas, sin remates deformes y de</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1297Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1297Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1297Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Montesa, el mayordomo, les empujaba: a los de la sierra les hablaba fuerte </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Montesa, el mayordomo, les empujaba: a los de la sierra les [v|hablaba|hablar|is] [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1297Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>hablaba</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hablar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1297Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1298"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1298Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde21" /><gams:textualContent>que había requerido el palo con intenciones de usarlo como infalible remedio de la embriaguez, tuvo lástima y suspiró fuerte , mascullando éstas o parecidas palabras: «Pegar ti otro día.»</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1298Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1298Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1298Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>tuvo lástima y suspiró fuerte </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>tuvo lástima y [v|suspiró|suspirar|is] [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1298Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>suspiró</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#suspirar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1298Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1299"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1299Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde21" /><gams:textualContent>Me parece que tienes razón.Lo mismo puede ser arriba que abajo.Yo te aseguro que cuando piso fuerte en los pasillos y en el comedor, y se estremece todo el caserón como si quisiera derrumbarse, me</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1299Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1299Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1299Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Yo te aseguro que cuando piso fuerte en los pasillos y en el comedor, y se estremece todo el caserón</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Yo te aseguro que cuando [v|piso|pisar|is] [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvnmnnn] en los pasillos y en el comedor, y se estremece todo el caserón</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1299Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>piso</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#pisar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1299Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1300"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1300Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde21" /><gams:textualContent>—Y si no, haz la prueba ahora mismo.Date unos paseos por la alcoba, pisando fuerte , y oiremos...»</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1300Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1300Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1300Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Date unos paseos por la alcoba, pisando fuerte , y oiremos...</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Date unos paseos por la alcoba, [v|pisando|pisar|is] [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvnmnnn] , y oiremos...</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1300Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>pisando</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#pisar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1300Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1301"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1301Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde113" /><gams:textualContent>No crea usted, no crea usted —dijo el secretario—, que si él pudiera, ya resollaría fuerte ;pero, en fin..., comprendo la delicadeza de usted..., y como quiera que aquí no hay sitio para que</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1301Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1301Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1301Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>si él pudiera, ya resollaría fuerte </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>si él pudiera, ya [v|resollaría|resollar|is] [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1301Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>resollaría</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#resollar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1301Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1302"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1302Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde221" /><gams:textualContent>de todas las armas de la Albufera, llegó á manejarla él con relativa facilidad. El tío Paloma  cargaba fuerte , y los primeros tiros hicieron tambalearse al muchacho, faltando poco para que cayese de espaldas en el fondo</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1302Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1302Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1302Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1302Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> El tío Paloma  cargaba fuerte </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|El tío Paloma|ms]  [v|cargaba|cargar|is] [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1302Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>El tío Paloma</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1302Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>cargaba</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cargar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1302Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1303"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1303Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde221" /><gams:textualContent>sus ánades, ponía el grito en el cielo notando la falta de alguno. El carabinero de mar  tosía fuerte  y miraba de cerca al viejo Sangonera, como si pretendiese meterle los recios bigotes por los ojos; pero</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1303Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1303Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1303Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1303Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> El carabinero de mar  tosía fuerte </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|El carabinero de mar|ms]  [v|tosía|toser|is] [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1303Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>El carabinero de mar</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1303Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>tosía</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#toser" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1303Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1304"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1304Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde521" /><gams:textualContent>“Llegué tarde a casa, una noche estrellada. Había taconeado  fuerte mis diez cuadras, alta la frente bajo el frescor nocturno.Me acosté como de costumbre, la vela</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1304Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1304Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1304Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Había taconeado  fuerte mis diez cuadras</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|Había taconeado|taconear|ts]  [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvnmnnn] mis diez cuadras</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1304Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>Había taconeado</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#taconear" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1304Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1305"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1305Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde224" /><gams:textualContent>los brazos cruzados sobre el pecho en pensativa y extática actitud. La negrura del hábito sacerdotal , emergía fuerte y rara sobre la yerta amarillez de los añojales.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1305Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1305Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1305Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1305Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1305Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text> La negrura del hábito sacerdotal , emergía fuerte y rara sobre la yerta amarillez de los añojales</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|La negrura del hábito sacerdotal|fs] , [v|emergía|emerger|is] [a|fuerte|fuerte|ausnmnnC] y [a|rara|raro|afsnmnnC] sobre la yerta amarillez de los añojales</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1305Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>La negrura del hábito sacerdotal</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1305Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>emergía</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#emerger" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1305Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1305Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>rara</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#raro" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">4</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FeminineSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1306"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1306Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde392" /><gams:textualContent>te parece que hizo el viejo e porra?Pos que me pepena de la mano y me la agarra juerte , juerte; luego comienza a pellizcarme las corvas...¡Ah, pero qué pliegue tan güeno le he</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1306Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1306Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1306Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Pos que me pepena de la mano y me la agarra juerte , juerte</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Pos que me pepena de la mano y me la [v|agarra|agarrar|ts] [a|juerte|fuerte|auvnmrnn] , juerte</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1306Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>agarra</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#agarrar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1306Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>juerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1307"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1307Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde30" /><gams:textualContent>Las campanas de la torre están sonando en nuestro pecho, al nivel de nuestro corazón, que late fuerte ;se ven brillar, lejos, en las viñas, los azadones, con una chispa de plata y</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1307Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1307Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1307Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>en nuestro pecho, al nivel de nuestro corazón, que late fuerte </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>en nuestro pecho, al nivel de nuestro corazón, que [v|late|latir|is] [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1307Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>late</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#latir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1307Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1308"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1308Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde440" /><gams:textualContent>Y acercándose, lo castiga desde a caballo;pero el barroso permanece estirado largo a largo, resoplando fuerte  y vueltos hacia atrás sus grandes ojos de amplísima córnea amarillenta.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1308Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1308Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1308Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>el barroso permanece estirado largo a largo, resoplando fuerte </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>el barroso permanece estirado largo a largo, [v|resoplando|resoplar|is] [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1308Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>resoplando</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#resoplar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1308Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1309"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1309Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde522" /><gams:textualContent>su abollada caja sobre su asiento de madera. El del pistón desatornilla la boquilla, y la sopla fuerte , fuerte, para aventar cualquier obstrucción.Cada cual tiene algún detalle que rematar.El del redoblante</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1309Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1309Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1309Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1309Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> El del pistón desatornilla la boquilla, y la sopla fuerte , fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|El del pistón|ms] desatornilla la boquilla, y la [v|sopla|soplar|ts] [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvnmrnn] , fuerte</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1309Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>El del pistón</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1309Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sopla</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#soplar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1309Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1310"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1310Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde522" /><gams:textualContent>en acción.El martillo bailotea. El hombre de la fragua , tiznado como un demonio, empuña , fuerte , la tenaza, sujetando contra el yunque el hierro rojizo que va cediendo, cediendo; que se va</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1310Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1310Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1310Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1310Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> El hombre de la fragua , tiznado como un demonio, empuña , fuerte , la tenaza</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|El hombre de la fragua|ms] , tiznado como un demonio, [v|empuña|empuñar|ts] , [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvnmnnn] , la tenaza</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1310Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>El hombre de la fragua</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1310Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>empuña</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#empuñar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1310Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1311"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1311Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde396" /><gams:textualContent>Sentóse Felicita, respiró fuerte , tomó aliento, pero no se reposó, sino que, tan pronto como había tocado el asiento,</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1311Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1311Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1311Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Sentóse Felicita, respiró fuerte , tomó aliento</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Sentóse Felicita, [v|respiró|respirar|is] [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvnmnnn] , tomó aliento</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1311Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>respiró</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#respirar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1311Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1312"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1312Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde256" /><gams:textualContent>¡Pa’ los pavos que el Negro viene roncando juerte !—exclamó Florido—.Los que tengan la barriga aujereada que abran los ojos —y las carcajadas</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1312Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1312Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1312Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1312Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>¡Pa’ los pavos que el Negro viene roncando juerte </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>¡Pa’ los pavos que [s|el Negro|ms] viene [v|roncando|roncar|is] [a|juerte|fuerte|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1312Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>el Negro</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1312Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>roncando</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#roncar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1312Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>juerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1313"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1313Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde256" /><gams:textualContent>con gesto airado como si fueran a pelear. Los estancieros del vecindario se enardecieron y empezaron a jugar fuerte .Y la jugada se hizo general.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1313Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1313Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1313Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1313Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Los estancieros del vecindario se enardecieron y empezaron a jugar fuerte </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Los estancieros del vecindario|mp] se enardecieron y empezaron a [v|jugar|jugar|is] [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1313Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Los estancieros del vecindario</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1313Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>jugar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#jugar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1313Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1314"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1314Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde256" /><gams:textualContent>Desde que se movió parecía otro caballo. Partieron  fuerte .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1314Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1314Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1314Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Partieron  fuerte </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|Partieron|partir|is]  [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1314Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>Partieron</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#partir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1314Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1315"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1315Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde256" /><gams:textualContent>En la sala bebieron otra limeta; carraspearon  fuerte  y partieron.Iban tan resueltos que las Gatas no intentaron siquiera hacerles ninguna objeción ni menos comunicarles los lúgubres</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1315Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1315Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1315Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> carraspearon  fuerte </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|carraspearon|carraspear|is]  [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1315Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>carraspearon</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#carraspear" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1315Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1316"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1316Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde256" /><gams:textualContent>daba las friegas le sudaban las manos que era una temeridá.Ansina me diba sacando el daño. Trabajaba  juerte  la vieja .Y encaprichada, ¡pucha digo!Una ves, que no podía pararme los dolores,</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1316Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1316Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1316Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1316Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Trabajaba  juerte  la vieja </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|Trabajaba|trabajar|is]  [a|juerte|fuerte|auvnmnnn]  [s|la vieja|fs] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1316Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>la vieja</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1316Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>Trabajaba</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#trabajar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1316Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>juerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1317"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1317Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde256" /><gams:textualContent>Aquí el patrón sonrió juerte .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1317Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1317Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1317Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1317Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Aquí el patrón sonrió juerte </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Aquí [s|el patrón|ms] [v|sonrió|sonreír|is] [a|juerte|fuerte|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1317Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>el patrón</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1317Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sonrió</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#sonreír" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1317Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>juerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1318"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1318Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde256" /><gams:textualContent>si no es muy rudo por demás cuida mejor los intereses que le confean pa’ que haiga aumento y dentre a ganar juerte .Las manadas y los rodeos finos rinden má que l’hasienda ordinaria, sabido.Las máquinas esquiladoras son primorosas</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1318Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1318Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1318Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>pa’ que haiga aumento y dentre a ganar juerte </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>pa’ que haiga aumento y dentre a [v|ganar|ganar|is] [a|juerte|fuerte|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1318Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>ganar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ganar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1318Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>juerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1319"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1319Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde256" /><gams:textualContent>en la última revuelta.Veíase aún intacto la especie de cobertizo de paja brava donde buscaban refugio cuando llovía fuerte , y más lejos el corralito de ramas, ahora secas, en el que estaba, recién ensillado,</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1319Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1319Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1319Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Veíase aún intacto la especie de cobertizo de paja brava donde buscaban refugio cuando llovía fuerte </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Veíase aún intacto la especie de cobertizo de paja brava donde buscaban refugio cuando [v|llovía|llover|is] [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1319Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>llovía</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#llover" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1319Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1320"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1320Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde256" /><gams:textualContent>no la reconocieron a causa de su indumenta y el ala del sombrero caída sobre los ojos, se dirigió pisando fuerte al escritorio del patrón.Éste estaba enterado por Saldivia de lo acontecido en el puesto y de</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1320Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1320Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1320Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>se dirigió pisando fuerte al escritorio del patrón</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>se dirigió [v|pisando|pisar|ts] [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvnmnnn] al escritorio del patrón</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1320Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>pisando</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#pisar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1320Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1321"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1321Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde256" /><gams:textualContent>, desiba.Teniba a uno ensartau en el asador, pa’ sacárselo tuve que meterle la pata y tirar juerte  porque lo teniba sumido en las caderas, tal vé.El patrón salió chato pa’ la sotea a sujetar</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1321Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1321Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1321Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>pa’ sacárselo tuve que meterle la pata y tirar juerte </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>pa’ sacárselo tuve que meterle la pata y [v|tirar|tirar|is] [a|juerte|fuerte|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1321Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>tirar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#tirar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1321Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>juerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1322"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1322Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde41" /><gams:textualContent>al anca en unas alforjas de mezcal.La lluvia continuaba impertinente y  el “viento abajo”  soplaba fuerte y frío .Chico no tenía miedo de ir sin compañía a la aldea del abajo; varias veces</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1322Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1322Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1322Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1322Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1322Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text> el “viento abajo”  soplaba fuerte y frío </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|el “viento abajo”|ms]  [v|soplaba|soplar|is] [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvnmnnC] y [a|frío|frío|ausnmnnC] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1322Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>el “viento abajo”</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1322Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>soplaba</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#soplar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1322Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1322Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>frío</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#frío" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">4</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1323"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1323Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde41" /><gams:textualContent>hagan?—preguntó don Baldómero todavía “muerto de risa”; pero luego recapacitó y poniéndose de pie llamó fuerte : — ¡Vira, Canda, ¿dónde diablos se han zampado?</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1323Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1323Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1323Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>don Baldómero todavía “muerto de risa”; pero luego recapacitó y poniéndose de pie llamó fuerte </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>don Baldómero todavía “muerto de risa”; pero luego recapacitó y poniéndose de pie [v|llamó|llamar|ts] [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1323Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>llamó</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#llamar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1323Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1324"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1324Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde41" /><gams:textualContent>aquellos ojitos azules como el cielo de la sierra.Se mordió los labios y tronando sus dientes la apretó fuerte en sus dedos acerados por el trabajo de la tierra y la cabeza extranjera crujió, convirtiéndose en menudos pedazos</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1324Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1324Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1324Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>la apretó fuerte en sus dedos</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>la [v|apretó|apretar|ts] [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvnmnnn] en sus dedos</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1324Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>apretó</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#apretar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1324Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1325"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1325Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde523" /><gams:textualContent>Fermín (A Leoncio.) ¡ Sujéteme  fuerte , Leoncio!</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1325Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1325Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1325Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Sujéteme  fuerte , Leoncio</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|Sujéteme|sujetar|ts]  [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvnmnnn] , Leoncio</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1325Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>Sujéteme</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#sujetar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1325Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1326"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1326Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde523" /><gams:textualContent>Fermín ¡ Sujéteme fuerte, todo lo fuerte que pueda, que me están entrando ganas de ponerme en cuatro patas!</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1326Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1326Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1326Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Fermín ¡ Sujéteme fuerte, todo lo fuerte que pueda</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Fermín ¡ [v|Sujéteme|sujetar|ts] fuerte, todo lo [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvmmrnn] que pueda</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1326Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>Sujéteme</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#sujetar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1326Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1327"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1327Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde401" /><gams:textualContent>y, desde que salgo, sí me acuerdo.Entonces pienso cuando desensillaba mi caballo y las caronas olían fuerte del sudor y pasaban al redil las ovejas bala y bala, y la laguna Yanañahui tenía un</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1327Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1327Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1327Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1327Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>cuando desensillaba mi caballo y las caronas olían fuerte del sudor</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>cuando desensillaba mi caballo y [s|las caronas|fp] [v|olían|oler|is] [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvnmnnn] del sudor</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1327Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>las caronas</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1327Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>olían</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#oler" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1327Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fuerte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fuerte" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1328"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1328Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde185" /><gams:textualContent>del sueño.¡Contemple bien su imagen ahora!Vibra inquieta al reflejarse en el agua... Sopla  fuerte  la brisa ;riza el cristal;la imagen riela, se desgaja en jirones.¡Qué corriente importuna</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1328Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1328Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1328Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1328Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Sopla  fuerte  la brisa </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|Sopla|soplar|is]  [a|fuerte|fuerte|auvnmnnn]  [s|la brisa|fs] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1328Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>la brisa</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En1328Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>Sopla</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#soplar" /><aaif:posi