 metro de largo</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2055Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>deslizándose</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#deslizar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2055Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>rápida</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#rápido" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FeminineSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2056"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2056Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde73" /><gams:textualContent>viste sus ojos amarillos, sus pupilas verticales buscándote con una mirada que no te alcanzó porque  el curare  actúa rápido .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2056Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2056Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2056Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2056Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> el curare  actúa rápido </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|el curare|ms]  [v|actúa|actuar|is] [a|rápido|rápido|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2056Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>el curare</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2056Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>actúa</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#actuar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2056Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>rápido</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#rápido" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2057"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2057Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde74" /><gams:textualContent>cobertizo.Oía muy cerca la respiración gruesa de la mujer.Lo sostenía por un brazo mientras se echaba rápida sobre el piso.La miró con pavor levantarse las espesas faldas hasta la cintura.Los gruesos muslos se</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2057Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2057Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2057Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>se echaba rápida sobre el piso</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>se [v|echaba|echar|rs] [a|rápida|rápido|afvnmnnn] sobre el piso</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2057Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>echaba</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#echar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2057Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>rápida</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#rápido" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FeminineSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2058"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2058Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde74" /><gams:textualContent>Fue torpe con la primera, pero luego y pronto con las demás  pasaba  rápido del saludo al retener la mano, al mirar a fondo, al apartarla, al</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2058Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2058Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2058Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> pasaba  rápido del saludo al retener la mano</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|pasaba|pasar|is]  [a|rápido|rápido|auvnmnnn] del saludo al retener la mano</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2058Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>pasaba</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#pasar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2058Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>rápido</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#rápido" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2059"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2059Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde74" /><gams:textualContent>casi incidentalmente: «Habría que encontrar a alguien para que se ocupara de la secretaría». Don Juan  reaccionó rápido .«No quiero que Soto abandone mi secretaría.Nadie podrá hacerlo como él.» «No tiene</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2059Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2059Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2059Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2059Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Don Juan  reaccionó rápido </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Don Juan|ms]  [v|reaccionó|reaccionar|is] [a|rápido|rápido|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2059Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Don Juan</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2059Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>reaccionó</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#reaccionar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2059Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>rápido</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#rápido" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2060"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2060Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde74" /><gams:textualContent>Al galope del caballo golpeaban el escudo de la silueta de hierro, que giraba rápida sobre su eje vertical.El saco de arena que colgaba de su brazo derecho tomaba vuelo y golpeaba a</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2060Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2060Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2060Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>la silueta de hierro, que giraba rápida sobre su eje vertical</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>la silueta de hierro, que [v|giraba|girar|is] [a|rápida|rápido|afvnmnnn] sobre su eje vertical</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2060Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>giraba</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#girar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2060Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>rápida</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#rápido" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FeminineSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2061"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2061Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde75" /><gams:textualContent>unas horas en Miami.Ya le proporcionamos un intento de explicación.Estúdielo.Nos consta que  usted  aprende rápido .Ha de citarla en el final de la calle Lake, en la esquina en que tropieza con el</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2061Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2061Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2061Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2061Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> usted  aprende rápido </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|usted|us]  [v|aprende|aprender|is] [a|rápido|rápido|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2061Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>usted</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Undefined" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2061Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>aprende</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#aprender" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2061Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>rápido</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#rápido" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2062"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2062Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde189" /><gams:textualContent>— Es un sitio asqueroso.Si querés  vamos  rápido a tu casa, hacés lo que tenés que hacer y después salimos y no volvemos por un tiempo,</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2062Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2062Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2062Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> vamos  rápido a tu casa</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|vamos|ir|is]  [a|rápido|rápido|auvnmnnn] a tu casa</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2062Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vamos</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2062Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>rápido</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#rápido" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2063"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2063Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde189" /><gams:textualContent>pasar?Pasará pasará y el último quedará.Detenido.De-te-ni-do.No.Por favor. Huir , rápido .Escapar por la tangente, rememorar los tiempos de recién llegado, cuando todos los actos parecían de liberación</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2063Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2063Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2063Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Huir , rápido .</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|Huir|huir|is] , [a|rápido|rápido|auvnmnnn] .</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2063Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>Huir</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#huir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2063Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>rápido</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#rápido" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2064"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2064Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde189" /><gams:textualContent>esto lo ve tan rápido, con los ojos cerrados, memoria hecha de imágenes.) Ella no camina rápido , va feliz, felicitándose, levitando por esa cuerda floja de la vereda en una ciudad que es el</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2064Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2064Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2064Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2064Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Ella no camina rápido </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Ella|fs] no [v|camina|caminar|is] [a|rápido|rápido|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2064Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Ella</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2064Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>camina</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caminar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2064Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>rápido</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#rápido" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2065"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2065Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde232" /><gams:textualContent>subterráneas.Sólo cerró los ojos a la visión cuando vio que  siete ratones blancos y siete ratones negros  reían rápidos e incansables  las raíces de los siete árboles que se iban desmoronando.Se quebró la tierra.Oyó los</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2065Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2065Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2065Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2065Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2065Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text> siete ratones blancos y siete ratones negros  reían rápidos e incansables </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|siete ratones blancos y siete ratones negros|mp]  [v|reían|reír|ts] [a|rápidos|rápido|apvnmnnC] e [a|incansables|incansable|apvnmnnC] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2065Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>siete ratones blancos y siete ratones negros</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2065Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>reían</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#reír" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2065Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>rápidos</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#rápido" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#MasculinePlural" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2065Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>incansables</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#incansable" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">4</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#MasculinePlural" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2066"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2066Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde76" /><gams:textualContent>—  Abrí , rápido , abrí — decía.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2066Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2066Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2066Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Abrí , rápido , abrí</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|Abrí|abrir|is] , [a|rápido|rápido|auvnmnnn] , abrí</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2066Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>Abrí</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#abrir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2066Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>rápido</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#rápido" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2067"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2067Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde76" /><gams:textualContent>peligro de aquellas voces arrastrándose hacia ella a través de las paredes, las ranuras de las puertas.Pero se levantó rápido .Se vistió y fue a pararse al lado de la ventana.Eran las siete de la mañana.La humedad</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2067Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2067Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2067Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>se levantó rápido </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>se [v|levantó|levantar|rs] [a|rápido|rápido|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2067Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>levantó</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#levantar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2067Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>rápido</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#rápido" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2068"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2068Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde76" /><gams:textualContent>Llegarían en media hora.«Nos vemos el miércoles», sonrió Lavinia, «me tengo que bañar rápido ».Con expresión de no entender lo que sucedía, Lucrecia debió aceptar y alejarse.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2068Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2068Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2068Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>me tengo que bañar rápido </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>me tengo que [v|bañar|bañar|rs] [a|rápido|rápido|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2068Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>bañar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bañar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2068Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>rápido</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#rápido" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2069"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2069Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde76" /><gams:textualContent>era extraña en la atmósfera tranquila de día de semana.Ella caminando ya tarde a la oficina; caminando  rápido , sintiendo las piernas moverse como si pertenecieran a otra persona.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2069Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2069Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2069Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> caminando  rápido </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|caminando|caminar|is]  [a|rápido|rápido|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2069Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>caminando</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caminar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2069Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>rápido</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#rápido" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2070"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2070Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde76" /><gams:textualContent>al mitin, cuando la discusión rompió en golpes de un bando estudiantil contra el otro.« Salí  rápido .Te vas a tu casa.Esperame que llego en la noche», le dijo.Salió atolondrada</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2070Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2070Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2070Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Salí  rápido </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|Salí|salir|is]  [a|rápido|rápido|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2070Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>Salí</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#salir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2070Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>rápido</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#rápido" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2071"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2071Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde76" /><gams:textualContent>dijo, sin poder evitar la visión del periódico y las fotos de los cadáveres acribillados.Se levantó rápida , echándose encima la ropa ajada del día anterior.«Me tengo que calmar», se decía</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2071Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2071Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2071Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Se levantó rápida </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Se [v|levantó|levantar|rs] [a|rápida|rápido|afvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2071Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>levantó</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#levantar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2071Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>rápida</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#rápido" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#FeminineSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2072"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2072Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde76" /><gams:textualContent>No se imaginan nada así que tenemos que aprovechar al máximo el elemento sorpresa.¡Y  entrar  rápido !No se olviden, ¡el que se quede afuera es hombre muerto!</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2072Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2072Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2072Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> entrar  rápido </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|entrar|entrar|is]  [a|rápido|rápido|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2072Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>entrar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#entrar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2072Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>rápido</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#rápido" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2073"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2073Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde76" /><gams:textualContent>lo triste que era la guerra.Matar gente.Pensaría que protegería al padre.Tendría que actuar rápido .Aguardar el instante preciso.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2073Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2073Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2073Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Tendría que actuar rápido </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Tendría que [v|actuar|actuar|is] [a|rápido|rápido|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2073Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>actuar</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#actuar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2073Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>rápido</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#rápido" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2074"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2074Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde76" /><gams:textualContent>De algún lugar le llegaba una ola de sangre fría.Tenía que sorprenderlo, pensó.Tenía que moverse rápido .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2074Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2074Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2074Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Tenía que moverse rápido </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Tenía que [v|moverse|mover|rs] [a|rápido|rápido|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2074Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>moverse</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mover" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2074Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>rápido</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#rápido" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2075"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2075Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde582" /><gams:textualContent>vendiendo unos madroños color verde oscuro a la orilla de la carretera."¡Mira que  este españolito  aprende rápido !—dijo la tía Rosa—.¿Dónde aprendiste tú lo que eran quenepas?" "Yo</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2075Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2075Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2075Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2075Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> este españolito  aprende rápido </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|este españolito|ms]  [v|aprende|aprender|is] [a|rápido|rápido|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2075Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>este españolito</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2075Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>aprende</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#aprender" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2075Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>rápido</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#rápido" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2076"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2076Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde173" /><gams:textualContent>sin poder determinar por qué, un hecho en el que faltaba la fortuna de lo casual. Su mente  trabajó rápido  y lo llevó a la siguiente imagen: esa misma mujer descorriendo una cortina desde el décimo piso para observarlo</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2076Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2076Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2076Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2076Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Su mente  trabajó rápido </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Su mente|fs]  [v|trabajó|trabajar|is] [a|rápido|rápido|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2076Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Su mente</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2076Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>trabajó</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#trabajar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2076Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>rápido</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#rápido" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2077"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2077Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde173" /><gams:textualContent>— Es lo que espero — respondió  rápido  Max .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2077Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2077Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2077Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2077Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> respondió  rápido  Max </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|respondió|reponder|ts]  [a|rápido|rápido|auvnmnnn]  [s|Max|ms] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2077Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Max</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2077Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>respondió</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#reponder" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2077Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>rápido</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#rápido" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2078"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2078Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde78" /><gams:textualContent>En la cafetería se propusieron comer rápido .Él pidió una cuña de kuchen de manzana y una coca-cola;ella, que se disponía a pedir</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2078Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2078Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2078Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>se propusieron comer rápido </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>se propusieron [v|comer|comer|is] [a|rápido|rápido|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2078Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>comer</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#comer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2078Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>rápido</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#rápido" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2079"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2079Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde134" /><gams:textualContent>llega pronto si en lugar de mirar hacia lo lejos se avanza con los ojos puestos en el suelo;se llega rápido a una línea de arbustos muy pequeños que llaman oeuf de poule, y a partir de ese lugar se</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2079Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2079Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2079Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>se llega rápido a una línea de arbustos muy pequeños</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>se [v|llega|llegar|is] [a|rápido|rápido|auvnmnnn] a una línea de arbustos muy pequeños</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2079Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>llega</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#llegar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2079Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>rápido</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#rápido" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2080"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2080Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde134" /><gams:textualContent>El marido abrió la puerta por mi lado, me moví rápido de asiento y él metió, como quien mete un bulto, a su mujer;ella se quejaba bajito</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2080Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2080Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2080Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>me moví rápido de asiento</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>me [v|moví|mover|rs] [a|rápido|rápido|auvnmnnn] de asiento</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2080Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>moví</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mover" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2080Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>rápido</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#rápido" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2081"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2081Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde134" /><gams:textualContent>le había cosido los labios al difunto y le amarré un cuchillo entre las manos, lo hice rápido  para que el cura de Jérémie no se enterara.El cadáver de Papá Crapaud estaba a salvo: ni el hombre</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2081Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2081Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2081Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>lo hice rápido </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>lo [v|hice|hacer|ts] [a|rápido|rápido|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2081Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>hice</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hacer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2081Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>rápido</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#rápido" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2082"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2082Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde134" /><gams:textualContent>— Suban, si quieren —dijo Thierry—, pero  háganlo rápido, mientras más rápido mejor.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2082Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2082Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2082Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> háganlo rápido, mientras más rápido mejor</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|háganlo|hacer|ts] rápido, mientras más [a|rápido|rápido|auvmmrnn] mejor</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2082Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>háganlo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#hacer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2082Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>rápido</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#rápido" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2083"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2083Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde538" /><gams:textualContent>más: los primeros meses se alimentan de leche materna.No hay nada nuevo en eso.Y  crecen  rápido : a los seis meses pesan más de doscientos kilos y aunque siguen mamando ya comen pasto y vegetales acuáticos</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2083Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2083Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2083Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> crecen  rápido </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|crecen|crecer|is]  [a|rápido|rápido|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2083Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>crecen</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#crecer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2083Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>rápido</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#rápido" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2084"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2084Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh.bibl#Cnde79" /><gams:textualContent>—  Caminemos  rapidito  —dijo ella, y lo cogió del brazo—.Los rateros le roban a la gente distraída</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2084Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2084Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2084Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Caminemos  rapidito </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|Caminemos|caminar|is]  [a|rapidito|rápido|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2084Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>Caminemos</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caminar" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.spacdh#En2084Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>rapidito</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#rápido" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:posi